 # Ollama模型\n│   │   └── transformers/           # Transformers模型\n│   ├── cloud/                      # 云端模型\n│   │   ├── openai/                 # OpenAI模型配置\n│   │   ├── anthropic/              # Anthropic模型配置\n│   │   └── azure/                  # Azure模型配置\n│   └── fine-tuned/                 # 微调模型\n│       ├── business-model/         # 业务专用模型\n│       └── domain-model/           # 领域专用模型\n├── embeddings/                     # 嵌入模型\n│   ├── text/                       # 文本嵌入\n│   │   ├── chinese/                # 中文嵌入模型\n│   │   └── multilingual/           # 多语言嵌入模型\n│   └── multimodal/                 # 多模态嵌入\n│       ├── text-image/             # 文本图像嵌入\n│       └── text-audio/             # 文本音频嵌入\n├── specialized/                    # 专用模型\n│   ├── classification/             # 分类模型\n│   │   ├── intent-classifier/      # 意图分类\n│   │   └── sentiment-classifier/   # 情感分类\n│   ├── ner/                        # 命名实体识别\n│   │   ├── business-ner/           # 业务实体识别\n│   │   └── general-ner/            # 通用实体识别\n│   └── generation/                 # 生成模型\n│       ├── report-generator/       # 报告生成\n│       └── code-generator/         # 代码生成\n└── configs/\n    ├── model-registry.yaml         # 模型注册表\n    ├── deployment.yaml             # 模型部署配置\n    └── optimization.yaml           # 模型优化配置\n```\n\n### 3.4 知识库管理\n\n```\nai-platform/knowledge/\n├── structured/                     # 结构化知识\n│   ├── business-rules/             # 业务规则\n│   │   ├── order-rules.yaml        # 订单业务规则\n│   │   ├── inventory-rules.yaml    # 库存业务规则\n│   │   ├── pricing-rules.yaml      # 定价规则\n│   │   └── approval-rules.yaml     # 审批规则\n│   ├── data-schemas/               # 数据模式\n│   │   ├── product-schema.json     # 商品数据模式\n│   │   ├── customer-schema.json    # 客户数据模式\n│   │   └── order-schema.json       # 订单数据模式\n│   └── workflows/                  # 工作流知识\n│       ├── order-workflow.yaml     # 订单处理流程\n│       ├── project-workflow.yaml   # 项目管理流程\n│       └── approval-workflow.yaml  # 审批流程\n├── unstructured/                   # 非结构化知识\n│   ├── documents/                  # 文档知识\n│   │   ├── manuals/                # 操作手册\n│   │   ├── policies/               # 政策文档\n│   │   ├── faqs/                   # 常见问题\n│   │   └── training/               # 培训资料\n│   ├── conversations/              # 对话知识\n│   │   ├── chat-logs/              # 聊天记录\n│   │   ├── support-tickets/        # 支持工单\n│   │   └── customer-feedback/      # 客户反馈\n│   └── multimedia/                 # 多媒体知识\n│       ├── images/                 # 图片资源\n│       ├── videos/                 # 视频教程\n│       └── audio/                  # 音频资源\n├── vector-db/                      # 向量数据库\n│   ├── collections/                # 向量集合\n│   │   ├── business-docs/          # 业务文档向量\n│   │   ├── product-info/           # 商品信息向量\n│   │   ├── customer-info/          # 客户信息向量\n│   │   └── historical-data/        # 历史数据向量\n│   ├── indexes/                    # 向量索引\n│   └── metadata/                   # 元数据\n├── graph-db/                       # 图数据库\n│   ├── entities/                   # 实体定义\n│   │   ├── business-entities.json  # 业务实体\n│   │   ├── system-entities.json    # 系统实体\n│   │   └── domain-entities.json    # 领域实体\n│   ├── relationships/              # 关系定义\n│   │   ├── business-relations.json # 业务关系\n│   │   └── semantic-relations.json # 语义关系\n│   └── reasoning/                  # 推理规则\n│       ├── inference-rules.json    # 推理规则\n│       └── constraint-rules.json   # 约束规则\n└── management/\n    ├── ingestion/                  # 知识摄取\n    │   ├── crawlers/               # 爬虫配置\n    │   ├── parsers/                # 解析器\n    │   └── validators/             # 验证器\n    ├── processing/                 # 知识处理\n    │   ├── cleaning/               # 数据清洗\n    │   ├── enrichment/             # 数据丰富\n    │   └── deduplication/          # 去重处理\n    └── quality/                    # 质量管理\n        ├── validation/             # 质量验证\n        ├── metrics/                # 质量指标\n        └── monitoring/             # 质量监控\n```\n\n## 4. 共享资源结构\n\n### 4.1 公共类型定义\n\n```\nshared/types/\n├── business/                       # 业务类型\n│   ├── product.d.ts               # 商品类型\n│   ├── customer.d.ts              # 客户类型\n│   ├── order.d.ts                 # 订单类型\n│   ├── inventory.d.ts             # 库存类型\n│   └── project.d.ts               # 项目类型\n├── infrastructure/                # 基础设施类型\n│   ├── auth.d.ts                  # 认证类型\n│   ├── user.d.ts                  # 用户类型\n│   ├── organization.d.ts          # 组织类型\n│   └── permission.d.ts            # 权限类型\n├── ai/                            # AI相关类型\n│   ├── agent.d.ts                 # 智能体类型\n│   ├── chat.d.ts                  # 聊天类型\n│   ├── knowledge.d.ts             # 知识类型\n│   └── model.d.ts                 # 模型类型\n├── common/                        # 通用类型\n│   ├── api.d.ts                   # API类型\n│   ├── response.d.ts              # 响应类型\n│   ├── pagination.d.ts            # 分页类型\n│   └── event.d.ts                 # 事件类型\n└── go/                            # Go类型定义\n    ├── business/                  # 业务Go类型\n    ├── infrastructure/            # 基础设施Go类型\n    ├── ai/                        # AI相关Go类型\n    └── common/                    # 通用Go类型\n```\n\n### 4.2 公共组件库\n\n```\nshared/components/\n├── basic/                         # 基础组件\n│   ├── Button/                    # 按钮组件\n│   ├── Input/                     # 输入组件\n│   ├── Select/                    # 选择组件\n│   ├── Table/                     # 表格组件\n│   └── Form/                      # 表单组件\n├── business/                      # 业务组件\n│   ├── ProductSelector/           # 商品选择器\n│   ├── CustomerSelector/          # 客户选择器\n│   ├── OrderCard/                 # 订单卡片\n│   ├── InventoryDisplay/          # 库存显示\n│   └── ProjectTimeline/           # 项目时间线\n├── ai/                            # AI组件\n│   ├── ChatInterface/             # 聊天界面\n│   ├── VoiceInput/                # 语音输入\n│   ├── SmartSuggestion/           # 智能建议\n│   └── DataVisualization/         # 数据可视化\n└── layout/                        # 布局组件\n    ├── PageContainer/             # 页面容器\n    ├── ContentLayout/             # 内容布局\n    ├── SidebarLayout/             # 侧边栏布局\n    └── ModalLayout/               # 弹窗布局\n```\n\n## 5. API网关结构\n\n```\ngateway/\n├── cmd/\n│   └── gateway/\n│       └── main.go\n├── internal/\n│   ├── router/\n│   │   ├── infrastructure.go      # 基础设施路由\n│   │   ├── business.go            # 业务模块路由\n│   │   ├── ai.go                  # AI平台路由\n│   │   └── admin.go               # 管理路由\n│   ├── middleware/\n│   │   ├── auth.go                # 认证中间件\n│   │   ├── rate_limit.go          # 限流中间件\n│   │   ├── load_balance.go        # 负载均衡\n│   │   ├── circuit_breaker.go     # 熔断器\n│   │   └── metrics.go             # 指标收集\n│   ├── proxy/\n│   │   ├── infrastructure.go      # 基础设施代理\n│   │   ├── business.go            # 业务模块代理\n│   │   └── ai.go                  # AI平台代理\n│   └── discovery/\n│       ├── consul.go              # 服务发现\n│       ├── registry.go            # 服务注册\n│       └── health_check.go        # 健康检查\n├── configs/\n│   ├── gateway.yaml               # 网关配置\n│   ├── routes.yaml                # 路由配置\n│   └── services.yaml              # 服务配置\n└── docs/\n    ├── api-gateway.md             # 网关文档\n    └── service-discovery.md       # 服务发现文档\n```\n\n## 6. 系统端口规划\n\n### 6.1 端口分配策略\n\n```\n端口范围规划：\n├── 系统基础设施层: 8000-8999\n├── 业务服务层: 9000-9999  \n├── AI平台层: 10000-10999\n├── 数据存储层: 11000-11999\n├── 中间件层: 12000-12999\n└── 开发工具层: 13000-13999\n```\n\n### 6.2 详细端口分配表\n\n| 服务类型 | 服务名称 | 端口 | 协议 | 用途说明 |\n|---------|---------|------|------|---------|\n| **系统基础设施层** |\n| API网关 | gateway | 8080 | HTTP | 统一API入口 |\n| 基础设施后端 | infrastructure-backend | 8090 | HTTP | 认证、权限、日志、接口管理 |\n| 基础设施前端 | infrastructure-frontend | 8000 | HTTP | 基础设施管理界面 |\n| WebSocket网关 | websocket-gateway | 8080 | WS | WebSocket连接管理 |\n| 健康检查 | health-check | 8082 | HTTP | 系统健康监控 |\n| **业务服务层** |\n| 基础数据后端 | basic-data-backend | 9090 | HTTP | 商品、客户、渠道管理 |\n| 基础数据前端 | basic-data-frontend | 9000 | HTTP | 基础数据管理界面 |\n| 业务运营后端 | operation-backend | 9091 | HTTP | 订单、库存、项目管理 |\n| 业务运营前端 | operation-frontend | 9001 | HTTP | 业务运营管理界面 |\n| 组织权限后端 | organization-backend | 9092 | HTTP | 员工、审批流管理 |\n| 组织权限前端 | organization-frontend | 9002 | HTTP | 组织权限管理界面 |\n| 系统集成后端 | integration-backend | 9093 | HTTP | 外部系统集成 |\n| 系统集成前端 | integration-frontend | 9003 | HTTP | 集成管理界面 |\n| **AI平台层** |\n| AI智能体后端 | ai-agent-backend | 10090 | HTTP | 智能体服务 |\n| AI聊天前端 | ai-chat-frontend | 10000 | HTTP | AI聊天界面 |\n| 知识库服务 | knowledge-service | 10091 | HTTP | 知识管理服务 |\n| 模型服务 | model-service | 10092 | HTTP | AI模型管理 |\n| NLP服务 | nlp-service | 10093 | HTTP | 自然语言处理 |\n| 向量搜索服务 | vector-search | 10094 | HTTP | 向量相似度搜索 |\n| 流式处理服务 | streaming-service | 10095 | WS | 流式数据处理 |\n| **数据存储层** |\n| SQLite主库 | sqlite-primary | 11001 | TCP | 主数据库 |\n| SQLite只读副本 | sqlite-replica | 11002 | TCP | 只读数据库副本 |\n| Milvus向量库 | milvus | 11530 | gRPC | 向量数据库 |\n| Milvus管理界面 | milvus-ui | 11531 | HTTP | Milvus管理界面 |\n| Neo4j图数据库 | neo4j | 11687 | Bolt | 知识图谱数据库 |\n| Neo4j管理界面 | neo4j-browser | 11474 | HTTP | Neo4j浏览器 |\n| Redis缓存 | redis | 11379 | TCP | 缓存服务 |\n| Redis Sentinel | redis-sentinel | 11380 | TCP | Redis高可用 |\n| **中间件层** |\n| Nginx负载均衡 | nginx-lb | 12080 | HTTP | 负载均衡器 |\n| Nginx静态资源 | nginx-static | 12081 | HTTP | 静态资源服务 |\n| RabbitMQ | rabbitmq | 12672 | AMQP | 消息队列 |\n| RabbitMQ管理界面 | rabbitmq-mgmt | 12673 | HTTP | 消息队列管理 |\n| Consul服务发现 | consul | 12500 | HTTP | 服务注册发现 |\n| Consul UI | consul-ui | 12501 | HTTP | Consul管理界面 |\n| Prometheus | prometheus | 12090 | HTTP | 指标监控 |\n| Grafana | grafana | 12091 | HTTP | 监控仪表盘 |\n| Jaeger | jaeger | 12086 | HTTP | 链路追踪 |\n| **开发工具层** |\n| 开发数据库 | dev-sqlite | 13000 | TCP | 开发环境数据库 |\n| 测试数据库 | test-sqlite | 13002 | TCP | 测试环境数据库 |\n| Mock服务 | mock-server | 13080 | HTTP | API模拟服务 |\n| API文档 | swagger-ui | 13081 | HTTP | API文档界面 |\n| 代码质量检查 | sonarqube | 13000 | HTTP | 代码质量分析 |\n\n### 6.3 Docker编排配置\n\n```yaml\n# docker-compose.yml\nversion: '3.8'\nservices:\n  # ==================== 系统基础设施层 ====================\n  # API网关\n  gateway:\n    build: ./gateway\n    ports:\n      - "8080:8080"     # 统一API入口\n      - "8080:8080"     # WebSocket网关\n    depends_on:\n      - infrastructure-backend\n      - basic-data-backend\n      - operation-backend\n      - ai-agent-backend\n    environment:\n      - HEALTH_CHECK_PORT=8082\n\n  # 基础设施模块\n  infrastructure-backend:\n    build: ./infrastructure/backend\n    ports:\n      - "8090:8090"     # 基础设施后端服务\n    environment:\n      - SERVER_PORT=8090\n      - DB_PATH=/data/infrastructure.db\n    volumes:\n      - ./data/infrastructure:/data\n    \n  infrastructure-frontend:\n    build: ./infrastructure/frontend\n    ports:\n      - "8000:8000"     # 基础设施前端\n    environment:\n      - REACT_APP_API_URL=http://localhost:8080/api/v1/infrastructure\n\n  # ==================== 业务服务层 ====================\n  # 基础数据模块\n  basic-data-backend:\n    build: ./business/basic-data/backend\n    ports:\n      - "9090:9090"     # 基础数据后端\n    environment:\n      - SERVER_PORT=9090\n      - DB_PATH=/data/basic_data.db\n    volumes:\n      - ./data/basic-data:/data\n      \n  basic-data-frontend:\n    build: ./business/basic-data/frontend\n    ports:\n      - "9000:9000"     # 基础数据前端\n    environment:\n      - REACT_APP_API_URL=http://localhost:8080/api/v1/basic-data\n\n  # 业务运营模块\n  operation-backend:\n    build: ./business/operation/backend\n    ports:\n      - "9091:9091"     # 业务运营后端\n    environment:\n      - SERVER_PORT=9091\n      - DB_PATH=/data/operation.db\n    volumes:\n      - ./data/operation:/data\n      \n  operation-frontend:\n    build: ./business/operation/frontend\n    ports:\n      - "9001:9001"     # 业务运营前端\n    environment:\n      - REACT_APP_API_URL=http://localhost:8080/api/v1/operation\n\n  # 组织权限模块\n  organization-backend:\n    build: ./business/organization/backend\n    ports:\n      - "9092:9092"     # 组织权限后端\n    environment:\n      - SERVER_PORT=9092\n      - DB_PATH=/data/organization.db\n    volumes:\n      - ./data/organization:/data\n      \n  organization-frontend:\n    build: ./business/organization/frontend\n    ports:\n      - "9002:9002"     # 组织权限前端\n    environment:\n      - REACT_APP_API_URL=http://localhost:8080/api/v1/organization\n\n  # 系统集成模块\n  integration-backend:\n    build: ./business/integration/backend\n    ports:\n      - "9093:9093"     # 系统集成后端\n    environment:\n      - SERVER_PORT=9093\n      - DB_PATH=/data/integration.db\n    volumes:\n      - ./data/integration:/data\n      \n  integration-frontend:\n    build: ./business/integration/frontend\n    ports:\n      - "9003:9003"     # 系统集成前端\n    environment:\n      - REACT_APP_API_URL=http://localhost:8080/api/v1/integration\n\n  # ==================== AI平台层 ====================\n  # AI智能体后端\n  ai-agent-backend:\n    build: ./ai-platform/agent-backend\n    ports:\n      - "10090:10090"   # AI智能体服务\n      - "10095:10095"   # 流式处理服务\n    environment:\n      - SERVER_PORT=10090\n      - STREAMING_PORT=10095\n      - OPENAI_API_KEY=${OPENAI_API_KEY}\n      - KNOWLEDGE_DB_URL=http://knowledge-service:10091\n      - MILVUS_URL=milvus:11530\n      - NEO4J_URL=neo4j:11687\n    depends_on:\n      - milvus\n      - neo4j\n      - knowledge-service\n      \n  # AI聊天前端\n  ai-chat-frontend:\n    build: ./ai-platform/chat-frontend\n    ports:\n      - "10000:10000"   # AI聊天界面\n    environment:\n      - REACT_APP_AI_API_URL=http://localhost:8080/api/v1/ai\n      - REACT_APP_WS_URL=ws://localhost:8080/ws\n\n  # 知识库服务\n  knowledge-service:\n    build: ./ai-platform/knowledge-service\n    ports:\n      - "10091:10091"   # 知识管理服务\n    environment:\n      - SERVER_PORT=10091\n      - MILVUS_URL=milvus:11530\n      - NEO4J_URL=neo4j:11687\n    volumes:\n      - ./ai-platform/knowledge:/data/knowledge\n\n  # 模型服务\n  model-service:\n    build: ./ai-platform/model-service\n    ports:\n      - "10092:10092"   # AI模型管理\n    environment:\n      - SERVER_PORT=10092\n      - MODEL_PATH=/models\n    volumes:\n      - ./ai-platform/models:/models\n    deploy:\n      resources:\n        reservations:\n          devices:\n            - driver: nvidia\n              count: 1\n              capabilities: [gpu]\n\n  # NLP服务\n  nlp-service:\n    build: ./ai-platform/nlp-service\n    ports:\n      - "10093:10093"   # 自然语言处理\n    environment:\n      - SERVER_PORT=10093\n      - MODEL_SERVICE_URL=http://model-service:10092\n\n  # 向量搜索服务\n  vector-search:\n    build: ./ai-platform/vector-search\n    ports:\n      - "10094:10094"   # 向量搜索\n    environment:\n      - SERVER_PORT=10094\n      - MILVUS_URL=milvus:11530\n\n  # ==================== 数据存储层 ====================\n  # SQLite主数据库（文件存储，无需暴露端口）\n  sqlite-data:\n    image: alpine:latest\n    volumes:\n      - ./data:/data\n    command: tail -f /dev/null\n\n  # Milvus向量数据库\n  milvus:\n    image: milvusdb/milvus:v2.3.0\n    ports:\n      - "11530:19530"   # Milvus gRPC\n      - "11531:9091"    # Milvus HTTP\n    environment:\n      - ETCD_ENDPOINTS=etcd:2379\n      - MINIO_ADDRESS=minio:9000\n    volumes:\n      - ./data/milvus:/var/lib/milvus\n    depends_on:\n      - etcd\n      - minio\n\n  # Neo4j知识图谱数据库\n  neo4j:\n    image: neo4j:5.0\n    ports:\n      - "11687:7687"    # Bolt协议\n      - "11474:7474"    # HTTP界面\n    environment:\n      - NEO4J_AUTH=neo4j/password\n      - NEO4J_dbms_security_procedures_unrestricted=apoc.*\n    volumes:\n      - ./data/neo4j:/data\n\n  # Redis缓存\n  redis:\n    image: redis:7-alpine\n    ports:\n      - "11379:6379"    # Redis服务\n      - "11380:26379"   # Redis Sentinel\n    volumes:\n      - ./data/redis:/data\n\n  # ==================== 中间件层 ====================\n  # Nginx负载均衡\n  nginx:\n    image: nginx:alpine\n    ports:\n      - "12080:80"      # 负载均衡\n      - "12081:8080"    # 静态资源\n    volumes:\n      - ./deployment/nginx/nginx.conf:/etc/nginx/nginx.conf\n      - ./deployment/nginx/static:/usr/share/nginx/html\n    depends_on:\n      - gateway\n\n  # RabbitMQ消息队列\n  rabbitmq:\n    image: rabbitmq:3-management\n    ports:\n      - "12672:5672"    # AMQP协议\n      - "12673:15672"   # 管理界面\n    environment:\n      - RABBITMQ_DEFAULT_USER=admin\n      - RABBITMQ_DEFAULT_PASS=password\n    volumes:\n      - ./data/rabbitmq:/var/lib/rabbitmq\n\n  # Consul服务发现\n  consul:\n    image: consul:latest\n    ports:\n      - "12500:8500"    # HTTP API\n      - "12501:8501"    # HTTPS API\n    command: consul agent -dev -client=0.0.0.0 -ui\n    volumes:\n      - ./data/consul:/consul/data\n\n  # Prometheus监控\n  prometheus:\n    image: prom/prometheus:latest\n    ports:\n      - "12090:9090"    # Prometheus服务\n    volumes:\n      - ./deployment/prometheus/prometheus.yml:/etc/prometheus/prometheus.yml\n      - ./data/prometheus:/prometheus\n\n  # Grafana监控仪表盘\n  grafana:\n    image: grafana/grafana:latest\n    ports:\n      - "12091:3000"    # Grafana界面\n    environment:\n      - GF_SECURITY_ADMIN_PASSWORD=admin\n    volumes:\n      - ./data/grafana:/var/lib/grafana\n      - ./deployment/grafana/dashboards:/etc/grafana/provisioning/dashboards\n\n  # Jaeger链路追踪\n  jaeger:\n    image: jaegertracing/all-in-one:latest\n    ports:\n      - "12086:16686"   # Jaeger UI\n      - "12085:14268"   # HTTP收集器\n    environment:\n      - COLLECTOR_OTLP_ENABLED=true\n\n  # ==================== 支持服务 ====================\n  # Etcd（Milvus依赖）\n  etcd:\n    image: quay.io/coreos/etcd:v3.5.0\n    environment:\n      - ETCD_AUTO_COMPACTION_MODE=revision\n      - ETCD_AUTO_COMPACTION_RETENTION=1000\n      - ETCD_QUOTA_BACKEND_BYTES=4294967296\n    volumes:\n      - ./data/etcd:/etcd\n    command: etcd -advertise-client-urls=http://127.0.0.1:2379 -listen-client-urls http://0.0.0.0:2379 --data-dir /etcd\n\n  # MinIO（Milvus依赖）\n  minio:\n    image: minio/minio:RELEASE.2023-03-20T20-16-18Z\n    ports:\n      - "11900:9000"    # MinIO API\n      - "11901:9001"    # MinIO Console\n    environment:\n      - MINIO_ACCESS_KEY=minioadmin\n      - MINIO_SECRET_KEY=minioadmin\n    volumes:\n      - ./data/minio:/data\n    command: minio server /data --console-address ":9001"\n\nvolumes:\n  data:\n    driver: local\n```\n\n### 6.4 开发环境端口规划\n\n```bash\n# 开发环境快速启动脚本\n# scripts/dev-start.sh\n\n#!/bin/bash\n\necho "🚀 启动李宁团购平台开发环境..."\n\n# 基础设施层\necho "📦 启动基础设施模块..."\ncd infrastructure/backend && go run cmd/server/main.go &  # 端口 8090\ncd infrastructure/frontend && npm start &                # 端口 8000\n\n# 业务服务层\necho "💼 启动业务模块..."\ncd business/basic-data/backend && go run cmd/server/main.go &     # 端口 9090\ncd business/basic-data/frontend && npm start &                    # 端口 9000\ncd business/operation/backend && go run cmd/server/main.go &      # 端口 9091\ncd business/operation/frontend && npm start &                     # 端口 9001\n\n# AI平台层\necho "🤖 启动AI平台..."\ncd ai-platform/agent-backend && go run cmd/agent-server/main.go & # 端口 10090\ncd ai-platform/chat-frontend && npm start &                       # 端口 10000\n\n# API网关\necho "🌐 启动API网关..."\ncd gateway && go run cmd/gateway/main.go &                        # 端口 8080\n\necho "✅ 开发环境启动完成！"\necho "🌟 访问地址："\necho "   - API网关: http://localhost:8080"\necho "   - 基础设施: http://localhost:8000"\necho "   - 基础数据: http://localhost:9000"\necho "   - 业务运营: http://localhost:9001"\necho "   - AI聊天: http://localhost:10000"\n```\n\n### 6.5 生产环境端口映射\n\n```yaml\n# deployment/k8s/ingress.yaml\napiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1\nkind: Ingress\nmetadata:\n  name: li-ning-platform-ingress\nspec:\n  rules:\n  - host: platform.lining.com\n    http:\n      paths:\n      - path: /api\n        pathType: Prefix\n        backend:\n          service:\n            name: gateway-service\n            port:\n              number: 8080\n      - path: /infrastructure\n        pathType: Prefix\n        backend:\n          service:\n            name: infrastructure-frontend\n            port:\n              number: 8000\n      - path: /business\n        pathType: Prefix\n        backend:\n          service:\n            name: business-frontend\n            port:\n              number: 9000\n      - path: /ai\n        pathType: Prefix\n        backend:\n          service:\n            name: ai-chat-frontend\n            port:\n              number: 10000\n```\n\n### 6.6 端口安全配置\n\n```yaml\n# deployment/security/network-policy.yaml\napiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1\nkind: NetworkPolicy\nmetadata:\n  name: li-ning-platform-network-policy\nspec:\n  podSelector: {}\n  policyTypes:\n  - Ingress\n  - Egress\n  ingress:\n  # 只允许通过API网关访问后端服务\n  - from:\n    - podSelector:\n        matchLabels:\n          app: gateway\n    ports:\n    - protocol: TCP\n      port: 8090  # infrastructure-backend\n    - protocol: TCP\n      port: 9090  # basic-data-backend\n    - protocol: TCP\n      port: 9091  # operation-backend\n    - protocol: TCP\n      port: 10090 # ai-agent-backend\n  # 允许前端访问\n  - ports:\n    - protocol: TCP\n      port: 8000  # infrastructure-frontend\n    - protocol: TCP\n      port: 9000  # basic-data-frontend\n    - protocol: TCP\n      port: 10000 # ai-chat-frontend\n```\n\n## 7. 开发与部署策略\n\n### 7.1 微服务开发顺序\n1. **基础设施模块**：认证、权限、日志、接口管理\n2. **业务模块**：基础数据 → 业务运营 → 组织管理 → 系统集成\n3. **AI平台**：知识库 → 智能体 → 聊天前端\n4. **API网关**：路由配置、负载均衡、服务发现\n\n### 7.2 模块间通信\n- **同步通信**：HTTP/gRPC API调用\n- **异步通信**：消息队列（Redis Pub/Sub）\n- **数据共享**：共享数据库 + 事件驱动\n- **AI集成**：WebSocket + 流式响应\n\n### 7.3 部署策略\n- **开发环境**：Docker Compose一键启动\n- **测试环境**：Kubernetes集群部署\n- **生产环境**：容器化 + 微服务架构\n- **AI服务**：GPU节点 + 模型缓存\n\n这个完整的系统架构设计为李宁团购平台提供了：\n- ✅ 清晰的模块边界和职责划分\n- ✅ 灵活的AI能力集成方案\n- ✅ 可扩展的微服务架构\n- ✅ 完整的开发和部署指导\n\n现在整个系统架构已经设计完成，可以按照这个结构进行分阶段开发！	1	2025-08-19 07:14:30.033236	2025-08-19 07:14:30.033236	\N	1	markdown	draft	\N	\N	team	\N	\N	\N	\N	{文件上传}	从文件 complete-system-architecture (1).md 上传	1	\N	\N	f	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N
