318	1	功能测试：admin用户权限验证 - 文档	# 功能测试：admin用户权限验证\n\n## 任务描述\n验证admin用户在取消免密码登录后，能够正常登录并拥有完整的系统管理员权限。\n\n## 测试环境设置\n- **项目路径**: `/Users/johnqiu/coding/www/projects/new-ai-proj`\n- **API基础路径**: `/api/v1`\n- **测试用户**: admin\n- **测试密码**: [需要从系统获取或重置]\n\n## 测试用例设计\n\n### 1. 认证功能测试\n\n#### TC-001: 标准登录测试\n**测试目标**: 验证admin用户能够使用密码正常登录\n**前置条件**: 免密码登录功能已移除\n**测试步骤**:\n1. 发送POST请求到 `/api/v1/auth/login`\n2. 请求体包含: `{"username": "admin", "password": "correct_password"}`\n3. 验证响应状态码为200\n4. 验证返回JWT token\n5. 验证token格式正确\n\n**预期结果**:\n```json\n{\n  "success": true,\n  "token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...",\n  "user": {\n    "id": 1,\n    "username": "admin",\n    "role": "administrator"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### TC-002: 错误密码登录测试\n**测试目标**: 验证错误密码被正确拒绝\n**测试步骤**:\n1. 使用错误密码尝试登录\n2. 验证返回401状态码\n3. 验证错误消息正确\n\n#### TC-003: 免密码登录阻止测试\n**测试目标**: 确认免密码登录已被完全禁用\n**测试步骤**:\n1. 尝试访问开发环境快速登录接口\n2. 验证接口不存在或返回错误\n3. 尝试不提供密码的登录请求\n\n### 2. 用户管理权限测试\n\n#### TC-004: 查看所有用户\n**API端点**: `GET /api/v1/admin/users`\n**测试步骤**:\n1. 使用admin token访问用户列表接口\n2. 验证能够获取完整用户列表\n3. 验证返回数据包含用户详细信息\n\n**预期结果**:\n```json\n{\n  "success": true,\n  "data": {\n    "users": [...],\n    "total": 10,\n    "page": 1\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### TC-005: 创建新用户\n**API端点**: `POST /api/v1/admin/users`\n**测试步骤**:\n1. 发送创建用户请求\n2. 验证用户创建成功\n3. 验证新用户出现在用户列表中\n\n**测试数据**:\n```json\n{\n  "username": "test_user_001",\n  "password": "TestPassword123!",\n  "email": "test001@example.com",\n  "role": "user"\n}\n```\n\n#### TC-006: 修改用户信息\n**API端点**: `PUT /api/v1/admin/users/{id}`\n**测试步骤**:\n1. 修改测试用户的信息\n2. 验证修改成功\n3. 验证修改后的信息正确保存\n\n#### TC-007: 删除用户\n**API端点**: `DELETE /api/v1/admin/users/{id}`\n**测试步骤**:\n1. 删除测试用户\n2. 验证删除成功\n3. 验证用户不再出现在列表中\n\n### 3. 系统配置权限测试\n\n#### TC-008: 查看系统配置\n**API端点**: `GET /api/v1/admin/system/config`\n**测试步骤**:\n1. 获取系统配置信息\n2. 验证能够访问敏感配置\n3. 验证配置信息完整\n\n#### TC-009: 修改系统配置\n**API端点**: `POST /api/v1/admin/system/config`\n**测试步骤**:\n1. 修改系统配置项\n2. 验证修改成功\n3. 验证配置生效\n\n#### TC-010: 查看系统日志\n**API端点**: `GET /api/v1/admin/system/logs`\n**测试步骤**:\n1. 获取系统日志\n2. 验证能够访问日志信息\n3. 验证日志内容正确\n\n### 4. 项目和数据管理权限测试\n\n#### TC-011: 访问所有项目数据\n**API端点**: `GET /api/v1/admin/projects`\n**测试步骤**:\n1. 获取所有项目列表\n2. 验证能够访问任意项目\n3. 验证项目数据完整\n\n#### TC-012: 管理任意用户的任务\n**API端点**: `GET /api/v1/admin/tasks`\n**测试步骤**:\n1. 获取所有用户的任务列表\n2. 验证能够查看任意用户的任务\n3. 验证能够修改任意用户的任务\n\n#### TC-013: 数据备份权限\n**API端点**: `POST /api/v1/admin/backup`\n**测试步骤**:\n1. 执行数据备份操作\n2. 验证备份成功\n3. 验证备份文件生成\n\n### 5. 权限边界测试\n\n#### TC-014: 跨权限访问测试\n**测试目标**: 确保admin权限范围正确\n**测试步骤**:\n1. 尝试访问不存在的管理接口\n2. 验证返回适当的错误\n3. 确认没有权限越界\n\n#### TC-015: Token过期处理\n**测试步骤**:\n1. 等待token过期或手动设置过期token\n2. 使用过期token访问管理接口\n3. 验证返回401未授权错误\n\n## 自动化测试脚本\n\n### 基础认证测试脚本\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n\nBASE_URL="http://localhost:3000/api/v1"\nADMIN_USER="admin"\nADMIN_PASS="admin_password"\n\n# 测试登录\necho "Testing admin login..."\nLOGIN_RESPONSE=$(curl -s -X POST "$BASE_URL/auth/login" \\\n  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \\\n  -d "{\\"username\\":\\"$ADMIN_USER\\",\\"password\\":\\"$ADMIN_PASS\\"}")\n\n# 提取token\nTOKEN=$(echo $LOGIN_RESPONSE | jq -r '.token')\n\nif [ "$TOKEN" = "null" ]; then\n  echo "❌ Admin login failed"\n  exit 1\nelse\n  echo "✅ Admin login successful"\nfi\n\n# 测试用户管理权限\necho "Testing user management permissions..."\nUSERS_RESPONSE=$(curl -s -X GET "$BASE_URL/admin/users" \\\n  -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN")\n\nif echo $USERS_RESPONSE | grep -q '"success":true'; then\n  echo "✅ User management permission verified"\nelse\n  echo "❌ User management permission failed"\nfi\n\n# 测试系统配置权限\necho "Testing system config permissions..."\nCONFIG_RESPONSE=$(curl -s -X GET "$BASE_URL/admin/system/config" \\\n  -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN")\n\nif echo $CONFIG_RESPONSE | grep -q '"success":true'; then\n  echo "✅ System config permission verified"\nelse\n  echo "❌ System config permission failed"\nfi\n```\n\n### Python自动化测试脚本\n```python\nimport requests\nimport json\n\nclass AdminPermissionTester:\n    def __init__(self, base_url, username, password):\n        self.base_url = base_url\n        self.username = username\n        self.password = password\n        self.token = None\n        \n    def login(self):\n        """测试登录功能"""\n        login_data = {\n            "username": self.username,\n            "password": self.password\n        }\n        \n        response = requests.post(\n            f"{self.base_url}/auth/login",\n            json=login_data\n        )\n        \n        if response.status_code == 200:\n            self.token = response.json().get('token')\n            print("✅ Admin login successful")\n            return True\n        else:\n            print("❌ Admin login failed")\n            return False\n    \n    def test_user_management(self):\n        """测试用户管理权限"""\n        headers = {"Authorization": f"Bearer {self.token}"}\n        \n        # 获取用户列表\n        response = requests.get(\n            f"{self.base_url}/admin/users",\n            headers=headers\n        )\n        \n        if response.status_code == 200:\n            print("✅ User list access successful")\n        else:\n            print("❌ User list access failed")\n            \n    def run_all_tests(self):\n        """运行所有测试"""\n        if self.login():\n            self.test_user_management()\n            # 添加更多测试...\n\n# 使用示例\ntester = AdminPermissionTester(\n    "http://localhost:3000/api/v1",\n    "admin",\n    "admin_password"\n)\ntester.run_all_tests()\n```\n\n## 性能验证\n\n### 响应时间测试\n- 登录响应时间应小于500ms\n- 用户列表查询应小于1000ms\n- 系统配置查询应小于200ms\n\n### 并发测试\n- 同时10个admin操作请求\n- 验证系统稳定性\n- 检查是否有竞态条件\n\n## 测试数据管理\n\n### 测试前准备\n1. 确保admin用户存在且密码正确\n2. 准备测试用的普通用户数据\n3. 备份重要的系统配置\n\n### 测试后清理\n1. 删除测试过程中创建的用户\n2. 恢复修改的系统配置\n3. 清理测试日志\n\n## 问题记录和追踪\n\n### 测试结果记录表格\n| 测试用例 | 状态 | 执行时间 | 问题描述 | 解决方案 |\n|---------|------|----------|----------|----------|\n| TC-001  | ✅   | 2025-08-26 10:00 | - | - |\n| TC-002  | ❌   | 2025-08-26 10:05 | 密码验证失败 | 检查密码哈希算法 |\n| ...     | ...  | ... | ... | ... |\n\n### 缺陷跟踪\n- **高优先级**: 影响基本登录功能的问题\n- **中优先级**: 影响管理功能的问题  \n- **低优先级**: 性能或体验问题\n\n## 完成标准\n1. ✅ admin用户能够正常登录（密码认证）\n2. ✅ 所有用户管理功能正常\n3. ✅ 所有系统配置权限正常\n4. ✅ 所有项目数据访问权限正常\n5. ✅ 权限边界控制正确\n6. ✅ 性能指标满足要求\n7. ✅ 所有测试用例通过\n8. ✅ 无安全漏洞或权限越界\n\n## 预估工时\n- 测试用例设计: 1小时\n- 手动测试执行: 2小时\n- 自动化脚本开发: 1.5小时\n- 问题修复和复测: 1小时\n- 测试报告编写: 0.5小时\n- **总计**: 6小时\n	1	2025-08-26 02:27:59.094314	2025-08-26 02:27:59.094314	\N	1	markdown	draft	\N	\N	team	\N	\N	0	\N	{mcp-generated}	任务 #545 的关联文档	1	\N	{"source": "claude-code-mcp", "task_id": "545", "created_by": "mcp-bridge"}	f	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N
319	1	功能测试：qiudl用户权限验证 - 文档	# 功能测试：qiudl用户权限验证\n\n## 任务描述\n验证qiudl用户在取消免密码登录后，能够正常登录并拥有完整的系统管理员权限。与admin用户权限测试并行执行，确保两个系统管理员用户的权限一致性。\n\n## 测试环境设置\n- **项目路径**: `/Users/johnqiu/coding/www/projects/new-ai-proj`\n- **API基础路径**: `/api/v1`\n- **测试用户**: qiudl\n- **测试密码**: [需要从系统获取或重置]\n\n## 测试用例设计\n\n### 1. 认证功能测试\n\n#### TC-QD-001: 标准登录测试\n**测试目标**: 验证qiudl用户能够使用密码正常登录\n**前置条件**: 免密码登录功能已移除\n**测试步骤**:\n1. 发送POST请求到 `/api/v1/auth/login`\n2. 请求体包含: `{"username": "qiudl", "password": "correct_password"}`\n3. 验证响应状态码为200\n4. 验证返回JWT token\n5. 验证token格式正确\n\n**预期结果**:\n```json\n{\n  "success": true,\n  "token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...",\n  "user": {\n    "id": 2,\n    "username": "qiudl",\n    "role": "administrator"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### TC-QD-002: 错误密码登录测试\n**测试目标**: 验证错误密码被正确拒绝\n**测试步骤**:\n1. 使用错误密码尝试登录\n2. 验证返回401状态码\n3. 验证错误消息正确\n\n#### TC-QD-003: 免密码登录阻止测试\n**测试目标**: 确认qiudl用户的免密码登录已被完全禁用\n**测试步骤**:\n1. 尝试使用开发环境特殊接口登录qiudl\n2. 验证接口不存在或返回错误\n3. 尝试不提供密码的登录请求\n\n### 2. 用户管理权限测试\n\n#### TC-QD-004: 查看所有用户\n**API端点**: `GET /api/v1/admin/users`\n**测试步骤**:\n1. 使用qiudl token访问用户列表接口\n2. 验证能够获取完整用户列表\n3. 验证返回数据包含所有用户详细信息\n4. 对比与admin用户获取的数据一致性\n\n#### TC-QD-005: 创建新用户\n**API端点**: `POST /api/v1/admin/users`\n**测试步骤**:\n1. 使用qiudl权限创建测试用户\n2. 验证用户创建成功\n3. 验证新用户出现在用户列表中\n\n**测试数据**:\n```json\n{\n  "username": "test_user_qd_001",\n  "password": "TestPassword123!",\n  "email": "testqd001@example.com",\n  "role": "user"\n}\n```\n\n#### TC-QD-006: 修改用户信息\n**API端点**: `PUT /api/v1/admin/users/{id}`\n**测试步骤**:\n1. 修改测试用户的信息\n2. 验证修改成功\n3. 验证修改后的信息正确保存\n4. 验证qiudl有修改其他用户的权限\n\n#### TC-QD-007: 用户权限分配\n**测试目标**: 验证qiudl能够管理其他用户的权限\n**测试步骤**:\n1. 修改测试用户的角色\n2. 分配/撤销用户权限\n3. 验证权限变更生效\n\n#### TC-QD-008: 删除用户\n**API端点**: `DELETE /api/v1/admin/users/{id}`\n**测试步骤**:\n1. 删除测试用户\n2. 验证删除成功\n3. 验证用户不再出现在列表中\n\n### 3. 系统配置权限测试\n\n#### TC-QD-009: 查看系统配置\n**API端点**: `GET /api/v1/admin/system/config`\n**测试步骤**:\n1. 使用qiudl token获取系统配置\n2. 验证能够访问敏感配置\n3. 验证配置信息完整\n4. 对比与admin用户权限的一致性\n\n#### TC-QD-010: 修改系统配置\n**API端点**: `POST /api/v1/admin/system/config`\n**测试步骤**:\n1. 修改系统配置项\n2. 验证修改成功\n3. 验证配置变更生效\n4. 测试配置修改对系统的影响\n\n#### TC-QD-011: 系统维护操作\n**测试范围**: 系统重启、清理缓存等维护操作\n**测试步骤**:\n1. 执行系统维护命令\n2. 验证操作权限\n3. 验证操作结果\n\n### 4. 日志和监控权限测试\n\n#### TC-QD-012: 查看系统日志\n**API端点**: `GET /api/v1/admin/system/logs`\n**测试步骤**:\n1. 获取系统日志\n2. 验证能够访问所有级别的日志\n3. 测试日志筛选和搜索功能\n\n#### TC-QD-013: 用户行为日志\n**测试步骤**:\n1. 查看用户活动日志\n2. 验证能够监控所有用户行为\n3. 测试日志导出功能\n\n#### TC-QD-014: 系统监控权限\n**测试步骤**:\n1. 访问系统监控面板\n2. 查看系统性能指标\n3. 验证告警管理权限\n\n### 5. 数据管理权限测试\n\n#### TC-QD-015: 项目数据访问\n**API端点**: `GET /api/v1/admin/projects`\n**测试步骤**:\n1. 获取所有项目数据\n2. 验证跨项目访问权限\n3. 测试项目设置修改权限\n\n#### TC-QD-016: 任务数据管理\n**API端点**: `GET /api/v1/admin/tasks`\n**测试步骤**:\n1. 访问所有用户的任务数据\n2. 修改任意用户的任务\n3. 批量操作任务数据\n\n#### TC-QD-017: 文档和笔记管理\n**测试步骤**:\n1. 访问所有用户的工作笔记\n2. 管理任务文档\n3. 批量文档操作权限\n\n#### TC-QD-018: 数据备份和恢复\n**API端点**: `POST /api/v1/admin/backup`\n**测试步骤**:\n1. 执行数据备份操作\n2. 测试数据恢复功能\n3. 验证备份完整性\n\n### 6. 权限一致性测试\n\n#### TC-QD-019: 与admin权限对比\n**测试目标**: 确保qiudl与admin具有相同的管理员权限\n**测试步骤**:\n1. 并行执行qiudl和admin的相同操作\n2. 对比操作结果和权限范围\n3. 验证权限完全一致\n\n#### TC-QD-020: 权限边界测试\n**测试步骤**:\n1. 尝试访问超出权限范围的接口\n2. 验证返回适当的错误码\n3. 确认没有权限泄露\n\n## 专项测试脚本\n\n### qiudl用户认证测试脚本\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n\nBASE_URL="http://localhost:3000/api/v1"\nQIUDL_USER="qiudl"\nQIUDL_PASS="qiudl_password"\n\necho "========== qiudl用户权限测试 =========="\n\n# 测试登录\necho "Testing qiudl login..."\nLOGIN_RESPONSE=$(curl -s -X POST "$BASE_URL/auth/login" \\\n  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \\\n  -d "{\\"username\\":\\"$QIUDL_USER\\",\\"password\\":\\"$QIUDL_PASS\\"}")\n\n# 提取token\nTOKEN=$(echo $LOGIN_RESPONSE | jq -r '.token')\n\nif [ "$TOKEN" = "null" ]; then\n  echo "❌ qiudl login failed"\n  echo "Response: $LOGIN_RESPONSE"\n  exit 1\nelse\n  echo "✅ qiudl login successful"\n  echo "Token: ${TOKEN:0:20}..."\nfi\n\n# 测试用户管理权限\necho "Testing qiudl user management permissions..."\nUSERS_RESPONSE=$(curl -s -X GET "$BASE_URL/admin/users" \\\n  -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN")\n\nif echo $USERS_RESPONSE | grep -q '"success":true'; then\n  echo "✅ qiudl user management permission verified"\n  USER_COUNT=$(echo $USERS_RESPONSE | jq '.data.total')\n  echo "   Total users accessible: $USER_COUNT"\nelse\n  echo "❌ qiudl user management permission failed"\n  echo "Response: $USERS_RESPONSE"\nfi\n\n# 创建测试用户\necho "Testing user creation by qiudl..."\nCREATE_USER_RESPONSE=$(curl -s -X POST "$BASE_URL/admin/users" \\\n  -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN" \\\n  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \\\n  -d '{\n    "username": "test_qiudl_user",\n    "password": "TestPass123!",\n    "email": "test@qiudl.com",\n    "role": "user"\n  }')\n\nif echo $CREATE_USER_RESPONSE | grep -q '"success":true'; then\n  echo "✅ qiudl user creation successful"\n  NEW_USER_ID=$(echo $CREATE_USER_RESPONSE | jq '.data.id')\n  echo "   New user ID: $NEW_USER_ID"\n  \n  # 清理测试用户\n  echo "Cleaning up test user..."\n  curl -s -X DELETE "$BASE_URL/admin/users/$NEW_USER_ID" \\\n    -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN" > /dev/null\n  echo "✅ Test user cleaned up"\nelse\n  echo "❌ qiudl user creation failed"\n  echo "Response: $CREATE_USER_RESPONSE"\nfi\n\necho "========== qiudl权限测试完成 =========="\n```\n\n### Python权限对比测试\n```python\nimport requests\nimport json\nfrom concurrent.futures import ThreadPoolExecutor\n\nclass PermissionComparisonTester:\n    def __init__(self, base_url):\n        self.base_url = base_url\n        self.admin_token = None\n        self.qiudl_token = None\n        \n    def login_user(self, username, password):\n        """用户登录"""\n        login_data = {\n            "username": username,\n            "password": password\n        }\n        \n        response = requests.post(\n            f"{self.base_url}/auth/login",\n            json=login_data\n        )\n        \n        if response.status_code == 200:\n            return response.json().get('token')\n        return None\n    \n    def setup_tokens(self, admin_pass, qiudl_pass):\n        """设置测试tokens"""\n        self.admin_token = self.login_user("admin", admin_pass)\n        self.qiudl_token = self.login_user("qiudl", qiudl_pass)\n        \n        return self.admin_token and self.qiudl_token\n    \n    def compare_permissions(self, endpoint, method='GET', data=None):\n        """对比两个用户的权限"""\n        headers_admin = {"Authorization": f"Bearer {self.admin_token}"}\n        headers_qiudl = {"Authorization": f"Bearer {self.qiudl_token}"}\n        \n        # 并行请求\n        with ThreadPoolExecutor(max_workers=2) as executor:\n            if method == 'GET':\n                admin_future = executor.submit(\n                    requests.get, \n                    f"{self.base_url}{endpoint}", \n                    headers=headers_admin\n                )\n                qiudl_future = executor.submit(\n                    requests.get, \n                    f"{self.base_url}{endpoint}", \n                    headers=headers_qiudl\n                )\n            elif method == 'POST':\n                admin_future = executor.submit(\n                    requests.post, \n                    f"{self.base_url}{endpoint}", \n                    headers=headers_admin, \n                    json=data\n                )\n                qiudl_future = executor.submit(\n                    requests.post, \n                    f"{self.base_url}{endpoint}", \n                    headers=headers_qiudl, \n                    json=data\n                )\n            \n            admin_response = admin_future.result()\n            qiudl_response = qiudl_future.result()\n        \n        # 比较结果\n        admin_status = admin_response.status_code\n        qiudl_status = qiudl_response.status_code\n        \n        if admin_status == qiudl_status:\n            print(f"✅ {endpoint}: 权限一致 (状态码: {admin_status})")\n        else:\n            print(f"❌ {endpoint}: 权限不一致 (admin: {admin_status}, qiudl: {qiudl_status})")\n            \n        return admin_status == qiudl_status\n    \n    def run_permission_comparison(self):\n        """运行权限对比测试"""\n        test_endpoints = [\n            ("/admin/users", "GET"),\n            ("/admin/system/config", "GET"),\n            ("/admin/system/logs", "GET"),\n            ("/admin/projects", "GET"),\n            ("/admin/tasks", "GET")\n        ]\n        \n        results = []\n        for endpoint, method in test_endpoints:\n            result = self.compare_permissions(endpoint, method)\n            results.append(result)\n        \n        success_rate = sum(results) / len(results) * 100\n        print(f"\\n权限一致性测试成功率: {success_rate}%")\n        \n        return all(results)\n\n# 使用示例\ntester = PermissionComparisonTester("http://localhost:3000/api/v1")\nif tester.setup_tokens("admin_password", "qiudl_password"):\n    tester.run_permission_comparison()\nelse:\n    print("登录失败，无法进行权限对比测试")\n```\n\n## 性能和压力测试\n\n### 并发登录测试\n```python\nimport concurrent.futures\nimport time\nimport requests\n\ndef concurrent_login_test(base_url, username, password, num_requests=10):\n    """并发登录测试"""\n    \n    def single_login():\n        start_time = time.time()\n        response = requests.post(\n            f"{base_url}/auth/login",\n            json={"username": username, "password": password}\n        )\n        end_time = time.time()\n        return {\n            "status_code": response.status_code,\n            "response_time": end_time - start_time,\n            "success": response.status_code == 200\n        }\n    \n    # 并发执行登录请求\n    with concurrent.futures.ThreadPoolExecutor(max_workers=num_requests) as executor:\n        futures = [executor.submit(single_login) for _ in range(num_requests)]\n        results = [future.result() for future in concurrent.futures.as_completed(futures)]\n    \n    # 统计结果\n    success_count = sum(1 for r in results if r["success"])\n    avg_response_time = sum(r["response_time"] for r in results) / len(results)\n    \n    print(f"qiudl并发登录测试结果:")\n    print(f"  成功率: {success_count}/{num_requests} ({success_count/num_requests*100:.1f}%)")\n    print(f"  平均响应时间: {avg_response_time:.3f}s")\n    print(f"  最大响应时间: {max(r['response_time'] for r in results):.3f}s")\n    print(f"  最小响应时间: {min(r['response_time'] for r in results):.3f}s")\n\n# 执行测试\nconcurrent_login_test("http://localhost:3000/api/v1", "qiudl", "qiudl_password")\n```\n\n## 测试报告模板\n\n### qiudl用户权限测试报告\n```\n测试执行日期: 2025-08-26\n测试人员: [测试人员姓名]\n测试环境: 开发环境\n\n一、测试概览\n- 测试用例总数: 20\n- 通过数量: [X]\n- 失败数量: [X]  \n- 跳过数量: [X]\n- 成功率: [X]%\n\n二、功能测试结果\n认证功能: [✅/❌]\n用户管理: [✅/❌]\n系统配置: [✅/❌]\n日志监控: [✅/❌]\n数据管理: [✅/❌]\n\n三、性能测试结果\n登录响应时间: [X]ms\n并发处理能力: [X] 请求/秒\n权限检查时间: [X]ms\n\n四、权限一致性验证\n与admin用户权限对比: [✅/❌]\n权限边界控制: [✅/❌]\n\n五、发现的问题\n[列出发现的问题和解决方案]\n\n六、测试结论\n[总体评估和建议]\n```\n\n## 完成标准\n1. ✅ qiudl用户能够正常登录（密码认证）\n2. ✅ 所有用户管理功能正常\n3. ✅ 所有系统配置权限正常\n4. ✅ 所有数据访问权限正常\n5. ✅ 与admin用户权限完全一致\n6. ✅ 权限边界控制正确\n7. ✅ 性能指标满足要求\n8. ✅ 所有测试用例通过\n9. ✅ 并发测试通过\n10. ✅ 无安全漏洞或权限异常\n\n## 预估工时\n- 测试用例设计: 1小时\n- 手动测试执行: 2小时\n- 权限对比测试: 1小时\n- 自动化脚本开发: 1.5小时\n- 性能和并发测试: 1小时\n- 问题修复和复测: 1小时\n- 测试报告编写: 0.5小时\n- **总计**: 8小时\n	1	2025-08-26 02:29:06.187232	2025-08-26 02:29:06.187232	\N	1	markdown	draft	\N	\N	team	\N	\N	0	\N	{mcp-generated}	任务 #546 的关联文档	1	\N	{"source": "claude-code-mcp", "task_id": "546", "created_by": "mcp-bridge"}	f	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N
320	1	安全测试：认证和授权验证 - 文档	# 安全测试：认证和授权验证\n\n## 任务描述\n对取消免密码登录功能后的系统进行全面的安全测试，验证认证机制的安全性和授权控制的有效性，确保没有安全漏洞。\n\n## 安全测试范围\n\n### 1. 认证安全测试\n\n#### 1.1 密码安全策略测试\n**测试目标**: 验证密码策略的有效性\n\n**ST-001: 弱密码拒绝测试**\n```bash\n# 测试各种弱密码\ncurl -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login \\\n  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \\\n  -d '{"username":"admin","password":"123456"}'\n\ncurl -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login \\\n  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \\\n  -d '{"username":"admin","password":"admin"}'\n```\n**预期结果**: 应返回密码不符合安全策略的错误\n\n**ST-002: 密码复杂度验证**\n测试密码复杂度要求：\n- 最小长度（应≥8位）\n- 包含大小写字母\n- 包含数字\n- 包含特殊字符\n\n**ST-003: 密码暴力破解防护**\n```python\nimport requests\nimport time\n\ndef brute_force_test(base_url, username, password_list):\n    """暴力破解防护测试"""\n    attempt_count = 0\n    \n    for password in password_list:\n        attempt_count += 1\n        response = requests.post(\n            f"{base_url}/auth/login",\n            json={"username": username, "password": password}\n        )\n        \n        print(f"Attempt {attempt_count}: {password} -> {response.status_code}")\n        \n        # 检查是否有频率限制\n        if response.status_code == 429:  # Too Many Requests\n            print("✅ Rate limiting detected")\n            return True\n        \n        time.sleep(0.1)  # 避免过快请求\n    \n    print("❌ No rate limiting detected")\n    return False\n\n# 测试常见密码列表\ncommon_passwords = [\n    "password", "123456", "admin", "qwerty", \n    "abc123", "password123", "admin123"\n]\n\nbrute_force_test("http://localhost:3000/api/v1", "admin", common_passwords)\n```\n\n#### 1.2 会话管理安全测试\n\n**ST-004: JWT Token安全验证**\n```bash\n# 测试无效token\ncurl -X GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/admin/users \\\n  -H "Authorization: Bearer invalid_token_here"\n\n# 测试空token\ncurl -X GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/admin/users \\\n  -H "Authorization: Bearer "\n\n# 测试恶意构造的token\ncurl -X GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/admin/users \\\n  -H "Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.malicious_payload"\n```\n\n**ST-005: Token过期处理测试**\n```python\nimport jwt\nimport time\nimport requests\n\ndef test_token_expiration(base_url, username, password):\n    """测试token过期处理"""\n    \n    # 正常登录获取token\n    login_response = requests.post(\n        f"{base_url}/auth/login",\n        json={"username": username, "password": password}\n    )\n    \n    if login_response.status_code != 200:\n        print("❌ Login failed")\n        return\n    \n    token = login_response.json().get('token')\n    \n    # 解码token查看过期时间\n    try:\n        decoded = jwt.decode(token, options={"verify_signature": False})\n        exp_time = decoded.get('exp')\n        current_time = int(time.time())\n        \n        print(f"Token expires at: {exp_time}")\n        print(f"Current time: {current_time}")\n        print(f"Valid for: {exp_time - current_time} seconds")\n        \n        # 测试过期token (需要等待或手动构造过期token)\n        # 这里可以构造一个已过期的token进行测试\n        \n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f"Token decode error: {e}")\n\ntest_token_expiration("http://localhost:3000/api/v1", "admin", "admin_password")\n```\n\n**ST-006: 会话固定攻击防护**\n```bash\n# 测试是否在登录后生成新的session token\n# 1. 获取初始token\n# 2. 登录后检查是否生成了新的token\n# 3. 确保旧token失效\n```\n\n### 2. 授权安全测试\n\n#### 2.1 权限提升攻击测试\n\n**ST-007: 水平权限提升测试**\n```python\ndef test_horizontal_privilege_escalation(base_url):\n    """测试用户是否能访问其他用户的数据"""\n    \n    # 创建两个测试用户\n    admin_token = login_and_get_token(base_url, "admin", "admin_pass")\n    \n    # 创建普通用户\n    create_response = requests.post(\n        f"{base_url}/admin/users",\n        headers={"Authorization": f"Bearer {admin_token}"},\n        json={\n            "username": "test_user1",\n            "password": "TestPass123!",\n            "role": "user"\n        }\n    )\n    \n    user1_id = create_response.json().get('data', {}).get('id')\n    \n    # 创建第二个普通用户\n    create_response2 = requests.post(\n        f"{base_url}/admin/users",\n        headers={"Authorization": f"Bearer {admin_token}"},\n        json={\n            "username": "test_user2", \n            "password": "TestPass123!",\n            "role": "user"\n        }\n    )\n    \n    user2_id = create_response2.json().get('data', {}).get('id')\n    \n    # 让user1尝试访问user2的数据\n    user1_token = login_and_get_token(base_url, "test_user1", "TestPass123!")\n    \n    # 尝试访问其他用户的任务\n    response = requests.get(\n        f"{base_url}/users/{user2_id}/tasks",\n        headers={"Authorization": f"Bearer {user1_token}"}\n    )\n    \n    if response.status_code == 403:\n        print("✅ Horizontal privilege escalation prevented")\n    else:\n        print("❌ Horizontal privilege escalation possible")\n    \n    # 清理测试数据\n    cleanup_test_users(base_url, admin_token, [user1_id, user2_id])\n```\n\n**ST-008: 垂直权限提升测试**\n```python\ndef test_vertical_privilege_escalation(base_url):\n    """测试普通用户是否能获得管理员权限"""\n    \n    admin_token = login_and_get_token(base_url, "admin", "admin_pass")\n    \n    # 创建普通用户\n    create_response = requests.post(\n        f"{base_url}/admin/users",\n        headers={"Authorization": f"Bearer {admin_token}"},\n        json={\n            "username": "normal_user",\n            "password": "NormalPass123!",\n            "role": "user"\n        }\n    )\n    \n    user_token = login_and_get_token(base_url, "normal_user", "NormalPass123!")\n    \n    # 尝试访问管理员功能\n    admin_endpoints = [\n        "/admin/users",\n        "/admin/system/config",\n        "/admin/system/logs"\n    ]\n    \n    escalation_possible = False\n    \n    for endpoint in admin_endpoints:\n        response = requests.get(\n            f"{base_url}{endpoint}",\n            headers={"Authorization": f"Bearer {user_token}"}\n        )\n        \n        if response.status_code == 200:\n            print(f"❌ Vertical escalation possible at {endpoint}")\n            escalation_possible = True\n        else:\n            print(f"✅ Access denied to {endpoint}")\n    \n    if not escalation_possible:\n        print("✅ Vertical privilege escalation prevented")\n    \n    # 清理测试用户\n    user_id = create_response.json().get('data', {}).get('id')\n    cleanup_test_users(base_url, admin_token, [user_id])\n```\n\n#### 2.2 API安全测试\n\n**ST-009: SQL注入攻击测试**\n```python\ndef test_sql_injection(base_url, admin_token):\n    """测试SQL注入漏洞"""\n    \n    sql_payloads = [\n        "'; DROP TABLE users; --",\n        "' OR '1'='1",\n        "'; UPDATE users SET role='admin' WHERE username='test'; --",\n        "' UNION SELECT * FROM users --"\n    ]\n    \n    for payload in sql_payloads:\n        # 测试用户创建接口\n        response = requests.post(\n            f"{base_url}/admin/users",\n            headers={"Authorization": f"Bearer {admin_token}"},\n            json={\n                "username": payload,\n                "password": "TestPass123!",\n                "role": "user"\n            }\n        )\n        \n        print(f"SQL Injection payload: {payload[:20]}... -> {response.status_code}")\n        \n        # 检查响应中是否有数据库错误信息泄露\n        if "error" in response.text.lower() and ("sql" in response.text.lower() or "database" in response.text.lower()):\n            print("❌ Possible SQL injection vulnerability detected")\n        else:\n            print("✅ SQL injection payload handled safely")\n```\n\n**ST-010: XSS攻击防护测试**\n```python\ndef test_xss_protection(base_url, admin_token):\n    """测试XSS攻击防护"""\n    \n    xss_payloads = [\n        "<script>alert('XSS')</script>",\n        "javascript:alert('XSS')",\n        "<img src=x onerror=alert('XSS')>",\n        "';alert('XSS');//"\n    ]\n    \n    for payload in xss_payloads:\n        response = requests.post(\n            f"{base_url}/admin/users",\n            headers={"Authorization": f"Bearer {admin_token}"},\n            json={\n                "username": f"test_user_{hash(payload)}",\n                "password": "TestPass123!",\n                "email": payload,  # 测试邮箱字段\n                "role": "user"\n            }\n        )\n        \n        print(f"XSS payload in email: {payload[:20]}... -> {response.status_code}")\n        \n        # 检查响应是否对输入进行了适当的转义\n        if payload in response.text:\n            print("❌ Possible XSS vulnerability - payload not escaped")\n        else:\n            print("✅ XSS payload properly handled")\n```\n\n### 3. 网络安全测试\n\n#### 3.1 传输安全测试\n\n**ST-011: HTTPS强制使用测试**\n```bash\n# 测试是否强制使用HTTPS\ncurl -I http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login\n\n# 检查HTTPS重定向\ncurl -I -L http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login\n```\n\n**ST-012: 安全头检查**\n```python\nimport requests\n\ndef check_security_headers(base_url):\n    """检查安全HTTP头"""\n    \n    response = requests.get(f"{base_url}/auth/login")\n    headers = response.headers\n    \n    security_headers = {\n        'X-Content-Type-Options': 'nosniff',\n        'X-Frame-Options': 'DENY',\n        'X-XSS-Protection': '1; mode=block',\n        'Strict-Transport-Security': 'max-age=',\n        'Content-Security-Policy': '',\n        'Referrer-Policy': 'strict-origin-when-cross-origin'\n    }\n    \n    for header, expected in security_headers.items():\n        if header in headers:\n            if expected and expected in headers[header]:\n                print(f"✅ {header}: {headers[header]}")\n            elif not expected:\n                print(f"✅ {header}: Present")\n            else:\n                print(f"⚠️  {header}: {headers[header]} (check configuration)")\n        else:\n            print(f"❌ {header}: Missing")\n\ncheck_security_headers("http://localhost:3000/api/v1")\n```\n\n### 4. 业务逻辑安全测试\n\n#### 4.1 竞态条件测试\n\n**ST-013: 并发操作安全测试**\n```python\nimport threading\nimport requests\nimport time\n\ndef test_race_conditions(base_url, admin_token):\n    """测试并发操作的安全性"""\n    \n    # 创建测试用户\n    create_response = requests.post(\n        f"{base_url}/admin/users",\n        headers={"Authorization": f"Bearer {admin_token}"},\n        json={\n            "username": "race_test_user",\n            "password": "TestPass123!",\n            "role": "user"\n        }\n    )\n    \n    user_id = create_response.json().get('data', {}).get('id')\n    \n    def concurrent_delete():\n        """并发删除用户"""\n        response = requests.delete(\n            f"{base_url}/admin/users/{user_id}",\n            headers={"Authorization": f"Bearer {admin_token}"}\n        )\n        return response.status_code\n    \n    # 同时启动多个删除请求\n    threads = []\n    results = []\n    \n    for i in range(5):\n        thread = threading.Thread(target=lambda: results.append(concurrent_delete()))\n        threads.append(thread)\n        thread.start()\n    \n    for thread in threads:\n        thread.join()\n    \n    success_count = sum(1 for status in results if status == 200)\n    \n    if success_count <= 1:\n        print("✅ Race condition handled properly")\n    else:\n        print(f"❌ Race condition detected - {success_count} successful deletes")\n```\n\n### 5. 日志和监控安全测试\n\n#### 5.1 敏感信息泄露测试\n\n**ST-014: 日志安全检查**\n```bash\n# 检查日志文件是否包含敏感信息\ngrep -r "password" logs/ 2>/dev/null || echo "No password logs found"\ngrep -r "token" logs/ 2>/dev/null | head -5\ngrep -r "secret" logs/ 2>/dev/null || echo "No secret logs found"\n\n# 检查错误信息是否泄露系统信息\ncurl -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login \\\n  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \\\n  -d '{"username":"nonexistent","password":"test"}' \\\n  | grep -i "stack\\|error\\|debug" || echo "No sensitive error info exposed"\n```\n\n### 6. 安全测试自动化脚本\n\n```python\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\n"""\n安全测试自动化脚本\n"""\n\nimport requests\nimport time\nimport jwt\nimport threading\nfrom concurrent.futures import ThreadPoolExecutor\n\nclass SecurityTester:\n    def __init__(self, base_url):\n        self.base_url = base_url\n        self.admin_token = None\n        self.test_results = []\n        \n    def login_admin(self, username, password):\n        """管理员登录"""\n        response = requests.post(\n            f"{self.base_url}/auth/login",\n            json={"username": username, "password": password}\n        )\n        \n        if response.status_code == 200:\n            self.admin_token = response.json().get('token')\n            return True\n        return False\n    \n    def run_all_tests(self):\n        """运行所有安全测试"""\n        tests = [\n            ("认证安全测试", self.test_authentication_security),\n            ("授权安全测试", self.test_authorization_security),\n            ("API安全测试", self.test_api_security),\n            ("网络安全测试", self.test_network_security),\n            ("业务逻辑安全测试", self.test_business_logic_security)\n        ]\n        \n        for test_name, test_func in tests:\n            print(f"\\n{'='*20} {test_name} {'='*20}")\n            try:\n                result = test_func()\n                self.test_results.append((test_name, result))\n            except Exception as e:\n                print(f"❌ {test_name} 执行失败: {e}")\n                self.test_results.append((test_name, False))\n        \n        self.generate_report()\n    \n    def test_authentication_security(self):\n        """认证安全测试"""\n        print("Testing authentication security...")\n        # 实现各种认证安全测试\n        return True\n    \n    def test_authorization_security(self):\n        """授权安全测试"""\n        print("Testing authorization security...")\n        # 实现授权安全测试\n        return True\n    \n    def test_api_security(self):\n        """API安全测试"""\n        print("Testing API security...")\n        # 实现API安全测试\n        return True\n    \n    def test_network_security(self):\n        """网络安全测试"""\n        print("Testing network security...")\n        # 实现网络安全测试\n        return True\n    \n    def test_business_logic_security(self):\n        """业务逻辑安全测试"""\n        print("Testing business logic security...")\n        # 实现业务逻辑安全测试\n        return True\n    \n    def generate_report(self):\n        """生成测试报告"""\n        print(f"\\n{'='*50}")\n        print("安全测试报告")\n        print(f"{'='*50}")\n        \n        total_tests = len(self.test_results)\n        passed_tests = sum(1 for _, result in self.test_results if result)\n        \n        print(f"总测试数: {total_tests}")\n        print(f"通过数: {passed_tests}")\n        print(f"失败数: {total_tests - passed_tests}")\n        print(f"成功率: {passed_tests/total_tests*100:.1f}%")\n        \n        print("\\n详细结果:")\n        for test_name, result in self.test_results:\n            status = "✅ PASS" if result else "❌ FAIL"\n            print(f"  {test_name}: {status}")\n\n# 使用示例\nif __name__ == "__main__":\n    tester = SecurityTester("http://localhost:3000/api/v1")\n    if tester.login_admin("admin", "admin_password"):\n        tester.run_all_tests()\n    else:\n        print("管理员登录失败，无法执行安全测试")\n```\n\n## 安全测试清单\n\n### 认证安全 ✓\n- [ ] 弱密码拒绝测试\n- [ ] 密码复杂度验证\n- [ ] 暴力破解防护测试\n- [ ] JWT Token安全验证\n- [ ] Token过期处理测试\n- [ ] 会话固定攻击防护\n\n### 授权安全 ✓\n- [ ] 水平权限提升测试\n- [ ] 垂直权限提升测试\n- [ ] API访问控制测试\n- [ ] 角色权限边界测试\n\n### API安全 ✓\n- [ ] SQL注入攻击测试\n- [ ] XSS攻击防护测试\n- [ ] CSRF攻击防护测试\n- [ ] 输入验证测试\n\n### 网络安全 ✓\n- [ ] HTTPS强制使用测试\n- [ ] 安全HTTP头检查\n- [ ] 传输加密验证\n- [ ] 证书验证测试\n\n### 业务逻辑安全 ✓\n- [ ] 竞态条件测试\n- [ ] 业务流程绕过测试\n- [ ] 数据完整性测试\n- [ ] 操作序列安全测试\n\n### 日志和监控安全 ✓\n- [ ] 敏感信息泄露检查\n- [ ] 错误信息安全检查\n- [ ] 日志注入防护测试\n- [ ] 监控数据安全检查\n\n## 完成标准\n1. ✅ 所有免密码登录入口已完全封堵\n2. ✅ 密码安全策略有效执行\n3. ✅ JWT认证机制安全可靠\n4. ✅ 权限控制严格有效\n5. ✅ 无SQL注入、XSS等常见漏洞\n6. ✅ 网络传输安全\n7. ✅ 业务逻辑安全\n8. ✅ 无敏感信息泄露\n9. ✅ 所有安全测试通过\n10. ✅ 安全测试报告完整\n\n## 预估工时\n- 测试用例设计: 2小时\n- 认证安全测试: 2小时\n- 授权安全测试: 2小时\n- API安全测试: 2小时\n- 网络安全测试: 1小时\n- 业务逻辑安全测试: 1.5小时\n- 自动化脚本开发: 2小时\n- 漏洞修复和复测: 2小时\n- 安全测试报告: 1小时\n- **总计**: 15.5小时\n	1	2025-08-26 02:40:13.564559	2025-08-26 02:40:13.564559	\N	1	markdown	draft	\N	\N	team	\N	\N	0	\N	{mcp-generated}	任务 #547 的关联文档	1	\N	{"source": "claude-code-mcp", "task_id": "547", "created_by": "mcp-bridge"}	f	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N
321	1	回归测试：系统功能验证 - 文档	# 回归测试：系统功能验证\n\n## 任务描述\n在取消免密码登录功能后，进行全面的回归测试，确保系统的核心功能没有受到影响，所有业务流程正常运行。\n\n## 回归测试范围\n\n### 1. 核心业务功能回归测试\n\n#### 1.1 用户认证和会话管理\n\n**RT-001: 标准登录流程测试**\n- 用户名密码登录\n- JWT token生成和验证\n- 会话保持和自动续期\n- 登出功能\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\necho "=== 用户认证功能回归测试 ==="\n\n# 测试正常登录\necho "Testing normal login flow..."\nLOGIN_RESPONSE=$(curl -s -X POST "http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login" \\\n  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \\\n  -d '{"username":"admin","password":"admin_password"}')\n\nTOKEN=$(echo $LOGIN_RESPONSE | jq -r '.token')\nif [ "$TOKEN" != "null" ]; then\n  echo "✅ Login successful"\nelse\n  echo "❌ Login failed"\n  echo "Response: $LOGIN_RESPONSE"\nfi\n\n# 测试token验证\necho "Testing token validation..."\nPROFILE_RESPONSE=$(curl -s -X GET "http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/profile" \\\n  -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN")\n\nif echo $PROFILE_RESPONSE | grep -q '"username"'; then\n  echo "✅ Token validation successful"\nelse\n  echo "❌ Token validation failed"\nfi\n\n# 测试登出\necho "Testing logout..."\nLOGOUT_RESPONSE=$(curl -s -X POST "http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/logout" \\\n  -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN")\n\nif echo $LOGOUT_RESPONSE | grep -q '"success":true'; then\n  echo "✅ Logout successful"\nelse\n  echo "❌ Logout failed"\nfi\n```\n\n#### 1.2 任务管理功能\n\n**RT-002: 任务CRUD操作测试**\n```python\nimport requests\nimport json\n\nclass TaskRegressionTester:\n    def __init__(self, base_url, token):\n        self.base_url = base_url\n        self.headers = {"Authorization": f"Bearer {token}"}\n        \n    def test_task_crud(self):\n        """测试任务增删改查功能"""\n        \n        # 创建任务\n        create_data = {\n            "title": "回归测试任务",\n            "description": "用于回归测试的任务",\n            "priority": "medium",\n            "status": "todo"\n        }\n        \n        create_response = requests.post(\n            f"{self.base_url}/tasks",\n            headers=self.headers,\n            json=create_data\n        )\n        \n        if create_response.status_code == 201:\n            print("✅ Task creation successful")\n            task_id = create_response.json().get('data', {}).get('id')\n        else:\n            print("❌ Task creation failed")\n            return False\n        \n        # 读取任务\n        read_response = requests.get(\n            f"{self.base_url}/tasks/{task_id}",\n            headers=self.headers\n        )\n        \n        if read_response.status_code == 200:\n            print("✅ Task reading successful")\n        else:\n            print("❌ Task reading failed")\n        \n        # 更新任务\n        update_data = {\n            "title": "回归测试任务 - 已更新",\n            "status": "in_progress"\n        }\n        \n        update_response = requests.put(\n            f"{self.base_url}/tasks/{task_id}",\n            headers=self.headers,\n            json=update_data\n        )\n        \n        if update_response.status_code == 200:\n            print("✅ Task updating successful")\n        else:\n            print("❌ Task updating failed")\n        \n        # 删除任务\n        delete_response = requests.delete(\n            f"{self.base_url}/tasks/{task_id}",\n            headers=self.headers\n        )\n        \n        if delete_response.status_code == 200:\n            print("✅ Task deletion successful")\n        else:\n            print("❌ Task deletion failed")\n        \n        return True\n```\n\n**RT-003: 任务状态流转测试**\n```python\ndef test_task_status_flow(base_url, token):\n    """测试任务状态流转"""\n    headers = {"Authorization": f"Bearer {token}"}\n    \n    # 创建任务\n    task_data = {\n        "title": "状态流转测试任务",\n        "status": "todo"\n    }\n    \n    create_response = requests.post(\n        f"{base_url}/tasks",\n        headers=headers,\n        json=task_data\n    )\n    \n    task_id = create_response.json().get('data', {}).get('id')\n    \n    # 测试状态流转: todo -> in_progress -> completed\n    status_flow = ["in_progress", "testing", "completed"]\n    \n    for status in status_flow:\n        update_response = requests.put(\n            f"{base_url}/tasks/{task_id}",\n            headers=headers,\n            json={"status": status}\n        )\n        \n        if update_response.status_code == 200:\n            print(f"✅ Status transition to '{status}' successful")\n        else:\n            print(f"❌ Status transition to '{status}' failed")\n    \n    # 清理测试数据\n    requests.delete(f"{base_url}/tasks/{task_id}", headers=headers)\n```\n\n#### 1.3 项目管理功能\n\n**RT-004: 项目管理回归测试**\n```python\ndef test_project_management(base_url, token):\n    """测试项目管理功能"""\n    headers = {"Authorization": f"Bearer {token}"}\n    \n    # 获取项目列表\n    projects_response = requests.get(\n        f"{base_url}/projects",\n        headers=headers\n    )\n    \n    if projects_response.status_code == 200:\n        print("✅ Project list retrieval successful")\n        projects_data = projects_response.json()\n        \n        if projects_data.get('data') and len(projects_data['data']) > 0:\n            project_id = projects_data['data'][0]['id']\n            \n            # 获取项目详情\n            detail_response = requests.get(\n                f"{base_url}/projects/{project_id}",\n                headers=headers\n            )\n            \n            if detail_response.status_code == 200:\n                print("✅ Project detail retrieval successful")\n            else:\n                print("❌ Project detail retrieval failed")\n        \n    else:\n        print("❌ Project list retrieval failed")\n```\n\n### 2. 文档和笔记系统回归测试\n\n#### 2.1 工作笔记功能测试\n\n**RT-005: 工作笔记CRUD测试**\n```python\ndef test_work_notes_crud(base_url, token):\n    """测试工作笔记增删改查功能"""\n    headers = {"Authorization": f"Bearer {token}"}\n    \n    # 创建工作笔记\n    note_data = {\n        "title": "回归测试笔记",\n        "content": "这是一个用于回归测试的工作笔记",\n        "tags": ["回归测试", "系统测试"]\n    }\n    \n    create_response = requests.post(\n        f"{base_url}/work-notes",\n        headers=headers,\n        json=note_data\n    )\n    \n    if create_response.status_code == 201:\n        print("✅ Work note creation successful")\n        note_id = create_response.json().get('data', {}).get('id')\n    else:\n        print("❌ Work note creation failed")\n        return False\n    \n    # 读取笔记列表\n    list_response = requests.get(\n        f"{base_url}/work-notes",\n        headers=headers\n    )\n    \n    if list_response.status_code == 200:\n        print("✅ Work notes list retrieval successful")\n    else:\n        print("❌ Work notes list retrieval failed")\n    \n    # 读取单个笔记\n    detail_response = requests.get(\n        f"{base_url}/work-notes/{note_id}",\n        headers=headers\n    )\n    \n    if detail_response.status_code == 200:\n        print("✅ Work note detail retrieval successful")\n    else:\n        print("❌ Work note detail retrieval failed")\n    \n    # 更新笔记\n    update_data = {\n        "title": "回归测试笔记 - 已更新",\n        "content": "更新后的内容"\n    }\n    \n    update_response = requests.put(\n        f"{base_url}/work-notes/{note_id}",\n        headers=headers,\n        json=update_data\n    )\n    \n    if update_response.status_code == 200:\n        print("✅ Work note updating successful")\n    else:\n        print("❌ Work note updating failed")\n    \n    # 删除笔记（清理测试数据）\n    delete_response = requests.delete(\n        f"{base_url}/work-notes/{note_id}",\n        headers=headers\n    )\n    \n    if delete_response.status_code == 200:\n        print("✅ Work note deletion successful")\n    else:\n        print("❌ Work note deletion failed")\n    \n    return True\n```\n\n#### 2.2 任务文档功能测试\n\n**RT-006: 任务文档管理测试**\n```python\ndef test_task_documents(base_url, token):\n    """测试任务文档功能"""\n    headers = {"Authorization": f"Bearer {token}"}\n    \n    # 首先创建一个测试任务\n    task_data = {\n        "title": "文档测试任务",\n        "description": "用于测试任务文档功能"\n    }\n    \n    task_response = requests.post(\n        f"{base_url}/tasks",\n        headers=headers,\n        json=task_data\n    )\n    \n    task_id = task_response.json().get('data', {}).get('id')\n    \n    # 为任务创建文档\n    doc_data = {\n        "title": "任务文档",\n        "content": "# 任务文档\\n\\n这是任务的详细文档。"\n    }\n    \n    doc_response = requests.post(\n        f"{base_url}/tasks/{task_id}/documents",\n        headers=headers,\n        json=doc_data\n    )\n    \n    if doc_response.status_code == 201:\n        print("✅ Task document creation successful")\n        doc_id = doc_response.json().get('data', {}).get('id')\n    else:\n        print("❌ Task document creation failed")\n        return False\n    \n    # 获取任务文档\n    get_doc_response = requests.get(\n        f"{base_url}/tasks/{task_id}/documents/{doc_id}",\n        headers=headers\n    )\n    \n    if get_doc_response.status_code == 200:\n        print("✅ Task document retrieval successful")\n    else:\n        print("❌ Task document retrieval failed")\n    \n    # 清理测试数据\n    requests.delete(f"{base_url}/tasks/{task_id}/documents/{doc_id}", headers=headers)\n    requests.delete(f"{base_url}/tasks/{task_id}", headers=headers)\n    \n    return True\n```\n\n### 3. MCP集成功能回归测试\n\n#### 3.1 MCP桥接功能测试\n\n**RT-007: MCP桥接通信测试**\n```python\ndef test_mcp_bridge_communication(base_url, token):\n    """测试MCP桥接通信功能"""\n    headers = {"Authorization": f"Bearer {token}"}\n    \n    # 测试MCP桥接状态\n    status_response = requests.get(\n        f"{base_url}/mcp/status",\n        headers=headers\n    )\n    \n    if status_response.status_code == 200:\n        print("✅ MCP bridge status check successful")\n        status_data = status_response.json()\n        \n        if status_data.get('data', {}).get('connected'):\n            print("✅ MCP bridge is connected")\n        else:\n            print("⚠️ MCP bridge is not connected")\n    else:\n        print("❌ MCP bridge status check failed")\n    \n    # 测试通过MCP创建任务\n    mcp_task_data = {\n        "title": "MCP测试任务",\n        "description": "通过MCP桥接创建的任务"\n    }\n    \n    mcp_response = requests.post(\n        f"{base_url}/mcp/tasks",\n        headers=headers,\n        json=mcp_task_data\n    )\n    \n    if mcp_response.status_code in [200, 201]:\n        print("✅ MCP task creation successful")\n        # 清理测试数据\n        task_id = mcp_response.json().get('data', {}).get('id')\n        if task_id:\n            requests.delete(f"{base_url}/tasks/{task_id}", headers=headers)\n    else:\n        print("❌ MCP task creation failed")\n```\n\n### 4. 数据库完整性测试\n\n#### 4.1 数据一致性验证\n\n**RT-008: 数据库约束测试**\n```python\ndef test_database_constraints(base_url, token):\n    """测试数据库约束和完整性"""\n    headers = {"Authorization": f"Bearer {token}"}\n    \n    # 测试唯一约束 - 尝试创建重复用户名\n    duplicate_user_data = {\n        "username": "admin",  # 已存在的用户名\n        "password": "TestPass123!",\n        "email": "duplicate@test.com"\n    }\n    \n    duplicate_response = requests.post(\n        f"{base_url}/admin/users",\n        headers=headers,\n        json=duplicate_user_data\n    )\n    \n    if duplicate_response.status_code == 409:  # Conflict\n        print("✅ Unique constraint validation successful")\n    else:\n        print("❌ Unique constraint validation failed")\n    \n    # 测试外键约束 - 尝试为不存在的项目创建任务\n    invalid_task_data = {\n        "title": "无效项目任务",\n        "project_id": 99999  # 不存在的项目ID\n    }\n    \n    invalid_task_response = requests.post(\n        f"{base_url}/tasks",\n        headers=headers,\n        json=invalid_task_data\n    )\n    \n    if invalid_task_response.status_code == 400:  # Bad Request\n        print("✅ Foreign key constraint validation successful")\n    else:\n        print("❌ Foreign key constraint validation failed")\n```\n\n### 5. 性能回归测试\n\n#### 5.1 响应时间测试\n\n**RT-009: API响应时间测试**\n```python\nimport time\nimport statistics\n\ndef test_api_response_times(base_url, token):\n    """测试API响应时间"""\n    headers = {"Authorization": f"Bearer {token}"}\n    \n    endpoints_to_test = [\n        ("/tasks", "GET"),\n        ("/projects", "GET"),\n        ("/work-notes", "GET"),\n        ("/admin/users", "GET")\n    ]\n    \n    for endpoint, method in endpoints_to_test:\n        response_times = []\n        \n        # 执行10次请求测量响应时间\n        for _ in range(10):\n            start_time = time.time()\n            \n            if method == "GET":\n                response = requests.get(f"{base_url}{endpoint}", headers=headers)\n            \n            end_time = time.time()\n            response_times.append((end_time - start_time) * 1000)  # 转换为毫秒\n        \n        avg_time = statistics.mean(response_times)\n        max_time = max(response_times)\n        \n        print(f"{endpoint} ({method}):")\n        print(f"  平均响应时间: {avg_time:.2f}ms")\n        print(f"  最大响应时间: {max_time:.2f}ms")\n        \n        # 性能标准检查\n        if avg_time < 500:  # 500ms内\n            print(f"  ✅ 响应时间符合标准")\n        else:\n            print(f"  ❌ 响应时间超过标准")\n```\n\n### 6. 前端集成测试\n\n#### 6.1 前端页面功能测试\n\n**RT-010: 关键页面访问测试**\n```python\ndef test_frontend_pages(base_url, token):\n    """测试前端关键页面的访问"""\n    \n    # 模拟带token的前端请求\n    headers = {\n        "Authorization": f"Bearer {token}",\n        "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml"\n    }\n    \n    frontend_pages = [\n        "/dashboard",\n        "/tasks",\n        "/projects", \n        "/work-notes",\n        "/admin/users",\n        "/admin/system"\n    ]\n    \n    for page in frontend_pages:\n        response = requests.get(f"{base_url}{page}", headers=headers)\n        \n        if response.status_code == 200:\n            print(f"✅ {page} 页面访问成功")\n        elif response.status_code == 302:  # 重定向\n            print(f"⚠️ {page} 页面重定向")\n        else:\n            print(f"❌ {page} 页面访问失败 (状态码: {response.status_code})")\n```\n\n## 回归测试自动化脚本\n\n```python\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\n"""\n回归测试自动化执行脚本\n"""\n\nimport requests\nimport json\nimport time\nfrom datetime import datetime\n\nclass RegressionTestSuite:\n    def __init__(self, base_url, admin_user, admin_pass):\n        self.base_url = base_url\n        self.admin_user = admin_user\n        self.admin_pass = admin_pass\n        self.token = None\n        self.test_results = []\n        \n    def setup(self):\n        """测试环境初始化"""\n        print("Setting up test environment...")\n        \n        # 管理员登录\n        login_response = requests.post(\n            f"{self.base_url}/auth/login",\n            json={"username": self.admin_user, "password": self.admin_pass}\n        )\n        \n        if login_response.status_code == 200:\n            self.token = login_response.json().get('token')\n            print("✅ Test setup successful")\n            return True\n        else:\n            print("❌ Test setup failed - cannot login")\n            return False\n    \n    def run_all_regression_tests(self):\n        """执行所有回归测试"""\n        if not self.setup():\n            return False\n        \n        test_suites = [\n            ("用户认证功能回归", self.test_authentication_regression),\n            ("任务管理功能回归", self.test_task_management_regression),\n            ("项目管理功能回归", self.test_project_management_regression),\n            ("文档系统功能回归", self.test_document_system_regression),\n            ("MCP集成功能回归", self.test_mcp_integration_regression),\n            ("数据库完整性回归", self.test_database_integrity_regression),\n            ("性能回归测试", self.test_performance_regression),\n            ("前端集成回归", self.test_frontend_integration_regression)\n        ]\n        \n        for suite_name, test_func in test_suites:\n            print(f"\\n{'='*20} {suite_name} {'='*20}")\n            start_time = time.time()\n            \n            try:\n                result = test_func()\n                execution_time = time.time() - start_time\n                \n                self.test_results.append({\n                    'suite': suite_name,\n                    'result': result,\n                    'execution_time': execution_time,\n                    'timestamp': datetime.now().isoformat()\n                })\n                \n                status = "✅ PASS" if result else "❌ FAIL"\n                print(f"{suite_name}: {status} ({execution_time:.2f}s)")\n                \n            except Exception as e:\n                execution_time = time.time() - start_time\n                print(f"❌ {suite_name} 执行异常: {e}")\n                \n                self.test_results.append({\n                    'suite': suite_name,\n                    'result': False,\n                    'execution_time': execution_time,\n                    'error': str(e),\n                    'timestamp': datetime.now().isoformat()\n                })\n        \n        self.generate_regression_report()\n        return True\n    \n    def test_authentication_regression(self):\n        """认证功能回归测试"""\n        # 实现具体的认证回归测试\n        return True\n    \n    def test_task_management_regression(self):\n        """任务管理功能回归测试"""\n        # 实现具体的任务管理回归测试\n        return True\n    \n    # ... 其他测试方法的实现\n    \n    def generate_regression_report(self):\n        """生成回归测试报告"""\n        print(f"\\n{'='*60}")\n        print("回归测试报告")\n        print(f"{'='*60}")\n        \n        total_suites = len(self.test_results)\n        passed_suites = sum(1 for result in self.test_results if result['result'])\n        total_time = sum(result['execution_time'] for result in self.test_results)\n        \n        print(f"测试执行时间: {datetime.now().strftime('%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S')}")\n        print(f"测试套件总数: {total_suites}")\n        print(f"通过套件数: {passed_suites}")\n        print(f"失败套件数: {total_suites - passed_suites}")\n        print(f"成功率: {passed_suites/total_suites*100:.1f}%")\n        print(f"总执行时间: {total_time:.2f}s")\n        \n        print("\\n详细结果:")\n        for result in self.test_results:\n            status = "✅ PASS" if result['result'] else "❌ FAIL"\n            suite_name = result['suite']\n            exec_time = result['execution_time']\n            \n            print(f"  {suite_name}: {status} ({exec_time:.2f}s)")\n            \n            if not result['result'] and 'error' in result:\n                print(f"    错误: {result['error']}")\n        \n        # 保存报告到文件\n        report_data = {\n            'timestamp': datetime.now().isoformat(),\n            'summary': {\n                'total_suites': total_suites,\n                'passed_suites': passed_suites,\n                'failed_suites': total_suites - passed_suites,\n                'success_rate': passed_suites/total_suites*100,\n                'total_execution_time': total_time\n            },\n            'results': self.test_results\n        }\n        \n        with open(f'regression_test_report_{int(time.time())}.json', 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n            json.dump(report_data, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n        \n        print(f"\\n📄 详细报告已保存到: regression_test_report_{int(time.time())}.json")\n\n# 执行回归测试\nif __name__ == "__main__":\n    suite = RegressionTestSuite(\n        "http://localhost:3000/api/v1",\n        "admin",\n        "admin_password"\n    )\n    suite.run_all_regression_tests()\n```\n\n## 回归测试检查清单\n\n### 核心功能回归 ✓\n- [ ] 用户登录认证功能正常\n- [ ] JWT token生成和验证正常\n- [ ] 会话管理和登出功能正常\n- [ ] 用户权限控制正常\n\n### 业务功能回归 ✓  \n- [ ] 任务CRUD操作正常\n- [ ] 任务状态流转正常\n- [ ] 项目管理功能正常\n- [ ] 用户管理功能正常\n\n### 数据功能回归 ✓\n- [ ] 工作笔记CRUD正常\n- [ ] 任务文档管理正常\n- [ ] 数据库约束有效\n- [ ] 数据完整性保证\n\n### 集成功能回归 ✓\n- [ ] MCP桥接通信正常\n- [ ] 前端页面访问正常\n- [ ] API接口响应正常\n- [ ] 错误处理机制正常\n\n### 性能功能回归 ✓\n- [ ] API响应时间符合标准\n- [ ] 并发处理能力正常\n- [ ] 数据库查询性能正常\n- [ ] 内存使用正常\n\n## 完成标准\n1. ✅ 所有核心业务功能正常运行\n2. ✅ 用户认证和授权功能完整\n3. ✅ 数据CRUD操作无异常\n4. ✅ MCP集成功能正常\n5. ✅ 前端页面正常访问\n6. ✅ API接口响应时间达标\n7. ✅ 数据库完整性保证\n8. ✅ 无功能回归问题\n9. ✅ 回归测试报告完整\n10. ✅ 所有测试用例通过\n\n## 预估工时\n- 测试用例设计: 2小时\n- 核心功能回归测试: 3小时\n- 业务功能回归测试: 2小时\n- 数据功能回归测试: 2小时\n- 集成功能回归测试: 2小时\n- 性能回归测试: 1.5小时\n- 自动化脚本开发: 2小时\n- 问题修复和复测: 2小时\n- 回归测试报告: 1小时\n- **总计**: 17.5小时\n	1	2025-08-26 02:41:38.905468	2025-08-26 02:41:38.905468	\N	1	markdown	draft	\N	\N	team	\N	\N