550	1	实现任务文档关联显示功能 - 修复/api/v1/projects/:id/tasks/:taskId/documents端点 - 文档	# 任务文档关联显示功能实现报告\n\n## 问题分析\n用户反映在任务#949中无法看到通过MCP create-and-attach接口创建的文档。经过调查发现：\n\n## 根本原因\n1. **API端点问题**: `/api/v1/projects/:id/tasks/:taskId/documents` 端点仍然返回占位符消息 "Get task documents coming soon"\n2. **MCP功能正常**: create-and-attach接口工作正常，能成功创建文档并关联到任务\n3. **数据库存储正常**: task_documents表中已正确记录关联关系\n\n## 实现的解决方案\n\n### 1. 修改路由配置 (`backend/routes/document_routes.go:107`)\n```go\n// 原来的占位符\ntaskDocuments.GET("", func(c *gin.Context) {\n    c.JSON(200, gin.H{"success": true, "data": []interface{}{}, "message": "Get task documents coming soon"})\n})\n\n// 修改为实际API调用\ntaskDocuments.GET("", app.GetDocumentHandler().GetTaskDocuments)\n```\n\n### 2. 实现处理器方法 (`backend/handlers/hybrid_document_handler.go:864-984`)\n新增了 `GetTaskDocuments` 方法，功能包括：\n- 参数验证 (projectId, taskId)\n- SQL查询任务关联文档\n- 返回标准JSON格式响应\n\n```go\nfunc (h *HybridDocumentHandler) GetTaskDocuments(c *gin.Context) {\n    // 获取并验证路径参数\n    // 执行SQL查询 task_documents 表\n    // 格式化并返回结果\n}\n```\n\n### 3. SQL查询实现\n```sql\nSELECT d.id, d.project_id, d.title, d.content, d.type, d.status,\n       d.file_url, d.file_size, d.mime_type, d.description, d.tags,\n       d.owner_id, d.visibility, d.version, d.is_template,\n       d.created_by, d.created_at, d.updated_at,\n       u.username as owner_name, td.relationship_type\nFROM documents d\nINNER JOIN task_documents td ON d.id = td.document_id\nLEFT JOIN users u ON d.owner_id = u.id\nWHERE td.task_id = $1 AND d.project_id = $2 AND d.deleted_at IS NULL AND td.deleted_at IS NULL\nORDER BY td.sort_order, td.created_at\n```\n\n## 测试验证\n\n### ✅ MCP create-and-attach功能验证\n- 测试任务949: 成功创建文档ID 547, 549\n- 数据库关联记录正常创建\n\n### ⚠️ 待解决问题\n- 新的GetTaskDocuments方法需要重新构建后端容器才能生效\n- 当前仍返回占位符消息，需要确保新代码加载\n\n## API规范\n\n### 请求格式\n```\nGET /api/v1/projects/{projectId}/tasks/{taskId}/documents\nAuthorization: Bearer {token}\n```\n\n### 响应格式\n```json\n{\n  "success": true,\n  "data": [\n    {\n      "id": 549,\n      "project_id": 1,\n      "title": "文档标题",\n      "content": "文档内容",\n      "type": "markdown",\n      "status": "draft",\n      "owner_name": "guoym",\n      "relationship_type": "attachment",\n      "created_at": "2025-08-30T05:07:21Z",\n      "updated_at": "2025-08-30T05:07:21Z"\n    }\n  ],\n  "total": 1,\n  "message": "Task documents retrieved successfully"\n}\n```\n\n## 结论\n\n任务文档关联显示功能的后端实现已完成，MCP的create-and-attach功能正常工作。前端应该能够通过标准API获取任务关联的文档。\n\n需要重新构建后端容器以确保新代码生效。	91	2025-08-30 05:14:52.712419	2025-08-30 05:14:52.712419	\N	91	markdown	draft	\N	\N	private	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	任务 #960 的关联文档	1	\N	{}	f	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N
