1138	1	散货出库模块数据模型设计方案	# 散货出库模块数据模型设计方案\n\n## 1. 现有代码分析\n\n### 1.1 现有数据模型评估\n\n#### 当前WmsModels.kt核心模型分析\n\n```kotlin\n// 现有出库单模型 - 主要用于装箱出库\ndata class OutboundOrder(\n    val id: String,\n    val orderNo: String,         // 字段名为code，需适配\n    val warehouseId: String,\n    val warehouseName: String?,\n    val status: String,\n    val orderDate: String?,      // 字段名为record_date\n    val customerName: String?,   // 字段名为receiver_name\n    val receiverAddress: String?,\n    val salesOrderCode: String?,\n    val totalItems: Int?,\n    val totalQuantity: Int?,\n    val items: List<OutboundItem>?,\n    val createdAt: String?\n) : Serializable\n\n// 现有出库商品模型\ndata class OutboundItem(\n    val id: String,\n    val goodsId: String,\n    val sku: String,\n    val name: String,\n    val productName: String? = name,\n    val expectedQty: Int,\n    val plannedQty: Int = expectedQty,\n    val pickedQty: Int = 0,      // 已拣数量\n    val locationCode: String?\n)\n```\n\n**现有模型问题分析**：\n1. ✅ **基础字段完整**：ID、SKU、数量等核心字段齐全\n2. ❌ **字段名不统一**：API字段名与模型字段名存在差异\n3. ❌ **缺少拣货状态**：没有单个商品的拣货状态跟踪\n4. ❌ **缺少异常处理**：没有异常信息记录\n5. ❌ **缺少批量操作**：没有批量确认的数据结构\n\n### 1.2 现有拣货模型分析\n\n```kotlin\n// 现有拣货商品模型 - 用于拣货页面\ndata class PickingItem(\n    val goodsId: String,\n    val sku: String,\n    val goodsBarcode: String?,\n    val goodsName: String,\n    val requiredQty: Int,        // 需拣数量\n    val needPickQty: Int = requiredQty,\n    var pickedQty: Int = 0,      // 已拣数量\n    val locationCode: String?,\n    val unit: String?,\n    val spec: String?\n) : Serializable {\n    val remainingQty: Int get() = needPickQty - pickedQty\n    val isCompleted: Boolean get() = pickedQty >= needPickQty\n}\n```\n\n**现有拣货模型优势**：\n1. ✅ **计算属性完善**：剩余数量、完成状态自动计算\n2. ✅ **扫码支持**：包含条形码字段\n3. ✅ **规格信息**：支持单位和规格显示\n\n### 1.3 现有API响应模型分析\n\n```kotlin\n// PDA出库拣货信息\ndata class OutboundPickingInfo(\n    val id: Long,\n    val code: String,\n    val status: String,\n    val statusName: String,\n    val warehouseId: Long,\n    val warehouseName: String,\n    val recordDate: String,\n    val note: String,\n    val createTime: String,\n    val items: List<OutboundPickingItem>\n) : Serializable\n\n// PDA出库拣货明细\ndata class OutboundPickingItem(\n    val id: Long,\n    val goodsId: Long,\n    val goodsCode: String,      // SKU\n    val goodsName: String,\n    val qty: Double,            // 数量为Double类型\n    val unitName: String,\n    val batch: String,\n    val barcode: String\n) : Serializable\n```\n\n**API模型特点**：\n1. ✅ **字段类型统一**：ID为Long，数量为Double\n2. ✅ **包含批次信息**：支持批次管理\n3. ❌ **转换复杂**：需要转换为UI模型\n\n## 2. 散货出库数据模型设计\n\n### 2.1 核心设计原则\n\n1. **简化为主**：专注散货出库，去除装箱相关字段\n2. **状态驱动**：以拣货状态为核心驱动流程\n3. **离线友好**：支持离线操作和数据同步\n4. **类型安全**：使用枚举和密封类确保类型安全\n5. **向前兼容**：与现有API保持兼容\n\n### 2.2 状态和枚举定义\n\n```kotlin\n// 散货出库单状态\nenum class BulkOutboundStatus(val code: String, val displayName: String) {\n    PENDING("pending", "待拣货"),\n    PICKING("picking", "拣货中"),\n    COMPLETED("completed", "已完成"),\n    CANCELLED("cancelled", "已取消"),\n    EXCEPTION("exception", "异常")\n}\n\n// 拣货商品状态\nenum class PickingItemStatus(val code: String, val displayName: String) {\n    PENDING("pending", "待拣货"),\n    PICKING("picking", "拣货中"),\n    COMPLETED("completed", "已完成"),\n    PARTIAL("partial", "部分完成"),\n    EXCEPTION("exception", "异常")\n}\n\n// 异常类型\nenum class ExceptionType(val code: String, val displayName: String) {\n    INSUFFICIENT_STOCK("insufficient_stock", "库存不足"),\n    GOODS_NOT_FOUND("goods_not_found", "商品找不到"),\n    GOODS_DAMAGED("goods_damaged", "商品损坏"),\n    LOCATION_ERROR("location_error", "库位错误"),\n    OTHER("other", "其他异常")\n}\n\n// 拣货优先级\nenum class PickingPriority(val level: Int, val displayName: String) {\n    LOW(1, "低"),\n    NORMAL(2, "普通"),\n    HIGH(3, "高"),\n    URGENT(4, "紧急")\n}\n```\n\n### 2.3 主数据模型\n\n#### 2.3.1 散货出库单模型\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 散货出库单主模型\n * 专门用于散货出库作业，简化自OutboundOrder\n */\ndata class BulkOutboundOrder(\n    val id: String,\n    val orderNo: String,\n    val warehouseId: String,\n    val warehouseName: String,\n    val status: BulkOutboundStatus,\n    val statusName: String = status.displayName,\n    val orderDate: String,\n    val customerName: String? = null,\n    val customerAddress: String? = null,\n    val salesOrderCode: String? = null,\n    val note: String? = null,\n    \n    // 统计信息\n    val totalItems: Int,           // 商品种类数\n    val totalQuantity: Int,        // 总数量\n    val pickedQuantity: Int = 0,   // 已拣数量\n    val exceptionQuantity: Int = 0, // 异常数量\n    \n    // 拣货进度\n    val progress: PickingProgress = PickingProgress.create(totalQuantity, pickedQuantity, exceptionQuantity),\n    \n    // 关联数据\n    val items: List<BulkPickingItem> = emptyList(),\n    val exceptions: List<PickingException> = emptyList(),\n    \n    // 时间戳\n    val createdAt: String,\n    val updatedAt: String? = null,\n    val startPickingAt: String? = null,\n    val completedAt: String? = null,\n    \n    // 离线同步\n    val syncStatus: SyncStatus = SyncStatus.SYNCED,\n    val lastSyncAt: String? = null\n) : Serializable {\n    \n    // 计算属性\n    val isCompleted: Boolean get() = progress.isCompleted\n    val hasException: Boolean get() = exceptions.isNotEmpty()\n    val completionRate: Float get() = progress.completionRate\n    \n    // 业务方法\n    fun canStartPicking(): Boolean = status == BulkOutboundStatus.PENDING\n    fun canCompletePicking(): Boolean = status == BulkOutboundStatus.PICKING && progress.isCompleted\n}\n```\n\n#### 2.3.2 散货拣货商品模型\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 散货拣货商品模型\n * 扩展自PickingItem，增加状态管理和批量操作支持\n */\ndata class BulkPickingItem(\n    val id: String,\n    val goodsId: String,\n    val sku: String,\n    val goodsBarcode: String? = null,\n    val goodsName: String,\n    val productName: String = goodsName,\n    \n    // 数量信息\n    val requiredQty: Int,          // 需拣数量\n    val plannedQty: Int = requiredQty, // 计划拣货数量\n    var pickedQty: Int = 0,        // 已拣数量\n    val exceptionQty: Int = 0,     // 异常数量\n    \n    // 状态信息\n    val status: PickingItemStatus = PickingItemStatus.PENDING,\n    val priority: PickingPriority = PickingPriority.NORMAL,\n    \n    // 位置和规格\n    val locationCode: String? = null,\n    val unit: String? = null,\n    val spec: String? = null,\n    val batch: String? = null,\n    \n    // 时间戳\n    val lastPickedAt: String? = null,\n    val completedAt: String? = null,\n    \n    // 离线同步\n    val pendingSync: Boolean = false,\n    val syncError: String? = null\n) : Serializable {\n    \n    // 计算属性\n    val remainingQty: Int get() = maxOf(0, requiredQty - pickedQty - exceptionQty)\n    val isCompleted: Boolean get() = pickedQty + exceptionQty >= requiredQty\n    val isPartialCompleted: Boolean get() = pickedQty > 0 && !isCompleted\n    val hasException: Boolean get() = exceptionQty > 0\n    val completionRate: Float get() = if (requiredQty > 0) (pickedQty.toFloat() / requiredQty) else 0f\n    \n    // 业务方法\n    fun canPick(): Boolean = status in listOf(PickingItemStatus.PENDING, PickingItemStatus.PICKING)\n    fun canPickQuantity(qty: Int): Boolean = remainingQty >= qty\n    \n    // 扫码匹配\n    fun matchesCode(code: String): Boolean {\n        return code == sku || code == goodsBarcode || code == goodsId\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 2.4 辅助数据模型\n\n#### 2.4.1 拣货进度模型\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 拣货进度统计\n */\ndata class PickingProgress(\n    val totalQuantity: Int,\n    val pickedQuantity: Int,\n    val exceptionQuantity: Int,\n    val pendingQuantity: Int = totalQuantity - pickedQuantity - exceptionQuantity\n) : Serializable {\n    \n    val completionRate: Float get() = if (totalQuantity > 0) {\n        (pickedQuantity + exceptionQuantity).toFloat() / totalQuantity\n    } else 0f\n    \n    val successRate: Float get() = if (totalQuantity > 0) {\n        pickedQuantity.toFloat() / totalQuantity\n    } else 0f\n    \n    val isCompleted: Boolean get() = pendingQuantity == 0\n    val hasProgress: Boolean get() = pickedQuantity > 0 || exceptionQuantity > 0\n    \n    companion object {\n        fun create(total: Int, picked: Int, exception: Int = 0): PickingProgress {\n            return PickingProgress(total, picked, exception)\n        }\n        \n        fun empty(): PickingProgress = PickingProgress(0, 0, 0)\n    }\n}\n```\n\n#### 2.4.2 拣货异常模型\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 拣货异常记录\n */\ndata class PickingException(\n    val id: String = UUID.randomUUID().toString(),\n    val itemId: String,           // 关联的商品ID\n    val sku: String,\n    val goodsName: String,\n    val exceptionType: ExceptionType,\n    val actualQty: Int,           // 实际拣到的数量\n    val expectedQty: Int,         // 期望拣货数量\n    val differenceQty: Int = expectedQty - actualQty, // 差异数量\n    val description: String,      // 异常描述\n    val solution: String? = null, // 解决方案\n    val operatorId: String? = null, // 操作员ID\n    val operatorName: String? = null, // 操作员姓名\n    val createdAt: String = getCurrentTimeString(),\n    val resolvedAt: String? = null,\n    val isResolved: Boolean = false,\n    \n    // 离线同步\n    val syncStatus: SyncStatus = SyncStatus.PENDING,\n    val syncError: String? = null\n) : Serializable\n```\n\n#### 2.4.3 同步状态枚举\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 数据同步状态\n */\nenum class SyncStatus(val code: String, val displayName: String) {\n    SYNCED("synced", "已同步"),\n    PENDING("pending", "待同步"),\n    SYNCING("syncing", "同步中"),\n    FAILED("failed", "同步失败"),\n    CONFLICT("conflict", "同步冲突")\n}\n```\n\n### 2.5 请求响应模型\n\n#### 2.5.1 批量拣货请求\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 批量拣货确认请求\n */\ndata class BulkPickingRequest(\n    val outboundId: String,\n    val operatorId: String? = null,\n    val items: List<PickingConfirmItem>,\n    val timestamp: String = getCurrentTimeString()\n) : Serializable\n\n/**\n * 拣货确认单项\n */\ndata class PickingConfirmItem(\n    val itemId: String,\n    val goodsId: String,\n    val sku: String,\n    val pickedQty: Int,\n    val locationCode: String? = null,\n    val batch: String? = null,\n    val note: String? = null\n) : Serializable\n```\n\n#### 2.5.2 异常提交请求\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 异常提交请求\n */\ndata class PickingExceptionRequest(\n    val outboundId: String,\n    val itemId: String,\n    val exceptionType: ExceptionType,\n    val actualQty: Int,\n    val expectedQty: Int,\n    val description: String,\n    val operatorId: String? = null,\n    val timestamp: String = getCurrentTimeString()\n) : Serializable\n```\n\n### 2.6 数据转换扩展\n\n#### 2.6.1 现有模型转换\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 现有模型转换扩展\n */\n// OutboundPickingInfo -> BulkOutboundOrder\nfun OutboundPickingInfo.toBulkOutboundOrder(): BulkOutboundOrder {\n    val bulkItems = items.map { it.toBulkPickingItem() }\n    val totalQty = bulkItems.sumOf { it.requiredQty }\n    val pickedQty = bulkItems.sumOf { it.pickedQty }\n    \n    return BulkOutboundOrder(\n        id = id.toString(),\n        orderNo = code,\n        warehouseId = warehouseId.toString(),\n        warehouseName = warehouseName,\n        status = BulkOutboundStatus.valueOf(status.uppercase()),\n        orderDate = recordDate,\n        totalItems = items.size,\n        totalQuantity = totalQty,\n        pickedQuantity = pickedQty,\n        items = bulkItems,\n        createdAt = createTime\n    )\n}\n\n// OutboundPickingItem -> BulkPickingItem\nfun OutboundPickingItem.toBulkPickingItem(): BulkPickingItem {\n    return BulkPickingItem(\n        id = id.toString(),\n        goodsId = goodsId.toString(),\n        sku = goodsCode,\n        goodsBarcode = barcode.takeIf { it.isNotBlank() },\n        goodsName = goodsName,\n        requiredQty = qty.toInt(),\n        unit = unitName,\n        batch = batch.takeIf { it.isNotBlank() }\n    )\n}\n```\n\n## 3. 数据模型架构\n\n### 3.1 分层设计\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────┐\n│         UI Layer Models             │\n│  (BulkOutboundOrder, BulkPickingItem) │\n├─────────────────────────────────────┤\n│       Business Layer Models        │\n│   (PickingSession, PickingProgress)   │\n├─────────────────────────────────────┤\n│        Data Layer Models           │\n│ (API Response, Database Entity)     │\n├─────────────────────────────────────┤\n│        Network Layer Models        │\n│   (Request, Response DTOs)          │\n└─────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### 3.2 模型职责分工\n\n1. **UI Models**: 直接用于界面展示，包含计算属性和业务逻辑\n2. **Business Models**: 处理业务逻辑，状态转换和数据验证\n3. **Data Models**: 数据存储和同步，对应数据库实体\n4. **Network Models**: 网络传输，对应API请求响应\n\n## 4. 实现建议\n\n### 4.1 文件组织\n\n```\ncom.diciai.app.model/\n├── bulk/                          // 散货出库模型包\n│   ├── BulkOutboundOrder.kt      // 主模型\n│   ├── BulkPickingItem.kt        // 拣货商品模型\n│   ├── PickingProgress.kt        // 进度统计\n│   ├── PickingException.kt       // 异常模型\n│   └── BulkPickingEnums.kt       // 枚举定义\n├── request/                       // 请求模型包\n│   ├── BulkPickingRequest.kt\n│   └── PickingExceptionRequest.kt\n├── response/                      // 响应模型包\n└── extension/                     // 转换扩展包\n    └── BulkPickingExtensions.kt\n```\n\n### 4.2 向后兼容策略\n\n1. **保留现有模型**: 不删除OutboundOrder等现有模型\n2. **适配器模式**: 创建转换适配器处理新旧模型转换\n3. **渐进迁移**: 新功能使用新模型，现有功能保持不变\n4. **版本控制**: 在模型中添加版本字段支持数据迁移\n\n### 4.3 测试策略\n\n1. **单元测试**: 每个模型的计算属性和业务方法\n2. **转换测试**: 新旧模型转换的正确性\n3. **序列化测试**: JSON序列化反序列化\n4. **边界测试**: 异常情况和边界值处理\n\n## 5. 总结\n\n### 5.1 设计亮点\n\n1. **简化设计**: 专注散货出库，去除不必要的复杂性\n2. **状态驱动**: 以状态为核心，清晰的业务流程\n3. **类型安全**: 使用枚举和密封类，避免魔法字符串\n4. **计算属性**: 自动计算进度、完成状态等，减少手动计算\n5. **离线支持**: 内置同步状态，支持离线操作\n\n### 5.2 技术优势\n\n1. **性能优化**: 轻量级模型，适合移动端\n2. **扩展性**: 预留扩展字段，支持未来功能\n3. **可维护性**: 清晰的分层和职责分工\n4. **测试友好**: 纯数据模型，易于单元测试\n\n### 5.3 实施建议\n\n1. **分阶段实施**: 先实现核心模型，再扩展辅助功能\n2. **兼容过渡**: 保持与现有API的兼容性\n3. **文档完善**: 详细的模型文档和使用示例\n4. **性能监控**: 关注内存使用和序列化性能\n\n---\n\n**设计完成状态**: ✅ 已完成  \n**预计实施时间**: 2天  \n**风险评估**: 低风险  \n**下一步**: 进入API接口设计阶段	110	2025-09-21 08:33:34.816313	2025-09-21 08:33:34.816313	\N	110	markdown	draft	\N	\N	private	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N		1	\N	{}	f	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N
1139	1	散货出库模块API接口设计方案	# 散货出库模块API接口设计方案\n\n## 1. 现有API分析\n\n### 1.1 现有WmsApi.kt接口分析\n\n#### 核心出库接口现状\n```kotlin\n// 现有出库单查询接口\n@GET("wms/outbound")  // ✅ 可复用 - 出库单列表\n@GET("wms/outbound/{id}")  // ✅ 可复用 - 出库单详情\n\n// PDA专用接口\n@GET("wms/outbound/pda-get-outbound-pick")  // ✅ 可复用 - PDA获取拣货信息\n@GET("wms/outbound/pda/{outbound_id}")  // ✅ 可复用 - 拣货详情\n\n// 装箱相关接口（散货出库不需要）\n@POST("wms/outbound/{id}/box")  // ❌ 不适用 - 装箱操作\n@POST("wms/outbound/pda-box-complete")  // ❌ 不适用 - 装箱完成\n\n// 出库确认接口\n@PUT("wms/outbound/out/{id}")  // ✅ 可复用 - 出库确认\n```\n\n#### 现有接口优势\n1. ✅ **RESTful设计**：接口设计符合REST规范\n2. ✅ **分页支持**：列表接口支持分页查询\n3. ✅ **状态筛选**：支持按状态筛选出库单\n4. ✅ **PDA适配**：已有PDA专用接口设计\n\n#### 现有接口局限性\n1. ❌ **缺少批量操作**：没有批量拣货确认接口\n2. ❌ **缺少异常处理**：没有异常提交接口\n3. ❌ **缺少进度跟踪**：没有拣货进度更新接口\n4. ❌ **缺少散货专用**：没有专门的散货出库接口\n\n### 1.2 API响应格式分析\n\n#### 标准响应格式\n```kotlin\n// 统一响应格式\nApiResponse<T> {\n    data: T?,\n    message: String?,\n    code: Int?,\n    success: Boolean?\n}\n\n// 列表响应格式\nListResponse<T> {\n    data: List<T>?,\n    total: Int?,\n    page: Int?,\n    pageSize: Int?\n}\n\n// WMS列表响应格式\nWmsListResponse<T> {\n    data: List<T>?,\n    pagination: {\n        current_page: Int,\n        per_page: Int,\n        total: Int,\n        total_pages: Int\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**响应格式特点**：\n1. ✅ **统一封装**：所有接口使用统一响应格式\n2. ✅ **分页信息完整**：包含总数、页码等分页信息\n3. ❌ **格式不统一**：ListResponse和WmsListResponse存在差异\n\n## 2. 散货出库API设计\n\n### 2.1 设计原则\n\n1. **向后兼容**：保持与现有API的兼容性\n2. **RESTful风格**：遵循REST设计原则\n3. **批量优先**：支持批量操作提升效率\n4. **离线友好**：支持离线模式和数据同步\n5. **状态驱动**：以状态变化为核心设计接口\n\n### 2.2 接口规划\n\n#### 2.2.1 散货出库单接口\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 散货出库API接口定义\n * 基于现有WmsApi扩展，专门用于散货出库作业\n */\ninterface BulkOutboundApi {\n    \n    // === 出库单查询接口 ===\n    \n    /**\n     * 获取散货出库单列表\n     * 基于现有 GET /wms/outbound 接口，增加散货筛选\n     */\n    @GET("v1/wms/bulk-outbound")\n    suspend fun getBulkOutboundOrders(\n        @Query("page") page: Int = 1,\n        @Query("pageSize") pageSize: Int = 20,\n        @Query("status") status: String? = null,\n        @Query("warehouse_id") warehouseId: String? = null,\n        @Query("operator_id") operatorId: String? = null,\n        @Query("created_at_start") createdAtStart: String? = null,\n        @Query("created_at_end") createdAtEnd: String? = null,\n        @Query("priority") priority: String? = null\n    ): Response<ApiResponse<BulkOutboundListResponse>>\n    \n    /**\n     * 获取散货出库单详情\n     * 包含完整的商品列表和拣货状态\n     */\n    @GET("v1/wms/bulk-outbound/{id}")\n    suspend fun getBulkOutboundOrder(\n        @Path("id") id: String\n    ): Response<ApiResponse<BulkOutboundOrder>>\n    \n    /**\n     * 扫码搜索出库单\n     * 支持通过出库单号或配送单号快速定位\n     */\n    @GET("v1/wms/bulk-outbound/search")\n    suspend fun searchBulkOutboundOrder(\n        @Query("code") code: String,  // 出库单号或配送单号\n        @Query("operator_id") operatorId: String? = null\n    ): Response<ApiResponse<BulkOutboundOrder>>\n    \n    // === 拣货作业接口 ===\n    \n    /**\n     * 开始散货拣货作业\n     * 创建拣货会话，锁定出库单\n     */\n    @POST("v1/wms/bulk-outbound/{id}/start-picking")\n    suspend fun startBulkPicking(\n        @Path("id") outboundId: String,\n        @Body request: StartPickingRequest\n    ): Response<ApiResponse<PickingSessionResponse>>\n    \n    /**\n     * 获取拣货任务列表\n     * 返回当前出库单的拣货清单\n     */\n    @GET("v1/wms/bulk-outbound/{id}/picking-tasks")\n    suspend fun getPickingTasks(\n        @Path("id") outboundId: String,\n        @Query("status") status: String? = null\n    ): Response<ApiResponse<List<BulkPickingItem>>>\n    \n    /**\n     * 单个商品拣货确认\n     * 确认单个商品的拣货数量\n     */\n    @POST("v1/wms/bulk-outbound/{id}/pick-item")\n    suspend fun confirmSinglePicking(\n        @Path("id") outboundId: String,\n        @Body request: SinglePickingRequest\n    ): Response<ApiResponse<PickingConfirmResponse>>\n    \n    /**\n     * 批量拣货确认\n     * 批量确认多个商品的拣货数量\n     */\n    @POST("v1/wms/bulk-outbound/{id}/batch-pick")\n    suspend fun confirmBatchPicking(\n        @Path("id") outboundId: String,\n        @Body request: BatchPickingRequest\n    ): Response<ApiResponse<BatchPickingResponse>>\n    \n    /**\n     * 完成散货拣货\n     * 完成整个出库单的拣货作业\n     */\n    @POST("v1/wms/bulk-outbound/{id}/complete-picking")\n    suspend fun completeBulkPicking(\n        @Path("id") outboundId: String,\n        @Body request: CompletePickingRequest\n    ): Response<ApiResponse<CompletionResponse>>\n    \n    // === 异常处理接口 ===\n    \n    /**\n     * 提交拣货异常\n     * 记录拣货过程中的异常情况\n     */\n    @POST("v1/wms/bulk-outbound/{id}/exception")\n    suspend fun submitPickingException(\n        @Path("id") outboundId: String,\n        @Body request: PickingExceptionRequest\n    ): Response<ApiResponse<ExceptionResponse>>\n    \n    /**\n     * 获取异常列表\n     * 查询出库单的异常记录\n     */\n    @GET("v1/wms/bulk-outbound/{id}/exceptions")\n    suspend fun getPickingExceptions(\n        @Path("id") outboundId: String,\n        @Query("status") status: String? = null\n    ): Response<ApiResponse<List<PickingException>>>\n    \n    /**\n     * 处理异常\n     * 标记异常为已处理\n     */\n    @PUT("v1/wms/bulk-outbound/exception/{exception_id}")\n    suspend fun resolveException(\n        @Path("exception_id") exceptionId: String,\n        @Body request: ResolveExceptionRequest\n    ): Response<ApiResponse<String>>\n    \n    // === 进度和统计接口 ===\n    \n    /**\n     * 获取拣货进度\n     * 实时查询拣货进度统计\n     */\n    @GET("v1/wms/bulk-outbound/{id}/progress")\n    suspend fun getPickingProgress(\n        @Path("id") outboundId: String\n    ): Response<ApiResponse<PickingProgress>>\n    \n    /**\n     * 上报拣货统计\n     * 上报操作时长等统计信息\n     */\n    @POST("v1/wms/bulk-outbound/{id}/stats")\n    suspend fun reportPickingStats(\n        @Path("id") outboundId: String,\n        @Body request: PickingStatsRequest\n    ): Response<ApiResponse<String>>\n    \n    // === 离线同步接口 ===\n    \n    /**\n     * 离线数据同步\n     * 同步离线期间的操作记录\n     */\n    @POST("v1/wms/bulk-outbound/sync")\n    suspend fun syncOfflineData(\n        @Body request: OfflineSyncRequest\n    ): Response<ApiResponse<SyncResponse>>\n    \n    /**\n     * 检查数据冲突\n     * 检查是否存在数据冲突\n     */\n    @POST("v1/wms/bulk-outbound/check-conflict")\n    suspend fun checkDataConflict(\n        @Body request: ConflictCheckRequest\n    ): Response<ApiResponse<ConflictCheckResponse>>\n}\n```\n\n### 2.3 请求响应模型定义\n\n#### 2.3.1 列表响应模型\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 散货出库单列表响应\n */\ndata class BulkOutboundListResponse(\n    val orders: List<BulkOutboundOrderSummary>,\n    val pagination: PaginationInfo,\n    val summary: OutboundListSummary? = null\n) : Serializable\n\ndata class BulkOutboundOrderSummary(\n    val id: String,\n    val orderNo: String,\n    val warehouseName: String,\n    val status: String,\n    val statusName: String,\n    val totalItems: Int,\n    val totalQuantity: Int,\n    val pickedQuantity: Int,\n    val progress: Float,\n    val priority: String,\n    val customerName: String?,\n    val orderDate: String,\n    val createdAt: String\n) : Serializable\n\ndata class OutboundListSummary(\n    val totalOrders: Int,\n    val pendingOrders: Int,\n    val pickingOrders: Int,\n    val completedOrders: Int,\n    val exceptionOrders: Int\n) : Serializable\n```\n\n#### 2.3.2 拣货操作请求模型\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 开始拣货请求\n */\ndata class StartPickingRequest(\n    val operatorId: String,\n    val operatorName: String,\n    val deviceId: String? = null,\n    val timestamp: String = getCurrentTimeString()\n) : Serializable\n\n/**\n * 单个商品拣货请求\n */\ndata class SinglePickingRequest(\n    val itemId: String,\n    val goodsId: String,\n    val sku: String,\n    val pickedQty: Int,\n    val locationCode: String? = null,\n    val batch: String? = null,\n    val operatorId: String,\n    val timestamp: String = getCurrentTimeString(),\n    val note: String? = null\n) : Serializable\n\n/**\n * 批量拣货请求\n */\ndata class BatchPickingRequest(\n    val items: List<PickingConfirmItem>,\n    val operatorId: String,\n    val timestamp: String = getCurrentTimeString(),\n    val note: String? = null\n) : Serializable\n\n/**\n * 拣货确认项\n */\ndata class PickingConfirmItem(\n    val itemId: String,\n    val goodsId: String,\n    val sku: String,\n    val pickedQty: Int,\n    val locationCode: String? = null,\n    val batch: String? = null\n) : Serializable\n```\n\n#### 2.3.3 异常处理请求模型\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 拣货异常提交请求\n */\ndata class PickingExceptionRequest(\n    val itemId: String,\n    val goodsId: String,\n    val sku: String,\n    val exceptionType: String,\n    val expectedQty: Int,\n    val actualQty: Int,\n    val description: String,\n    val operatorId: String,\n    val timestamp: String = getCurrentTimeString(),\n    val images: List<String>? = null,\n    val locationCode: String? = null\n) : Serializable\n\n/**\n * 异常处理请求\n */\ndata class ResolveExceptionRequest(\n    val solution: String,\n    val adjustedQty: Int? = null,\n    val operatorId: String,\n    val timestamp: String = getCurrentTimeString(),\n    val note: String? = null\n) : Serializable\n```\n\n#### 2.3.4 响应模型\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 拣货会话响应\n */\ndata class PickingSessionResponse(\n    val sessionId: String,\n    val outboundId: String,\n    val status: String,\n    val lockedBy: String,\n    val lockedAt: String,\n    val estimatedDuration: Int? = null\n) : Serializable\n\n/**\n * 拣货确认响应\n */\ndata class PickingConfirmResponse(\n    val success: Boolean,\n    val itemId: String,\n    val updatedItem: BulkPickingItem,\n    val progress: PickingProgress,\n    val message: String? = null\n) : Serializable\n\n/**\n * 批量拣货响应\n */\ndata class BatchPickingResponse(\n    val successCount: Int,\n    val failedCount: Int,\n    val totalCount: Int,\n    val failedItems: List<FailedPickingItem>? = null,\n    val progress: PickingProgress,\n    val message: String? = null\n) : Serializable\n\ndata class FailedPickingItem(\n    val itemId: String,\n    val sku: String,\n    val error: String\n) : Serializable\n```\n\n### 2.4 兼容性设计\n\n#### 2.4.1 与现有API的兼容\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 兼容性适配器\n * 将现有API响应转换为新的数据模型\n */\nclass ApiCompatibilityAdapter {\n    \n    /**\n     * 现有出库单列表 -> 散货出库单列表\n     */\n    suspend fun adaptOutboundList(\n        existingApi: WmsApi,\n        page: Int,\n        status: String?\n    ): BulkOutboundListResponse {\n        val response = existingApi.getOutboundOrders(page = page, status = status)\n        return response.body()?.data?.let { wmsResponse ->\n            BulkOutboundListResponse(\n                orders = wmsResponse.data.map { it.toBulkOutboundSummary() },\n                pagination = wmsResponse.pagination.toPaginationInfo()\n            )\n        } ?: throw Exception("Empty response")\n    }\n    \n    /**\n     * 现有拣货详情 -> 散货出库单详情\n     */\n    suspend fun adaptPickingDetails(\n        existingApi: WmsApi,\n        outboundId: String\n    ): BulkOutboundOrder {\n        val response = existingApi.getPickingDetails(outboundId)\n        return response.body()?.data?.toBulkOutboundOrder()\n            ?: throw Exception("Picking details not found")\n    }\n}\n```\n\n#### 2.4.2 版本控制策略\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * API版本控制\n */\nobject ApiVersions {\n    const val V1 = "v1"\n    const val V2 = "v2"  // 预留未来版本\n    \n    // 当前使用版本\n    const val CURRENT = V1\n}\n\n/**\n * 版本化的API接口\n */\ninterface VersionedBulkOutboundApi {\n    \n    @GET("{version}/wms/bulk-outbound")\n    suspend fun getBulkOutboundOrders(\n        @Path("version") version: String = ApiVersions.CURRENT,\n        @Query("page") page: Int = 1,\n        // ... 其他参数\n    ): Response<ApiResponse<BulkOutboundListResponse>>\n}\n```\n\n## 3. API实现策略\n\n### 3.1 渐进式实现\n\n#### 第一阶段：基础适配\n1. **复用现有接口**：直接使用现有API，通过适配器转换\n2. **最小改动**：不修改现有后端，只在客户端适配\n3. **功能验证**：验证核心拣货流程\n\n#### 第二阶段：增强接口\n1. **批量操作**：新增批量拣货确认接口\n2. **异常处理**：添加异常提交和处理接口\n3. **进度跟踪**：实现实时进度更新\n\n#### 第三阶段：优化完善\n1. **性能优化**：优化接口响应速度\n2. **离线支持**：实现离线数据同步\n3. **监控分析**：添加操作统计和分析\n\n### 3.2 错误处理策略\n\n#### 3.2.1 错误码定义\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 散货出库API错误码\n */\nobject BulkOutboundErrorCodes {\n    const val OUTBOUND_NOT_FOUND = "BULK_OUTBOUND_001"\n    const val OUTBOUND_LOCKED = "BULK_OUTBOUND_002"\n    const val INVALID_STATUS = "BULK_OUTBOUND_003"\n    const val INSUFFICIENT_STOCK = "BULK_OUTBOUND_004"\n    const val ITEM_NOT_FOUND = "BULK_OUTBOUND_005"\n    const val QUANTITY_EXCEEDED = "BULK_OUTBOUND_006"\n    const val SYNC_CONFLICT = "BULK_OUTBOUND_007"\n    const val OPERATION_TIMEOUT = "BULK_OUTBOUND_008"\n}\n\n/**\n * 错误响应模型\n */\ndata class BulkOutboundError(\n    val code: String,\n    val message: String,\n    val details: Map<String, Any>? = null,\n    val timestamp: String = getCurrentTimeString()\n) : Serializable\n```\n\n#### 3.2.2 重试策略\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * API重试配置\n */\ndata class RetryConfig(\n    val maxRetries: Int = 3,\n    val initialDelay: Long = 1000L,\n    val maxDelay: Long = 10000L,\n    val backoffMultiplier: Double = 2.0,\n    val retryableErrors: Set<String> = setOf(\n        "NETWORK_ERROR",\n        "TIMEOUT",\n        "SERVER_ERROR"\n    )\n)\n```\n\n### 3.3 缓存策略\n\n#### 3.3.1 数据缓存\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * API缓存配置\n */\ndata class CacheConfig(\n    val outboundListCacheDuration: Long = 5 * 60 * 1000L,  // 5分钟\n    val outboundDetailCacheDuration: Long = 2 * 60 * 1000L, // 2分钟\n    val progressCacheDuration: Long = 30 * 1000L,          // 30秒\n    val maxCacheSize: Int = 100\n)\n```\n\n## 4. 性能优化\n\n### 4.1 分页策略\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 智能分页配置\n */\ndata class PaginationConfig(\n    val defaultPageSize: Int = 20,\n    val maxPageSize: Int = 100,\n    val preloadThreshold: Float = 0.8f,  // 滚动到80%时预加载\n    val enableInfiniteScroll: Boolean = true\n)\n```\n\n### 4.2 数据压缩\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 响应数据优化\n */\ndata class OptimizedBulkOutboundSummary(\n    val id: String,\n    val no: String,        // 简化字段名\n    val wh: String,        // warehouse -> wh\n    val st: String,        // status -> st\n    val ti: Int,           // totalItems -> ti\n    val tq: Int,           // totalQuantity -> tq\n    val pq: Int = 0,       // pickedQuantity -> pq\n    val pr: Float = 0f,    // progress -> pr\n    val od: String,        // orderDate -> od\n    val ca: String         // createdAt -> ca\n) : Serializable\n```\n\n## 5. 安全性设计\n\n### 5.1 权限控制\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 权限验证请求头\n */\ninterface SecureBulkOutboundApi {\n    \n    @GET("v1/wms/bulk-outbound")\n    suspend fun getBulkOutboundOrders(\n        @Header("Authorization") token: String,\n        @Header("X-Operator-ID") operatorId: String,\n        @Header("X-Device-ID") deviceId: String? = null,\n        // ... 其他参数\n    ): Response<ApiResponse<BulkOutboundListResponse>>\n}\n```\n\n### 5.2 请求签名\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 请求签名配置\n */\ndata class SignatureConfig(\n    val enabled: Boolean = true,\n    val algorithm: String = "HMAC-SHA256",\n    val timestampTolerance: Long = 300 * 1000L, // 5分钟\n    val nonceLength: Int = 16\n)\n```\n\n## 6. 监控和日志\n\n### 6.1 API监控\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * API性能监控\n */\ndata class ApiMetrics(\n    val endpoint: String,\n    val method: String,\n    val responseTime: Long,\n    val statusCode: Int,\n    val errorCode: String? = null,\n    val timestamp: String\n) : Serializable\n```\n\n### 6.2 操作日志\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 拣货操作日志\n */\ndata class PickingOperationLog(\n    val operationId: String,\n    val outboundId: String,\n    val operatorId: String,\n    val operationType: String,\n    val details: Map<String, Any>,\n    val timestamp: String,\n    val duration: Long? = null\n) : Serializable\n```\n\n## 7. 测试策略\n\n### 7.1 接口测试\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * API测试配置\n */\n@TestConfiguration\nclass ApiTestConfig {\n    \n    @Bean\n    fun mockBulkOutboundApi(): BulkOutboundApi {\n        return mockk<BulkOutboundApi> {\n            coEvery { getBulkOutboundOrders(any(), any()) } returns \n                Response.success(ApiResponse(data = mockBulkOutboundList))\n            \n            coEvery { startBulkPicking(any(), any()) } returns\n                Response.success(ApiResponse(data = mockPickingSession))\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 7.2 性能测试\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * API性能测试\n */\nclass ApiPerformanceTest {\n    \n    @Test\n    fun `test outbound list api response time`() = runTest {\n        val startTime = System.currentTimeMillis()\n        val response = api.getBulkOutboundOrders()\n        val responseTime = System.currentTimeMillis() - startTime\n        \n        assertTrue(response.isSuccessful)\n        assertTrue(responseTime < 2000) // 响应时间小于2秒\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## 8. 实施计划\n\n### 8.1 开发阶段\n\n| 阶段 | 内容 | 时间 | 优先级 |\n|------|------|------|--------|\n| Phase 1 | 基础接口定义和适配器 | 1天 | 高 |\n| Phase 2 | 批量操作和异常处理接口 | 1天 | 高 |\n| Phase 3 | 离线同步和冲突处理 | 0.5天 | 中 |\n| Phase 4 | 性能优化和监控 | 0.5天 | 低 |\n\n### 8.2 集成测试\n\n1. **单接口测试**：验证每个接口的功能正确性\n2. **业务流程测试**：验证完整的拣货流程\n3. **并发测试**：验证多用户并发操作\n4. **性能测试**：验证接口响应时间和吞吐量\n\n## 9. 总结\n\n### 9.1 设计优势\n\n1. **向后兼容**：充分复用现有API，降低开发成本\n2. **渐进演进**：支持分阶段实施，风险可控\n3. **性能优化**：批量操作和缓存策略提升性能\n4. **扩展性强**：预留版本控制和功能扩展能力\n5. **安全可靠**：完善的错误处理和安全机制\n\n### 9.2 技术亮点\n\n1. **适配器模式**：优雅地处理新旧API兼容\n2. **批量设计**：支持批量操作提升效率\n3. **状态驱动**：以状态变化为核心的接口设计\n4. **离线友好**：支持离线操作和数据同步\n5. **监控完善**：全面的性能监控和日志记录\n\n### 9.3 实施建议\n\n1. **优先级排序**：先实现核心功能，再扩展高级特性\n2. **测试驱动**：每个接口都要有完整的测试覆盖\n3. **文档同步**：接口文档与代码实现同步更新\n4. **性能监控**：上线后持续监控接口性能\n5. **用户反馈**：收集用户使用反馈，持续优化\n\n---\n\n**设计完成状态**: ✅ 已完成  \n**预计实施时间**: 2天  \n**风险评估**: 低风险  \n**下一步**: 进入Repository层重构阶段	110	2025-09-21 08:35:43.538004	2025-09-21 08:35:43.538004	\N	110	markdown	draft	\N	\N	private	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N		1	\N	{}	f	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N
1140	1	散货出库模块Repository层重构设计方案	# 散货出库模块Repository层重构设计方案\n\n## 1. 现有Repository分析\n\n### 1.1 现有WmsRepository.kt分析\n\n#### 当前架构特点\n```kotlin\nclass WmsRepository {\n    private val wmsApi = ApiClient.createService(WmsApi::class.java)\n    \n    // 现有方法架构\n    suspend fun getOutboundOrders(page: Int = 1, status: String? = null) = withContext(Dispatchers.IO) {\n        try {\n            val response = wmsApi.getOutboundOrders(page = page, status = status)\n            if (response.isSuccessful) {\n                Result.success(response.body()?.data)\n            } else {\n                Result.failure(Exception("Failed to fetch outbound orders: ${response.message()}"))\n            }\n        } catch (e: Exception) {\n            Result.failure(e)\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n#### 现有架构优势\n1. ✅ **统一错误处理**：使用Result包装异步结果\n2. ✅ **线程安全**：使用Dispatchers.IO处理网络请求\n3. ✅ **API封装**：统一的API调用模式\n\n#### 现有架构局限性\n1. ❌ **缺少离线支持**：没有本地数据缓存机制\n2. ❌ **缺少数据同步**：没有离线数据同步逻辑\n3. ❌ **缺少状态管理**：没有统一的数据状态管理\n4. ❌ **缺少批量操作**：没有批量操作的优化处理\n5. ❌ **错误处理单一**：错误处理过于简单\n\n### 1.2 Repository职责分析\n\n#### 当前职责\n- 网络API调用\n- 基础错误处理\n- 数据类型转换\n\n#### 缺失职责\n- 本地数据缓存\n- 离线数据管理\n- 数据同步策略\n- 状态持久化\n- 性能优化\n\n## 2. 散货出库Repository设计\n\n### 2.1 设计原则\n\n1. **单一职责**：每个Repository专注特定业务领域\n2. **离线优先**：优先使用本地数据，异步同步网络数据\n3. **状态驱动**：以数据状态为核心管理数据流\n4. **性能优化**：缓存、批量操作、预加载等优化策略\n5. **错误恢复**：完善的错误处理和恢复机制\n\n### 2.2 架构设计\n\n#### 2.2.1 分层架构\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────┐\n│           ViewModel Layer           │\n├─────────────────────────────────────┤\n│         Repository Layer            │\n│  ┌─────────────────────────────────┐ │\n│  │    BulkOutboundRepository       │ │\n│  └─────────────────────────────────┘ │\n├─────────────────────────────────────┤\n│          Data Source Layer          │\n│  ┌─────────────┐ ┌─────────────────┐ │\n│  │ Remote Data │ │   Local Data    │ │\n│  │   Source    │ │     Source      │ │\n│  └─────────────┘ └─────────────────┘ │\n├─────────────────────────────────────┤\n│         Storage Layer               │\n│  ┌─────────────┐ ┌─────────────────┐ │\n│  │     API     │ │   Room Database │ │\n│  └─────────────┘ └─────────────────┘ │\n└─────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n#### 2.2.2 核心组件设计\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 散货出库Repository主接口\n * 定义散货出库相关的所有数据操作\n */\ninterface BulkOutboundRepository {\n    \n    // === 出库单查询 ===\n    suspend fun getOutboundOrders(\n        refresh: Boolean = false,\n        page: Int = 1,\n        status: String? = null\n    ): Flow<DataResult<List<BulkOutboundOrder>>>\n    \n    suspend fun getOutboundOrder(id: String, refresh: Boolean = false): Flow<DataResult<BulkOutboundOrder>>\n    \n    suspend fun searchOutboundOrder(code: String): Flow<DataResult<BulkOutboundOrder?>>\n    \n    // === 拣货操作 ===\n    suspend fun startPicking(outboundId: String, operatorInfo: OperatorInfo): DataResult<PickingSession>\n    \n    suspend fun confirmSinglePicking(request: SinglePickingRequest): DataResult<PickingConfirmResponse>\n    \n    suspend fun confirmBatchPicking(request: BatchPickingRequest): DataResult<BatchPickingResponse>\n    \n    suspend fun submitException(request: PickingExceptionRequest): DataResult<ExceptionResponse>\n    \n    suspend fun completePicking(outboundId: String): DataResult<CompletionResponse>\n    \n    // === 进度和状态 ===\n    fun getPickingProgress(outboundId: String): Flow<PickingProgress>\n    \n    suspend fun updateLocalProgress(outboundId: String, progress: PickingProgress)\n    \n    // === 离线支持 ===\n    suspend fun syncOfflineData(): DataResult<SyncResult>\n    \n    suspend fun getPendingSyncOperations(): List<OfflineOperation>\n    \n    suspend fun clearSyncedData()\n    \n    // === 缓存管理 ===\n    suspend fun clearCache()\n    \n    suspend fun preloadData(outboundIds: List<String>)\n}\n```\n\n### 2.3 数据结果封装\n\n#### 2.3.1 统一数据结果类型\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 统一的数据结果封装\n * 包含数据状态、加载状态、错误信息等\n */\nsealed class DataResult<out T> {\n    data class Success<T>(val data: T) : DataResult<T>()\n    data class Error(val exception: Throwable, val cachedData: Any? = null) : DataResult<Nothing>()\n    object Loading : DataResult<Nothing>()\n    \n    val isSuccess: Boolean get() = this is Success\n    val isError: Boolean get() = this is Error\n    val isLoading: Boolean get() = this is Loading\n    \n    fun getOrNull(): T? = when (this) {\n        is Success -> data\n        else -> null\n    }\n    \n    fun getOrThrow(): T = when (this) {\n        is Success -> data\n        is Error -> throw exception\n        is Loading -> throw IllegalStateException("Data is still loading")\n    }\n}\n\n/**\n * 数据源状态\n */\nenum class DataSource {\n    CACHE,      // 缓存数据\n    NETWORK,    // 网络数据\n    LOCAL,      // 本地数据\n    HYBRID      // 混合数据\n}\n\n/**\n * 带数据源信息的结果\n */\ndata class SourcedResult<T>(\n    val result: DataResult<T>,\n    val source: DataSource,\n    val timestamp: Long = System.currentTimeMillis(),\n    val isFresh: Boolean = false\n)\n```\n\n#### 2.3.2 离线操作模型\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 离线操作记录\n */\ndata class OfflineOperation(\n    val id: String = UUID.randomUUID().toString(),\n    val type: OperationType,\n    val outboundId: String,\n    val payload: String,  // JSON序列化的操作数据\n    val timestamp: Long = System.currentTimeMillis(),\n    val retryCount: Int = 0,\n    val maxRetries: Int = 3,\n    val status: OfflineOperationStatus = OfflineOperationStatus.PENDING\n) : Serializable\n\nenum class OperationType {\n    START_PICKING,\n    CONFIRM_PICKING,\n    BATCH_PICKING,\n    SUBMIT_EXCEPTION,\n    COMPLETE_PICKING,\n    UPDATE_PROGRESS\n}\n\nenum class OfflineOperationStatus {\n    PENDING,    // 待同步\n    SYNCING,    // 同步中\n    SYNCED,     // 已同步\n    FAILED,     // 同步失败\n    CONFLICT    // 同步冲突\n}\n```\n\n### 2.4 数据源实现\n\n#### 2.4.1 远程数据源\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 远程数据源接口\n */\ninterface BulkOutboundRemoteDataSource {\n    suspend fun getOutboundOrders(page: Int, status: String?): List<BulkOutboundOrder>\n    suspend fun getOutboundOrder(id: String): BulkOutboundOrder\n    suspend fun startPicking(outboundId: String, request: StartPickingRequest): PickingSession\n    suspend fun confirmPicking(outboundId: String, request: BatchPickingRequest): BatchPickingResponse\n    suspend fun submitException(outboundId: String, request: PickingExceptionRequest): ExceptionResponse\n    suspend fun completePicking(outboundId: String, request: CompletePickingRequest): CompletionResponse\n}\n\n/**\n * 远程数据源实现\n */\nclass BulkOutboundRemoteDataSourceImpl(\n    private val api: BulkOutboundApi,\n    private val compatibilityAdapter: ApiCompatibilityAdapter\n) : BulkOutboundRemoteDataSource {\n    \n    override suspend fun getOutboundOrders(page: Int, status: String?): List<BulkOutboundOrder> {\n        return try {\n            val response = api.getBulkOutboundOrders(page = page, status = status)\n            if (response.isSuccessful) {\n                response.body()?.data?.orders ?: emptyList()\n            } else {\n                // 降级到现有API\n                compatibilityAdapter.adaptOutboundList(page, status).orders.map { it.toBulkOutboundOrder() }\n            }\n        } catch (e: Exception) {\n            // 网络异常时尝试使用兼容API\n            compatibilityAdapter.adaptOutboundList(page, status).orders.map { it.toBulkOutboundOrder() }\n        }\n    }\n    \n    override suspend fun getOutboundOrder(id: String): BulkOutboundOrder {\n        return try {\n            val response = api.getBulkOutboundOrder(id)\n            if (response.isSuccessful) {\n                response.body()?.data ?: throw Exception("Empty response")\n            } else {\n                // 降级到现有API\n                compatibilityAdapter.adaptPickingDetails(id)\n            }\n        } catch (e: Exception) {\n            // 使用兼容API\n            compatibilityAdapter.adaptPickingDetails(id)\n        }\n    }\n    \n    // ... 其他方法实现\n}\n```\n\n#### 2.4.2 本地数据源\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 本地数据源接口\n */\ninterface BulkOutboundLocalDataSource {\n    suspend fun getOutboundOrders(): List<BulkOutboundOrder>\n    suspend fun getOutboundOrder(id: String): BulkOutboundOrder?\n    suspend fun saveOutboundOrders(orders: List<BulkOutboundOrder>)\n    suspend fun saveOutboundOrder(order: BulkOutboundOrder)\n    suspend fun updatePickingProgress(outboundId: String, progress: PickingProgress)\n    suspend fun getPickingProgress(outboundId: String): PickingProgress?\n    suspend fun saveOfflineOperation(operation: OfflineOperation)\n    suspend fun getPendingOperations(): List<OfflineOperation>\n    suspend fun updateOperationStatus(operationId: String, status: OfflineOperationStatus)\n    suspend fun deleteOperation(operationId: String)\n    suspend fun clearExpiredCache(expiration: Long)\n}\n\n/**\n * 本地数据源实现\n * 基于Room数据库\n */\nclass BulkOutboundLocalDataSourceImpl(\n    private val orderDao: BulkOutboundOrderDao,\n    private val progressDao: PickingProgressDao,\n    private val operationDao: OfflineOperationDao\n) : BulkOutboundLocalDataSource {\n    \n    override suspend fun getOutboundOrders(): List<BulkOutboundOrder> {\n        return orderDao.getAllOrders().map { it.toDomainModel() }\n    }\n    \n    override suspend fun getOutboundOrder(id: String): BulkOutboundOrder? {\n        return orderDao.getOrderById(id)?.toDomainModel()\n    }\n    \n    override suspend fun saveOutboundOrders(orders: List<BulkOutboundOrder>) {\n        val entities = orders.map { it.toEntity() }\n        orderDao.insertOrders(entities)\n    }\n    \n    override suspend fun updatePickingProgress(outboundId: String, progress: PickingProgress) {\n        val entity = PickingProgressEntity(\n            outboundId = outboundId,\n            totalQuantity = progress.totalQuantity,\n            pickedQuantity = progress.pickedQuantity,\n            exceptionQuantity = progress.exceptionQuantity,\n            lastUpdated = System.currentTimeMillis()\n        )\n        progressDao.insertOrUpdate(entity)\n    }\n    \n    override suspend fun saveOfflineOperation(operation: OfflineOperation) {\n        val entity = operation.toEntity()\n        operationDao.insertOperation(entity)\n    }\n    \n    // ... 其他方法实现\n}\n```\n\n### 2.5 Repository实现\n\n#### 2.5.1 主Repository实现\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 散货出库Repository实现\n * 集成远程数据源和本地数据源，实现离线优先策略\n */\nclass BulkOutboundRepositoryImpl(\n    private val remoteDataSource: BulkOutboundRemoteDataSource,\n    private val localDataSource: BulkOutboundLocalDataSource,\n    private val networkManager: NetworkManager,\n    private val syncManager: DataSyncManager,\n    private val cachePolicy: CachePolicy\n) : BulkOutboundRepository {\n    \n    private val _progressFlow = MutableSharedFlow<Pair<String, PickingProgress>>()\n    \n    override suspend fun getOutboundOrders(\n        refresh: Boolean,\n        page: Int,\n        status: String?\n    ): Flow<DataResult<List<BulkOutboundOrder>>> = flow {\n        \n        emit(DataResult.Loading)\n        \n        try {\n            // 1. 先返回缓存数据（如果有）\n            if (!refresh) {\n                val cachedOrders = localDataSource.getOutboundOrders()\n                if (cachedOrders.isNotEmpty()) {\n                    emit(DataResult.Success(cachedOrders))\n                }\n            }\n            \n            // 2. 如果需要刷新或网络可用，获取最新数据\n            if (refresh || networkManager.isOnline()) {\n                try {\n                    val remoteOrders = remoteDataSource.getOutboundOrders(page, status)\n                    \n                    // 保存到本地缓存\n                    localDataSource.saveOutboundOrders(remoteOrders)\n                    \n                    // 返回最新数据\n                    emit(DataResult.Success(remoteOrders))\n                    \n                } catch (networkException: Exception) {\n                    // 网络异常时，如果有缓存数据就返回缓存，否则抛出异常\n                    val cachedOrders = localDataSource.getOutboundOrders()\n                    if (cachedOrders.isNotEmpty()) {\n                        emit(DataResult.Error(networkException, cachedOrders))\n                    } else {\n                        emit(DataResult.Error(networkException))\n                    }\n                }\n            } else {\n                // 离线模式，只返回缓存数据\n                val cachedOrders = localDataSource.getOutboundOrders()\n                emit(DataResult.Success(cachedOrders))\n            }\n            \n        } catch (e: Exception) {\n            emit(DataResult.Error(e))\n        }\n    }.flowOn(Dispatchers.IO)\n    \n    override suspend fun confirmSinglePicking(\n        request: SinglePickingRequest\n    ): DataResult<PickingConfirmResponse> = withContext(Dispatchers.IO) {\n        \n        try {\n            if (networkManager.isOnline()) {\n                // 在线模式：直接调用API\n                try {\n                    val response = remoteDataSource.confirmPicking(\n                        request.outboundId,\n                        BatchPickingRequest(\n                            items = listOf(request.toConfirmItem()),\n                            operatorId = request.operatorId\n                        )\n                    )\n                    \n                    // 更新本地进度\n                    updateLocalPickingProgress(request)\n                    \n                    DataResult.Success(response.toSingleResponse())\n                    \n                } catch (networkException: Exception) {\n                    // 网络异常，保存到离线队列\n                    saveOfflineOperation(request)\n                    updateLocalPickingProgress(request)\n                    \n                    DataResult.Success(\n                        PickingConfirmResponse(\n                            success = true,\n                            itemId = request.itemId,\n                            message = "已保存，将在网络恢复时同步"\n                        )\n                    )\n                }\n            } else {\n                // 离线模式：保存到离线队列\n                saveOfflineOperation(request)\n                updateLocalPickingProgress(request)\n                \n                DataResult.Success(\n                    PickingConfirmResponse(\n                        success = true,\n                        itemId = request.itemId,\n                        message = "离线模式，已保存到本地"\n                    )\n                )\n            }\n        } catch (e: Exception) {\n            DataResult.Error(e)\n        }\n    }\n    \n    override fun getPickingProgress(outboundId: String): Flow<PickingProgress> {\n        return _progressFlow\n            .filter { it.first == outboundId }\n            .map { it.second }\n            .onStart {\n                // 发送初始进度\n                val initialProgress = localDataSource.getPickingProgress(outboundId)\n                if (initialProgress != null) {\n                    emit(initialProgress)\n                }\n            }\n            .flowOn(Dispatchers.IO)\n    }\n    \n    override suspend fun syncOfflineData(): DataResult<SyncResult> = withContext(Dispatchers.IO) {\n        try {\n            if (!networkManager.isOnline()) {\n                return@withContext DataResult.Error(Exception("Network not available"))\n            }\n            \n            val pendingOperations = localDataSource.getPendingOperations()\n            var successCount = 0\n            var failedCount = 0\n            val failedOperations = mutableListOf<OfflineOperation>()\n            \n            pendingOperations.forEach { operation ->\n                try {\n                    when (operation.type) {\n                        OperationType.CONFIRM_PICKING -> {\n                            val request = Json.decodeFromString<SinglePickingRequest>(operation.payload)\n                            remoteDataSource.confirmPicking(operation.outboundId, request.toBatchRequest())\n                            localDataSource.updateOperationStatus(operation.id, OfflineOperationStatus.SYNCED)\n                            successCount++\n                        }\n                        // ... 处理其他操作类型\n                    }\n                } catch (e: Exception) {\n                    localDataSource.updateOperationStatus(operation.id, OfflineOperationStatus.FAILED)\n                    failedOperations.add(operation)\n                    failedCount++\n                }\n            }\n            \n            val result = SyncResult(\n                totalOperations = pendingOperations.size,\n                successCount = successCount,\n                failedCount = failedCount,\n                failedOperations = failedOperations\n            )\n            \n            DataResult.Success(result)\n            \n        } catch (e: Exception) {\n            DataResult.Error(e)\n        }\n    }\n    \n    private suspend fun updateLocalPickingProgress(request: SinglePickingRequest) {\n        // 更新本地进度并发送给观察者\n        val currentProgress = localDataSource.getPickingProgress(request.outboundId)\n            ?: PickingProgress.empty()\n        \n        val updatedProgress = currentProgress.copy(\n            pickedQuantity = currentProgress.pickedQuantity + request.pickedQty\n        )\n        \n        localDataSource.updatePickingProgress(request.outboundId, updatedProgress)\n        _progressFlow.emit(request.outboundId to updatedProgress)\n    }\n    \n    private suspend fun saveOfflineOperation(request: SinglePickingRequest) {\n        val operation = OfflineOperation(\n            type = OperationType.CONFIRM_PICKING,\n            outboundId = request.outboundId,\n            payload = Json.encodeToString(request)\n        )\n        localDataSource.saveOfflineOperation(operation)\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 2.6 缓存策略\n\n#### 2.6.1 缓存策略接口\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 缓存策略接口\n */\ninterface CachePolicy {\n    fun shouldRefresh(dataType: DataType, lastUpdateTime: Long): Boolean\n    fun getCacheExpiration(dataType: DataType): Long\n    fun getMaxCacheSize(dataType: DataType): Int\n}\n\nenum class DataType {\n    OUTBOUND_LIST,      // 出库单列表\n    OUTBOUND_DETAIL,    // 出库单详情\n    PICKING_PROGRESS,   // 拣货进度\n    USER_PREFERENCES    // 用户偏好\n}\n\n/**\n * 默认缓存策略实现\n */\nclass DefaultCachePolicy : CachePolicy {\n    \n    override fun shouldRefresh(dataType: DataType, lastUpdateTime: Long): Boolean {\n        val now = System.currentTimeMillis()\n        val expiration = getCacheExpiration(dataType)\n        return (now - lastUpdateTime) > expiration\n    }\n    \n    override fun getCacheExpiration(dataType: DataType): Long {\n        return when (dataType) {\n            DataType.OUTBOUND_LIST -> 5 * 60 * 1000L      // 5分钟\n            DataType.OUTBOUND_DETAIL -> 2 * 60 * 1000L    // 2分钟\n            DataType.PICKING_PROGRESS -> 30 * 1000L       // 30秒\n            DataType.USER_PREFERENCES -> 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000L // 24小时\n        }\n    }\n    \n    override fun getMaxCacheSize(dataType: DataType): Int {\n        return when (dataType) {\n            DataType.OUTBOUND_LIST -> 100     // 100个列表项\n            DataType.OUTBOUND_DETAIL -> 50    // 50个详情\n            DataType.PICKING_PROGRESS -> 20   // 20个进度记录\n            DataType.USER_PREFERENCES -> 10   // 10个偏好设置\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 2.7 数据同步管理\n\n#### 2.7.1 同步管理器\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 数据同步管理器\n */\ninterface DataSyncManager {\n    suspend fun startAutoSync()\n    suspend fun stopAutoSync()\n    suspend fun forceSyncNow()\n    fun getSyncStatus(): Flow<SyncStatus>\n    suspend fun resolveConflict(conflict: DataConflict, resolution: ConflictResolution)\n}\n\n/**\n * 同步状态\n */\ndata class SyncStatus(\n    val isRunning: Boolean,\n    val lastSyncTime: Long,\n    val pendingOperations: Int,\n    val conflictCount: Int,\n    val errorMessage: String? = null\n)\n\n/**\n * 数据冲突\n */\ndata class DataConflict(\n    val operationId: String,\n    val localData: Any,\n    val remoteData: Any,\n    val conflictType: ConflictType\n)\n\nenum class ConflictType {\n    VERSION_MISMATCH,    // 版本不匹配\n    CONCURRENT_EDIT,     // 并发编辑\n    DATA_CORRUPTION      // 数据损坏\n}\n\nenum class ConflictResolution {\n    USE_LOCAL,          // 使用本地数据\n    USE_REMOTE,         // 使用远程数据\n    MERGE,              // 合并数据\n    MANUAL              // 手动解决\n}\n```\n\n### 2.8 性能优化\n\n#### 2.8.1 预加载策略\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 数据预加载管理器\n */\nclass DataPreloader(\n    private val repository: BulkOutboundRepository,\n    private val predictiveEngine: PredictiveEngine\n) {\n    \n    suspend fun preloadData(context: PreloadContext) {\n        when (context.trigger) {\n            PreloadTrigger.APP_START -> {\n                // 应用启动时预加载常用数据\n                preloadRecentOrders()\n                preloadUserPreferences()\n            }\n            PreloadTrigger.USER_LOGIN -> {\n                // 用户登录后预加载相关数据\n                preloadAssignedOrders(context.userId)\n            }\n            PreloadTrigger.LOCATION_CHANGE -> {\n                // 位置变化时预加载附近仓库数据\n                preloadNearbyWarehouse(context.location)\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    \n    private suspend fun preloadRecentOrders() {\n        // 预加载最近的出库单\n        val recentOrderIds = predictiveEngine.predictRecentOrders()\n        repository.preloadData(recentOrderIds)\n    }\n}\n\ndata class PreloadContext(\n    val trigger: PreloadTrigger,\n    val userId: String? = null,\n    val location: Location? = null\n)\n\nenum class PreloadTrigger {\n    APP_START,\n    USER_LOGIN,\n    LOCATION_CHANGE,\n    TIME_BASED\n}\n```\n\n#### 2.8.2 批量操作优化\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 批量操作管理器\n */\nclass BatchOperationManager(\n    private val repository: BulkOutboundRepository\n) {\n    \n    private val batchQueue = mutableListOf<PickingOperation>()\n    private val batchSize = 10\n    private val batchTimeout = 5000L // 5秒\n    \n    suspend fun queueOperation(operation: PickingOperation) {\n        batchQueue.add(operation)\n        \n        if (batchQueue.size >= batchSize) {\n            flushBatch()\n        } else {\n            scheduleFlush()\n        }\n    }\n    \n    private suspend fun flushBatch() {\n        if (batchQueue.isEmpty()) return\n        \n        val operations = batchQueue.toList()\n        batchQueue.clear()\n        \n        try {\n            val batchRequest = BatchPickingRequest(\n                items = operations.map { it.toConfirmItem() },\n                operatorId = operations.first().operatorId\n            )\n            \n            repository.confirmBatchPicking(batchRequest)\n            \n        } catch (e: Exception) {\n            // 批量失败时，回退到单个操作\n            operations.forEach { operation ->\n                repository.confirmSinglePicking(operation.toSingleRequest())\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    \n    private suspend fun scheduleFlush() {\n        delay(batchTimeout)\n        if (batchQueue.isNotEmpty()) {\n            flushBatch()\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## 3. 依赖注入配置\n\n### 3.1 Hilt模块配置\n\n```kotlin\n@Module\n@InstallIn(SingletonComponent::class)\nobject RepositoryModule {\n    \n    @Provides\n    @Singleton\n    fun provideBulkOutboundRemoteDataSource(\n        api: BulkOutboundApi,\n        adapter: ApiCompatibilityAdapter\n    ): BulkOutboundRemoteDataSource {\n        return BulkOutboundRemoteDataSourceImpl(api, adapter)\n    }\n    \n    @Provides\n    @Singleton\n    fun provideBulkOutboundLocalDataSource(\n        orderDao: BulkOutboundOrderDao,\n        progressDao: PickingProgressDao,\n        operationDao: OfflineOperationDao\n    ): BulkOutboundLocalDataSource {\n        return BulkOutboundLocalDataSourceImpl(orderDao, progressDao, operationDao)\n    }\n    \n    @Provides\n    @Singleton\n    fun provideBulkOutboundRepository(\n        remoteDataSource: BulkOutboundRemoteDataSource,\n        localDataSource: BulkOutboundLocalDataSource,\n        networkManager: NetworkManager,\n        syncManager: DataSyncManager,\n        cachePolicy: CachePolicy\n    ): BulkOutboundRepository {\n        return BulkOutboundRepositoryImpl(\n            remoteDataSource,\n            localDataSource,\n            networkManager,\n            syncManager,\n            cachePolicy\n        )\n    }\n    \n    @Provides\n    @Singleton\n    fun provideCachePolicy(): CachePolicy {\n        return DefaultCachePolicy()\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## 4. 测试策略\n\n### 4.1 单元测试\n\n```kotlin\n@RunWith(MockitoJUnitRunner::class)\nclass BulkOutboundRepositoryTest {\n    \n    @Mock lateinit var remoteDataSource: BulkOutboundRemoteDataSource\n    @Mock lateinit var localDataSource: BulkOutboundLocalDataSource\n    @Mock lateinit var networkManager: NetworkManager\n    @Mock lateinit var syncManager: DataSyncManager\n    @Mock lateinit var cachePolicy: CachePolicy\n    \n    private lateinit var repository: BulkOutboundRepository\n    \n    @Before\n    fun setup() {\n        repository = BulkOutboundRepositoryImpl(\n            remoteDataSource,\n            localDataSource,\n            networkManager,\n            syncManager,\n            cachePolicy\n        )\n    }\n    \n    @Test\n    fun `test get outbound orders with network available`() = runTest {\n        // Given\n        val mockOrders = listOf(createMockBulkOutboundOrder())\n        `when`(networkManager.isOnline()).thenReturn(true)\n        `when`(remoteDataSource.getOutboundOrders(1, null)).thenReturn(mockOrders)\n        \n        // When\n        val result = repository.getOutboundOrders(refresh = true).first()\n        \n        // Then\n        assertTrue(result.isSuccess)\n        assertEquals(mockOrders, result.getOrNull())\n        verify(localDataSource).saveOutboundOrders(mockOrders)\n    }\n    \n    @Test\n    fun `test confirm picking with offline mode`() = runTest {\n        // Given\n        val request = createMockSinglePickingRequest()\n        `when`(networkManager.isOnline()).thenReturn(false)\n        \n        // When\n        val result = repository.confirmSinglePicking(request)\n        \n        // Then\n        assertTrue(result.isSuccess)\n        verify(localDataSource).saveOfflineOperation(any())\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 4.2 集成测试\n\n```kotlin\n@RunWith(AndroidJUnit4::class)\n@SmallTest\nclass BulkOutboundRepositoryIntegrationTest {\n    \n    @get:Rule\n    val instantTaskExecutorRule = InstantTaskExecutorRule()\n    \n    private lateinit var database: TestDatabase\n    private lateinit var repository: BulkOutboundRepository\n    \n    @Before\n    fun setup() {\n        database = Room.inMemoryDatabaseBuilder(\n            ApplicationProvider.getApplicationContext(),\n            TestDatabase::class.java\n        ).allowMainThreadQueries().build()\n        \n        repository = BulkOutboundRepositoryImpl(\n            // ... 注入测试依赖\n        )\n    }\n    \n    @Test\n    fun testCompletePickingFlow() = runTest {\n        // 1. 获取出库单列表\n        val orders = repository.getOutboundOrders().first().getOrNull()\n        assertNotNull(orders)\n        \n        // 2. 开始拣货\n        val startResult = repository.startPicking(orders.first().id, mockOperatorInfo)\n        assertTrue(startResult.isSuccess)\n        \n        // 3. 确认拣货\n        val confirmResult = repository.confirmSinglePicking(mockPickingRequest)\n        assertTrue(confirmResult.isSuccess)\n        \n        // 4. 完成拣货\n        val completeResult = repository.completePicking(orders.first().id)\n        assertTrue(completeResult.isSuccess)\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## 5. 性能监控\n\n### 5.1 性能指标\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * Repository性能监控\n */\nclass RepositoryPerformanceMonitor {\n    \n    fun trackOperation(\n        operation: String,\n        duration: Long,\n        dataSize: Int,\n        cacheHit: Boolean\n    ) {\n        val metrics = PerformanceMetrics(\n            operation = operation,\n            duration = duration,\n            dataSize = dataSize,\n            cacheHit = cacheHit,\n            timestamp = System.currentTimeMillis()\n        )\n        \n        // 发送到分析平台\n        analyticsManager.track(metrics)\n    }\n}\n\ndata class PerformanceMetrics(\n    val operation: String,\n    val duration: Long,\n    val dataSize: Int,\n    val cacheHit: Boolean,\n    val timestamp: Long\n)\n```\n\n## 6. 实施计划\n\n### 6.1 分阶段实施\n\n| 阶段 | 内容 | 时间 | 依赖 |\n|------|------|------|------|\n| Phase 1 | 基础Repository接口和数据源 | 1天 | 数据模型完成 |\n| Phase 2 | 离线支持和同步机制 | 1天 | Phase 1 |\n| Phase 3 | 缓存策略和性能优化 | 0.5天 | Phase 2 |\n| Phase 4 | 测试和监控 | 0.5天 | Phase 3 |\n\n### 6.2 风险评估\n\n1. **数据一致性风险**：离线操作可能导致数据不一致\n   - 缓解：完善的冲突检测和解决机制\n\n2. **性能风险**：大量数据缓存可能影响性能\n   - 缓解：智能缓存策略和定期清理\n\n3. **复杂性风险**：Repository层逻辑过于复杂\n   - 缓解：清晰的职责分工和充分的测试\n\n## 7. 总结\n\n### 7.1 设计优势\n\n1. **离线优先**：完善的离线支持，提升用户体验\n2. **性能优化**：多级缓存和批量操作，提升性能\n3. **数据一致性**：完善的同步机制，保证数据一致性\n4. **可测试性**：清晰的分层和依赖注入，易于测试\n5. **可维护性**：单一职责和模块化设计，易于维护\n\n### 7.2 技术亮点\n\n1. **Flow响应式编程**：实时数据更新和状态管理\n2. **协程并发**：高效的异步操作处理\n3. **多数据源策略**：灵活的数据获取策略\n4. **智能缓存**：基于使用模式的缓存策略\n5. **冲突解决**：完善的数据冲突处理机制\n\n---\n\n**设计完成状态**: ✅ 已完成  \n**预计实施时间**: 2天  \n**风险评估**: 中风险  \n**下一步**: 进入数据库设计阶段	110	2025-09-21 08:38:07.462925	2025-09-21 08:38:07.462925	\N	110	markdown	draft	\N	\N	private	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N		1	\N	{}	f	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N
1141	1	散货出库模块数据库设计方案	# 散货出库模块数据库设计方案\n\n## 1. 数据库架构概述\n\n### 1.1 设计目标\n\n1. **离线优先**：支持离线操作，本地数据完整性\n2. **高性能**：优化查询性能，快速数据检索\n3. **数据一致性**：保证本地和远程数据同步\n4. **扩展性**：支持未来功能扩展\n5. **存储优化**：合理的存储空间使用\n\n### 1.2 技术选型\n\n- **数据库框架**：Room (Android官方推荐ORM)\n- **数据库引擎**：SQLite\n- **并发策略**：WAL模式 (Write-Ahead Logging)\n- **版本管理**：Room自动迁移 + 手动迁移策略\n\n### 1.3 数据库架构\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────┐\n│            Application              │\n├─────────────────────────────────────┤\n│              DAO Layer              │\n│  ┌─────────────────────────────────┐ │\n│  │    BulkOutboundDatabase         │ │\n│  └─────────────────────────────────┘ │\n├─────────────────────────────────────┤\n│             Entity Layer            │\n│  ┌──────┐ ┌──────┐ ┌──────┐ ┌──────┐ │\n│  │ Order│ │ Item │ │Progress│ │Operation│ │\n│  │Entity│ │Entity│ │Entity │ │ Entity │ │\n│  └──────┘ └──────┘ └──────┘ └──────┘ │\n├─────────────────────────────────────┤\n│              Room ORM               │\n├─────────────────────────────────────┤\n│            SQLite Engine            │\n└─────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n## 2. 数据库实体设计\n\n### 2.1 出库单实体 (BulkOutboundOrderEntity)\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 散货出库单数据库实体\n * 主表，存储出库单基本信息\n */\n@Entity(\n    tableName = "bulk_outbound_orders",\n    indices = [\n        Index(value = ["order_no"], unique = true),\n        Index(value = ["warehouse_id"]),\n        Index(value = ["status"]),\n        Index(value = ["created_at"]),\n        Index(value = ["sync_status"])\n    ]\n)\ndata class BulkOutboundOrderEntity(\n    @PrimaryKey\n    @ColumnInfo(name = "id")\n    val id: String,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "order_no")\n    val orderNo: String,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "warehouse_id")\n    val warehouseId: String,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "warehouse_name")\n    val warehouseName: String,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "status")\n    val status: String,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "status_name")\n    val statusName: String,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "order_date")\n    val orderDate: String,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "customer_name")\n    val customerName: String? = null,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "customer_address")\n    val customerAddress: String? = null,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "sales_order_code")\n    val salesOrderCode: String? = null,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "note")\n    val note: String? = null,\n    \n    // 统计信息\n    @ColumnInfo(name = "total_items")\n    val totalItems: Int,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "total_quantity")\n    val totalQuantity: Int,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "picked_quantity")\n    val pickedQuantity: Int = 0,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "exception_quantity")\n    val exceptionQuantity: Int = 0,\n    \n    // 时间戳\n    @ColumnInfo(name = "created_at")\n    val createdAt: Long,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "updated_at")\n    val updatedAt: Long? = null,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "start_picking_at")\n    val startPickingAt: Long? = null,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "completed_at")\n    val completedAt: Long? = null,\n    \n    // 同步状态\n    @ColumnInfo(name = "sync_status")\n    val syncStatus: String = "SYNCED", // SYNCED, PENDING, SYNCING, FAILED, CONFLICT\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "last_sync_at")\n    val lastSyncAt: Long? = null,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "version")\n    val version: Int = 1,\n    \n    // 缓存控制\n    @ColumnInfo(name = "cache_expires_at")\n    val cacheExpiresAt: Long = System.currentTimeMillis() + 5 * 60 * 1000L // 5分钟过期\n)\n```\n\n### 2.2 拣货商品实体 (BulkPickingItemEntity)\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 散货拣货商品数据库实体\n * 子表，存储出库单商品明细\n */\n@Entity(\n    tableName = "bulk_picking_items",\n    indices = [\n        Index(value = ["outbound_id"]),\n        Index(value = ["goods_id"]),\n        Index(value = ["sku"]),\n        Index(value = ["status"]),\n        Index(value = ["sync_status"])\n    ],\n    foreignKeys = [\n        ForeignKey(\n            entity = BulkOutboundOrderEntity::class,\n            parentColumns = ["id"],\n            childColumns = ["outbound_id"],\n            onDelete = ForeignKey.CASCADE\n        )\n    ]\n)\ndata class BulkPickingItemEntity(\n    @PrimaryKey\n    @ColumnInfo(name = "id")\n    val id: String,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "outbound_id")\n    val outboundId: String,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "goods_id")\n    val goodsId: String,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "sku")\n    val sku: String,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "goods_barcode")\n    val goodsBarcode: String? = null,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "goods_name")\n    val goodsName: String,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "product_name")\n    val productName: String,\n    \n    // 数量信息\n    @ColumnInfo(name = "required_qty")\n    val requiredQty: Int,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "planned_qty")\n    val plannedQty: Int,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "picked_qty")\n    val pickedQty: Int = 0,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "exception_qty")\n    val exceptionQty: Int = 0,\n    \n    // 状态信息\n    @ColumnInfo(name = "status")\n    val status: String = "PENDING", // PENDING, PICKING, COMPLETED, PARTIAL, EXCEPTION\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "priority")\n    val priority: String = "NORMAL", // LOW, NORMAL, HIGH, URGENT\n    \n    // 位置和规格信息\n    @ColumnInfo(name = "location_code")\n    val locationCode: String? = null,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "unit")\n    val unit: String? = null,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "spec")\n    val spec: String? = null,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "batch")\n    val batch: String? = null,\n    \n    // 时间戳\n    @ColumnInfo(name = "last_picked_at")\n    val lastPickedAt: Long? = null,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "completed_at")\n    val completedAt: Long? = null,\n    \n    // 同步状态\n    @ColumnInfo(name = "sync_status")\n    val syncStatus: String = "SYNCED",\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "sync_error")\n    val syncError: String? = null,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "version")\n    val version: Int = 1\n)\n```\n\n### 2.3 拣货进度实体 (PickingProgressEntity)\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 拣货进度数据库实体\n * 存储实时拣货进度信息\n */\n@Entity(\n    tableName = "picking_progress",\n    indices = [\n        Index(value = ["outbound_id"], unique = true),\n        Index(value = ["updated_at"])\n    ],\n    foreignKeys = [\n        ForeignKey(\n            entity = BulkOutboundOrderEntity::class,\n            parentColumns = ["id"],\n            childColumns = ["outbound_id"],\n            onDelete = ForeignKey.CASCADE\n        )\n    ]\n)\ndata class PickingProgressEntity(\n    @PrimaryKey\n    @ColumnInfo(name = "outbound_id")\n    val outboundId: String,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "total_quantity")\n    val totalQuantity: Int,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "picked_quantity")\n    val pickedQuantity: Int,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "exception_quantity")\n    val exceptionQuantity: Int,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "completion_rate")\n    val completionRate: Float,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "success_rate")\n    val successRate: Float,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "is_completed")\n    val isCompleted: Boolean,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "session_id")\n    val sessionId: String? = null,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "operator_id")\n    val operatorId: String? = null,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "operator_name")\n    val operatorName: String? = null,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "start_time")\n    val startTime: Long? = null,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "end_time")\n    val endTime: Long? = null,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "updated_at")\n    val updatedAt: Long = System.currentTimeMillis(),\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "version")\n    val version: Int = 1\n)\n```\n\n### 2.4 拣货异常实体 (PickingExceptionEntity)\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 拣货异常数据库实体\n * 存储拣货过程中的异常记录\n */\n@Entity(\n    tableName = "picking_exceptions",\n    indices = [\n        Index(value = ["outbound_id"]),\n        Index(value = ["item_id"]),\n        Index(value = ["exception_type"]),\n        Index(value = ["is_resolved"]),\n        Index(value = ["created_at"]),\n        Index(value = ["sync_status"])\n    ],\n    foreignKeys = [\n        ForeignKey(\n            entity = BulkOutboundOrderEntity::class,\n            parentColumns = ["id"],\n            childColumns = ["outbound_id"],\n            onDelete = ForeignKey.CASCADE\n        ),\n        ForeignKey(\n            entity = BulkPickingItemEntity::class,\n            parentColumns = ["id"],\n            childColumns = ["item_id"],\n            onDelete = ForeignKey.CASCADE\n        )\n    ]\n)\ndata class PickingExceptionEntity(\n    @PrimaryKey\n    @ColumnInfo(name = "id")\n    val id: String,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "outbound_id")\n    val outboundId: String,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "item_id")\n    val itemId: String,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "sku")\n    val sku: String,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "goods_name")\n    val goodsName: String,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "exception_type")\n    val exceptionType: String, // INSUFFICIENT_STOCK, GOODS_NOT_FOUND, GOODS_DAMAGED, etc.\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "expected_qty")\n    val expectedQty: Int,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "actual_qty")\n    val actualQty: Int,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "difference_qty")\n    val differenceQty: Int,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "description")\n    val description: String,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "solution")\n    val solution: String? = null,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "operator_id")\n    val operatorId: String? = null,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "operator_name")\n    val operatorName: String? = null,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "created_at")\n    val createdAt: Long = System.currentTimeMillis(),\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "resolved_at")\n    val resolvedAt: Long? = null,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "is_resolved")\n    val isResolved: Boolean = false,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "sync_status")\n    val syncStatus: String = "PENDING",\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "sync_error")\n    val syncError: String? = null,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "version")\n    val version: Int = 1\n)\n```\n\n### 2.5 离线操作实体 (OfflineOperationEntity)\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 离线操作数据库实体\n * 存储待同步的离线操作\n */\n@Entity(\n    tableName = "offline_operations",\n    indices = [\n        Index(value = ["operation_type"]),\n        Index(value = ["outbound_id"]),\n        Index(value = ["status"]),\n        Index(value = ["created_at"]),\n        Index(value = ["retry_count"])\n    ]\n)\ndata class OfflineOperationEntity(\n    @PrimaryKey\n    @ColumnInfo(name = "id")\n    val id: String,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "operation_type")\n    val operationType: String, // START_PICKING, CONFIRM_PICKING, BATCH_PICKING, etc.\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "outbound_id")\n    val outboundId: String,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "payload")\n    val payload: String, // JSON serialized operation data\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "status")\n    val status: String = "PENDING", // PENDING, SYNCING, SYNCED, FAILED, CONFLICT\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "retry_count")\n    val retryCount: Int = 0,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "max_retries")\n    val maxRetries: Int = 3,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "next_retry_at")\n    val nextRetryAt: Long? = null,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "error_message")\n    val errorMessage: String? = null,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "created_at")\n    val createdAt: Long = System.currentTimeMillis(),\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "updated_at")\n    val updatedAt: Long = System.currentTimeMillis(),\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "synced_at")\n    val syncedAt: Long? = null,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "version")\n    val version: Int = 1\n)\n```\n\n### 2.6 用户偏好设置实体 (UserPreferencesEntity)\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 用户偏好设置数据库实体\n * 存储用户的个性化设置\n */\n@Entity(\n    tableName = "user_preferences",\n    indices = [\n        Index(value = ["user_id"], unique = true),\n        Index(value = ["updated_at"])\n    ]\n)\ndata class UserPreferencesEntity(\n    @PrimaryKey\n    @ColumnInfo(name = "user_id")\n    val userId: String,\n    \n    // 扫码设置\n    @ColumnInfo(name = "scan_mode")\n    val scanMode: String = "AUTO", // AUTO, MANUAL, CONTINUOUS\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "scan_sound_enabled")\n    val scanSoundEnabled: Boolean = true,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "scan_vibration_enabled")\n    val scanVibrationEnabled: Boolean = true,\n    \n    // 操作设置\n    @ColumnInfo(name = "auto_confirm_enabled")\n    val autoConfirmEnabled: Boolean = false,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "batch_size")\n    val batchSize: Int = 10,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "offline_mode_enabled")\n    val offlineModeEnabled: Boolean = false,\n    \n    // 显示设置\n    @ColumnInfo(name = "list_page_size")\n    val listPageSize: Int = 20,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "show_progress_bar")\n    val showProgressBar: Boolean = true,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "show_item_images")\n    val showItemImages: Boolean = true,\n    \n    // 同步设置\n    @ColumnInfo(name = "auto_sync_enabled")\n    val autoSyncEnabled: Boolean = true,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "sync_interval_minutes")\n    val syncIntervalMinutes: Int = 5,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "wifi_only_sync")\n    val wifiOnlySync: Boolean = false,\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "updated_at")\n    val updatedAt: Long = System.currentTimeMillis(),\n    \n    @ColumnInfo(name = "version")\n    val version: Int = 1\n)\n```\n\n## 3. 数据访问对象 (DAO) 设计\n\n### 3.1 出库单DAO\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 散货出库单数据访问对象\n */\n@Dao\ninterface BulkOutboundOrderDao {\n    \n    // === 基础CRUD操作 ===\n    \n    @Query("SELECT * FROM bulk_outbound_orders ORDER BY created_at DESC")\n    suspend fun getAllOrders(): List<BulkOutboundOrderEntity>\n    \n    @Query("SELECT * FROM bulk_outbound_orders WHERE id = :id")\n    suspend fun getOrderById(id: String): BulkOutboundOrderEntity?\n    \n    @Query("SELECT * FROM bulk_outbound_orders WHERE order_no = :orderNo")\n    suspend fun getOrderByOrderNo(orderNo: String): BulkOutboundOrderEntity?\n    \n    @Insert(onConflict = OnConflictStrategy.REPLACE)\n    suspend fun insertOrder(order: BulkOutboundOrderEntity)\n    \n    @Insert(onConflict = OnConflictStrategy.REPLACE)\n    suspend fun insertOrders(orders: List<BulkOutboundOrderEntity>)\n    \n    @Update\n    suspend fun updateOrder(order: BulkOutboundOrderEntity)\n    \n    @Delete\n    suspend fun deleteOrder(order: BulkOutboundOrderEntity)\n    \n    // === 条件查询 ===\n    \n    @Query("""\n        SELECT * FROM bulk_outbound_orders \n        WHERE (:status IS NULL OR status = :status)\n        AND (:warehouseId IS NULL OR warehouse_id = :warehouseId)\n        ORDER BY created_at DESC\n        LIMIT :limit OFFSET :offset\n    """)\n    suspend fun getOrdersWithFilters(\n        status: String?,\n        warehouseId: String?,\n        limit: Int,\n        offset: Int\n    ): List<BulkOutboundOrderEntity>\n    \n    @Query("""\n        SELECT COUNT(*) FROM bulk_outbound_orders \n        WHERE (:status IS NULL OR status = :status)\n        AND (:warehouseId IS NULL OR warehouse_id = :warehouseId)\n    """)\n    suspend fun getOrdersCount(status: String?, warehouseId: String?): Int\n    \n    @Query("""\n        SELECT * FROM bulk_outbound_orders \n        WHERE order_no LIKE '%' || :searchQuery || '%' \n        OR customer_name LIKE '%' || :searchQuery || '%'\n        ORDER BY created_at DESC\n    """)\n    suspend fun searchOrders(searchQuery: String): List<BulkOutboundOrderEntity>\n    \n    // === 状态更新 ===\n    \n    @Query("""\n        UPDATE bulk_outbound_orders \n        SET status = :status, status_name = :statusName, updated_at = :updatedAt\n        WHERE id = :id\n    """)\n    suspend fun updateOrderStatus(id: String, status: String, statusName: String, updatedAt: Long)\n    \n    @Query("""\n        UPDATE bulk_outbound_orders \n        SET picked_quantity = :pickedQty, exception_quantity = :exceptionQty, \n            updated_at = :updatedAt, sync_status = 'PENDING'\n        WHERE id = :id\n    """)\n    suspend fun updatePickingProgress(\n        id: String,\n        pickedQty: Int,\n        exceptionQty: Int,\n        updatedAt: Long = System.currentTimeMillis()\n    )\n    \n    // === 同步管理 ===\n    \n    @Query("SELECT * FROM bulk_outbound_orders WHERE sync_status = :syncStatus")\n    suspend fun getOrdersBySyncStatus(syncStatus: String): List<BulkOutboundOrderEntity>\n    \n    @Query("""\n        UPDATE bulk_outbound_orders \n        SET sync_status = :syncStatus, last_sync_at = :syncTime\n        WHERE id = :id\n    """)\n    suspend fun updateSyncStatus(id: String, syncStatus: String, syncTime: Long)\n    \n    // === 缓存管理 ===\n    \n    @Query("DELETE FROM bulk_outbound_orders WHERE cache_expires_at < :currentTime")\n    suspend fun deleteExpiredCache(currentTime: Long = System.currentTimeMillis())\n    \n    @Query("SELECT COUNT(*) FROM bulk_outbound_orders")\n    suspend fun getTotalCount(): Int\n    \n    // === 关联查询 ===\n    \n    @Transaction\n    @Query("SELECT * FROM bulk_outbound_orders WHERE id = :id")\n    suspend fun getOrderWithItems(id: String): OrderWithItems?\n    \n    @Transaction\n    @Query("""\n        SELECT * FROM bulk_outbound_orders \n        WHERE status IN ('PENDING', 'PICKING') \n        ORDER BY created_at DESC\n    """)\n    suspend fun getActiveOrdersWithItems(): List<OrderWithItems>\n}\n\n/**\n * 出库单和商品的关联查询结果\n */\ndata class OrderWithItems(\n    @Embedded val order: BulkOutboundOrderEntity,\n    @Relation(\n        parentColumn = "id",\n        entityColumn = "outbound_id"\n    )\n    val items: List<BulkPickingItemEntity>\n)\n```\n\n### 3.2 拣货商品DAO\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 拣货商品数据访问对象\n */\n@Dao\ninterface BulkPickingItemDao {\n    \n    // === 基础CRUD操作 ===\n    \n    @Query("SELECT * FROM bulk_picking_items WHERE outbound_id = :outboundId ORDER BY goods_name")\n    suspend fun getItemsByOutboundId(outboundId: String): List<BulkPickingItemEntity>\n    \n    @Query("SELECT * FROM bulk_picking_items WHERE id = :id")\n    suspend fun getItemById(id: String): BulkPickingItemEntity?\n    \n    @Insert(onConflict = OnConflictStrategy.REPLACE)\n    suspend fun insertItem(item: BulkPickingItemEntity)\n    \n    @Insert(onConflict = OnConflictStrategy.REPLACE)\n    suspend fun insertItems(items: List<BulkPickingItemEntity>)\n    \n    @Update\n    suspend fun updateItem(item: BulkPickingItemEntity)\n    \n    @Delete\n    suspend fun deleteItem(item: BulkPickingItemEntity)\n    \n    // === 条件查询 ===\n    \n    @Query("""\n        SELECT * FROM bulk_picking_items \n        WHERE outbound_id = :outboundId \n        AND (:status IS NULL OR status = :status)\n        ORDER BY priority DESC, goods_name ASC\n    """)\n    suspend fun getItemsWithStatus(outboundId: String, status: String?): List<BulkPickingItemEntity>\n    \n    @Query("""\n        SELECT * FROM bulk_picking_items \n        WHERE outbound_id = :outboundId \n        AND (sku = :code OR goods_barcode = :code)\n    """)\n    suspend fun findItemByCode(outboundId: String, code: String): BulkPickingItemEntity?\n    \n    @Query("""\n        SELECT * FROM bulk_picking_items \n        WHERE outbound_id = :outboundId \n        AND status IN ('PENDING', 'PICKING')\n        ORDER BY priority DESC, goods_name ASC\n    """)\n    suspend fun getPendingItems(outboundId: String): List<BulkPickingItemEntity>\n    \n    // === 批量更新 ===\n    \n    @Query("""\n        UPDATE bulk_picking_items \n        SET picked_qty = :pickedQty, status = :status, \n            last_picked_at = :timestamp, sync_status = 'PENDING'\n        WHERE id = :id\n    """)\n    suspend fun updatePickingStatus(\n        id: String,\n        pickedQty: Int,\n        status: String,\n        timestamp: Long = System.currentTimeMillis()\n    )\n    \n    @Transaction\n    suspend fun updateMultipleItems(updates: List<PickingItemUpdate>) {\n        updates.forEach { update ->\n            updatePickingStatus(update.itemId, update.pickedQty, update.status)\n        }\n    }\n    \n    // === 统计查询 ===\n    \n    @Query("""\n        SELECT \n            COUNT(*) as totalItems,\n            SUM(required_qty) as totalQuantity,\n            SUM(picked_qty) as pickedQuantity,\n            SUM(exception_qty) as exceptionQuantity\n        FROM bulk_picking_items \n        WHERE outbound_id = :outboundId\n    """)\n    suspend fun getPickingStatistics(outboundId: String): PickingStatistics\n    \n    @Query("""\n        SELECT COUNT(*) FROM bulk_picking_items \n        WHERE outbound_id = :outboundId AND status = 'COMPLETED'\n    """)\n    suspend fun getCompletedItemsCount(outboundId: String): Int\n    \n    // === 同步管理 ===\n    \n    @Query("SELECT * FROM bulk_picking_items WHERE sync_status = 'PENDING'")\n    suspend fun getPendingSyncItems(): List<BulkPickingItemEntity>\n    \n    @Query("UPDATE bulk_picking_items SET sync_status = :status WHERE id IN (:ids)")\n    suspend fun updateSyncStatus(ids: List<String>, status: String)\n}\n\n/**\n * 拣货更新数据\n */\ndata class PickingItemUpdate(\n    val itemId: String,\n    val pickedQty: Int,\n    val status: String\n)\n\n/**\n * 拣货统计数据\n */\ndata class PickingStatistics(\n    val totalItems: Int,\n    val totalQuantity: Int,\n    val pickedQuantity: Int,\n    val exceptionQuantity: Int\n)\n```\n\n### 3.3 拣货进度DAO\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 拣货进度数据访问对象\n */\n@Dao\ninterface PickingProgressDao {\n    \n    @Query("SELECT * FROM picking_progress WHERE outbound_id = :outboundId")\n    suspend fun getProgress(outboundId: String): PickingProgressEntity?\n    \n    @Insert(onConflict = OnConflictStrategy.REPLACE)\n    suspend fun insertOrUpdate(progress: PickingProgressEntity)\n    \n    @Query("""\n        UPDATE picking_progress \n        SET picked_quantity = :pickedQty, exception_quantity = :exceptionQty,\n            completion_rate = :completionRate, success_rate = :successRate,\n            is_completed = :isCompleted, updated_at = :updatedAt\n        WHERE outbound_id = :outboundId\n    """)\n    suspend fun updateProgress(\n        outboundId: String,\n        pickedQty: Int,\n        exceptionQty: Int,\n        completionRate: Float,\n        successRate: Float,\n        isCompleted: Boolean,\n        updatedAt: Long = System.currentTimeMillis()\n    )\n    \n    @Query("DELETE FROM picking_progress WHERE outbound_id = :outboundId")\n    suspend fun deleteProgress(outboundId: String)\n    \n    @Query("SELECT * FROM picking_progress WHERE updated_at > :since ORDER BY updated_at DESC")\n    suspend fun getRecentProgress(since: Long): List<PickingProgressEntity>\n}\n```\n\n### 3.4 离线操作DAO\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 离线操作数据访问对象\n */\n@Dao\ninterface OfflineOperationDao {\n    \n    @Query("SELECT * FROM offline_operations WHERE status = 'PENDING' ORDER BY created_at ASC")\n    suspend fun getPendingOperations(): List<OfflineOperationEntity>\n    \n    @Query("SELECT * FROM offline_operations WHERE status = :status ORDER BY created_at DESC")\n    suspend fun getOperationsByStatus(status: String): List<OfflineOperationEntity>\n    \n    @Insert(onConflict = OnConflictStrategy.REPLACE)\n    suspend fun insertOperation(operation: OfflineOperationEntity)\n    \n    @Query("""\n        UPDATE offline_operations \n        SET status = :status, updated_at = :updatedAt, \n            synced_at = :syncedAt, error_message = :errorMessage\n        WHERE id = :id\n    """)\n    suspend fun updateOperationStatus(\n        id: String,\n        status: String,\n        updatedAt: Long = System.currentTimeMillis(),\n        syncedAt: Long? = null,\n        errorMessage: String? = null\n    )\n    \n    @Query("""\n        UPDATE offline_operations \n        SET retry_count = retry_count + 1, next_retry_at = :nextRetryAt,\n            error_message = :errorMessage, updated_at = :updatedAt\n        WHERE id = :id\n    """)\n    suspend fun incrementRetryCount(\n        id: String,\n        nextRetryAt: Long,\n        errorMessage: String,\n        updatedAt: Long = System.currentTimeMillis()\n    )\n    \n    @Query("DELETE FROM offline_operations WHERE id = :id")\n    suspend fun deleteOperation(id: String)\n    \n    @Query("DELETE FROM offline_operations WHERE status = 'SYNCED' AND synced_at < :beforeTime")\n    suspend fun deleteSyncedOperations(beforeTime: Long)\n    \n    @Query("SELECT COUNT(*) FROM offline_operations WHERE status = 'PENDING'")\n    suspend fun getPendingOperationsCount(): Int\n}\n```\n\n## 4. 数据库配置\n\n### 4.1 Room数据库配置\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 散货出库模块数据库\n */\n@Database(\n    entities = [\n        BulkOutboundOrderEntity::class,\n        BulkPickingItemEntity::class,\n        PickingProgressEntity::class,\n        PickingExceptionEntity::class,\n        OfflineOperationEntity::class,\n        UserPreferencesEntity::class\n    ],\n    version = 1,\n    exportSchema = true\n)\n@TypeConverters(DatabaseConverters::class)\nabstract class BulkOutboundDatabase : RoomDatabase() {\n    \n    abstract fun outboundOrderDao(): BulkOutboundOrderDao\n    abstract fun pickingItemDao(): BulkPickingItemDao\n    abstract fun progressDao(): PickingProgressDao\n    abstract fun exceptionDao(): PickingExceptionDao\n    abstract fun offlineOperationDao(): OfflineOperationDao\n    abstract fun userPreferencesDao(): UserPreferencesDao\n    \n    companion object {\n        const val DATABASE_NAME = "bulk_outbound_database"\n        \n        @Volatile\n        private var INSTANCE: BulkOutboundDatabase? = null\n        \n        fun getDatabase(context: Context): BulkOutboundDatabase {\n            return INSTANCE ?: synchronized(this) {\n                val instance = Room.databaseBuilder(\n                    context.applicationContext,\n                    BulkOutboundDatabase::class.java,\n                    DATABASE_NAME\n                )\n                .addCallback(DatabaseCallback())\n                .addMigrations(*getAllMigrations())\n                .setJournalMode(RoomDatabase.JournalMode.WAL)\n                .build()\n                \n                INSTANCE = instance\n                instance\n            }\n        }\n        \n        private fun getAllMigrations(): Array<Migration> {\n            return arrayOf(\n                // 后续版本迁移脚本\n            )\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 4.2 类型转换器\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 数据库类型转换器\n */\nclass DatabaseConverters {\n    \n    @TypeConverter\n    fun fromStringList(value: List<String>?): String? {\n        return value?.let { Json.encodeToString(it) }\n    }\n    \n    @TypeConverter\n    fun toStringList(value: String?): List<String>? {\n        return value?.let { Json.decodeFromString(it) }\n    }\n    \n    @TypeConverter\n    fun fromTimestamp(value: Long?): Date? {\n        return value?.let { Date(it) }\n    }\n    \n    @TypeConverter\n    fun toTimestamp(date: Date?): Long? {\n        return date?.time\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 4.3 数据库回调\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 数据库创建和更新回调\n */\nclass DatabaseCallback : RoomDatabase.Callback() {\n    \n    override fun onCreate(db: SupportSQLiteDatabase) {\n        super.onCreate(db)\n        \n        // 创建全文搜索索引\n        db.execSQL("""\n            CREATE VIRTUAL TABLE IF NOT EXISTS outbound_orders_fts \n            USING fts4(content='bulk_outbound_orders', order_no, customer_name, note)\n        """)\n        \n        // 创建触发器维护FTS索引\n        db.execSQL("""\n            CREATE TRIGGER IF NOT EXISTS outbound_orders_fts_insert \n            AFTER INSERT ON bulk_outbound_orders \n            BEGIN\n                INSERT INTO outbound_orders_fts(docid, order_no, customer_name, note) \n                VALUES (new.rowid, new.order_no, new.customer_name, new.note);\n            END\n        """)\n        \n        db.execSQL("""\n            CREATE TRIGGER IF NOT EXISTS outbound_orders_fts_delete \n            AFTER DELETE ON bulk_outbound_orders \n            BEGIN\n                INSERT INTO outbound_orders_fts(outbound_orders_fts) \n                VALUES ('delete=' || old.rowid);\n            END\n        """)\n        \n        db.execSQL("""\n            CREATE TRIGGER IF NOT EXISTS outbound_orders_fts_update \n            AFTER UPDATE ON bulk_outbound_orders \n            BEGIN\n                INSERT INTO outbound_orders_fts(outbound_orders_fts) \n                VALUES ('delete=' || old.rowid);\n                INSERT INTO outbound_orders_fts(docid, order_no, customer_name, note) \n                VALUES (new.rowid, new.order_no, new.customer_name, new.note);\n            END\n        """)\n    }\n    \n    override fun onOpen(db: SupportSQLiteDatabase) {\n        super.onOpen(db)\n        \n        // 启用WAL模式\n        db.execSQL("PRAGMA journal_mode=WAL")\n        \n        // 启用外键约束\n        db.execSQL("PRAGMA foreign_keys=ON")\n        \n        // 设置同步模式\n        db.execSQL("PRAGMA synchronous=NORMAL")\n        \n        // 设置缓存大小 (8MB)\n        db.execSQL("PRAGMA cache_size=2000")\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## 5. 数据库迁移策略\n\n### 5.1 版本迁移\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 数据库迁移管理\n */\nobject DatabaseMigrations {\n    \n    // 示例：从版本1迁移到版本2\n    val MIGRATION_1_2 = object : Migration(1, 2) {\n        override fun migrate(database: SupportSQLiteDatabase) {\n            // 添加新字段\n            database.execSQL("""\n                ALTER TABLE bulk_outbound_orders \n                ADD COLUMN priority INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 2\n            """)\n            \n            // 创建新表\n            database.execSQL("""\n                CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS picking_sessions (\n                    id TEXT PRIMARY KEY NOT NULL,\n                    outbound_id TEXT NOT NULL,\n                    operator_id TEXT,\n                    start_time INTEGER,\n                    end_time INTEGER,\n                    status TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'ACTIVE',\n                    created_at INTEGER NOT NULL,\n                    FOREIGN KEY(outbound_id) REFERENCES bulk_outbound_orders(id) ON DELETE CASCADE\n                )\n            """)\n            \n            // 创建索引\n            database.execSQL("""\n                CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS index_picking_sessions_outbound_id \n                ON picking_sessions(outbound_id)\n            """)\n        }\n    }\n    \n    // 示例：从版本2迁移到版本3\n    val MIGRATION_2_3 = object : Migration(2, 3) {\n        override fun migrate(database: SupportSQLiteDatabase) {\n            // 数据转换和清理\n            database.execSQL("""\n                UPDATE bulk_picking_items \n                SET status = 'COMPLETED' \n                WHERE picked_qty >= required_qty AND status = 'PICKING'\n            """)\n            \n            // 删除废弃字段\n            database.execSQL("""\n                CREATE TABLE bulk_picking_items_new (\n                    id TEXT PRIMARY KEY NOT NULL,\n                    outbound_id TEXT NOT NULL,\n                    goods_id TEXT NOT NULL,\n                    sku TEXT NOT NULL,\n                    goods_name TEXT NOT NULL,\n                    required_qty INTEGER NOT NULL,\n                    picked_qty INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,\n                    status TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'PENDING',\n                    created_at INTEGER NOT NULL,\n                    FOREIGN KEY(outbound_id) REFERENCES bulk_outbound_orders(id) ON DELETE CASCADE\n                )\n            """)\n            \n            database.execSQL("""\n                INSERT INTO bulk_picking_items_new \n                SELECT id, outbound_id, goods_id, sku, goods_name, \n                       required_qty, picked_qty, status, created_at\n                FROM bulk_picking_items\n            """)\n            \n            database.execSQL("DROP TABLE bulk_picking_items")\n            database.execSQL("ALTER TABLE bulk_picking_items_new RENAME TO bulk_picking_items")\n        }\n    }\n    \n    fun getAllMigrations(): Array<Migration> {\n        return arrayOf(MIGRATION_1_2, MIGRATION_2_3)\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 5.2 数据备份和恢复\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 数据库备份和恢复工具\n */\nclass DatabaseBackupManager(private val context: Context) {\n    \n    suspend fun backupDatabase(): File? = withContext(Dispatchers.IO) {\n        try {\n            val dbFile = context.getDatabasePath(BulkOutboundDatabase.DATABASE_NAME)\n            val backupDir = File(context.getExternalFilesDir(null), "backups")\n            if (!backupDir.exists()) {\n                backupDir.mkdirs()\n            }\n            \n            val timestamp = SimpleDateFormat("yyyyMMdd_HHmmss", Locale.getDefault())\n                .format(Date())\n            val backupFile = File(backupDir, "bulk_outbound_backup_$timestamp.db")\n            \n            dbFile.copyTo(backupFile, overwrite = true)\n            backupFile\n        } catch (e: Exception) {\n            null\n        }\n    }\n    \n    suspend fun restoreDatabase(backupFile: File): Boolean = withContext(Dispatchers.IO) {\n        try {\n            val dbFile = context.getDatabasePath(BulkOutboundDatabase.DATABASE_NAME)\n            \n            // 关闭数据库连接\n            BulkOutboundDatabase.getDatabase(context).close()\n            \n            // 恢复备份\n            backupFile.copyTo(dbFile, overwrite = true)\n            \n            true\n        } catch (e: Exception) {\n            false\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## 6. 性能优化\n\n### 6.1 查询优化\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 数据库查询优化工具\n */\nclass DatabaseOptimizer {\n    \n    companion object {\n        // 预编译常用查询\n        const val QUERY_ACTIVE_ORDERS = """\n            SELECT * FROM bulk_outbound_orders \n            WHERE status IN ('PENDING', 'PICKING') \n            AND cache_expires_at > ?\n            ORDER BY created_at DESC\n        """\n        \n        const val QUERY_PENDING_ITEMS = """\n            SELECT * FROM bulk_picking_items \n            WHERE outbound_id = ? AND status = 'PENDING'\n            ORDER BY priority DESC, goods_name ASC\n        """\n    }\n    \n    // 批量查询优化\n    suspend fun getOrdersWithItemsBatch(orderIds: List<String>): Map<String, OrderWithItems> {\n        val placeholders = orderIds.joinToString(",") { "?" }\n        \n        // 使用IN查询减少数据库访问次数\n        val orders = getOrdersInBatch(orderIds)\n        val items = getItemsInBatch(orderIds)\n        \n        // 在内存中组装关联数据\n        return orders.associateWith { order ->\n            OrderWithItems(order, items.filter { it.outboundId == order.id })\n        }.mapKeys { it.key.id }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 6.2 索引策略\n\n```sql\n-- 复合索引优化\nCREATE INDEX idx_outbound_status_warehouse_date \nON bulk_outbound_orders(status, warehouse_id, created_at);\n\n-- 部分索引（只索引活跃数据）\nCREATE INDEX idx_active_items \nON bulk_picking_items(outbound_id, status) \nWHERE status IN ('PENDING', 'PICKING');\n\n-- 覆盖索引（包含查询所需的所有字段）\nCREATE INDEX idx_picking_summary \nON bulk_picking_items(outbound_id, required_qty, picked_qty, status);\n```\n\n### 6.3 缓存策略\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 数据库缓存管理\n */\nclass DatabaseCacheManager {\n    \n    private val memoryCache = LruCache<String, Any>(100)\n    \n    fun <T> getCached(key: String): T? {\n        @Suppress("UNCHECKED_CAST")\n        return memoryCache.get(key) as? T\n    }\n    \n    fun putCache(key: String, value: Any) {\n        memoryCache.put(key, value)\n    }\n    \n    // 智能缓存清理\n    suspend fun cleanupExpiredCache() {\n        // 清理过期的数据库缓存\n        val currentTime = System.currentTimeMillis()\n        \n        // 清理内存缓存\n        memoryCache.evictAll()\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## 7. 监控和维护\n\n### 7.1 数据库健康检查\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 数据库健康检查工具\n */\nclass DatabaseHealthChecker(private val database: BulkOutboundDatabase) {\n    \n    suspend fun performHealthCheck(): DatabaseHealthReport {\n        val report = DatabaseHealthReport()\n        \n        try {\n            // 检查数据库完整性\n            report.integrityCheck = checkIntegrity()\n            \n            // 检查表大小\n            report.tableSizes = getTableSizes()\n            \n            // 检查索引使用情况\n            report.indexUsage = getIndexUsage()\n            \n            // 检查未同步数据量\n            report.pendingSyncCount = getPendingSyncCount()\n            \n            // 检查磁盘空间\n            report.diskUsage = getDiskUsage()\n            \n        } catch (e: Exception) {\n            report.errors.add(e.message ?: "Unknown error")\n        }\n        \n        return report\n    }\n    \n    private suspend fun checkIntegrity(): Boolean {\n        return try {\n            database.openHelper.readableDatabase.execSQL("PRAGMA integrity_check")\n            true\n        } catch (e: Exception) {\n            false\n        }\n    }\n}\n\ndata class DatabaseHealthReport(\n    var integrityCheck: Boolean = false,\n    var tableSizes: Map<String, Long> = emptyMap(),\n    var indexUsage: Map<String, Long> = emptyMap(),\n    var pendingSyncCount: Int = 0,\n    var diskUsage: Long = 0,\n    val errors: MutableList<String> = mutableListOf()\n)\n```\n\n## 8. 测试策略\n\n### 8.1 数据库测试\n\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 数据库单元测试\n */\n@RunWith(AndroidJUnit4::class)\n@SmallTest\nclass BulkOutboundDatabaseTest {\n    \n    @get:Rule\n    val instantTaskExecutorRule = InstantTaskExecutorRule()\n    \n    private lateinit var database: BulkOutboundDatabase\n    private lateinit var orderDao: BulkOutboundOrderDao\n    private lateinit var itemDao: BulkPickingItemDao\n    \n    @Before\n    fun setup() {\n        database = Room.inMemoryDatabaseBuilder(\n            ApplicationProvider.getApplicationContext(),\n            BulkOutboundDatabase::class.java\n        ).allowMainThreadQueries().build()\n        \n        orderDao = database.outboundOrderDao()\n        itemDao = database.pickingItemDao()\n    }\n    \n    @After\n    fun teardown() {\n        database.close()\n    }\n    \n    @Test\n    fun testInsertAndGetOrder() = runTest {\n        // Given\n        val order = createTestOrder()\n        \n        // When\n        orderDao.insertOrder(order)\n        val retrievedOrder = orderDao.getOrderById(order.id)\n        \n        // Then\n        assertNotNull(retrievedOrder)\n        assertEquals(order.orderNo, retrievedOrder?.orderNo)\n    }\n    \n    @Test\n    fun testForeignKeyConstraint() = runTest {\n        // Given\n        val order = createTestOrder()\n        val item = createTestItem(order.id)\n        \n        // When\n        orderDao.insertOrder(order)\n        itemDao.insertItem(item)\n        \n        // Delete parent order\n        orderDao.deleteOrder(order)\n        \n        // Then\n        val retrievedItem = itemDao.getItemById(item.id)\n        assertNull(retrievedItem) // Should be deleted due to CASCADE\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## 9. 实施计划\n\n### 9.1 开发阶段\n\n| 阶段 | 内容 | 时间 | 依赖 |\n|------|------|------|------|\n| Phase 1 | 实体类和DAO定义 | 0.5天 | 数据模型设计 |\n| Phase 2 | 数据库配置和迁移 | 0.5天 | Phase 1 |\n| Phase 3 | 性能优化和监控 | 0.5天 | Phase 2 |\n| Phase 4 | 测试和文档 | 0.5天 | Phase 3 |\n\n### 9.2 风险评估\n\n1. **迁移风险**：数据库版本升级可能导致数据丢失\n   - 缓解：完善的备份和测试机制\n\n2. **性能风险**：大量数据可能影响查询性能\n   - 缓解：合理的索引设计和查询优化\n\n3. **存储风险**：离线数据可能占用过多存储空间\n   - 缓解：定期清理和压缩策略\n\n## 10. 总结\n\n### 10.1 设计优势\n\n1. **离线优先**：完整的本地数据支持，提升用户体验\n2. **性能优化**：合理的索引和查询策略，保证查询效率\n3. **数据一致性**：外键约束和事务保证数据完整性\n4. **扩展性**：预留版本管理和迁移机制\n5. **监控完善**：健康检查和性能监控\n\n### 10.2 技术亮点\n\n1. **Room框架**：类型安全的数据库访问\n2. **WAL模式**：提升并发性能\n3. **FTS搜索**：全文搜索支持\n4. **复合索引**：优化复杂查询性能\n5. **智能缓存**：多级缓存策略\n\n---\n\n**设计完成状态**: ✅ 已完成  \n**预计实施时间**: 1天  \n**风险评估**: 低风险  \n**下一步**: 开始核心功能开发阶段	110	2025-09-21 08:41:02.855982	2025-09-21 08:41:02.855982	\N	110	markdown	draft	\N	\N	private	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N		1	\N	{}	f	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N
1142	1	腾讯云服务器部署实施方案	# 腾讯云服务器部署实施方案\n\n## 📋 项目概述\n\n**目标服务器**: 腾讯云服务器 152.136.104.251  \n**项目名称**: AI项目管理系统  \n**技术栈**: Go后端 + React前端 + PostgreSQL + Redis + Docker  \n**部署方式**: Docker Compose 容器化部署\n\n## 🎯 部署目标\n\n### 生产环境要求\n- **高可用性**: 99.5%以上可用性保证\n- **安全性**: HTTPS加密，权限控制，防火墙配置\n- **性能**: 支持并发100+用户，响应时间<2秒\n- **监控**: 完整的日志记录和性能监控\n- **备份**: 自动数据库备份和恢复方案\n\n## 🛠️ 服务器环境准备\n\n### 1. 系统要求\n```bash\n# 操作系统：推荐 Ubuntu 22.04 LTS 或 CentOS 8+\n# CPU：最少2核，推荐4核\n# 内存：最少4GB，推荐8GB\n# 硬盘：最少40GB，推荐100GB\n# 网络：公网IP，带宽≥5Mbps\n```\n\n### 2. 基础软件安装\n```bash\n# 更新系统包\nsudo apt update && sudo apt upgrade -y\n\n# 安装必要工具\nsudo apt install -y curl wget git vim htop unzip\n\n# 安装Docker和Docker Compose\ncurl -fsSL https://get.docker.com -o get-docker.sh\nsudo sh get-docker.sh\nsudo usermod -aG docker $USER\n\n# 安装Docker Compose\nsudo curl -L "https://github.com/docker/compose/releases/latest/download/docker-compose-$(uname -s)-$(uname -m)" -o /usr/local/bin/docker-compose\nsudo chmod +x /usr/local/bin/docker-compose\n\n# 验证安装\ndocker --version\ndocker-compose --version\n```\n\n### 3. 防火墙配置\n```bash\n# 配置UFW防火墙\nsudo ufw enable\nsudo ufw allow ssh\nsudo ufw allow 80/tcp    # HTTP\nsudo ufw allow 443/tcp   # HTTPS\nsudo ufw allow 22/tcp    # SSH\n\n# 内部服务端口（仅本地访问）\nsudo ufw deny 5432/tcp   # PostgreSQL\nsudo ufw deny 6379/tcp   # Redis\nsudo ufw deny 8080/tcp   # 后端API（通过Nginx代理）\nsudo ufw deny 3000/tcp   # 前端（通过Nginx代理）\n\nsudo ufw status\n```\n\n## 🐳 生产环境Docker配置\n\n### 1. 创建生产环境配置文件\n\n#### docker-compose.prod.yml\n```yaml\nversion: '3.8'\n\nservices:\n  # PostgreSQL 生产数据库\n  postgres-prod:\n    image: postgres:16\n    container_name: ai_postgres_prod\n    environment:\n      POSTGRES_USER: ${DB_USER}\n      POSTGRES_PASSWORD: ${DB_PASSWORD}\n      POSTGRES_DB: ${DB_NAME}\n      POSTGRES_INITDB_ARGS: "--locale=C --encoding=UTF8"\n    ports:\n      - "127.0.0.1:5432:5432"  # 仅本地访问\n    volumes:\n      - postgres_prod_data:/var/lib/postgresql/data\n      - ./backups:/backups\n      - ./scripts/init-prod.sql:/docker-entrypoint-initdb.d/01-init.sql\n    restart: always\n    healthcheck:\n      test: ["CMD-SHELL", "pg_isready -U ${DB_USER} -d ${DB_NAME}"]\n      interval: 30s\n      timeout: 10s\n      retries: 3\n    networks:\n      - ai_prod_network\n\n  # Go 后端服务\n  backend-prod:\n    build:\n      context: ./backend\n      dockerfile: Dockerfile.prod\n    container_name: ai_backend_prod\n    depends_on:\n      - postgres-prod\n    environment:\n      ENV: production\n      DB_HOST: postgres-prod\n      DB_PORT: 5432\n      DB_USER: ${DB_USER}\n      DB_PASSWORD: ${DB_PASSWORD}\n      DB_NAME: ${DB_NAME}\n      JWT_SECRET: ${JWT_SECRET}\n      GIN_MODE: release\n    ports:\n      - "127.0.0.1:8080:8080"  # 仅本地访问\n    volumes:\n      - ./logs:/app/logs\n      - ./uploads:/app/uploads\n    restart: always\n    healthcheck:\n      test: ["CMD", "curl", "-f", "http://localhost:8080/health"]\n      interval: 30s\n      timeout: 10s\n      retries: 3\n    networks:\n      - ai_prod_network\n\n  # React 前端服务\n  frontend-prod:\n    build:\n      context: ./frontend\n      dockerfile: Dockerfile.prod\n    container_name: ai_frontend_prod\n    environment:\n      REACT_APP_API_URL: https://yourdomain.com/api/v1\n      REACT_APP_ENV: production\n    ports:\n      - "127.0.0.1:3000:80"  # 仅本地访问\n    restart: always\n    healthcheck:\n      test: ["CMD", "curl", "-f", "http://localhost:80"]\n      interval: 60s\n      timeout: 30s\n      retries: 3\n    networks:\n      - ai_prod_network\n\n  # Redis 缓存\n  redis-prod:\n    image: redis:7-alpine\n    container_name: ai_redis_prod\n    ports:\n      - "127.0.0.1:6379:6379"  # 仅本地访问\n    volumes:\n      - redis_prod_data:/data\n      - ./config/redis.conf:/etc/redis/redis.conf\n    command: ["redis-server", "/etc/redis/redis.conf"]\n    restart: always\n    healthcheck:\n      test: ["CMD", "redis-cli", "ping"]\n      interval: 30s\n      timeout: 3s\n      retries: 3\n    networks:\n      - ai_prod_network\n\n  # Nginx 反向代理\n  nginx:\n    image: nginx:alpine\n    container_name: ai_nginx\n    depends_on:\n      - backend-prod\n      - frontend-prod\n    ports:\n      - "80:80"\n      - "443:443"\n    volumes:\n      - ./nginx/nginx.conf:/etc/nginx/nginx.conf\n      - ./nginx/sites:/etc/nginx/conf.d\n      - ./ssl:/etc/nginx/ssl\n      - ./logs/nginx:/var/log/nginx\n    restart: always\n    healthcheck:\n      test: ["CMD", "curl", "-f", "http://localhost"]\n      interval: 30s\n      timeout: 10s\n      retries: 3\n    networks:\n      - ai_prod_network\n\nnetworks:\n  ai_prod_network:\n    driver: bridge\n\nvolumes:\n  postgres_prod_data:\n    driver: local\n  redis_prod_data:\n    driver: local\n```\n\n### 2. 生产环境变量文件\n\n#### .env.prod\n```bash\n# 生产环境配置\nENV=production\nNODE_ENV=production\nAPP_ENV=production\n\n# 数据库配置（生产环境强密码）\nDB_HOST=postgres-prod\nDB_PORT=5432\nDB_USER=ai_prod_user\nDB_PASSWORD=SecurePassword123!@#\nDB_NAME=ai_project_prod\nDB_SSL_MODE=require\n\n# JWT安全配置\nJWT_SECRET=ProductionSecretKey2024!@#$%^&*()\nJWT_EXPIRATION=24h\n\n# 服务配置\nBACKEND_PORT=8080\nFRONTEND_PORT=80\nGIN_MODE=release\nLOG_LEVEL=info\n\n# CORS配置\nCORS_ORIGIN=https://yourdomain.com\n\n# SSL配置\nSSL_CERT_PATH=/etc/nginx/ssl/cert.pem\nSSL_KEY_PATH=/etc/nginx/ssl/key.pem\n\n# 备份配置\nBACKUP_SCHEDULE=0 2 * * *  # 每天凌晨2点备份\nBACKUP_RETENTION_DAYS=30\n\n# 监控配置\nENABLE_MONITORING=true\nLOG_RETENTION_DAYS=90\n```\n\n## 🌐 Nginx反向代理配置\n\n### 1. 主配置文件 - nginx.conf\n```nginx\nuser nginx;\nworker_processes auto;\n\nerror_log /var/log/nginx/error.log warn;\npid /var/run/nginx.pid;\n\nevents {\n    worker_connections 1024;\n    use epoll;\n    multi_accept on;\n}\n\nhttp {\n    include /etc/nginx/mime.types;\n    default_type application/octet-stream;\n\n    # 日志格式\n    log_format main '$remote_addr - $remote_user [$time_local] "$request" '\n                    '$status $body_bytes_sent "$http_referer" '\n                    '"$http_user_agent" "$http_x_forwarded_for"';\n\n    access_log /var/log/nginx/access.log main;\n\n    # 基础配置\n    sendfile on;\n    tcp_nopush on;\n    tcp_nodelay on;\n    keepalive_timeout 65;\n    types_hash_max_size 2048;\n\n    # Gzip压缩\n    gzip on;\n    gzip_vary on;\n    gzip_min_length 1024;\n    gzip_types text/plain text/css text/xml text/javascript application/javascript application/xml+rss application/json;\n\n    # 上传限制\n    client_max_body_size 50M;\n\n    # 包含站点配置\n    include /etc/nginx/conf.d/*.conf;\n}\n```\n\n### 2. 站点配置 - sites/ai-project.conf\n```nginx\n# HTTP重定向到HTTPS\nserver {\n    listen 80;\n    server_name 152.136.104.251 yourdomain.com;\n    return 301 https://$server_name$request_uri;\n}\n\n# HTTPS主配置\nserver {\n    listen 443 ssl http2;\n    server_name 152.136.104.251 yourdomain.com;\n\n    # SSL配置\n    ssl_certificate /etc/nginx/ssl/cert.pem;\n    ssl_certificate_key /etc/nginx/ssl/key.pem;\n    ssl_session_timeout 1d;\n    ssl_session_cache shared:MozTLS:10m;\n    ssl_session_tickets off;\n\n    # SSL安全配置\n    ssl_protocols TLSv1.2 TLSv1.3;\n    ssl_ciphers ECDHE-ECDSA-AES128-GCM-SHA256:ECDHE-RSA-AES128-GCM-SHA256;\n    ssl_prefer_server_ciphers off;\n\n    # 安全头\n    add_header Strict-Transport-Security "max-age=63072000" always;\n    add_header X-Frame-Options SAMEORIGIN;\n    add_header X-Content-Type-Options nosniff;\n    add_header X-XSS-Protection "1; mode=block";\n\n    # 前端静态文件\n    location / {\n        proxy_pass http://frontend-prod:80;\n        proxy_set_header Host $host;\n        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme;\n        \n        # 缓存静态资源\n        location ~* \\.(js|css|png|jpg|jpeg|gif|ico|svg)$ {\n            expires 1y;\n            add_header Cache-Control "public, immutable";\n        }\n    }\n\n    # API代理\n    location /api/ {\n        proxy_pass http://backend-prod:8080;\n        proxy_set_header Host $host;\n        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme;\n        \n        # API超时配置\n        proxy_connect_timeout 30s;\n        proxy_send_timeout 30s;\n        proxy_read_timeout 30s;\n    }\n\n    # 健康检查\n    location /health {\n        proxy_pass http://backend-prod:8080/health;\n        access_log off;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## 🔐 SSL证书配置\n\n### 1. Let's Encrypt免费证书（推荐）\n```bash\n# 安装Certbot\nsudo apt install -y certbot python3-certbot-nginx\n\n# 申请证书\nsudo certbot --nginx -d yourdomain.com -d www.yourdomain.com\n\n# 自动续期\nsudo crontab -e\n# 添加：0 12 * * * /usr/bin/certbot renew --quiet\n```\n\n### 2. 自签名证书（开发测试用）\n```bash\n# 创建SSL目录\nmkdir -p ssl\n\n# 生成自签名证书\nopenssl req -x509 -nodes -days 365 -newkey rsa:2048 \\\n    -keyout ssl/key.pem \\\n    -out ssl/cert.pem \\\n    -subj "/C=CN/ST=Beijing/L=Beijing/O=Company/CN=152.136.104.251"\n```\n\n## 🚀 部署流程\n\n### 1. 服务器初始化脚本\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n# deploy-init.sh\n\nset -e\n\necho "🚀 开始初始化腾讯云服务器..."\n\n# 1. 系统更新\nsudo apt update && sudo apt upgrade -y\n\n# 2. 安装基础软件\nsudo apt install -y curl wget git vim htop unzip ufw\n\n# 3. 安装Docker\nif ! command -v docker &> /dev/null; then\n    curl -fsSL https://get.docker.com -o get-docker.sh\n    sudo sh get-docker.sh\n    sudo usermod -aG docker $USER\n    rm get-docker.sh\nfi\n\n# 4. 安装Docker Compose\nif ! command -v docker-compose &> /dev/null; then\n    sudo curl -L "https://github.com/docker/compose/releases/latest/download/docker-compose-$(uname -s)-$(uname -m)" -o /usr/local/bin/docker-compose\n    sudo chmod +x /usr/local/bin/docker-compose\nfi\n\n# 5. 配置防火墙\nsudo ufw enable\nsudo ufw allow ssh\nsudo ufw allow 80/tcp\nsudo ufw allow 443/tcp\n\n# 6. 创建项目目录\nsudo mkdir -p /opt/ai-project\nsudo chown $USER:$USER /opt/ai-project\n\necho "✅ 服务器初始化完成！"\necho "📝 请重新登录以使Docker权限生效"\n```\n\n### 2. 项目部署脚本\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n# deploy.sh\n\nset -e\n\nPROJECT_DIR="/opt/ai-project"\nBACKUP_DIR="/opt/backups"\nLOG_FILE="/var/log/deploy.log"\n\necho "🚀 开始部署AI项目管理系统..." | tee -a $LOG_FILE\n\n# 1. 创建必要目录\nmkdir -p $PROJECT_DIR $BACKUP_DIR\ncd $PROJECT_DIR\n\n# 2. 克隆或更新代码\nif [ -d ".git" ]; then\n    echo "📦 更新代码..." | tee -a $LOG_FILE\n    git pull origin main\nelse\n    echo "📦 克隆代码..." | tee -a $LOG_FILE\n    git clone https://github.com/your-repo/ai-project.git .\nfi\n\n# 3. 复制生产配置\ncp .env.prod .env\ncp docker-compose.prod.yml docker-compose.yml\n\n# 4. 构建生产镜像\necho "🏗️ 构建Docker镜像..." | tee -a $LOG_FILE\ndocker-compose build --no-cache\n\n# 5. 启动服务\necho "🚀 启动服务..." | tee -a $LOG_FILE\ndocker-compose up -d\n\n# 6. 等待服务启动\necho "⏳ 等待服务启动..." | tee -a $LOG_FILE\nsleep 30\n\n# 7. 健康检查\necho "🔍 执行健康检查..." | tee -a $LOG_FILE\nif curl -f http://localhost/health > /dev/null 2>&1; then\n    echo "✅ 部署成功！服务正在运行" | tee -a $LOG_FILE\nelse\n    echo "❌ 部署失败！请检查日志" | tee -a $LOG_FILE\n    docker-compose logs\n    exit 1\nfi\n\necho "📊 服务状态:" | tee -a $LOG_FILE\ndocker-compose ps\n```\n\n### 3. 数据库初始化脚本\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n# init-database.sh\n\nset -e\n\necho "🗄️ 初始化生产数据库..."\n\n# 1. 等待数据库启动\nuntil docker exec ai_postgres_prod pg_isready -U $DB_USER -d $DB_NAME; do\n    echo "等待数据库启动..."\n    sleep 2\ndone\n\n# 2. 运行数据库迁移\necho "📝 执行数据库迁移..."\ndocker exec ai_backend_prod /app/migrate up\n\n# 3. 创建默认管理员账户\necho "👤 创建管理员账户..."\ndocker exec ai_backend_prod /app/create-admin\n\n# 4. 导入种子数据\necho "🌱 导入种子数据..."\ndocker exec ai_backend_prod /app/seed-data\n\necho "✅ 数据库初始化完成！"\n```\n\n## 📊 监控和日志方案\n\n### 1. 日志收集配置\n```yaml\n# logging/docker-compose.logging.yml\nversion: '3.8'\n\nservices:\n  # ELK Stack for logging\n  elasticsearch:\n    image: elasticsearch:8.8.0\n    container_name: ai_elasticsearch\n    environment:\n      - discovery.type=single-node\n      - xpack.security.enabled=false\n    volumes:\n      - elasticsearch_data:/usr/share/elasticsearch/data\n    ports:\n      - "127.0.0.1:9200:9200"\n\n  logstash:\n    image: logstash:8.8.0\n    container_name: ai_logstash\n    volumes:\n      - ./logstash/pipeline:/usr/share/logstash/pipeline\n      - ./logs:/var/logs\n    depends_on:\n      - elasticsearch\n\n  kibana:\n    image: kibana:8.8.0\n    container_name: ai_kibana\n    environment:\n      - ELASTICSEARCH_HOSTS=http://elasticsearch:9200\n    ports:\n      - "127.0.0.1:5601:5601"\n    depends_on:\n      - elasticsearch\n```\n\n### 2. 系统监控配置\n```yaml\n# monitoring/docker-compose.monitoring.yml\nversion: '3.8'\n\nservices:\n  # Prometheus监控\n  prometheus:\n    image: prom/prometheus\n    container_name: ai_prometheus\n    ports:\n      - "127.0.0.1:9090:9090"\n    volumes:\n      - ./prometheus/prometheus.yml:/etc/prometheus/prometheus.yml\n      - prometheus_data:/prometheus\n\n  # Grafana仪表板\n  grafana:\n    image: grafana/grafana\n    container_name: ai_grafana\n    ports:\n      - "127.0.0.1:3000:3000"\n    environment:\n      - GF_SECURITY_ADMIN_PASSWORD=admin123\n    volumes:\n      - grafana_data:/var/lib/grafana\n      - ./grafana/dashboards:/var/lib/grafana/dashboards\n\nvolumes:\n  prometheus_data:\n  grafana_data:\n  elasticsearch_data:\n```\n\n## 🔄 备份和恢复方案\n\n### 1. 自动备份脚本\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n# backup.sh\n\nBACKUP_DIR="/opt/backups"\nDATE=$(date +%Y%m%d_%H%M%S)\nDB_BACKUP_FILE="$BACKUP_DIR/db_backup_$DATE.sql"\nFILES_BACKUP_FILE="$BACKUP_DIR/files_backup_$DATE.tar.gz"\n\necho "🔄 开始备份..."\n\n# 1. 数据库备份\ndocker exec ai_postgres_prod pg_dump -U $DB_USER $DB_NAME > $DB_BACKUP_FILE\ngzip $DB_BACKUP_FILE\n\n# 2. 文件备份\ntar -czf $FILES_BACKUP_FILE -C /opt/ai-project \\\n    uploads logs config --exclude='logs/*.log'\n\n# 3. 清理旧备份（保留30天）\nfind $BACKUP_DIR -type f -mtime +30 -delete\n\n# 4. 备份到云存储（可选）\n# 腾讯云COS或阿里云OSS上传脚本\n\necho "✅ 备份完成：$DB_BACKUP_FILE.gz, $FILES_BACKUP_FILE"\n```\n\n### 2. 定时备份配置\n```bash\n# 添加到crontab\ncrontab -e\n\n# 每天凌晨2点执行备份\n0 2 * * * /opt/ai-project/scripts/backup.sh >> /var/log/backup.log 2>&1\n\n# 每周日进行完整系统备份\n0 1 * * 0 /opt/ai-project/scripts/full-backup.sh >> /var/log/backup.log 2>&1\n```\n\n## 🚨 故障恢复方案\n\n### 1. 服务恢复脚本\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n# recovery.sh\n\necho "🚨 开始故障恢复..."\n\n# 1. 停止所有服务\ndocker-compose down\n\n# 2. 检查磁盘空间\ndf -h\n\n# 3. 清理Docker资源\ndocker system prune -f\n\n# 4. 恢复最新备份\nLATEST_BACKUP=$(ls -t /opt/backups/db_backup_*.sql.gz | head -1)\nif [ -f "$LATEST_BACKUP" ]; then\n    echo "📦 恢复数据库备份：$LATEST_BACKUP"\n    gunzip -c $LATEST_BACKUP | docker exec -i ai_postgres_prod psql -U $DB_USER $DB_NAME\nfi\n\n# 5. 重启服务\ndocker-compose up -d\n\n# 6. 健康检查\nsleep 30\ncurl -f http://localhost/health || echo "❌ 服务恢复失败"\n\necho "✅ 故障恢复完成"\n```\n\n## 📋 部署检查清单\n\n### 部署前检查\n- [ ] 服务器系统更新完成\n- [ ] Docker和Docker Compose已安装\n- [ ] 防火墙规则配置正确\n- [ ] SSL证书已申请\n- [ ] 域名DNS解析配置\n- [ ] 环境变量文件配置\n- [ ] 数据库密码设置\n\n### 部署过程检查\n- [ ] 代码成功克隆/更新\n- [ ] Docker镜像构建成功\n- [ ] 所有容器启动正常\n- [ ] 数据库连接正常\n- [ ] API接口响应正常\n- [ ] 前端页面加载正常\n- [ ] SSL证书工作正常\n\n### 部署后检查\n- [ ] 健康检查接口正常\n- [ ] 日志收集正常\n- [ ] 监控指标正常\n- [ ] 备份脚本测试通过\n- [ ] 故障恢复流程测试\n- [ ] 性能压力测试\n- [ ] 安全扫描通过\n\n## 🔧 常见问题解决\n\n### 1. 端口冲突\n```bash\n# 检查端口占用\nsudo netstat -tulpn | grep :80\nsudo netstat -tulpn | grep :443\n\n# 停止冲突服务\nsudo systemctl stop apache2  # 如果有Apache\nsudo systemctl stop nginx    # 如果有旧Nginx\n```\n\n### 2. 内存不足\n```bash\n# 检查内存使用\nfree -h\ndocker stats\n\n# 清理Docker资源\ndocker system prune -a\ndocker volume prune\n```\n\n### 3. 磁盘空间不足\n```bash\n# 检查磁盘使用\ndf -h\ndu -sh /var/lib/docker\n\n# 清理日志文件\nsudo find /var/log -type f -name "*.log" -mtime +7 -delete\ndocker logs --tail 100 container_name > /tmp/recent.log\n```\n\n## 📞 技术支持\n\n### 联系方式\n- **技术负责人**: 项目技术团队\n- **监控告警**: 通过Grafana配置钉钉/微信告警\n- **日志查询**: Kibana界面 (http://152.136.104.251:5601)\n- **监控面板**: Grafana界面 (http://152.136.104.251:3000)\n\n### 维护时间\n- **常规维护**: 每周日 02:00-04:00\n- **紧急维护**: 7x24小时响应\n- **备份验证**: 每月第一个周日\n\n---\n\n## 📈 性能优化建议\n\n### 1. 数据库优化\n- 启用连接池\n- 配置适当的缓存大小\n- 定期执行VACUUM和ANALYZE\n- 建立适当的索引\n\n### 2. 应用优化\n- 启用Gzip压缩\n- 配置静态资源缓存\n- 使用CDN加速\n- 实现API速率限制\n\n### 3. 系统优化\n- 配置swap分区\n- 调整文件描述符限制\n- 优化内核参数\n- 监控系统资源使用\n\n此部署方案确保AI项目管理系统在腾讯云服务器上稳定、安全、高效运行，并提供完整的监控、备份和故障恢复机制。	110	2025-09-21 08:46:05.108655	2025-09-21 08:46:05.108655	\N	110	markdown	draft	\N	\N	private	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N		1	\N	{}	f	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N
1143	1	任务文档	# 腾讯云服务器部署实施方案 - 任务执行总结\n\n## 任务概述\n为AI项目管理系统制定了完整的腾讯云服务器(152.136.104.251)部署实施方案，包含所有必要的配置文件、脚本和文档。\n\n## 完成的工作\n\n### 1. 生产环境Docker配置\n- **docker-compose.prod.yml**: 生产环境容器编排配置\n  - PostgreSQL数据库服务(ai_postgres_prod)\n  - 后端API服务(ai_backend_prod)  \n  - 前端服务(ai_frontend_prod)\n  - Redis缓存服务(ai_redis_prod)\n  - Nginx反向代理服务\n  - MCP任务桥接服务(ai_mcp_server_prod)\n  - 包含健康检查、资源限制、重启策略\n\n### 2. 环境配置\n- **.env.prod**: 生产环境变量配置\n  - 数据库连接配置(PostgreSQL)\n  - JWT认证密钥\n  - 服务器域名和端口配置\n  - Redis连接配置\n  - 安全密钥管理\n\n### 3. Nginx配置\n- **nginx/nginx.conf**: 主Nginx配置\n  - 安全头设置\n  - Gzip压缩优化\n  - 速率限制\n  - 上游服务配置\n- **nginx/sites/ai-project.conf**: 站点配置\n  - HTTP到HTTPS重定向\n  - SSL/TLS配置\n  - API代理设置\n  - 静态文件服务\n\n### 4. 生产Docker镜像\n- **backend/Dockerfile.prod**: 后端生产镜像\n  - 多阶段构建优化\n  - 非root用户安全配置\n  - 健康检查集成\n- **frontend/Dockerfile.prod**: 前端生产镜像\n  - React应用构建优化\n  - Nginx静态文件服务\n  - 缓存策略配置\n\n### 5. 部署脚本\n- **scripts/deploy.sh**: 主部署脚本\n  - 环境检查和准备\n  - 代码部署和配置\n  - 服务启动和验证\n  - 错误处理和回滚\n- **scripts/setup-ssl.sh**: SSL证书设置\n  - Let's Encrypt证书申请\n  - 证书自动续期配置\n- **scripts/backup.sh**: 自动备份脚本\n  - 数据库备份\n  - 文件系统备份\n  - 备份验证和清理\n\n### 6. 前端Nginx配置\n- **frontend/nginx.conf**: 前端容器内部配置\n  - React路由支持\n  - 静态资源缓存\n  - Gzip压缩\n  - 安全头设置\n\n### 7. 部署文档\n- **DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md**: 完整部署指南\n  - 快速部署步骤\n  - 详细配置说明\n  - 安全配置指导\n  - 监控和维护\n  - 故障排除指南\n  - 性能优化建议\n\n## 技术架构\n\n```\n[用户] → [Nginx(443/80)] → [后端API(8080)] → [PostgreSQL(5432)]\n                        → [前端React(80)]    → [Redis(6379)]\n                        → [MCP服务(9090)]\n```\n\n## 安全特性\n- HTTPS强制访问\n- 防火墙端口限制\n- 非root用户运行\n- 环境变量密钥管理\n- 安全头配置\n- 访问日志记录\n\n## 监控和维护\n- 健康检查端点\n- 自动重启策略\n- 日志管理\n- 定期备份\n- 资源监控\n- 性能优化\n\n## 部署流程\n1. 服务器环境准备(Docker安装、防火墙配置)\n2. 代码克隆和配置\n3. SSL证书设置\n4. 容器构建和启动\n5. 服务验证和测试\n6. 监控和备份配置\n\n## 关键配置要点\n- **数据库**: 生产级PostgreSQL配置，数据持久化\n- **缓存**: Redis配置，性能优化\n- **代理**: Nginx反向代理，负载均衡\n- **安全**: SSL/TLS加密，安全头配置\n- **备份**: 自动化备份策略，数据安全\n- **监控**: 健康检查，服务监控\n\n## 文件清单\n```\n├── docker-compose.prod.yml     # 生产环境Docker配置\n├── .env.prod                   # 生产环境变量\n├── nginx/\n│   ├── nginx.conf             # 主Nginx配置\n│   └── sites/ai-project.conf  # 站点配置\n├── scripts/\n│   ├── deploy.sh              # 主部署脚本\n│   ├── setup-ssl.sh           # SSL设置脚本\n│   └── backup.sh              # 备份脚本\n├── backend/Dockerfile.prod    # 后端生产镜像\n├── frontend/\n│   ├── Dockerfile.prod        # 前端生产镜像\n│   └── nginx.conf             # 前端内部配置\n└── DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md        # 部署指南\n```\n\n## 执行结果\n✅ 完成了腾讯云服务器152.136.104.251的完整部署方案\n✅ 创建了所有必要的配置文件和脚本\n✅ 提供了详细的部署文档和操作指南\n✅ 实现了生产级的安全和性能配置\n✅ 建立了完整的监控和备份体系\n\n## 后续建议\n1. 在实际部署前先在测试环境验证配置\n2. 根据实际负载调整资源配置\n3. 配置监控告警系统\n4. 建立CI/CD自动化部署流程\n5. 定期进行安全审计和更新\n\n部署方案已全面完成，可以直接用于腾讯云服务器的生产部署。	110	2025-09-21 08:54:14.088633	2025-09-21 08:54:14.088633	\N	110	markdown	draft	\N	\N	private	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N		1	\N	{}	f	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N
1144	\N	散货出库模块基础架构实现完成总结	# 散货出库模块基础架构实现完成总结\n\n## 实现概述\n\n已成功完成散货出库模块的基础架构搭建，包括数据模型、API接口、Repository层和数据库设计。整个架构采用现代化的Android开发模式，支持离线优先、响应式编程和类型安全。\n\n## 完成的任务\n\n### ✅ 任务1917 - 数据模型设计\n**文件清单：**\n- `BulkPickingEnums.kt` - 完整的枚举定义\n- `PickingProgress.kt` - 拣货进度跟踪模型  \n- `TimeUtils.kt` - 时间工具函数\n- `BulkPickingItem.kt` - 拣货项业务模型\n- `BulkOutboundOrder.kt` - 出库单主模型\n- `PickingException.kt` - 异常处理模型\n- `OfflineOperation.kt` - 离线操作模型\n- `BulkPickingRequests.kt` - API请求模型\n- `BulkPickingResponses.kt` - API响应模型\n\n**关键特性：**\n- 完整的业务状态建模\n- 支持离线操作跟踪\n- 异常处理机制\n- 类型安全的数据转换\n\n### ✅ 任务1918 - API接口设计\n**文件清单：**\n- `BulkOutboundApi.kt` - Retrofit API接口定义\n- `BulkOutboundApiService.kt` - API服务封装\n- `BulkOutboundModule.kt` - 依赖注入配置\n\n**关键特性：**\n- RESTful API设计\n- 统一的错误处理机制\n- 响应式编程支持\n- 文件上传功能\n\n### ✅ 任务1919 - Repository层重构\n**文件清单：**\n- `BulkOutboundRepository.kt` - Repository接口\n- `BulkOutboundRepositoryImpl.kt` - Repository实现\n\n**关键特性：**\n- 离线优先的数据访问策略\n- 智能网络和本地数据源切换\n- 离线操作缓存和同步\n- 响应式数据流支持\n\n### ✅ 任务1920 - 数据库设计\n**文件清单：**\n- `BulkOutboundEntity.kt` - Room数据库实体\n- `BulkOutboundDao.kt` - 出库单数据访问对象\n- `OfflineOperationDao.kt` - 离线操作数据访问\n- `PickingExceptionDao.kt` - 异常记录数据访问\n- `BulkOutboundDatabase.kt` - 数据库配置\n\n**关键特性：**\n- 完整的本地数据存储方案\n- 支持复杂查询和统计\n- 数据库迁移策略\n- 健康检查和维护工具\n\n## 架构亮点\n\n### 1. 离线优先架构\n- 支持完全离线操作\n- 自动数据同步机制\n- 冲突检测和解决\n- 重试机制\n\n### 2. 响应式编程\n- 使用Kotlin Flow进行实时数据更新\n- 数据变化自动通知UI\n- 支持背压和取消操作\n\n### 3. 类型安全\n- 强类型的数据模型\n- 编译时错误检查\n- 安全的类型转换\n\n### 4. 性能优化\n- 本地缓存策略\n- 批量操作支持\n- 懒加载和分页\n- 数据库索引优化\n\n### 5. 错误处理\n- 分层错误处理\n- 网络错误恢复\n- 用户友好的错误提示\n\n## 技术栈\n\n- **架构模式**: MVVM + Repository Pattern\n- **网络层**: Retrofit2 + Coroutines\n- **数据库**: Room + WAL模式\n- **依赖注入**: Dagger Hilt\n- **响应式编程**: Kotlin Flow\n- **JSON处理**: Gson\n- **异步处理**: Kotlin Coroutines\n\n## 下一步计划\n\n基础架构已完成，接下来将进入阶段2的核心功能开发：\n\n1. **出库单列表页面** - 展示出库单列表，支持筛选和搜索\n2. **出库单详情页面** - 显示详细信息和拣货进度\n3. **拣货作业页面** - 核心拣货操作界面，支持扫码和异常处理\n4. **离线功能开发** - 完善离线模式的用户体验\n\n## 代码质量保证\n\n- 完整的异常处理\n- 详细的代码注释\n- 一致的命名规范\n- 模块化设计\n- 依赖解耦\n\n基础架构的成功实现为后续UI开发和业务逻辑实现奠定了坚实的基础。	110	2025-09-21 08:57:14.244311	2025-09-21 08:57:14.247516	\N	110	markdown	draft	\N	\N	team	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	1	\N	{"priority": "medium", "is_pinned": false, "read_time": 6, "view_count": 0, "word_count": 1923, "last_read_at": null, "is_bookmarked": false, "related_notes": null, "related_tasks": null, "work_note_type": "general"}	f	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N
1145	1	出库单列表页面实现方案	# 出库单列表页面实现方案\n\n## 1. 页面概述\n\n出库单列表页面是散货出库模块的入口页面，用于展示所有出库单的概览信息，支持筛选、搜索、状态管理和导航到详情页面。\n\n## 2. 功能需求\n\n### 2.1 核心功能\n- **出库单列表展示**: 显示出库单摘要信息\n- **实时状态更新**: 响应式数据更新\n- **筛选和搜索**: 多维度数据筛选\n- **下拉刷新**: 支持手动刷新数据\n- **分页加载**: 无限滚动或分页加载\n- **离线支持**: 离线模式下显示缓存数据\n\n### 2.2 业务功能\n- **状态筛选**: 按出库单状态筛选\n- **仓库筛选**: 按仓库筛选\n- **日期筛选**: 按订单日期筛选\n- **快速搜索**: 按订单号、客户名称搜索\n- **优先级显示**: 高优先级订单突出显示\n- **进度显示**: 拣货进度可视化\n\n## 3. 技术架构\n\n### 3.1 架构模式\n- **MVVM模式**: ViewModel + LiveData/StateFlow\n- **Repository模式**: 统一数据访问\n- **组合式UI**: Jetpack Compose\n\n### 3.2 核心组件\n```\nBulkOutboundListScreen (Composable)\n├── BulkOutboundListViewModel\n├── BulkOutboundRepository\n├── UI Components\n│   ├── SearchBar\n│   ├── FilterPanel\n│   ├── OutboundOrderCard\n│   ├── LoadingIndicator\n│   └── EmptyState\n└── Navigation\n```\n\n## 4. ViewModel设计\n\n### 4.1 状态管理\n```kotlin\ndata class BulkOutboundListUiState(\n    val isLoading: Boolean = false,\n    val orders: List<BulkOutboundOrderSummary> = emptyList(),\n    val filteredOrders: List<BulkOutboundOrderSummary> = emptyList(),\n    val selectedStatus: BulkOutboundStatus? = null,\n    val selectedWarehouse: String? = null,\n    val searchQuery: String = "",\n    val isRefreshing: Boolean = false,\n    val errorMessage: String? = null,\n    val hasMoreData: Boolean = true,\n    val isOffline: Boolean = false,\n    val summary: OutboundListSummary? = null\n)\n```\n\n### 4.2 主要功能\n- **数据加载**: 初始化和分页加载\n- **筛选逻辑**: 多条件筛选组合\n- **搜索功能**: 实时搜索\n- **刷新机制**: 下拉刷新和自动刷新\n- **离线处理**: 离线状态管理\n\n## 5. UI组件设计\n\n### 5.1 页面布局\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────┐\n│ TopAppBar (标题 + 操作按钮)  │\n├─────────────────────────────┤\n│ SearchBar (搜索框)          │\n├─────────────────────────────┤\n│ FilterChips (筛选标签)      │\n├─────────────────────────────┤\n│ Summary Cards (统计摘要)    │\n├─────────────────────────────┤\n│ LazyColumn (订单列表)       │\n│ ├── OutboundOrderCard      │\n│ ├── OutboundOrderCard      │\n│ └── LoadMoreIndicator      │\n└─────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### 5.2 订单卡片设计\n```kotlin\n@Composable\nfun OutboundOrderCard(\n    order: BulkOutboundOrderSummary,\n    onOrderClick: (String) -> Unit,\n    onStartPicking: (String) -> Unit\n) {\n    Card {\n        Column {\n            // 订单号和状态\n            Row {\n                Text(order.orderNo)\n                StatusChip(order.status)\n            }\n            \n            // 客户信息和日期\n            Row {\n                Text(order.customerName)\n                Text(order.orderDate)\n            }\n            \n            // 进度条\n            LinearProgressIndicator(order.progress)\n            \n            // 统计信息\n            Row {\n                InfoChip("商品", order.totalItems)\n                InfoChip("数量", order.totalQuantity)\n                InfoChip("已拣", order.pickedQuantity)\n            }\n            \n            // 操作按钮\n            Row {\n                if (order.canStartPicking()) {\n                    Button("开始拣货", onStartPicking)\n                }\n                Button("查看详情", onOrderClick)\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 5.3 筛选组件\n```kotlin\n@Composable\nfun FilterPanel(\n    selectedStatus: BulkOutboundStatus?,\n    selectedWarehouse: String?,\n    onStatusSelected: (BulkOutboundStatus?) -> Unit,\n    onWarehouseSelected: (String?) -> Unit\n) {\n    LazyRow {\n        // 状态筛选\n        items(BulkOutboundStatus.values()) { status ->\n            FilterChip(\n                selected = selectedStatus == status,\n                onClick = { onStatusSelected(status) },\n                label = { Text(status.displayName) }\n            )\n        }\n        \n        // 仓库筛选\n        // ...\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## 6. 数据流设计\n\n### 6.1 数据加载流程\n```\n用户进入页面\n    ↓\nViewModel.loadOutboundOrders()\n    ↓\nRepository.getBulkOutboundOrders()\n    ↓\n检查网络状态\n    ↓\n在线: API调用 + 缓存更新\n离线: 读取本地缓存\n    ↓\n更新UI状态\n```\n\n### 6.2 筛选和搜索流程\n```\n用户输入筛选条件\n    ↓\nViewModel.updateFilter()\n    ↓\n组合筛选条件\n    ↓\n过滤订单列表\n    ↓\n更新filteredOrders\n```\n\n## 7. 离线功能设计\n\n### 7.1 离线指示器\n- **网络状态监听**: 实时检测网络状态\n- **离线提示**: 显示离线状态标识\n- **缓存数据**: 优先显示本地缓存\n\n### 7.2 数据同步\n- **后台同步**: 网络恢复时自动同步\n- **冲突处理**: 处理数据冲突\n- **进度提示**: 同步进度反馈\n\n## 8. 性能优化\n\n### 8.1 列表优化\n- **LazyColumn**: 虚拟化长列表\n- **State提升**: 避免不必要的重组\n- **Key优化**: 稳定的列表项Key\n\n### 8.2 内存优化\n- **图片加载**: 使用Coil异步加载\n- **数据分页**: 避免一次性加载大量数据\n- **缓存策略**: 合理的缓存生命周期\n\n## 9. 用户体验设计\n\n### 9.1 加载状态\n- **骨架屏**: 初始加载状态\n- **下拉刷新**: SwipeRefresh支持\n- **加载更多**: 底部加载指示器\n\n### 9.2 错误处理\n- **网络错误**: 重试机制\n- **空状态**: 友好的空状态提示\n- **错误提示**: Snackbar错误消息\n\n### 9.3 交互反馈\n- **点击反馈**: Ripple效果\n- **状态变化**: 动画过渡\n- **操作确认**: 关键操作二次确认\n\n## 10. 导航设计\n\n### 10.1 页面跳转\n- **详情页**: 点击订单卡片跳转详情\n- **拣货页**: 开始拣货跳转作业页面\n- **扫码页**: 支持扫码快速定位订单\n\n### 10.2 参数传递\n```kotlin\n// 导航到详情页\nnavController.navigate("outbound_detail/${orderId}")\n\n// 导航到拣货页\nnavController.navigate("picking/${orderId}")\n```\n\n## 11. 测试策略\n\n### 11.1 单元测试\n- **ViewModel测试**: 业务逻辑测试\n- **Repository测试**: 数据访问测试\n- **工具类测试**: 工具函数测试\n\n### 11.2 UI测试\n- **Compose测试**: UI组件测试\n- **交互测试**: 用户操作测试\n- **导航测试**: 页面跳转测试\n\n## 12. 实现计划\n\n### 12.1 开发阶段\n1. **基础框架**: ViewModel + Repository集成\n2. **UI组件**: 基础UI组件实现\n3. **数据绑定**: 数据展示和状态管理\n4. **筛选搜索**: 筛选和搜索功能\n5. **离线支持**: 离线模式实现\n6. **性能优化**: 性能调优和测试\n\n### 12.2 预估工时\n- **总工时**: 16-20小时\n- **基础实现**: 8-10小时\n- **功能完善**: 6-8小时\n- **测试优化**: 2-2小时\n\n## 13. 技术风险和解决方案\n\n### 13.1 主要风险\n- **性能风险**: 大量数据列表渲染\n- **网络风险**: 网络不稳定影响用户体验\n- **状态风险**: 复杂的状态管理\n\n### 13.2 解决方案\n- **虚拟化**: 使用LazyColumn优化长列表\n- **缓存策略**: 实现合理的离线缓存\n- **状态管理**: 使用MVI模式简化状态\n\n## 14. 后续扩展\n\n### 14.1 功能扩展\n- **批量操作**: 支持批量状态更新\n- **导出功能**: 导出订单列表\n- **统计图表**: 可视化统计信息\n\n### 14.2 体验优化\n- **个性化**: 用户偏好设置\n- **快捷操作**: 手势操作支持\n- **语音交互**: 语音搜索功能\n\n该实现方案提供了完整的技术架构和实现细节，为开发团队提供清晰的开发指导。	110	2025-09-21 09:03:41.253431	2025-09-21 09:03:41.253431	\N	110	markdown	draft	\N	\N	private	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N		1	\N	{}	f	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N
1146	1	出库单详情页面实现方案	# 出库单详情页面实现方案\n\n## 1. 页面概述\n\n出库单详情页面是查看和管理单个出库单的核心页面，提供完整的订单信息展示、拣货进度跟踪、异常处理和操作入口。\n\n## 2. 功能需求\n\n### 2.1 信息展示\n- **订单基础信息**: 订单号、客户、日期、状态等\n- **商品明细**: 详细的商品拣货清单\n- **拣货进度**: 实时进度跟踪和可视化\n- **异常记录**: 拣货异常列表和处理状态\n- **操作历史**: 操作时间线和记录\n\n### 2.2 交互功能\n- **开始拣货**: 启动拣货作业\n- **查看商品**: 商品详情和库位信息\n- **异常处理**: 查看和处理异常\n- **状态操作**: 暂停、继续、完成等\n- **扫码功能**: 快速定位商品\n\n### 2.3 实时功能\n- **进度更新**: 实时拣货进度\n- **状态同步**: 多设备状态同步\n- **通知提醒**: 关键状态变化通知\n\n## 3. 技术架构\n\n### 3.1 架构设计\n```\nBulkOutboundDetailScreen\n├── BulkOutboundDetailViewModel\n├── BulkOutboundRepository\n├── UI Sections\n│   ├── OrderHeaderSection\n│   ├── ProgressSection\n│   ├── ItemListSection\n│   ├── ExceptionSection\n│   └── ActionSection\n└── Navigation & Dialogs\n```\n\n### 3.2 数据流架构\n- **响应式更新**: Flow + StateFlow\n- **离线优先**: Repository模式\n- **实时同步**: WebSocket/轮询\n\n## 4. ViewModel设计\n\n### 4.1 状态模型\n```kotlin\ndata class BulkOutboundDetailUiState(\n    val isLoading: Boolean = false,\n    val order: BulkOutboundOrder? = null,\n    val items: List<BulkPickingItem> = emptyList(),\n    val exceptions: List<PickingException> = emptyList(),\n    val progress: PickingProgress? = null,\n    val isRefreshing: Boolean = false,\n    val selectedTab: DetailTab = DetailTab.ITEMS,\n    val showStartDialog: Boolean = false,\n    val showCompleteDialog: Boolean = false,\n    val errorMessage: String? = null,\n    val isOffline: Boolean = false,\n    val operationInProgress: Boolean = false\n)\n\nenum class DetailTab {\n    ITEMS,      // 商品明细\n    PROGRESS,   // 进度详情\n    EXCEPTIONS, // 异常记录\n    HISTORY     // 操作历史\n}\n```\n\n### 4.2 核心功能\n```kotlin\nclass BulkOutboundDetailViewModel(\n    private val repository: BulkOutboundRepository,\n    private val outboundId: String\n) : ViewModel() {\n    \n    // 状态管理\n    private val _uiState = MutableStateFlow(BulkOutboundDetailUiState())\n    val uiState: StateFlow<BulkOutboundDetailUiState> = _uiState.asStateFlow()\n    \n    // 核心操作\n    suspend fun startPicking(operatorId: String, operatorName: String)\n    suspend fun completePicking(note: String? = null)\n    suspend fun pausePicking()\n    suspend fun refreshData()\n    \n    // 导航操作\n    fun navigateToPickingScreen()\n    fun navigateToItemDetail(itemId: String)\n    fun showExceptionDetail(exceptionId: String)\n}\n```\n\n## 5. UI组件设计\n\n### 5.1 页面布局\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────┐\n│ TopAppBar + Actions         │\n├─────────────────────────────┤\n│ Order Header Section       │\n│ ├── 订单号 + 状态标签       │\n│ ├── 客户信息 + 日期        │\n│ └── 整体进度条             │\n├─────────────────────────────┤\n│ TabRow (切换标签)          │\n├─────────────────────────────┤\n│ TabContent                 │\n│ ├── Items Tab (商品列表)   │\n│ ├── Progress Tab (进度)    │\n│ ├── Exception Tab (异常)   │\n│ └── History Tab (历史)     │\n├─────────────────────────────┤\n│ Floating Action Button     │\n│ (开始拣货/继续拣货)        │\n└─────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### 5.2 订单头部组件\n```kotlin\n@Composable\nfun OrderHeaderSection(\n    order: BulkOutboundOrder,\n    progress: PickingProgress\n) {\n    Card(\n        modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth().padding(16.dp)\n    ) {\n        Column(modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp)) {\n            // 订单号和状态\n            Row(\n                modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth(),\n                horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.SpaceBetween\n            ) {\n                Text(\n                    text = order.orderNo,\n                    style = MaterialTheme.typography.h6\n                )\n                StatusChip(status = order.status)\n            }\n            \n            Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(8.dp))\n            \n            // 客户信息\n            Row {\n                Icon(Icons.Default.Person, contentDescription = null)\n                Text(text = order.customerName ?: "未知客户")\n            }\n            \n            // 日期信息\n            Row {\n                Icon(Icons.Default.DateRange, contentDescription = null)\n                Text(text = order.orderDate)\n            }\n            \n            Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(16.dp))\n            \n            // 进度信息\n            ProgressSection(progress = progress)\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 5.3 商品列表组件\n```kotlin\n@Composable\nfun ItemListSection(\n    items: List<BulkPickingItem>,\n    onItemClick: (String) -> Unit,\n    onStartPickItem: (String) -> Unit\n) {\n    LazyColumn {\n        items(items, key = { it.id }) { item ->\n            PickingItemCard(\n                item = item,\n                onClick = { onItemClick(item.id) },\n                onStartPick = { onStartPickItem(item.id) }\n            )\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n@Composable\nfun PickingItemCard(\n    item: BulkPickingItem,\n    onClick: () -> Unit,\n    onStartPick: () -> Unit\n) {\n    Card(\n        modifier = Modifier\n            .fillMaxWidth()\n            .padding(horizontal = 16.dp, vertical = 4.dp)\n            .clickable { onClick() }\n    ) {\n        Column(modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp)) {\n            // 商品信息\n            Row(\n                modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth(),\n                horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.SpaceBetween\n            ) {\n                Column(modifier = Modifier.weight(1f)) {\n                    Text(\n                        text = item.goodsName,\n                        style = MaterialTheme.typography.subtitle1\n                    )\n                    Text(\n                        text = "SKU: ${item.sku}",\n                        style = MaterialTheme.typography.caption\n                    )\n                    if (item.locationCode != null) {\n                        Text(\n                            text = "库位: ${item.locationCode}",\n                            style = MaterialTheme.typography.caption\n                        )\n                    }\n                }\n                \n                StatusChip(status = item.status)\n            }\n            \n            Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(8.dp))\n            \n            // 数量信息\n            Row(\n                modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth(),\n                horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.SpaceBetween\n            ) {\n                Text("计划: ${item.plannedQuantity}")\n                Text("已拣: ${item.pickedQuantity}")\n                if (item.exceptionQuantity > 0) {\n                    Text(\n                        text = "异常: ${item.exceptionQuantity}",\n                        color = MaterialTheme.colors.error\n                    )\n                }\n            }\n            \n            // 进度条\n            LinearProgressIndicator(\n                progress = item.completionRate,\n                modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth()\n            )\n            \n            // 操作按钮\n            if (item.canStartPicking()) {\n                Button(\n                    onClick = onStartPick,\n                    modifier = Modifier.align(Alignment.End)\n                ) {\n                    Text("开始拣货")\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 5.4 进度详情组件\n```kotlin\n@Composable\nfun ProgressSection(progress: PickingProgress) {\n    Column {\n        // 总体进度\n        Row(\n            modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth(),\n            horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.SpaceBetween\n        ) {\n            Text("总进度")\n            Text("${(progress.completionRate * 100).toInt()}%")\n        }\n        \n        LinearProgressIndicator(\n            progress = progress.completionRate,\n            modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth()\n        )\n        \n        Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(16.dp))\n        \n        // 详细统计\n        Row(\n            modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth(),\n            horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.SpaceEvenly\n        ) {\n            ProgressStatCard(\n                title = "总数量",\n                value = progress.totalQuantity.toString(),\n                color = MaterialTheme.colors.primary\n            )\n            ProgressStatCard(\n                title = "已拣",\n                value = progress.pickedQuantity.toString(),\n                color = Color.Green\n            )\n            ProgressStatCard(\n                title = "待拣",\n                value = progress.pendingQuantity.toString(),\n                color = Color.Orange\n            )\n            if (progress.exceptionQuantity > 0) {\n                ProgressStatCard(\n                    title = "异常",\n                    value = progress.exceptionQuantity.toString(),\n                    color = MaterialTheme.colors.error\n                )\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 5.5 异常列表组件\n```kotlin\n@Composable\nfun ExceptionListSection(\n    exceptions: List<PickingException>,\n    onExceptionClick: (String) -> Unit,\n    onResolveException: (String) -> Unit\n) {\n    LazyColumn {\n        items(exceptions, key = { it.id }) { exception ->\n            ExceptionCard(\n                exception = exception,\n                onClick = { onExceptionClick(exception.id) },\n                onResolve = { onResolveException(exception.id) }\n            )\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n@Composable\nfun ExceptionCard(\n    exception: PickingException,\n    onClick: () -> Unit,\n    onResolve: () -> Unit\n) {\n    Card(\n        modifier = Modifier\n            .fillMaxWidth()\n            .padding(horizontal = 16.dp, vertical = 4.dp)\n            .clickable { onClick() },\n        backgroundColor = if (exception.isResolved) {\n            MaterialTheme.colors.surface\n        } else {\n            MaterialTheme.colors.error.copy(alpha = 0.1f)\n        }\n    ) {\n        Column(modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp)) {\n            // 异常类型和状态\n            Row(\n                modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth(),\n                horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.SpaceBetween\n            ) {\n                Text(\n                    text = exception.exceptionType.displayName,\n                    style = MaterialTheme.typography.subtitle1,\n                    color = if (exception.isResolved) {\n                        MaterialTheme.colors.onSurface\n                    } else {\n                        MaterialTheme.colors.error\n                    }\n                )\n                \n                if (exception.isResolved) {\n                    Icon(\n                        Icons.Default.CheckCircle,\n                        contentDescription = "已解决",\n                        tint = Color.Green\n                    )\n                } else {\n                    Icon(\n                        Icons.Default.Warning,\n                        contentDescription = "待处理",\n                        tint = MaterialTheme.colors.error\n                    )\n                }\n            }\n            \n            // 商品信息\n            Text(\n                text = "${exception.sku} - ${exception.goodsName}",\n                style = MaterialTheme.typography.body2\n            )\n            \n            // 数量信息\n            Text(\n                text = "期望: ${exception.expectedQty}, 实际: ${exception.actualQty}",\n                style = MaterialTheme.typography.caption\n            )\n            \n            // 异常描述\n            Text(\n                text = exception.description,\n                style = MaterialTheme.typography.body2\n            )\n            \n            // 解决方案\n            if (exception.solution != null) {\n                Text(\n                    text = "解决方案: ${exception.solution}",\n                    style = MaterialTheme.typography.caption,\n                    color = Color.Green\n                )\n            }\n            \n            // 操作按钮\n            if (!exception.isResolved) {\n                Button(\n                    onClick = onResolve,\n                    modifier = Modifier.align(Alignment.End)\n                ) {\n                    Text("处理异常")\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## 6. 业务逻辑设计\n\n### 6.1 状态管理\n```kotlin\n// 开始拣货\nsuspend fun startPicking(operatorId: String, operatorName: String) {\n    _uiState.update { it.copy(operationInProgress = true) }\n    \n    try {\n        val result = repository.startPicking(\n            outboundId = outboundId,\n            operatorId = operatorId,\n            operatorName = operatorName\n        )\n        \n        when (result) {\n            is ApiResult.Success -> {\n                _uiState.update { \n                    it.copy(\n                        operationInProgress = false,\n                        showStartDialog = false\n                    )\n                }\n                // 导航到拣货页面\n                navigateToPickingScreen()\n            }\n            is ApiResult.Error -> {\n                _uiState.update { \n                    it.copy(\n                        operationInProgress = false,\n                        errorMessage = result.message\n                    )\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    } catch (e: Exception) {\n        _uiState.update { \n            it.copy(\n                operationInProgress = false,\n                errorMessage = "操作失败: ${e.message}"\n            )\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 6.2 实时数据更新\n```kotlin\n// 监听数据变化\nprivate fun observeOrderData() {\n    viewModelScope.launch {\n        repository.observeBulkOutboundDetail(outboundId)\n            .catch { e ->\n                _uiState.update { \n                    it.copy(errorMessage = "数据加载失败: ${e.message}")\n                }\n            }\n            .collect { order ->\n                _uiState.update { \n                    it.copy(\n                        order = order,\n                        isLoading = false\n                    )\n                }\n            }\n    }\n    \n    // 监听拣货项变化\n    viewModelScope.launch {\n        repository.observePickingItems(outboundId)\n            .collect { items ->\n                _uiState.update { it.copy(items = items) }\n            }\n    }\n    \n    // 监听异常变化\n    viewModelScope.launch {\n        repository.getPickingExceptions(outboundId)\n            .collect { exceptions ->\n                _uiState.update { it.copy(exceptions = exceptions) }\n            }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## 7. 导航设计\n\n### 7.1 页面导航\n```kotlin\n// 导航到拣货页面\nfun navigateToPickingScreen() {\n    navController.navigate("picking/${outboundId}")\n}\n\n// 导航到商品详情\nfun navigateToItemDetail(itemId: String) {\n    navController.navigate("item_detail/${itemId}")\n}\n\n// 导航到异常处理\nfun navigateToExceptionDetail(exceptionId: String) {\n    navController.navigate("exception_detail/${exceptionId}")\n}\n```\n\n### 7.2 参数传递\n```kotlin\n@Composable\nfun BulkOutboundDetailScreen(\n    outboundId: String,\n    navController: NavController,\n    viewModel: BulkOutboundDetailViewModel = hiltViewModel()\n) {\n    // 页面内容\n}\n```\n\n## 8. 离线功能设计\n\n### 8.1 离线数据展示\n- **缓存数据**: 优先显示本地缓存\n- **离线标识**: 显示离线状态\n- **操作限制**: 离线模式下限制某些操作\n\n### 8.2 操作缓存\n- **离线操作**: 缓存用户操作\n- **自动同步**: 网络恢复时同步\n- **冲突处理**: 处理数据冲突\n\n## 9. 性能优化\n\n### 9.1 数据加载优化\n- **懒加载**: 按需加载数据\n- **缓存策略**: 合理使用内存缓存\n- **分页加载**: 大数据集分页处理\n\n### 9.2 UI性能优化\n- **State提升**: 避免不必要的重组\n- **Key优化**: 稳定的列表Key\n- **内存管理**: 及时释放资源\n\n## 10. 用户体验设计\n\n### 10.1 加载状态\n- **骨架屏**: 优雅的加载状态\n- **下拉刷新**: 支持手动刷新\n- **错误重试**: 失败后重试机制\n\n### 10.2 交互反馈\n- **操作确认**: 关键操作二次确认\n- **进度反馈**: 操作进度提示\n- **状态动画**: 平滑的状态切换\n\n## 11. 测试策略\n\n### 11.1 单元测试\n- **ViewModel测试**: 业务逻辑验证\n- **Repository测试**: 数据访问测试\n- **UI组件测试**: 组件功能测试\n\n### 11.2 集成测试\n- **端到端测试**: 完整流程测试\n- **离线测试**: 离线模式测试\n- **性能测试**: 加载性能测试\n\n## 12. 实现计划\n\n### 12.1 开发阶段\n1. **基础框架**: ViewModel + Repository集成 (4h)\n2. **UI组件**: 核心UI组件开发 (8h)\n3. **业务逻辑**: 状态管理和操作流程 (6h)\n4. **实时更新**: 数据监听和同步 (4h)\n5. **离线支持**: 离线模式实现 (4h)\n6. **测试优化**: 测试和性能优化 (4h)\n\n### 12.2 总工时估算\n- **预估总工时**: 26-30小时\n- **核心功能**: 18-20小时\n- **优化完善**: 8-10小时\n\n## 13. 风险和解决方案\n\n### 13.1 技术风险\n- **实时同步**: 数据一致性问题\n- **性能风险**: 大量数据渲染\n- **离线冲突**: 数据冲突处理\n\n### 13.2 解决策略\n- **版本控制**: 使用版本号管理数据\n- **分页加载**: 优化大数据集处理\n- **冲突解决**: 实现合理的冲突策略\n\n该实现方案为出库单详情页面提供了完整的技术架构和开发指导，确保功能完整性和用户体验的优秀表现。	110	2025-09-21 09:21:06.009812	2025-09-21 09:21:06.009812	\N	110	markdown	draft	\N	\N	private	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N		1	\N	{}	f	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N
1147	1	拣货作业页面实现方案	# 拣货作业页面实现方案\n\n## 1. 页面概述\n\n拣货作业页面是散货出库模块的核心操作界面，为拣货员提供高效、准确的拣货作业流程，支持扫码、手动输入、异常处理和实时进度跟踪。\n\n## 2. 功能需求\n\n### 2.1 核心拣货功能\n- **商品拣货**: 逐个商品拣货确认\n- **数量输入**: 支持手动输入和扫码确认\n- **位置指引**: 显示商品库位信息\n- **进度跟踪**: 实时更新拣货进度\n- **批量操作**: 支持批量拣货确认\n\n### 2.2 扫码功能\n- **商品扫码**: 扫描商品条码快速定位\n- **位置扫码**: 扫描库位码验证位置\n- **多码支持**: 支持一维码、二维码\n- **连续扫码**: 连续扫码提高效率\n\n### 2.3 异常处理\n- **异常报告**: 快速报告拣货异常\n- **异常类型**: 多种异常类型选择\n- **图片上传**: 异常现场拍照\n- **异常处理**: 异常解决流程\n\n### 2.4 操作辅助\n- **语音提示**: 语音播报和提示\n- **快捷操作**: 常用操作快捷键\n- **离线支持**: 离线模式拣货\n- **数据同步**: 实时数据同步\n\n## 3. 技术架构\n\n### 3.1 整体架构\n```\nBulkPickingScreen\n├── BulkPickingViewModel\n├── ScannerService (扫码服务)\n├── VoiceService (语音服务)\n├── UI Components\n│   ├── PickingHeader\n│   ├── CurrentItemCard\n│   ├── QuantityInput\n│   ├── ActionButtons\n│   ├── ProgressIndicator\n│   └── ExceptionDialog\n└── Services\n    ├── OfflineManager\n    ├── SyncService\n    └── CameraService\n```\n\n### 3.2 服务集成\n- **Sunmi扫码器**: 集成Sunmi设备扫码功能\n- **相机服务**: 异常拍照功能\n- **语音服务**: TTS语音播报\n- **网络监听**: 实时网络状态\n\n## 4. ViewModel设计\n\n### 4.1 状态模型\n```kotlin\ndata class BulkPickingUiState(\n    val isLoading: Boolean = false,\n    val order: BulkOutboundOrder? = null,\n    val currentItem: BulkPickingItem? = null,\n    val allItems: List<BulkPickingItem> = emptyList(),\n    val pendingItems: List<BulkPickingItem> = emptyList(),\n    val completedItems: List<BulkPickingItem> = emptyList(),\n    val progress: PickingProgress? = null,\n    val inputQuantity: String = "",\n    val scannedCode: String = "",\n    val showExceptionDialog: Boolean = false,\n    val showCompletionDialog: Boolean = false,\n    val isScanning: Boolean = false,\n    val isSpeaking: Boolean = false,\n    val isOffline: Boolean = false,\n    val errorMessage: String? = null,\n    val pendingOperations: Int = 0,\n    val sessionId: String? = null\n)\n```\n\n### 4.2 核心功能\n```kotlin\nclass BulkPickingViewModel(\n    private val repository: BulkOutboundRepository,\n    private val scannerService: ScannerService,\n    private val voiceService: VoiceService,\n    private val outboundId: String\n) : ViewModel() {\n    \n    // 扫码处理\n    suspend fun handleScanResult(code: String)\n    \n    // 数量确认\n    suspend fun confirmQuantity(quantity: Int)\n    \n    // 批量确认\n    suspend fun confirmBatch(items: List<PickingConfirmItem>)\n    \n    // 异常处理\n    suspend fun reportException(exception: PickingExceptionRequest)\n    \n    // 完成拣货\n    suspend fun completePicking(note: String? = null)\n    \n    // 跳过商品\n    fun skipItem()\n    \n    // 返回上一个\n    fun previousItem()\n    \n    // 语音播报\n    fun speakItemInfo(item: BulkPickingItem)\n}\n```\n\n## 5. UI组件设计\n\n### 5.1 页面布局\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────┐\n│ Header (进度 + 状态)        │\n├─────────────────────────────┤\n│ Current Item Card          │\n│ ├── 商品信息 + 图片        │\n│ ├── 库位信息 + 指引        │\n│ ├── 计划数量 vs 实际数量   │\n│ └── 批次/保质期信息        │\n├─────────────────────────────┤\n│ Quantity Input Section     │\n│ ├── 数量输入框             │\n│ ├── 数量增减按钮           │\n│ └── 快捷数量按钮           │\n├─────────────────────────────┤\n│ Action Buttons             │\n│ ├── 扫码按钮               │\n│ ├── 确认按钮               │\n│ ├── 异常按钮               │\n│ └── 跳过按钮               │\n├─────────────────────────────┤\n│ Bottom Navigation          │\n│ ├── 上一个 | 下一个        │\n│ ├── 批量操作 | 完成拣货    │\n│ └── 离线状态 | 设置        │\n└─────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### 5.2 拣货头部组件\n```kotlin\n@Composable\nfun PickingHeader(\n    progress: PickingProgress,\n    isOffline: Boolean,\n    pendingOperations: Int\n) {\n    Card(\n        modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth(),\n        elevation = 4.dp\n    ) {\n        Column(modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp)) {\n            // 进度信息\n            Row(\n                modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth(),\n                horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.SpaceBetween\n            ) {\n                Text(\n                    text = "拣货进度",\n                    style = MaterialTheme.typography.h6\n                )\n                Text(\n                    text = "${progress.pickedQuantity}/${progress.totalQuantity}",\n                    style = MaterialTheme.typography.h6\n                )\n            }\n            \n            // 进度条\n            LinearProgressIndicator(\n                progress = progress.completionRate,\n                modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth()\n            )\n            \n            // 状态信息\n            Row(\n                modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth(),\n                horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.SpaceBetween\n            ) {\n                // 离线状态\n                if (isOffline) {\n                    Row {\n                        Icon(\n                            Icons.Default.CloudOff,\n                            contentDescription = "离线",\n                            tint = Color.Orange\n                        )\n                        Text("离线模式", color = Color.Orange)\n                    }\n                }\n                \n                // 待同步操作\n                if (pendingOperations > 0) {\n                    Row {\n                        Icon(\n                            Icons.Default.Sync,\n                            contentDescription = "同步",\n                            tint = Color.Blue\n                        )\n                        Text("待同步: $pendingOperations", color = Color.Blue)\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 5.3 当前商品卡片\n```kotlin\n@Composable\nfun CurrentItemCard(\n    item: BulkPickingItem?,\n    onSpeakClick: () -> Unit\n) {\n    if (item == null) {\n        EmptyItemCard()\n        return\n    }\n    \n    Card(\n        modifier = Modifier\n            .fillMaxWidth()\n            .padding(16.dp),\n        elevation = 8.dp\n    ) {\n        Column(modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp)) {\n            // 商品基本信息\n            Row(\n                modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth(),\n                horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.SpaceBetween\n            ) {\n                Column(modifier = Modifier.weight(1f)) {\n                    Text(\n                        text = item.goodsName,\n                        style = MaterialTheme.typography.h6,\n                        maxLines = 2,\n                        overflow = TextOverflow.Ellipsis\n                    )\n                    Text(\n                        text = "SKU: ${item.sku}",\n                        style = MaterialTheme.typography.body2,\n                        color = MaterialTheme.colors.onSurface.copy(alpha = 0.7f)\n                    )\n                    if (item.specification != null) {\n                        Text(\n                            text = "规格: ${item.specification}",\n                            style = MaterialTheme.typography.caption\n                        )\n                    }\n                }\n                \n                // 语音播报按钮\n                IconButton(onClick = onSpeakClick) {\n                    Icon(\n                        Icons.Default.VolumeUp,\n                        contentDescription = "语音播报"\n                    )\n                }\n            }\n            \n            Divider(modifier = Modifier.padding(vertical = 8.dp))\n            \n            // 位置信息\n            if (item.locationCode != null) {\n                LocationInfoRow(\n                    locationCode = item.locationCode!!,\n                    locationName = item.locationName\n                )\n            }\n            \n            // 数量信息\n            QuantityInfoSection(\n                planned = item.plannedQuantity,\n                picked = item.pickedQuantity,\n                remaining = item.remainingQuantity\n            )\n            \n            // 批次信息\n            if (item.batch != null) {\n                BatchInfoRow(batch = item.batch!!)\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n@Composable\nfun LocationInfoRow(\n    locationCode: String,\n    locationName: String?\n) {\n    Row(\n        modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth(),\n        verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically\n    ) {\n        Icon(\n            Icons.Default.LocationOn,\n            contentDescription = "位置",\n            tint = MaterialTheme.colors.primary\n        )\n        Spacer(modifier = Modifier.width(8.dp))\n        Column {\n            Text(\n                text = "库位: $locationCode",\n                style = MaterialTheme.typography.subtitle1,\n                fontWeight = FontWeight.Bold\n            )\n            if (locationName != null) {\n                Text(\n                    text = locationName,\n                    style = MaterialTheme.typography.caption\n                )\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n@Composable\nfun QuantityInfoSection(\n    planned: Int,\n    picked: Int,\n    remaining: Int\n) {\n    Row(\n        modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth(),\n        horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.SpaceEvenly\n    ) {\n        QuantityInfoCard(\n            title = "计划",\n            value = planned.toString(),\n            color = MaterialTheme.colors.primary\n        )\n        QuantityInfoCard(\n            title = "已拣",\n            value = picked.toString(),\n            color = Color.Green\n        )\n        QuantityInfoCard(\n            title = "剩余",\n            value = remaining.toString(),\n            color = if (remaining > 0) Color.Orange else Color.Green\n        )\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 5.4 数量输入组件\n```kotlin\n@Composable\nfun QuantityInputSection(\n    quantity: String,\n    onQuantityChange: (String) -> Unit,\n    onIncrease: () -> Unit,\n    onDecrease: () -> Unit,\n    onQuickSelect: (Int) -> Unit\n) {\n    Card(\n        modifier = Modifier\n            .fillMaxWidth()\n            .padding(horizontal = 16.dp)\n    ) {\n        Column(modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp)) {\n            Text(\n                text = "拣货数量",\n                style = MaterialTheme.typography.subtitle1\n            )\n            \n            Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(8.dp))\n            \n            // 数量输入行\n            Row(\n                modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth(),\n                verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically,\n                horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.spacedBy(8.dp)\n            ) {\n                // 减少按钮\n                IconButton(\n                    onClick = onDecrease,\n                    modifier = Modifier.size(48.dp)\n                ) {\n                    Icon(Icons.Default.Remove, contentDescription = "减少")\n                }\n                \n                // 数量输入框\n                OutlinedTextField(\n                    value = quantity,\n                    onValueChange = onQuantityChange,\n                    modifier = Modifier.weight(1f),\n                    textStyle = TextStyle(\n                        fontSize = 24.sp,\n                        textAlign = TextAlign.Center\n                    ),\n                    keyboardOptions = KeyboardOptions(\n                        keyboardType = KeyboardType.Number\n                    ),\n                    singleLine = true\n                )\n                \n                // 增加按钮\n                IconButton(\n                    onClick = onIncrease,\n                    modifier = Modifier.size(48.dp)\n                ) {\n                    Icon(Icons.Default.Add, contentDescription = "增加")\n                }\n            }\n            \n            Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(16.dp))\n            \n            // 快捷数量按钮\n            LazyRow(\n                horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.spacedBy(8.dp)\n            ) {\n                items(listOf(1, 5, 10, 20, 50, 100)) { qty ->\n                    OutlinedButton(\n                        onClick = { onQuickSelect(qty) },\n                        modifier = Modifier.height(36.dp)\n                    ) {\n                        Text("$qty")\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 5.5 操作按钮组件\n```kotlin\n@Composable\nfun ActionButtonsSection(\n    onScanClick: () -> Unit,\n    onConfirmClick: () -> Unit,\n    onExceptionClick: () -> Unit,\n    onSkipClick: () -> Unit,\n    isScanning: Boolean,\n    canConfirm: Boolean\n) {\n    Card(\n        modifier = Modifier\n            .fillMaxWidth()\n            .padding(horizontal = 16.dp)\n    ) {\n        Column(modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp)) {\n            // 主要操作按钮\n            Row(\n                modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth(),\n                horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.spacedBy(8.dp)\n            ) {\n                // 扫码按钮\n                Button(\n                    onClick = onScanClick,\n                    modifier = Modifier.weight(1f),\n                    colors = ButtonDefaults.buttonColors(\n                        backgroundColor = if (isScanning) Color.Red else MaterialTheme.colors.secondary\n                    )\n                ) {\n                    Icon(\n                        if (isScanning) Icons.Default.Stop else Icons.Default.QrCodeScanner,\n                        contentDescription = if (isScanning) "停止扫码" else "扫码"\n                    )\n                    Spacer(modifier = Modifier.width(4.dp))\n                    Text(if (isScanning) "停止" else "扫码")\n                }\n                \n                // 确认按钮\n                Button(\n                    onClick = onConfirmClick,\n                    modifier = Modifier.weight(1f),\n                    enabled = canConfirm,\n                    colors = ButtonDefaults.buttonColors(\n                        backgroundColor = Color.Green\n                    )\n                ) {\n                    Icon(Icons.Default.Check, contentDescription = "确认")\n                    Spacer(modifier = Modifier.width(4.dp))\n                    Text("确认")\n                }\n            }\n            \n            Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(8.dp))\n            \n            // 辅助操作按钮\n            Row(\n                modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth(),\n                horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.spacedBy(8.dp)\n            ) {\n                // 异常按钮\n                OutlinedButton(\n                    onClick = onExceptionClick,\n                    modifier = Modifier.weight(1f),\n                    colors = ButtonDefaults.outlinedButtonColors(\n                        contentColor = MaterialTheme.colors.error\n                    )\n                ) {\n                    Icon(Icons.Default.Warning, contentDescription = "异常")\n                    Spacer(modifier = Modifier.width(4.dp))\n                    Text("异常")\n                }\n                \n                // 跳过按钮\n                OutlinedButton(\n                    onClick = onSkipClick,\n                    modifier = Modifier.weight(1f)\n                ) {\n                    Icon(Icons.Default.SkipNext, contentDescription = "跳过")\n                    Spacer(modifier = Modifier.width(4.dp))\n                    Text("跳过")\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 5.6 异常处理对话框\n```kotlin\n@Composable\nfun ExceptionDialog(\n    isVisible: Boolean,\n    currentItem: BulkPickingItem?,\n    onDismiss: () -> Unit,\n    onSubmit: (PickingExceptionRequest) -> Unit\n) {\n    if (!isVisible || currentItem == null) return\n    \n    var selectedType by remember { mutableStateOf<ExceptionType?>(null) }\n    var actualQuantity by remember { mutableStateOf("0") }\n    var description by remember { mutableStateOf("") }\n    var photos by remember { mutableStateOf<List<String>>(emptyList()) }\n    \n    AlertDialog(\n        onDismissRequest = onDismiss,\n        title = { Text("报告拣货异常") },\n        text = {\n            Column {\n                // 商品信息\n                Text(\n                    text = "${currentItem.goodsName} (${currentItem.sku})",\n                    style = MaterialTheme.typography.subtitle1\n                )\n                Text(\n                    text = "计划数量: ${currentItem.plannedQuantity}",\n                    style = MaterialTheme.typography.caption\n                )\n                \n                Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(16.dp))\n                \n                // 异常类型选择\n                Text("异常类型:")\n                ExceptionType.values().forEach { type ->\n                    Row(\n                        verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically\n                    ) {\n                        RadioButton(\n                            selected = selectedType == type,\n                            onClick = { selectedType = type }\n                        )\n                        Text(type.displayName)\n                    }\n                }\n                \n                Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(16.dp))\n                \n                // 实际数量\n                OutlinedTextField(\n                    value = actualQuantity,\n                    onValueChange = { actualQuantity = it },\n                    label = { Text("实际拣到数量") },\n                    keyboardOptions = KeyboardOptions(\n                        keyboardType = KeyboardType.Number\n                    )\n                )\n                \n                Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(16.dp))\n                \n                // 异常描述\n                OutlinedTextField(\n                    value = description,\n                    onValueChange = { description = it },\n                    label = { Text("异常描述") },\n                    maxLines = 3\n                )\n                \n                Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(16.dp))\n                \n                // 拍照按钮\n                Button(\n                    onClick = { /* 启动相机拍照 */ },\n                    modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth()\n                ) {\n                    Icon(Icons.Default.CameraAlt, contentDescription = "拍照")\n                    Spacer(modifier = Modifier.width(8.dp))\n                    Text("拍照记录")\n                }\n                \n                // 显示已拍照片数量\n                if (photos.isNotEmpty()) {\n                    Text("已拍摄 ${photos.size} 张照片")\n                }\n            }\n        },\n        confirmButton = {\n            Button(\n                onClick = {\n                    if (selectedType != null) {\n                        val request = PickingExceptionRequest(\n                            itemId = currentItem.id,\n                            goodsId = currentItem.goodsId,\n                            sku = currentItem.sku,\n                            exceptionType = selectedType!!,\n                            expectedQty = currentItem.plannedQuantity,\n                            actualQty = actualQuantity.toIntOrNull() ?: 0,\n                            description = description,\n                            operatorId = "current_user", // 从当前用户获取\n                            images = photos\n                        )\n                        onSubmit(request)\n                    }\n                },\n                enabled = selectedType != null && description.isNotBlank()\n            ) {\n                Text("提交")\n            }\n        },\n        dismissButton = {\n            TextButton(onClick = onDismiss) {\n                Text("取消")\n            }\n        }\n    )\n}\n```\n\n## 6. 扫码功能设计\n\n### 6.1 Sunmi扫码器集成\n```kotlin\nclass SunmiScannerService @Inject constructor() {\n    private var isScanning = false\n    private var scanCallback: ((String) -> Unit)? = null\n    \n    fun startScanning(callback: (String) -> Unit) {\n        isScanning = true\n        scanCallback = callback\n        // 集成Sunmi扫码器SDK\n        SunmiScannerManager.getInstance().startScan { result ->\n            callback(result)\n        }\n    }\n    \n    fun stopScanning() {\n        isScanning = false\n        scanCallback = null\n        SunmiScannerManager.getInstance().stopScan()\n    }\n    \n    fun handleScanResult(code: String) {\n        scanCallback?.invoke(code)\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 6.2 扫码结果处理\n```kotlin\nsuspend fun handleScanResult(code: String) {\n    _uiState.update { it.copy(scannedCode = code) }\n    \n    // 根据扫码内容判断类型\n    when (val scanType = determineScanType(code)) {\n        ScanType.GOODS_CODE -> {\n            // 商品条码，查找对应商品\n            val item = findItemBySku(code)\n            if (item != null) {\n                setCurrentItem(item)\n                speakItemInfo(item)\n            } else {\n                showError("未找到对应商品")\n            }\n        }\n        ScanType.LOCATION_CODE -> {\n            // 库位码，验证当前商品位置\n            validateLocation(code)\n        }\n        ScanType.QR_CODE -> {\n            // 二维码，可能包含多种信息\n            parseQRCodeContent(code)\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## 7. 语音功能设计\n\n### 7.1 语音播报\n```kotlin\nclass VoiceService @Inject constructor(\n    private val textToSpeech: TextToSpeech\n) {\n    fun speakItemInfo(item: BulkPickingItem) {\n        val text = "请拣货：${item.goodsName}，" +\n                  "数量：${item.plannedQuantity}，" +\n                  "库位：${item.locationCode ?: "未知"}"\n        textToSpeech.speak(text, TextToSpeech.QUEUE_FLUSH, null, null)\n    }\n    \n    fun speakQuantityConfirm(quantity: Int) {\n        val text = "已确认数量：$quantity"\n        textToSpeech.speak(text, TextToSpeech.QUEUE_ADD, null, null)\n    }\n    \n    fun speakException(type: ExceptionType) {\n        val text = "已报告异常：${type.displayName}"\n        textToSpeech.speak(text, TextToSpeech.QUEUE_ADD, null, null)\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## 8. 离线功能设计\n\n### 8.1 离线操作缓存\n```kotlin\n// 拣货确认离线缓存\nsuspend fun confirmQuantityOffline(\n    item: BulkPickingItem,\n    quantity: Int\n) {\n    // 更新本地状态\n    updateLocalItemStatus(item.id, quantity)\n    \n    // 缓存离线操作\n    val operation = OfflineOperation(\n        type = OperationType.SINGLE_PICKING,\n        outboundId = outboundId,\n        payload = gson.toJson(\n            SinglePickingRequest(\n                outboundId = outboundId,\n                itemId = item.id,\n                goodsId = item.goodsId,\n                sku = item.sku,\n                pickedQty = quantity,\n                operatorId = getCurrentUserId()\n            )\n        )\n    )\n    \n    repository.cacheOfflineOperation(operation)\n    \n    // 更新UI状态\n    _uiState.update { \n        it.copy(pendingOperations = it.pendingOperations + 1)\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 8.2 数据同步\n```kotlin\nsuspend fun syncPendingOperations() {\n    if (!repository.isNetworkAvailable()) return\n    \n    val result = repository.syncOfflineOperations()\n    when (result) {\n        is ApiResult.Success -> {\n            _uiState.update { \n                it.copy(\n                    pendingOperations = result.data.failedCount,\n                    isOffline = false\n                )\n            }\n        }\n        is ApiResult.Error -> {\n            // 同步失败，保持离线状态\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## 9. 性能优化\n\n### 9.1 UI响应优化\n- **防抖处理**: 扫码结果防抖\n- **状态缓存**: 缓存计算结果\n- **懒加载**: 按需加载数据\n\n### 9.2 扫码优化\n- **连续扫码**: 快速连续扫码处理\n- **去重处理**: 避免重复扫码\n- **错误恢复**: 扫码失败自动重试\n\n## 10. 用户体验设计\n\n### 10.1 操作流畅性\n- **手势支持**: 滑动切换商品\n- **键盘快捷键**: 外接键盘支持\n- **触觉反馈**: 重要操作震动反馈\n\n### 10.2 视觉反馈\n- **状态动画**: 平滑的状态切换\n- **进度动画**: 动态进度更新\n- **成功提示**: 操作成功动画\n\n## 11. 测试策略\n\n### 11.1 功能测试\n- **扫码测试**: 各种条码类型测试\n- **网络测试**: 在线/离线模式测试\n- **异常测试**: 异常流程测试\n\n### 11.2 性能测试\n- **响应时间**: 操作响应速度\n- **内存使用**: 长时间使用内存测试\n- **电池消耗**: 扫码功能耗电测试\n\n## 12. 实现计划\n\n### 12.1 开发阶段\n1. **基础框架**: ViewModel + 扫码集成 (6h)\n2. **UI组件**: 核心UI组件开发 (10h)\n3. **扫码功能**: Sunmi扫码器集成 (6h)\n4. **语音功能**: TTS语音播报 (4h)\n5. **离线支持**: 离线模式实现 (6h)\n6. **异常处理**: 异常报告和处理 (4h)\n7. **测试优化**: 测试和性能优化 (4h)\n\n### 12.2 总工时估算\n- **预估总工时**: 36-40小时\n- **核心功能**: 26-30小时\n- **优化完善**: 10小时\n\n## 13. 风险和解决方案\n\n### 13.1 技术风险\n- **扫码稳定性**: 设备兼容性问题\n- **性能风险**: 连续扫码性能\n- **同步冲突**: 离线数据冲突\n\n### 13.2 解决策略\n- **设备适配**: 多设备兼容测试\n- **性能监控**: 实时性能监控\n- **冲突解决**: 智能冲突处理机制\n\n该实现方案为拣货作业页面提供了完整的功能设计和技术架构，确保高效、准确的拣货作业体验。	110	2025-09-21 09:23:15.477058	2025-09-21 09:23:15.477058	\N	110	markdown	draft	\N	\N	private	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N		1	\N	{}	f	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N
1148	1	离线功能开发实现方案	# 离线功能开发实现方案\n\n## 1. 功能概述\n\n离线功能是散货出库模块的重要特性，确保在网络不稳定或断网环境下，拣货作业能够正常进行，并在网络恢复后自动同步数据，保证业务连续性。\n\n## 2. 核心需求\n\n### 2.1 离线工作能力\n- **完全离线操作**: 断网情况下正常使用\n- **数据本地存储**: 本地缓存所有必要数据\n- **操作记录**: 记录所有离线操作\n- **状态管理**: 维护离线状态和进度\n\n### 2.2 数据同步能力\n- **自动同步**: 网络恢复时自动同步\n- **冲突检测**: 识别数据冲突\n- **冲突解决**: 智能冲突处理策略\n- **增量同步**: 仅同步变更数据\n\n### 2.3 用户体验\n- **离线指示**: 清晰的离线状态提示\n- **操作反馈**: 离线操作成功提示\n- **同步进度**: 同步过程可视化\n- **错误处理**: 友好的错误提示和恢复\n\n## 3. 技术架构\n\n### 3.1 整体架构\n```\nOffline Manager\n├── NetworkMonitor (网络监听)\n├── OfflineStorage (离线存储)\n├── SyncEngine (同步引擎)\n├── ConflictResolver (冲突解决器)\n├── CacheManager (缓存管理器)\n└── UI Components\n    ├── OfflineIndicator\n    ├── SyncProgressDialog\n    └── ConflictResolutionDialog\n```\n\n### 3.2 数据流架构\n```\nUI Layer\n    ↓\nRepository Layer (离线优先)\n    ↓\nLocal Storage ← → Sync Engine ← → Remote API\n    ↓                ↓               ↓\nSQLite DB      Conflict Resolver   Server\n```\n\n## 4. 网络监听服务\n\n### 4.1 网络状态监听\n```kotlin\n@Singleton\nclass NetworkMonitor @Inject constructor(\n    @ApplicationContext private val context: Context\n) {\n    private val connectivityManager = context.getSystemService(Context.CONNECTIVITY_SERVICE) as ConnectivityManager\n    \n    private val _networkState = MutableStateFlow(NetworkState.UNKNOWN)\n    val networkState: StateFlow<NetworkState> = _networkState.asStateFlow()\n    \n    private val networkCallback = object : ConnectivityManager.NetworkCallback() {\n        override fun onAvailable(network: Network) {\n            _networkState.value = NetworkState.CONNECTED\n        }\n        \n        override fun onLost(network: Network) {\n            _networkState.value = NetworkState.DISCONNECTED\n        }\n        \n        override fun onCapabilitiesChanged(\n            network: Network,\n            networkCapabilities: NetworkCapabilities\n        ) {\n            val hasInternet = networkCapabilities.hasCapability(\n                NetworkCapabilities.NET_CAPABILITY_INTERNET\n            )\n            _networkState.value = if (hasInternet) {\n                NetworkState.CONNECTED\n            } else {\n                NetworkState.LIMITED\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    \n    fun startMonitoring() {\n        val request = NetworkRequest.Builder()\n            .addCapability(NetworkCapabilities.NET_CAPABILITY_INTERNET)\n            .build()\n        connectivityManager.registerNetworkCallback(request, networkCallback)\n        \n        // 初始状态检查\n        _networkState.value = getCurrentNetworkState()\n    }\n    \n    fun stopMonitoring() {\n        connectivityManager.unregisterNetworkCallback(networkCallback)\n    }\n    \n    private fun getCurrentNetworkState(): NetworkState {\n        val network = connectivityManager.activeNetwork ?: return NetworkState.DISCONNECTED\n        val capabilities = connectivityManager.getNetworkCapabilities(network) ?: return NetworkState.DISCONNECTED\n        \n        return if (capabilities.hasCapability(NetworkCapabilities.NET_CAPABILITY_INTERNET)) {\n            NetworkState.CONNECTED\n        } else {\n            NetworkState.LIMITED\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nenum class NetworkState {\n    CONNECTED,      // 网络正常\n    DISCONNECTED,   // 网络断开\n    LIMITED,        // 网络受限\n    UNKNOWN         // 未知状态\n}\n```\n\n### 4.2 网络状态响应\n```kotlin\nclass OfflineManager @Inject constructor(\n    private val networkMonitor: NetworkMonitor,\n    private val syncEngine: SyncEngine,\n    private val repository: BulkOutboundRepository\n) {\n    \n    fun initialize() {\n        // 监听网络状态变化\n        GlobalScope.launch {\n            networkMonitor.networkState.collect { state ->\n                when (state) {\n                    NetworkState.CONNECTED -> {\n                        // 网络恢复，启动自动同步\n                        handleNetworkReconnected()\n                    }\n                    NetworkState.DISCONNECTED -> {\n                        // 网络断开，进入离线模式\n                        handleNetworkDisconnected()\n                    }\n                    else -> {\n                        // 其他状态处理\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    \n    private suspend fun handleNetworkReconnected() {\n        Timber.d("网络已恢复，开始同步离线数据")\n        \n        // 检查是否有待同步数据\n        if (repository.hasPendingSyncData()) {\n            syncEngine.startAutoSync()\n        }\n    }\n    \n    private suspend fun handleNetworkDisconnected() {\n        Timber.d("网络已断开，进入离线模式")\n        \n        // 停止正在进行的同步\n        syncEngine.stopSync()\n        \n        // 通知UI进入离线模式\n        notifyOfflineMode()\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## 5. 离线数据存储\n\n### 5.1 缓存策略\n```kotlin\n@Singleton\nclass CacheManager @Inject constructor(\n    private val database: BulkOutboundDatabase,\n    private val preferences: SharedPreferences\n) {\n    \n    companion object {\n        private const val CACHE_RETENTION_DAYS = 7\n        private const val LAST_SYNC_TIME_KEY = "last_sync_time"\n        private const val OFFLINE_MODE_KEY = "offline_mode"\n    }\n    \n    // 预缓存数据\n    suspend fun preloadEssentialData(warehouseId: String) {\n        try {\n            // 缓存当前仓库的所有待拣货订单\n            val orders = apiService.getBulkOutboundOrders(\n                warehouseId = warehouseId,\n                status = "pending,picking"\n            )\n            \n            orders.onSuccess { response ->\n                // 缓存订单列表\n                response.orders.forEach { orderSummary ->\n                    // 获取完整订单详情并缓存\n                    val detailResult = apiService.getBulkOutboundDetail(orderSummary.id)\n                    detailResult.onSuccess { order ->\n                        database.bulkOutboundDao().insertOutboundOrder(order)\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            \n            updateLastSyncTime()\n        } catch (e: Exception) {\n            Timber.e(e, "预缓存数据失败")\n        }\n    }\n    \n    // 清理过期缓存\n    suspend fun cleanupExpiredCache() {\n        val cutoffTime = System.currentTimeMillis() - (CACHE_RETENTION_DAYS * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000L)\n        database.bulkOutboundDao().deleteExpiredOrders(cutoffTime)\n        database.offlineOperationDao().deleteOperationsBefore(cutoffTime)\n    }\n    \n    // 获取缓存统计\n    suspend fun getCacheStats(): CacheStats {\n        return database.bulkOutboundDao().getCacheStats()\n    }\n    \n    private fun updateLastSyncTime() {\n        preferences.edit()\n            .putLong(LAST_SYNC_TIME_KEY, System.currentTimeMillis())\n            .apply()\n    }\n    \n    fun getLastSyncTime(): Long {\n        return preferences.getLong(LAST_SYNC_TIME_KEY, 0)\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 5.2 离线操作队列\n```kotlin\n@Singleton\nclass OfflineOperationQueue @Inject constructor(\n    private val dao: OfflineOperationDao,\n    private val gson: Gson\n) {\n    \n    // 添加离线操作\n    suspend fun enqueueOperation(\n        type: OperationType,\n        outboundId: String,\n        payload: Any\n    ): String {\n        val operation = OfflineOperation(\n            type = type,\n            outboundId = outboundId,\n            payload = gson.toJson(payload),\n            timestamp = System.currentTimeMillis()\n        )\n        \n        dao.insertOperation(operation)\n        Timber.d("已添加离线操作: ${operation.type} for $outboundId")\n        \n        return operation.id\n    }\n    \n    // 获取待同步操作\n    suspend fun getPendingOperations(): List<OfflineOperation> {\n        return dao.getPendingOperations()\n    }\n    \n    // 标记操作为已同步\n    suspend fun markOperationSynced(operationId: String) {\n        dao.markOperationSynced(operationId)\n    }\n    \n    // 标记操作失败\n    suspend fun markOperationFailed(operationId: String) {\n        dao.incrementRetryCount(operationId)\n    }\n    \n    // 删除已完成操作\n    suspend fun cleanupCompletedOperations() {\n        dao.deleteSyncedOperations()\n    }\n    \n    // 获取操作统计\n    suspend fun getOperationStats(): OperationStats {\n        return dao.getOperationStats()\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## 6. 数据同步引擎\n\n### 6.1 同步引擎核心\n```kotlin\n@Singleton\nclass SyncEngine @Inject constructor(\n    private val repository: BulkOutboundRepository,\n    private val operationQueue: OfflineOperationQueue,\n    private val conflictResolver: ConflictResolver,\n    private val networkMonitor: NetworkMonitor\n) {\n    \n    private val _syncState = MutableStateFlow(SyncState.IDLE)\n    val syncState: StateFlow<SyncState> = _syncState.asStateFlow()\n    \n    private val _syncProgress = MutableStateFlow(SyncProgress())\n    val syncProgress: StateFlow<SyncProgress> = _syncProgress.asStateFlow()\n    \n    // 自动同步\n    suspend fun startAutoSync() {\n        if (_syncState.value != SyncState.IDLE) {\n            Timber.w("同步已在进行中，跳过自动同步")\n            return\n        }\n        \n        startSync(isAutoSync = true)\n    }\n    \n    // 手动同步\n    suspend fun startManualSync() {\n        startSync(isAutoSync = false)\n    }\n    \n    private suspend fun startSync(isAutoSync: Boolean) {\n        if (networkMonitor.networkState.value != NetworkState.CONNECTED) {\n            Timber.w("网络未连接，无法开始同步")\n            return\n        }\n        \n        _syncState.value = SyncState.SYNCING\n        \n        try {\n            val pendingOperations = operationQueue.getPendingOperations()\n            if (pendingOperations.isEmpty()) {\n                _syncState.value = SyncState.COMPLETED\n                return\n            }\n            \n            _syncProgress.value = SyncProgress(\n                total = pendingOperations.size,\n                completed = 0,\n                failed = 0\n            )\n            \n            // 按类型和时间排序操作\n            val sortedOperations = pendingOperations.sortedWith(\n                compareBy<OfflineOperation> { it.type.priority }\n                    .thenBy { it.timestamp }\n            )\n            \n            var completed = 0\n            var failed = 0\n            \n            for (operation in sortedOperations) {\n                try {\n                    val result = syncSingleOperation(operation)\n                    if (result.isSuccess) {\n                        operationQueue.markOperationSynced(operation.id)\n                        completed++\n                    } else {\n                        // 检查是否需要冲突解决\n                        if (result.isConflict) {\n                            handleSyncConflict(operation, result)\n                        } else {\n                            operationQueue.markOperationFailed(operation.id)\n                            failed++\n                        }\n                    }\n                } catch (e: Exception) {\n                    Timber.e(e, "同步操作失败: ${operation.id}")\n                    operationQueue.markOperationFailed(operation.id)\n                    failed++\n                }\n                \n                // 更新进度\n                _syncProgress.value = SyncProgress(\n                    total = pendingOperations.size,\n                    completed = completed,\n                    failed = failed\n                )\n            }\n            \n            _syncState.value = SyncState.COMPLETED\n            \n            // 清理已完成的操作\n            operationQueue.cleanupCompletedOperations()\n            \n        } catch (e: Exception) {\n            Timber.e(e, "同步过程出错")\n            _syncState.value = SyncState.FAILED\n        }\n    }\n    \n    private suspend fun syncSingleOperation(operation: OfflineOperation): SyncResult {\n        return when (operation.type) {\n            OperationType.START_PICKING -> {\n                val request = gson.fromJson(operation.payload, StartPickingRequest::class.java)\n                repository.startPicking(\n                    operation.outboundId,\n                    request.operatorId,\n                    request.operatorName,\n                    request.deviceId\n                ).toSyncResult()\n            }\n            OperationType.SINGLE_PICKING -> {\n                val request = gson.fromJson(operation.payload, SinglePickingRequest::class.java)\n                repository.confirmSinglePicking(operation.outboundId, request).toSyncResult()\n            }\n            OperationType.BATCH_PICKING -> {\n                val request = gson.fromJson(operation.payload, BatchPickingRequest::class.java)\n                repository.confirmBatchPicking(operation.outboundId, request).toSyncResult()\n            }\n            OperationType.SUBMIT_EXCEPTION -> {\n                val request = gson.fromJson(operation.payload, PickingExceptionRequest::class.java)\n                repository.submitPickingException(operation.outboundId, request).toSyncResult()\n            }\n            OperationType.COMPLETE_PICKING -> {\n                val request = gson.fromJson(operation.payload, CompletePickingRequest::class.java)\n                repository.completePicking(operation.outboundId, request.operatorId, request.completionNote).toSyncResult()\n            }\n            else -> SyncResult.Success\n        }\n    }\n    \n    fun stopSync() {\n        _syncState.value = SyncState.CANCELLED\n    }\n}\n\n// 扩展函数：API结果转换为同步结果\nprivate fun <T> ApiResult<T>.toSyncResult(): SyncResult {\n    return when (this) {\n        is ApiResult.Success -> SyncResult.Success\n        is ApiResult.Error -> {\n            if (code == 409) { // 冲突状态码\n                SyncResult.Conflict(message)\n            } else {\n                SyncResult.Failed(message)\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nsealed class SyncResult {\n    object Success : SyncResult()\n    data class Failed(val message: String) : SyncResult()\n    data class Conflict(val message: String) : SyncResult()\n    \n    val isSuccess: Boolean get() = this is Success\n    val isConflict: Boolean get() = this is Conflict\n}\n\nenum class SyncState {\n    IDLE,       // 空闲\n    SYNCING,    // 同步中\n    COMPLETED,  // 已完成\n    FAILED,     // 失败\n    CANCELLED   // 已取消\n}\n\ndata class SyncProgress(\n    val total: Int = 0,\n    val completed: Int = 0,\n    val failed: Int = 0,\n    val current: String? = null\n) {\n    val progressRate: Float get() = if (total > 0) (completed + failed).toFloat() / total else 0f\n    val successRate: Float get() = if (total > 0) completed.toFloat() / total else 0f\n}\n```\n\n### 6.2 冲突解决器\n```kotlin\n@Singleton\nclass ConflictResolver @Inject constructor(\n    private val database: BulkOutboundDatabase,\n    private val repository: BulkOutboundRepository\n) {\n    \n    suspend fun resolveConflict(\n        operation: OfflineOperation,\n        conflictInfo: SyncResult.Conflict\n    ): ConflictResolution {\n        \n        return when (operation.type) {\n            OperationType.SINGLE_PICKING -> resolvePickingConflict(operation)\n            OperationType.BATCH_PICKING -> resolveBatchConflict(operation)\n            OperationType.SUBMIT_EXCEPTION -> resolveExceptionConflict(operation)\n            else -> ConflictResolution.UseLocal // 默认使用本地数据\n        }\n    }\n    \n    private suspend fun resolvePickingConflict(operation: OfflineOperation): ConflictResolution {\n        val localRequest = gson.fromJson(operation.payload, SinglePickingRequest::class.java)\n        \n        // 获取服务器最新数据\n        val serverOrder = repository.getBulkOutboundDetail(operation.outboundId, forceRefresh = true)\n        \n        return when (serverOrder) {\n            is ApiResult.Success -> {\n                val serverItem = serverOrder.data.items.find { it.id == localRequest.itemId }\n                \n                when {\n                    serverItem == null -> {\n                        // 服务器上商品不存在，丢弃本地操作\n                        ConflictResolution.Discard("商品在服务器上不存在")\n                    }\n                    serverItem.status == PickingItemStatus.COMPLETED -> {\n                        // 服务器上已完成，检查数量是否一致\n                        if (serverItem.pickedQuantity >= localRequest.pickedQty) {\n                            ConflictResolution.Discard("服务器上已完成更多数量")\n                        } else {\n                            ConflictResolution.Merge("合并拣货数量")\n                        }\n                    }\n                    else -> {\n                        // 使用本地数据，累加数量\n                        ConflictResolution.UseLocal\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            is ApiResult.Error -> {\n                // 无法获取服务器数据，保留本地操作\n                ConflictResolution.Retry("无法获取服务器数据，稍后重试")\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    \n    private suspend fun resolveBatchConflict(operation: OfflineOperation): ConflictResolution {\n        // 批量操作冲突解决逻辑\n        return ConflictResolution.UseLocal\n    }\n    \n    private suspend fun resolveExceptionConflict(operation: OfflineOperation): ConflictResolution {\n        // 异常报告冲突解决逻辑\n        return ConflictResolution.UseLocal\n    }\n}\n\nsealed class ConflictResolution {\n    object UseLocal : ConflictResolution()                    // 使用本地数据\n    object UseServer : ConflictResolution()                   // 使用服务器数据\n    data class Merge(val reason: String) : ConflictResolution()     // 合并数据\n    data class Discard(val reason: String) : ConflictResolution()   // 丢弃操作\n    data class Retry(val reason: String) : ConflictResolution()     // 稍后重试\n}\n```\n\n## 7. UI组件设计\n\n### 7.1 离线状态指示器\n```kotlin\n@Composable\nfun OfflineIndicator(\n    isOffline: Boolean,\n    pendingOperations: Int,\n    syncState: SyncState,\n    onSyncClick: () -> Unit\n) {\n    if (!isOffline && pendingOperations == 0 && syncState == SyncState.IDLE) {\n        return // 在线且无待同步数据时不显示\n    }\n    \n    Card(\n        modifier = Modifier\n            .fillMaxWidth()\n            .padding(horizontal = 16.dp, vertical = 4.dp),\n        backgroundColor = when {\n            isOffline -> Color.Orange.copy(alpha = 0.1f)\n            syncState == SyncState.SYNCING -> Color.Blue.copy(alpha = 0.1f)\n            else -> Color.Green.copy(alpha = 0.1f)\n        }\n    ) {\n        Row(\n            modifier = Modifier\n                .fillMaxWidth()\n                .padding(12.dp),\n            horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.SpaceBetween,\n            verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically\n        ) {\n            Row(verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically) {\n                Icon(\n                    imageVector = when {\n                        isOffline -> Icons.Default.CloudOff\n                        syncState == SyncState.SYNCING -> Icons.Default.Sync\n                        else -> Icons.Default.Cloud\n                    },\n                    contentDescription = null,\n                    tint = when {\n                        isOffline -> Color.Orange\n                        syncState == SyncState.SYNCING -> Color.Blue\n                        else -> Color.Green\n                    }\n                )\n                \n                Spacer(modifier = Modifier.width(8.dp))\n                \n                Column {\n                    Text(\n                        text = when {\n                            isOffline -> "离线模式"\n                            syncState == SyncState.SYNCING -> "同步中..."\n                            else -> "在线模式"\n                        },\n                        style = MaterialTheme.typography.subtitle2\n                    )\n                    \n                    if (pendingOperations > 0) {\n                        Text(\n                            text = "待同步: $pendingOperations 项操作",\n                            style = MaterialTheme.typography.caption,\n                            color = MaterialTheme.colors.onSurface.copy(alpha = 0.7f)\n                        )\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            \n            // 同步按钮\n            if (pendingOperations > 0 && syncState == SyncState.IDLE) {\n                OutlinedButton(\n                    onClick = onSyncClick,\n                    modifier = Modifier.height(32.dp)\n                ) {\n                    Text("同步", fontSize = 12.sp)\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 7.2 同步进度对话框\n```kotlin\n@Composable\nfun SyncProgressDialog(\n    isVisible: Boolean,\n    progress: SyncProgress,\n    onCancel: () -> Unit\n) {\n    if (!isVisible) return\n    \n    AlertDialog(\n        onDismissRequest = { /* 禁止点击外部关闭 */ },\n        title = { Text("数据同步中") },\n        text = {\n            Column {\n                // 总体进度\n                Text("正在同步离线操作...")\n                \n                Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(16.dp))\n                \n                // 进度条\n                LinearProgressIndicator(\n                    progress = progress.progressRate,\n                    modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth()\n                )\n                \n                Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(8.dp))\n                \n                // 详细信息\n                Row(\n                    modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth(),\n                    horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.SpaceBetween\n                ) {\n                    Text("总计: ${progress.total}")\n                    Text("完成: ${progress.completed}")\n                    Text("失败: ${progress.failed}")\n                }\n                \n                // 当前操作\n                if (progress.current != null) {\n                    Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(8.dp))\n                    Text(\n                        text = "当前: ${progress.current}",\n                        style = MaterialTheme.typography.caption\n                    )\n                }\n            }\n        },\n        confirmButton = { /* 同步中不显示确认按钮 */ },\n        dismissButton = {\n            TextButton(onClick = onCancel) {\n                Text("取消")\n            }\n        }\n    )\n}\n```\n\n### 7.3 冲突解决对话框\n```kotlin\n@Composable\nfun ConflictResolutionDialog(\n    isVisible: Boolean,\n    conflictInfo: ConflictInfo,\n    onResolutionSelected: (ConflictResolution) -> Unit,\n    onDismiss: () -> Unit\n) {\n    if (!isVisible) return\n    \n    AlertDialog(\n        onDismissRequest = onDismiss,\n        title = { Text("数据冲突") },\n        text = {\n            Column {\n                Text("检测到数据冲突，请选择处理方式:")\n                \n                Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(16.dp))\n                \n                // 冲突详情\n                Card(\n                    modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth(),\n                    backgroundColor = MaterialTheme.colors.error.copy(alpha = 0.1f)\n                ) {\n                    Column(modifier = Modifier.padding(12.dp)) {\n                        Text(\n                            text = "冲突操作: ${conflictInfo.operationType}",\n                            style = MaterialTheme.typography.subtitle2\n                        )\n                        Text(\n                            text = "描述: ${conflictInfo.description}",\n                            style = MaterialTheme.typography.caption\n                        )\n                    }\n                }\n                \n                Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(16.dp))\n                \n                // 解决方案选项\n                ConflictResolutionOptions(\n                    availableResolutions = conflictInfo.availableResolutions,\n                    onResolutionSelected = onResolutionSelected\n                )\n            }\n        },\n        confirmButton = { /* 在选项中处理 */ },\n        dismissButton = {\n            TextButton(onClick = onDismiss) {\n                Text("稍后处理")\n            }\n        }\n    )\n}\n\n@Composable\nfun ConflictResolutionOptions(\n    availableResolutions: List<ConflictResolutionOption>,\n    onResolutionSelected: (ConflictResolution) -> Unit\n) {\n    Column {\n        availableResolutions.forEach { option ->\n            Card(\n                modifier = Modifier\n                    .fillMaxWidth()\n                    .padding(vertical = 2.dp)\n                    .clickable { onResolutionSelected(option.resolution) }\n            ) {\n                Row(\n                    modifier = Modifier.padding(12.dp),\n                    verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically\n                ) {\n                    Icon(\n                        imageVector = option.icon,\n                        contentDescription = null,\n                        tint = option.color\n                    )\n                    Spacer(modifier = Modifier.width(12.dp))\n                    Column {\n                        Text(\n                            text = option.title,\n                            style = MaterialTheme.typography.subtitle2\n                        )\n                        Text(\n                            text = option.description,\n                            style = MaterialTheme.typography.caption\n                        )\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\ndata class ConflictInfo(\n    val operationType: String,\n    val description: String,\n    val availableResolutions: List<ConflictResolutionOption>\n)\n\ndata class ConflictResolutionOption(\n    val resolution: ConflictResolution,\n    val title: String,\n    val description: String,\n    val icon: ImageVector,\n    val color: Color\n)\n```\n\n## 8. 离线操作优先级\n\n### 8.1 操作优先级定义\n```kotlin\n// 为操作类型添加优先级\nval OperationType.priority: Int\n    get() = when (this) {\n        OperationType.START_PICKING -> 1      // 开始拣货优先级最高\n        OperationType.SINGLE_PICKING -> 2     // 单个拣货确认\n        OperationType.BATCH_PICKING -> 2      // 批量拣货确认\n        OperationType.SUBMIT_EXCEPTION -> 3   // 异常提交\n        OperationType.RESOLVE_EXCEPTION -> 4  // 异常解决\n        OperationType.COMPLETE_PICKING -> 5   // 完成拣货优先级最低\n        OperationType.UPDATE_STATUS -> 6      // 状态更新\n    }\n```\n\n### 8.2 智能合并策略\n```kotlin\nclass OperationMerger {\n    \n    // 合并相同商品的多次拣货操作\n    fun mergePickingOperations(operations: List<OfflineOperation>): List<OfflineOperation> {\n        val mergedOperations = mutableListOf<OfflineOperation>()\n        val pickingGroups = operations\n            .filter { it.type == OperationType.SINGLE_PICKING }\n            .groupBy { operation ->\n                val request = gson.fromJson(operation.payload, SinglePickingRequest::class.java)\n                "${operation.outboundId}:${request.itemId}"\n            }\n        \n        pickingGroups.forEach { (key, groupOperations) ->\n            if (groupOperations.size > 1) {\n                // 合并多个拣货操作\n                val totalQuantity = groupOperations.sumOf { operation ->\n                    val request = gson.fromJson(operation.payload, SinglePickingRequest::class.java)\n                    request.pickedQty\n                }\n                \n                val latestOperation = groupOperations.maxByOrNull { it.timestamp }!!\n                val latestRequest = gson.fromJson(latestOperation.payload, SinglePickingRequest::class.java)\n                \n                val mergedRequest = latestRequest.copy(pickedQty = totalQuantity)\n                val mergedOperation = latestOperation.copy(\n                    payload = gson.toJson(mergedRequest)\n                )\n                \n                mergedOperations.add(mergedOperation)\n            } else {\n                mergedOperations.add(groupOperations.first())\n            }\n        }\n        \n        // 添加其他类型的操作\n        mergedOperations.addAll(\n            operations.filter { it.type != OperationType.SINGLE_PICKING }\n        )\n        \n        return mergedOperations\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## 9. 性能优化\n\n### 9.1 批量同步优化\n```kotlin\nclass BatchSyncOptimizer {\n    \n    suspend fun optimizeSyncBatch(operations: List<OfflineOperation>): List<SyncBatch> {\n        val batches = mutableListOf<SyncBatch>()\n        \n        // 按出库单分组\n        val operationsByOrder = operations.groupBy { it.outboundId }\n        \n        operationsByOrder.forEach { (outboundId, orderOperations) ->\n            // 检查是否可以批量处理\n            val pickingOperations = orderOperations.filter { \n                it.type in listOf(OperationType.SINGLE_PICKING, OperationType.BATCH_PICKING)\n            }\n            \n            if (pickingOperations.size > 3) {\n                // 创建批量拣货请求\n                val batchRequest = createBatchPickingRequest(pickingOperations)\n                batches.add(SyncBatch.BatchOperation(outboundId, batchRequest, pickingOperations))\n            } else {\n                // 单独处理\n                pickingOperations.forEach { operation ->\n                    batches.add(SyncBatch.SingleOperation(operation))\n                }\n            }\n            \n            // 添加其他操作\n            orderOperations.filter { it.type !in listOf(OperationType.SINGLE_PICKING, OperationType.BATCH_PICKING) }\n                .forEach { operation ->\n                    batches.add(SyncBatch.SingleOperation(operation))\n                }\n        }\n        \n        return batches\n    }\n    \n    private fun createBatchPickingRequest(operations: List<OfflineOperation>): BatchPickingRequest {\n        val items = operations.map { operation ->\n            val request = gson.fromJson(operation.payload, SinglePickingRequest::class.java)\n            request.toConfirmItem()\n        }\n        \n        return BatchPickingRequest(\n            items = items,\n            operatorId = "current_user", // 从操作中获取\n            timestamp = getCurrentTimeString()\n        )\n    }\n}\n\nsealed class SyncBatch {\n    data class SingleOperation(val operation: OfflineOperation) : SyncBatch()\n    data class BatchOperation(\n        val outboundId: String,\n        val batchRequest: BatchPickingRequest,\n        val originalOperations: List<OfflineOperation>\n    ) : SyncBatch()\n}\n```\n\n### 9.2 增量同步\n```kotlin\nclass IncrementalSyncManager {\n    \n    private fun getLastSyncTimestamp(): Long {\n        return preferences.getLong("last_sync_timestamp", 0)\n    }\n    \n    private fun updateLastSyncTimestamp() {\n        preferences.edit()\n            .putLong("last_sync_timestamp", System.currentTimeMillis())\n            .apply()\n    }\n    \n    suspend fun performIncrementalSync() {\n        val lastSyncTime = getLastSyncTimestamp()\n        \n        // 只同步上次同步后的操作\n        val pendingOperations = dao.getOperationsAfter(lastSyncTime)\n        \n        if (pendingOperations.isNotEmpty()) {\n            syncEngine.syncOperations(pendingOperations)\n            updateLastSyncTimestamp()\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## 10. 错误处理和恢复\n\n### 10.1 错误分类处理\n```kotlin\nclass SyncErrorHandler {\n    \n    fun handleSyncError(error: SyncError): ErrorHandlingStrategy {\n        return when (error.type) {\n            SyncErrorType.NETWORK_ERROR -> {\n                ErrorHandlingStrategy.Retry(\n                    maxRetries = 3,\n                    backoffDelay = 5000L\n                )\n            }\n            SyncErrorType.SERVER_ERROR -> {\n                when (error.httpCode) {\n                    in 500..599 -> ErrorHandlingStrategy.Retry(maxRetries = 2)\n                    409 -> ErrorHandlingStrategy.ResolveConflict\n                    404 -> ErrorHandlingStrategy.Discard("资源不存在")\n                    else -> ErrorHandlingStrategy.Fail("服务器错误")\n                }\n            }\n            SyncErrorType.DATA_ERROR -> {\n                ErrorHandlingStrategy.Discard("数据格式错误")\n            }\n            SyncErrorType.PERMISSION_ERROR -> {\n                ErrorHandlingStrategy.Fail("权限不足")\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nsealed class ErrorHandlingStrategy {\n    data class Retry(val maxRetries: Int, val backoffDelay: Long = 1000L) : ErrorHandlingStrategy()\n    object ResolveConflict : ErrorHandlingStrategy()\n    data class Discard(val reason: String) : ErrorHandlingStrategy()\n    data class Fail(val reason: String) : ErrorHandlingStrategy()\n}\n```\n\n## 11. 测试策略\n\n### 11.1 离线功能测试\n```kotlin\n@Test\nfun testOfflinePickingOperation() = runTest {\n    // 模拟网络断开\n    networkMonitor.setNetworkState(NetworkState.DISCONNECTED)\n    \n    // 执行拣货操作\n    val result = viewModel.confirmQuantity(10)\n    \n    // 验证操作被缓存\n    assertTrue(result.isSuccess)\n    assertEquals(1, operationQueue.getPendingOperations().size)\n    \n    // 模拟网络恢复\n    networkMonitor.setNetworkState(NetworkState.CONNECTED)\n    \n    // 验证自动同步\n    syncEngine.startAutoSync()\n    advanceUntilIdle()\n    \n    // 验证操作已同步\n    assertEquals(0, operationQueue.getPendingOperations().size)\n}\n```\n\n### 11.2 冲突解决测试\n```kotlin\n@Test\nfun testConflictResolution() = runTest {\n    // 创建冲突场景\n    val localOperation = createPickingOperation(itemId = "item1", quantity = 5)\n    operationQueue.enqueueOperation(localOperation)\n    \n    // 模拟服务器状态\n    mockServer.setItemStatus("item1", PickingItemStatus.COMPLETED, pickedQuantity = 3)\n    \n    // 执行同步\n    val result = syncEngine.syncSingleOperation(localOperation)\n    \n    // 验证冲突检测\n    assertTrue(result.isConflict)\n    \n    // 验证冲突解决\n    val resolution = conflictResolver.resolveConflict(localOperation, result as SyncResult.Conflict)\n    assertEquals(ConflictResolution.Merge::class, resolution::class)\n}\n```\n\n## 12. 实现计划\n\n### 12.1 开发阶段\n1. **网络监听**: 网络状态监听和响应 (6h)\n2. **离线存储**: 缓存管理和操作队列 (8h)\n3. **同步引擎**: 核心同步逻辑实现 (12h)\n4. **冲突解决**: 冲突检测和解决机制 (10h)\n5. **UI组件**: 离线状态指示和同步界面 (8h)\n6. **性能优化**: 批量同步和增量同步 (6h)\n7. **测试**: 全面的离线功能测试 (8h)\n\n### 12.2 总工时估算\n- **预估总工时**: 50-58小时\n- **核心功能**: 36-42小时\n- **优化测试**: 14-16小时\n\n## 13. 风险和解决方案\n\n### 13.1 主要风险\n- **数据一致性**: 离线期间数据冲突\n- **存储空间**: 大量离线数据占用\n- **同步性能**: 大量操作同步延迟\n- **电池消耗**: 频繁同步耗电\n\n### 13.2 解决策略\n- **版本控制**: 数据版本和时间戳管理\n- **清理策略**: 定期清理过期数据\n- **智能同步**: 根据网络状况调整同步策略\n- **后台限制**: 合理控制后台同步频率\n\n该实现方案提供了完整的离线功能架构，确保在各种网络条件下都能提供稳定可靠的用户体验。	110	2025-09-21 09:25:48.889015	2025-09