1186	129	任务文档	# 入库单详情界面开发 - 商品列表和数量录入\n\n## 📋 任务目标\n\n开发入库单详情界面，显示商品列表并支持数量录入，UI风格与散货出库保持一致。\n\n## 🎯 功能需求\n\n### 1. 界面布局\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ [←] 入库单: RK202309220001           │\n├─────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 📋 单据信息                          │\n│ 状态: 已审核 | 总计: 3种商品          │\n├─────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 📦 商品列表                          │\n│                                     │\n│ ┌─────────────────────────────────┐   │\n│ │ SKU001 - 商品A                   │   │\n│ │ 预期: 100 件                     │   │\n│ │ 实际: [___] 件    [✓确认]        │   │\n│ └─────────────────────────────────┘   │\n│                                     │\n│ ┌─────────────────────────────────┐   │\n│ │ SKU002 - 商品B                   │   │\n│ │ 预期: 50 件                      │   │\n│ │ 实际: [___] 件    [✓确认]        │   │\n│ └─────────────────────────────────┘   │\n│                                     │\n│ ┌─────────────────────────────────┐   │\n│ │        📤 完成入库                │   │\n│ └─────────────────────────────────┘   │\n└─────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### 2. UI组件要求\n\n**标题栏 (Toolbar)**\n- 使用与出库相同的样式\n- 左侧返回按钮，点击返回主界面\n- 标题显示："入库单: {入库单号}"\n- 背景色与出库保持一致\n\n**单据信息卡片**\n- 使用CardView，圆角和阴影与出库一致\n- 显示状态、商品总数等基本信息\n- 状态使用不同颜色标识\n\n**商品列表项**\n- RecyclerView + CardView布局\n- 商品信息：编码、名称\n- 数量信息：预期数量、实际数量输入框\n- 确认按钮：与出库按钮样式保持一致\n\n**完成按钮**\n- 固定在底部的主要按钮\n- 只有所有商品都确认后才可点击\n- 样式与出库"完成"按钮一致\n\n### 3. 数据显示逻辑\n\n**商品列表项状态**\n```kotlin\nenum class ItemStatus {\n    PENDING,    // 待录入 - 灰色\n    INPUTED,    // 已录入 - 蓝色\n    CONFIRMED   // 已确认 - 绿色\n}\n```\n\n**数量验证规则**\n- 必须为正数\n- 支持小数点后2位\n- 可以与预期数量不一致（差异允许）\n\n### 4. 交互逻辑\n\n**数量录入流程**\n1. 点击数量输入框\n2. 弹出数字键盘\n3. 输入实际数量\n4. 点击"确认"按钮\n5. 更新该项状态为已确认\n\n**完成入库流程**\n1. 检查所有商品是否已确认\n2. 收集所有商品的实际数量\n3. 调用完成入库API\n4. 显示成功提示并返回主界面\n\n## 💻 技术实现\n\n### 1. Activity结构\n```kotlin\nclass InboundDetailActivity : AppCompatActivity() {\n    private lateinit var rvItems: RecyclerView\n    private lateinit var btnComplete: Button\n    private lateinit var itemsAdapter: InboundItemsAdapter\n    \n    private var inboundData: InboundData? = null\n    private val apiService = InboundApiService()\n    \n    override fun onCreate(savedInstanceState: Bundle?) {\n        super.onCreate(savedInstanceState)\n        setContentView(R.layout.activity_inbound_detail)\n        \n        initViews()\n        loadData()\n        setupListeners()\n    }\n    \n    private fun initViews() {\n        setupToolbar()\n        setupRecyclerView()\n    }\n    \n    private fun loadData() {\n        inboundData = intent.getParcelableExtra("inbound_data")\n        inboundData?.let { data ->\n            updateUI(data)\n        }\n    }\n    \n    private fun updateUI(data: InboundData) {\n        // 更新单据信息\n        // 更新商品列表\n    }\n    \n    private fun completeInbound() {\n        // 完成入库逻辑\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 2. 适配器实现\n```kotlin\nclass InboundItemsAdapter(\n    private val items: MutableList<InboundItem>,\n    private val onItemConfirmed: (Int) -> Unit\n) : RecyclerView.Adapter<InboundItemsAdapter.ViewHolder>() {\n    \n    inner class ViewHolder(itemView: View) : RecyclerView.ViewHolder(itemView) {\n        val tvGoodsCode: TextView = itemView.findViewById(R.id.tv_goods_code)\n        val tvGoodsName: TextView = itemView.findViewById(R.id.tv_goods_name)\n        val tvExpectedQty: TextView = itemView.findViewById(R.id.tv_expected_qty)\n        val etActualQty: EditText = itemView.findViewById(R.id.et_actual_qty)\n        val btnConfirm: Button = itemView.findViewById(R.id.btn_confirm)\n        val ivStatus: ImageView = itemView.findViewById(R.id.iv_status)\n    }\n    \n    override fun onCreateViewHolder(parent: ViewGroup, viewType: Int): ViewHolder {\n        val view = LayoutInflater.from(parent.context)\n            .inflate(R.layout.item_inbound_goods, parent, false)\n        return ViewHolder(view)\n    }\n    \n    override fun onBindViewHolder(holder: ViewHolder, position: Int) {\n        val item = items[position]\n        \n        with(holder) {\n            tvGoodsCode.text = item.goods_code\n            tvGoodsName.text = item.name\n            tvExpectedQty.text = "预期: ${item.expected_qty} 件"\n            \n            // 设置实际数量\n            if (item.actual_qty > 0) {\n                etActualQty.setText(item.actual_qty.toString())\n            }\n            \n            // 设置确认按钮\n            btnConfirm.setOnClickListener {\n                val actualQty = etActualQty.text.toString().toDoubleOrNull()\n                if (actualQty != null && actualQty > 0) {\n                    item.actual_qty = actualQty\n                    onItemConfirmed(position)\n                    updateItemStatus(holder, true)\n                } else {\n                    showError("请输入有效数量")\n                }\n            }\n            \n            // 更新状态显示\n            updateItemStatus(holder, item.actual_qty > 0)\n        }\n    }\n    \n    private fun updateItemStatus(holder: ViewHolder, confirmed: Boolean) {\n        if (confirmed) {\n            holder.ivStatus.setImageResource(R.drawable.ic_check_green)\n            holder.btnConfirm.isEnabled = false\n            holder.btnConfirm.text = "已确认"\n        } else {\n            holder.ivStatus.setImageResource(R.drawable.ic_pending_gray)\n            holder.btnConfirm.isEnabled = true\n            holder.btnConfirm.text = "确认"\n        }\n    }\n    \n    override fun getItemCount() = items.size\n}\n```\n\n### 3. 布局文件\n\n**activity_inbound_detail.xml**\n```xml\n<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>\n<LinearLayout xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"\n    android:layout_width="match_parent"\n    android:layout_height="match_parent"\n    android:orientation="vertical"\n    android:background="@color/background_main">\n\n    <androidx.appcompat.widget.Toolbar\n        android:id="@+id/toolbar"\n        style="@style/AppTheme.Toolbar"\n        android:layout_width="match_parent"\n        android:layout_height="?attr/actionBarSize" />\n\n    <androidx.cardview.widget.CardView\n        android:layout_width="match_parent"\n        android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n        android:layout_margin="@dimen/margin_standard"\n        style="@style/Widget.App.CardView">\n\n        <LinearLayout\n            android:layout_width="match_parent"\n            android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n            android:orientation="vertical"\n            android:padding="@dimen/padding_standard">\n\n            <TextView\n                android:id="@+id/tv_inbound_info"\n                android:layout_width="match_parent"\n                android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                style="@style/TextAppearance.App.Body1" />\n\n        </LinearLayout>\n\n    </androidx.cardview.widget.CardView>\n\n    <androidx.recyclerview.widget.RecyclerView\n        android:id="@+id/rv_items"\n        android:layout_width="match_parent"\n        android:layout_height="0dp"\n        android:layout_weight="1"\n        android:layout_margin="@dimen/margin_standard" />\n\n    <Button\n        android:id="@+id/btn_complete"\n        style="@style/Widget.App.Button.Primary"\n        android:layout_width="match_parent"\n        android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n        android:layout_margin="@dimen/margin_standard"\n        android:text="完成入库"\n        android:enabled="false" />\n\n</LinearLayout>\n```\n\n**item_inbound_goods.xml**\n```xml\n<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>\n<androidx.cardview.widget.CardView xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"\n    android:layout_width="match_parent"\n    android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n    android:layout_marginBottom="@dimen/margin_small"\n    style="@style/Widget.App.CardView">\n\n    <LinearLayout\n        android:layout_width="match_parent"\n        android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n        android:orientation="vertical"\n        android:padding="@dimen/padding_standard">\n\n        <LinearLayout\n            android:layout_width="match_parent"\n            android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n            android:orientation="horizontal"\n            android:gravity="center_vertical">\n\n            <ImageView\n                android:id="@+id/iv_status"\n                android:layout_width="24dp"\n                android:layout_height="24dp"\n                android:src="@drawable/ic_pending_gray" />\n\n            <LinearLayout\n                android:layout_width="0dp"\n                android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                android:layout_weight="1"\n                android:layout_marginStart="@dimen/margin_small"\n                android:orientation="vertical">\n\n                <TextView\n                    android:id="@+id/tv_goods_code"\n                    android:layout_width="wrap_content"\n                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                    style="@style/TextAppearance.App.Subtitle2" />\n\n                <TextView\n                    android:id="@+id/tv_goods_name"\n                    android:layout_width="wrap_content"\n                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                    style="@style/TextAppearance.App.Body2" />\n\n                <TextView\n                    android:id="@+id/tv_expected_qty"\n                    android:layout_width="wrap_content"\n                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                    style="@style/TextAppearance.App.Caption" />\n\n            </LinearLayout>\n\n        </LinearLayout>\n\n        <LinearLayout\n            android:layout_width="match_parent"\n            android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n            android:layout_marginTop="@dimen/margin_small"\n            android:orientation="horizontal"\n            android:gravity="center_vertical">\n\n            <TextView\n                android:layout_width="wrap_content"\n                android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                android:text="实际:"\n                style="@style/TextAppearance.App.Body2" />\n\n            <EditText\n                android:id="@+id/et_actual_qty"\n                android:layout_width="0dp"\n                android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                android:layout_weight="1"\n                android:layout_marginStart="@dimen/margin_small"\n                android:layout_marginEnd="@dimen/margin_small"\n                android:hint="输入数量"\n                android:inputType="numberDecimal"\n                style="@style/Widget.App.EditText.Compact" />\n\n            <Button\n                android:id="@+id/btn_confirm"\n                android:layout_width="wrap_content"\n                android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                android:text="确认"\n                style="@style/Widget.App.Button.Secondary.Compact" />\n\n        </LinearLayout>\n\n    </LinearLayout>\n\n</androidx.cardview.widget.CardView>\n```\n\n## 📱 状态管理\n\n### 1. 商品确认状态追踪\n```kotlin\nprivate fun updateCompleteButtonState() {\n    val allConfirmed = itemsAdapter.items.all { it.actual_qty > 0 }\n    btnComplete.isEnabled = allConfirmed\n    \n    if (allConfirmed) {\n        btnComplete.text = "完成入库"\n        btnComplete.setBackgroundColor(getColor(R.color.primary))\n    } else {\n        btnComplete.text = "请先确认所有商品数量"\n        btnComplete.setBackgroundColor(getColor(R.color.disabled))\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 2. 数量差异提示\n```kotlin\nprivate fun showQuantityDifference(expected: Double, actual: Double) {\n    if (expected != actual) {\n        val difference = actual - expected\n        val message = if (difference > 0) {\n            "数量多了 ${difference} 件"\n        } else {\n            "数量少了 ${-difference} 件"\n        }\n        Toast.makeText(this, message, Toast.LENGTH_SHORT).show()\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## ⏱️ 时间安排\n\n- **界面布局实现**: 1天\n- **列表适配器开发**: 1天\n- **交互逻辑完善**: 1天\n- **状态管理和测试**: 0.5天\n\n## ✅ 验收标准\n\n- [ ] UI样式与出库详情页保持一致\n- [ ] 商品列表显示正确\n- [ ] 数量录入功能正常\n- [ ] 确认状态更新正确\n- [ ] 完成按钮状态管理正确\n- [ ] 数量差异提示友好\n- [ ] 通过功能测试	110	2025-09-22 13:02:33.121916	2025-09-22 13:02:33.121916	\N	110	markdown	draft	\N	\N	private	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N		1	\N	{}	f	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N
1187	129	任务文档	# 错误处理和用户反馈机制开发\n\n## 📋 任务目标\n\n建立完善的错误处理机制和用户反馈系统，确保应用在各种异常情况下都能提供友好的用户体验。\n\n## 🎯 错误处理策略\n\n### 1. 网络错误处理\n\n**网络异常类型**\n```kotlin\nsealed class NetworkError : Exception() {\n    object NoConnection : NetworkError()\n    object Timeout : NetworkError() \n    object ServerError : NetworkError()\n    data class HttpError(val code: Int, val message: String) : NetworkError()\n    data class ParseError(val cause: Throwable) : NetworkError()\n}\n```\n\n**网络状态检查**\n```kotlin\nclass NetworkManager(private val context: Context) {\n    \n    fun isNetworkAvailable(): Boolean {\n        val connectivityManager = context.getSystemService(Context.CONNECTIVITY_SERVICE) as ConnectivityManager\n        val network = connectivityManager.activeNetwork ?: return false\n        val capabilities = connectivityManager.getNetworkCapabilities(network) ?: return false\n        \n        return capabilities.hasTransport(NetworkCapabilities.TRANSPORT_WIFI) ||\n               capabilities.hasTransport(NetworkCapabilities.TRANSPORT_CELLULAR) ||\n               capabilities.hasTransport(NetworkCapabilities.TRANSPORT_ETHERNET)\n    }\n    \n    fun showNoNetworkDialog(activity: Activity) {\n        AlertDialog.Builder(activity)\n            .setTitle("网络连接异常")\n            .setMessage("请检查网络连接后重试")\n            .setPositiveButton("重试") { _, _ ->\n                // 重试逻辑\n            }\n            .setNegativeButton("取消") { dialog, _ ->\n                dialog.dismiss()\n            }\n            .show()\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 2. API错误处理\n\n**API响应错误码映射**\n```kotlin\nobject ErrorCodeMapper {\n    fun mapErrorMessage(code: Int, message: String): String {\n        return when (code) {\n            400 -> "请求参数错误：$message"\n            401 -> "登录已过期，请重新登录"\n            403 -> "无权限访问此功能"\n            404 -> "入库单不存在或已被删除"\n            500 -> "服务器内部错误，请稍后重试"\n            502 -> "服务暂时不可用"\n            503 -> "服务器维护中"\n            else -> message.ifEmpty { "未知错误" }\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**业务错误处理**\n```kotlin\nclass ApiErrorHandler {\n    fun handleApiError(error: Throwable, context: Context) {\n        when (error) {\n            is NetworkError.NoConnection -> {\n                showToast(context, "网络连接不可用，请检查网络设置")\n            }\n            is NetworkError.Timeout -> {\n                showToast(context, "网络连接超时，请重试")\n            }\n            is NetworkError.ServerError -> {\n                showToast(context, "服务器暂时不可用，请稍后重试")\n            }\n            is NetworkError.HttpError -> {\n                val message = ErrorCodeMapper.mapErrorMessage(error.code, error.message)\n                showToast(context, message)\n            }\n            is NetworkError.ParseError -> {\n                showToast(context, "数据解析错误，请重试")\n            }\n            else -> {\n                showToast(context, "操作失败：${error.message}")\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    \n    private fun showToast(context: Context, message: String) {\n        Toast.makeText(context, message, Toast.LENGTH_LONG).show()\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. 输入验证错误\n\n**入库单号验证**\n```kotlin\nobject InputValidator {\n    \n    fun validateInboundCode(code: String): ValidationResult {\n        return when {\n            code.isBlank() -> ValidationResult.Error("请输入入库单号")\n            code.length < 6 -> ValidationResult.Error("入库单号长度不能少于6位")\n            code.length > 20 -> ValidationResult.Error("入库单号长度不能超过20位")\n            !code.matches(Regex("^[A-Z0-9]+$")) -> ValidationResult.Error("入库单号只能包含大写字母和数字")\n            else -> ValidationResult.Success\n        }\n    }\n    \n    fun validateQuantity(quantity: String): ValidationResult {\n        return when {\n            quantity.isBlank() -> ValidationResult.Error("请输入数量")\n            quantity.toDoubleOrNull() == null -> ValidationResult.Error("请输入有效数字")\n            quantity.toDouble() <= 0 -> ValidationResult.Error("数量必须大于0")\n            quantity.toDouble() > 99999 -> ValidationResult.Error("数量不能超过99999")\n            else -> ValidationResult.Success\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nsealed class ValidationResult {\n    object Success : ValidationResult()\n    data class Error(val message: String) : ValidationResult()\n}\n```\n\n### 4. 用户反馈机制\n\n**Toast统一管理**\n```kotlin\nobject ToastManager {\n    private var currentToast: Toast? = null\n    \n    fun showSuccess(context: Context, message: String) {\n        showToast(context, message, R.drawable.ic_success, Color.GREEN)\n    }\n    \n    fun showError(context: Context, message: String) {\n        showToast(context, message, R.drawable.ic_error, Color.RED)\n    }\n    \n    fun showWarning(context: Context, message: String) {\n        showToast(context, message, R.drawable.ic_warning, Color.YELLOW)\n    }\n    \n    fun showInfo(context: Context, message: String) {\n        showToast(context, message, R.drawable.ic_info, Color.BLUE)\n    }\n    \n    private fun showToast(context: Context, message: String, iconRes: Int, color: Int) {\n        currentToast?.cancel()\n        \n        val toast = Toast.makeText(context, message, Toast.LENGTH_SHORT)\n        \n        // 自定义Toast布局（可选）\n        val layout = LayoutInflater.from(context).inflate(R.layout.custom_toast, null)\n        val icon = layout.findViewById<ImageView>(R.id.toast_icon)\n        val text = layout.findViewById<TextView>(R.id.toast_text)\n        \n        icon.setImageResource(iconRes)\n        icon.setColorFilter(color)\n        text.text = message\n        \n        toast.view = layout\n        toast.show()\n        \n        currentToast = toast\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**加载状态指示器**\n```kotlin\nclass LoadingDialog private constructor(private val context: Context) {\n    \n    private var dialog: AlertDialog? = null\n    \n    companion object {\n        fun create(context: Context): LoadingDialog {\n            return LoadingDialog(context)\n        }\n    }\n    \n    fun show(message: String = "加载中...") {\n        if (dialog?.isShowing == true) {\n            return\n        }\n        \n        val view = LayoutInflater.from(context).inflate(R.layout.dialog_loading, null)\n        val textView = view.findViewById<TextView>(R.id.tv_loading_message)\n        textView.text = message\n        \n        dialog = AlertDialog.Builder(context)\n            .setView(view)\n            .setCancelable(false)\n            .create()\n        \n        dialog?.show()\n    }\n    \n    fun hide() {\n        dialog?.dismiss()\n        dialog = null\n    }\n    \n    fun updateMessage(message: String) {\n        dialog?.findViewById<TextView>(R.id.tv_loading_message)?.text = message\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 5. 确认对话框\n\n**操作确认对话框**\n```kotlin\nobject ConfirmDialogHelper {\n    \n    fun showCompleteConfirm(\n        context: Context,\n        inboundCode: String,\n        totalItems: Int,\n        onConfirm: () -> Unit\n    ) {\n        AlertDialog.Builder(context)\n            .setTitle("确认完成入库")\n            .setMessage("入库单号：$inboundCode\\n商品总数：$totalItems 种\\n\\n确认完成入库操作吗？")\n            .setPositiveButton("确认") { _, _ ->\n                onConfirm()\n            }\n            .setNegativeButton("取消") { dialog, _ ->\n                dialog.dismiss()\n            }\n            .show()\n    }\n    \n    fun showQuantityDifferenceDialog(\n        context: Context,\n        differences: List<QuantityDifference>,\n        onConfirm: () -> Unit\n    ) {\n        val message = buildString {\n            appendLine("发现数量差异：")\n            differences.forEach { diff ->\n                appendLine("${diff.goodsName}: 预期${diff.expected}，实际${diff.actual}")\n            }\n            appendLine("\\n是否继续完成入库？")\n        }\n        \n        AlertDialog.Builder(context)\n            .setTitle("数量差异确认")\n            .setMessage(message)\n            .setPositiveButton("继续") { _, _ ->\n                onConfirm()\n            }\n            .setNegativeButton("返回修改") { dialog, _ ->\n                dialog.dismiss()\n            }\n            .show()\n    }\n}\n\ndata class QuantityDifference(\n    val goodsName: String,\n    val expected: Double,\n    val actual: Double\n)\n```\n\n### 6. 统一异常处理\n\n**全局异常处理器**\n```kotlin\nclass GlobalExceptionHandler private constructor() : Thread.UncaughtExceptionHandler {\n    \n    companion object {\n        fun setup(application: Application) {\n            Thread.setDefaultUncaughtExceptionHandler(GlobalExceptionHandler())\n        }\n    }\n    \n    override fun uncaughtException(t: Thread, e: Throwable) {\n        Log.e("GlobalException", "Uncaught exception", e)\n        \n        // 记录崩溃日志\n        CrashLogger.logCrash(e)\n        \n        // 友好提示用户\n        // 注意：这里不能直接操作UI，需要通过其他方式\n        \n        // 重启应用或退出\n        restartApp()\n    }\n    \n    private fun restartApp() {\n        // 重启应用逻辑\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 7. 日志记录\n\n**操作日志记录**\n```kotlin\nobject OperationLogger {\n    \n    fun logUserAction(action: String, details: Map<String, Any>) {\n        val logEntry = mapOf(\n            "timestamp" to System.currentTimeMillis(),\n            "action" to action,\n            "details" to details,\n            "user" to UserManager.getCurrentUser()?.username\n        )\n        \n        // 本地日志\n        Log.i("UserAction", "Action: $action, Details: $details")\n        \n        // 可选：上传到服务器\n        // LogUploader.uploadLog(logEntry)\n    }\n    \n    fun logError(error: Throwable, context: String) {\n        val logEntry = mapOf(\n            "timestamp" to System.currentTimeMillis(),\n            "error" to error.message,\n            "context" to context,\n            "stackTrace" to error.stackTraceToString()\n        )\n        \n        Log.e("AppError", "Error in $context", error)\n        \n        // 可选：上传错误日志\n        // ErrorReporter.reportError(logEntry)\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## 📱 实际应用示例\n\n### 1. 主界面错误处理\n```kotlin\nprivate fun queryInbound() {\n    val inboundCode = etInboundCode.text.toString().trim()\n    \n    // 输入验证\n    when (val result = InputValidator.validateInboundCode(inboundCode)) {\n        is ValidationResult.Error -> {\n            ToastManager.showError(this, result.message)\n            return\n        }\n        ValidationResult.Success -> {\n            // 继续执行\n        }\n    }\n    \n    // 网络检查\n    if (!NetworkManager(this).isNetworkAvailable()) {\n        NetworkManager(this).showNoNetworkDialog(this)\n        return\n    }\n    \n    // 显示加载\n    val loadingDialog = LoadingDialog.create(this)\n    loadingDialog.show("查询入库单...")\n    \n    // API调用\n    apiService.queryInbound(inboundCode) { result ->\n        runOnUiThread {\n            loadingDialog.hide()\n            \n            result.fold(\n                onSuccess = { data ->\n                    ToastManager.showSuccess(this, "查询成功")\n                    OperationLogger.logUserAction("query_inbound", mapOf("code" to inboundCode))\n                    startInboundDetailActivity(data)\n                },\n                onFailure = { error ->\n                    ApiErrorHandler().handleApiError(error, this)\n                    OperationLogger.logError(error, "query_inbound")\n                }\n            )\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 2. 详情页错误处理\n```kotlin\nprivate fun completeInbound() {\n    // 检查数量差异\n    val differences = checkQuantityDifferences()\n    \n    if (differences.isNotEmpty()) {\n        ConfirmDialogHelper.showQuantityDifferenceDialog(this, differences) {\n            performCompleteInbound()\n        }\n    } else {\n        ConfirmDialogHelper.showCompleteConfirm(\n            this, \n            inboundData.inbound_code, \n            inboundData.items.size\n        ) {\n            performCompleteInbound()\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## ⏱️ 时间安排\n\n- **错误处理框架搭建**: 1天\n- **用户反馈组件开发**: 0.5天\n- **验证和日志功能**: 0.5天\n- **集成测试和调试**: 1天\n\n## ✅ 验收标准\n\n- [ ] 网络错误处理完善\n- [ ] API错误映射正确\n- [ ] 输入验证功能正常\n- [ ] 用户反馈提示友好\n- [ ] 加载状态指示清晰\n- [ ] 确认对话框交互良好\n- [ ] 操作日志记录完整\n- [ ] 异常情况处理稳定	110	2025-09-22 13:03:21.989995	2025-09-22 13:03:21.98