1206	1	任务文档	# Modal关闭后ant-modal-wrap DOM残留问题修复\n\n## 问题描述\n\n用户反馈关闭Modal弹窗后，页面DOM中仍然残留 `ant-modal-wrap` 元素，这会导致：\n1. 内存泄漏\n2. DOM污染\n3. 潜在的性能问题\n4. 样式冲突风险\n\n## 问题分析\n\n通过深入调查发现多个根本原因：\n\n### 1. CSS强制显示问题\n在 `antd5-modal-fix.css` 中发现强制显示规则：\n```css\n.ant-modal-wrap:has(.ant-modal):not([style*="display: none"]),\n.ant-modal-wrap:has(.ant-modal-confirm):not([style*="display: none"]) {\n  display: flex !important;\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Portal渲染配置问题\n在 `EnterpriseUserManagementPage.tsx` 中发现：\n```typescript\ngetContainer={false}  // 错误配置\n```\n\n### 3. React.StrictMode影响\n项目使用了React.StrictMode，可能影响组件的正常清理流程。\n\n### 4. 缺乏主动清理机制\nAntd Modal在某些情况下不会自动清理DOM残留。\n\n## 解决方案\n\n### 1. 修复CSS规则 (`antd5-modal-fix.css`)\n\n**修改前：**\n```css\n.ant-modal-wrap:has(.ant-modal),\n.ant-modal-wrap:has(.ant-modal-confirm) {\n  display: flex !important;\n}\n```\n\n**修改后：**\n```css\n.ant-modal-wrap:has(.ant-modal):not([style*="display: none"]),\n.ant-modal-wrap:has(.ant-modal-confirm):not([style*="display: none"]) {\n  display: flex !important;\n}\n```\n\n**增加清理动画：**\n```css\n.ant-modal-wrap[style*="display: none"] {\n  pointer-events: none !important;\n  animation: modal-cleanup 0.1s ease-out forwards;\n}\n\n@keyframes modal-cleanup {\n  to {\n    opacity: 0;\n    visibility: hidden;\n  }\n}\n\n.ant-modal-wrap:empty,\n.ant-modal-wrap:not(:has(*)) {\n  display: none !important;\n  visibility: hidden !important;\n  pointer-events: none !important;\n}\n```\n\n### 2. 修复Portal配置 (`EnterpriseUserManagementPage.tsx`)\n\n**修改：**\n```typescript\n// 修改前\ngetContainer={false}\n\n// 修改后  \ngetContainer={() => document.body}\n```\n\n### 3. 创建Modal清理工具 (`utils/modalCleanup.ts`)\n\n创建了专用的Modal DOM清理工具：\n\n```typescript\n// 清理所有残留的Modal DOM元素\nexport const cleanupModalDOMs = (): void => {\n  // 清理空的ant-modal-wrap\n  const emptyWraps = document.querySelectorAll('.ant-modal-wrap:empty');\n  emptyWraps.forEach(wrap => wrap.remove());\n\n  // 清理没有内容的ant-modal-wrap\n  const allWraps = document.querySelectorAll('.ant-modal-wrap');\n  allWraps.forEach(wrap => {\n    const hasModal = wrap.querySelector('.ant-modal, .ant-modal-confirm');\n    const isHidden = wrap.style.display === 'none' || \n                     wrap.style.visibility === 'hidden';\n    \n    if (!hasModal || isHidden) {\n      wrap.remove();\n    }\n  });\n\n  // 清理残留的遮罩层\n  const orphanMasks = document.querySelectorAll('.ant-modal-mask');\n  orphanMasks.forEach(mask => {\n    const parentWrap = mask.closest('.ant-modal-wrap');\n    if (!parentWrap) {\n      mask.remove();\n    }\n  });\n};\n\n// 监听Modal状态变化并自动清理\nexport const setupModalCleanup = (): (() => void) => {\n  const observer = new MutationObserver((mutations) => {\n    let needsCleanup = false;\n    \n    mutations.forEach((mutation) => {\n      if (mutation.type === 'attributes' && \n          mutation.attributeName === 'style' &&\n          mutation.target instanceof HTMLElement) {\n        \n        const target = mutation.target;\n        if (target.classList.contains('ant-modal-wrap')) {\n          const isHidden = target.style.display === 'none';\n          if (isHidden) {\n            needsCleanup = true;\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    });\n    \n    if (needsCleanup) {\n      setTimeout(cleanupModalDOMs, 100);\n    }\n  });\n  \n  observer.observe(document.body, {\n    childList: true,\n    subtree: true,\n    attributes: true,\n    attributeFilter: ['style', 'class']\n  });\n  \n  return () => observer.disconnect();\n};\n```\n\n### 4. 集成到App.tsx\n\n在App.tsx中集成Modal清理系统：\n\n```typescript\nimport { setupModalCleanup } from './utils/modalCleanup';\n\nconst AppContent: React.FC = () => {\n  // 初始化Modal清理系统\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const cleanup = setupModalCleanup();\n    return cleanup;\n  }, []);\n  \n  // ... 其他代码\n};\n```\n\n## 文件修改清单\n\n1. **frontend/src/styles/antd5-modal-fix.css**\n   - 修复强制显示规则\n   - 添加清理动画\n   - 添加空容器隐藏规则\n\n2. **frontend/src/pages/EnterpriseUserManagementPage.tsx**  \n   - 第603行：修复getContainer配置\n\n3. **frontend/src/utils/modalCleanup.ts** (新建)\n   - Modal DOM清理工具函数\n   - MutationObserver自动监控\n   - 强制清理功能\n\n4. **frontend/src/App.tsx**\n   - 第19行：导入modalCleanup\n   - 第134-138行：初始化清理系统\n\n## 测试验证\n\n修复完成后需要验证：\n\n1. **基础功能测试**\n   - 打开各种Modal（确认对话框、表单弹窗等）\n   - 正常关闭Modal\n   - 检查DOM中是否还有残留的 `ant-modal-wrap`\n\n2. **边界情况测试**\n   - 快速连续打开/关闭Modal\n   - 嵌套Modal场景\n   - 异常关闭情况\n\n3. **性能测试**\n   - 长时间使用后内存占用\n   - DOM节点数量变化\n\n## 技术要点\n\n1. **CSS `:has()` 伪类**：用于检测容器内是否有特定元素\n2. **MutationObserver**：监听DOM变化，实现自动清理\n3. **Portal渲染控制**：确保Modal渲染到正确位置\n4. **动画延迟清理**：给React足够时间完成清理流程\n\n## 开发调试\n\n在开发环境下，工具函数被暴露到全局：\n\n```javascript\n// 浏览器控制台中可用\nwindow.modalCleanup.cleanup()        // 手动清理\nwindow.modalCleanup.forceCleanup()   // 强制清理\nwindow.modalCleanup.setupCleanup()   // 重新初始化\n```\n\n## 预期效果\n\n修复后应该实现：\n- ✅ Modal关闭后DOM完全清理\n- ✅ 无内存泄漏\n- ✅ 无样式冲突\n- ✅ 保持原有功能正常	1	2025-09-23 05:10:34.818898	2025-09-23 05:10:34.818898	\N	1	markdown	draft	\N	\N	private	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N		1	\N	{}	f	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N
1207	1	任务文档	# 工作笔记模块产品需求文档 (PRD)\n\n## 1. 产品概述\n\n### 1.1 产品背景\n工作笔记模块是AI项目管理系统中的知识管理核心组件，为用户提供个人和团队的知识沉淀、信息整理和经验分享平台。该模块基于Document基础架构，专门针对工作场景进行了优化。\n\n### 1.2 产品定位\n- **核心价值**：让知识管理变得简单高效，促进团队知识共享\n- **目标用户**：项目团队成员、知识工作者、管理者\n- **使用场景**：会议记录、技术文档、想法记录、工作日志、参考资料\n\n## 2. 功能架构\n\n### 2.1 核心功能模块\n\n#### 2.1.1 笔记管理\n- **创建笔记**：支持多种类型（通用、会议、想法、日志、参考、模板）\n- **编辑器**：Markdown编辑器，支持预览模式、全屏编辑\n- **自动保存**：实时保存，防止数据丢失\n- **版本控制**：记录修改历史，支持版本对比和回滚\n\n#### 2.1.2 分类组织\n- **文件夹系统**：层级文件夹结构，支持无限嵌套\n- **标签系统**：多标签分类，便于横向关联\n- **收藏/置顶**：重要内容快速访问\n- **优先级标识**：低/中/高/紧急四级优先级\n\n#### 2.1.3 搜索发现\n- **全文搜索**：标题、内容、描述全文检索\n- **高级过滤**：按类型、状态、优先级、时间范围过滤\n- **ID快搜**：支持#ID格式快速定位\n- **智能推荐**：基于用户行为的内容推荐\n\n#### 2.1.4 协作共享\n- **权限控制**：私有/团队/公开三级可见性\n- **任务关联**：工作笔记与项目任务双向关联\n- **批量转换**：工作笔记转换为任务文档\n- **分享链接**：生成可分享的阅读链接\n\n### 2.2 数据模型设计\n\n#### 2.2.1 WorkNote核心字段\n```typescript\ninterface WorkNote {\n  // 基础信息\n  id: number;\n  title: string;\n  content?: string;\n  description?: string;\n  \n  // 分类属性\n  work_note_type: 'general' | 'meeting' | 'idea' | 'log' | 'reference' | 'template';\n  priority: 'low' | 'medium' | 'high' | 'urgent';\n  tags: string[];\n  \n  // 状态管理\n  status: 'draft' | 'published' | 'archived' | 'template';\n  visibility: 'private' | 'team' | 'public';\n  is_pinned: boolean;\n  is_bookmarked: boolean;\n  \n  // 关联关系\n  folder_id?: number;\n  related_tasks: number[];\n  related_notes: number[];\n  \n  // 统计信息\n  view_count: number;\n  word_count?: number;\n  read_time?: number;\n  last_read_at?: string;\n  \n  // 元数据\n  owner_id: number;\n  created_at: string;\n  updated_at: string;\n}\n```\n\n#### 2.2.2 WorkNoteFolder文件夹模型\n```typescript\ninterface WorkNoteFolder {\n  id: number;\n  name: string;\n  description?: string;\n  parent_id?: number;\n  visibility: 'private' | 'team' | 'public';\n  color?: string;\n  icon?: string;\n  notes_count: number;\n  subfolders_count: number;\n}\n```\n\n### 2.3 API接口设计\n\n#### 2.3.1 笔记CRUD\n- `GET /api/v1/work-notes` - 获取笔记列表\n- `POST /api/v1/work-notes` - 创建笔记\n- `GET /api/v1/work-notes/:id` - 获取单个笔记\n- `PUT /api/v1/work-notes/:id` - 更新笔记\n- `DELETE /api/v1/work-notes/:id` - 删除笔记\n\n#### 2.3.2 搜索与统计\n- `GET /api/v1/work-notes/search` - 搜索笔记\n- `GET /api/v1/work-notes/stats` - 获取统计信息\n\n#### 2.3.3 转换功能\n- `POST /api/v1/work-notes/:id/convert-preview` - 转换预览\n- `POST /api/v1/work-notes/:id/convert-to-task-document` - 转换为任务文档\n- `POST /api/v1/work-notes/batch-convert-to-task-documents` - 批量转换\n\n#### 2.3.4 文件夹管理\n- `GET /api/v1/work-note-folders` - 获取文件夹列表\n- `POST /api/v1/work-note-folders` - 创建文件夹\n- `GET /api/v1/work-note-folders/tree` - 获取文件夹树\n- `PUT /api/v1/work-note-folders/:id` - 更新文件夹\n- `DELETE /api/v1/work-note-folders/:id` - 删除文件夹\n\n## 3. 用户体验设计\n\n### 3.1 界面布局\n\n#### 3.1.1 主界面结构\n- **左侧面板**：文件夹树形导航\n- **中间列表**：笔记列表（表格/卡片视图切换）\n- **右侧详情**：笔记内容预览/编辑\n- **顶部工具栏**：搜索、过滤、排序、视图切换\n\n#### 3.1.2 编辑器界面\n- **抽屉式编辑器**：右侧滑出，支持全屏模式\n- **实时预览**：编辑/预览模式切换\n- **工具栏**：保存、发布、设置、标签等操作\n- **状态指示**：自动保存状态、字数统计、未保存提醒\n\n### 3.2 交互流程\n\n#### 3.2.1 创建笔记流程\n1. 点击"新建笔记"按钮\n2. 选择笔记类型（可选预设模板）\n3. 填写标题和内容\n4. 设置分类、标签、权限\n5. 保存或发布\n\n#### 3.2.2 搜索发现流程\n1. 在搜索框输入关键词\n2. 系统实时显示搜索建议\n3. 选择搜索结果或使用高级过滤\n4. 浏览搜索结果，点击查看详情\n\n#### 3.2.3 转换流程\n1. 选择要转换的工作笔记\n2. 预览转换效果\n3. 选择目标任务和转换选项\n4. 确认转换，生成任务文档\n\n### 3.3 响应式设计\n- **桌面端**：三栏布局，充分利用屏幕空间\n- **平板端**：二栏布局，左侧导航可折叠\n- **移动端**：单栏布局，底部导航，专注内容\n\n## 4. 技术实现\n\n### 4.1 前端架构\n- **框架**：React + TypeScript\n- **UI组件**：Ant Design 5.x\n- **状态管理**：React Hooks + Context\n- **编辑器**：自定义Markdown编辑器\n- **数据获取**：Axios + React Query\n\n### 4.2 后端架构\n- **语言**：Go\n- **框架**：Gin + GORM\n- **数据库**：PostgreSQL\n- **缓存**：Redis（可选）\n- **文件存储**：本地存储 + 云存储支持\n\n### 4.3 核心组件\n\n#### 4.3.1 前端组件\n- `WorkNotesManager` - 主管理界面\n- `ModernWorkNoteEditor` - 现代化编辑器\n- `ModernWorkNoteViewer` - 内容查看器\n- `WorkNoteConversionModal` - 转换功能弹窗\n- `BatchWorkNoteConversionModal` - 批量转换\n- `WorkNoteTaskSelectionModal` - 任务选择\n\n#### 4.3.2 后端服务\n- `WorkNoteHandler` - HTTP请求处理\n- `WorkNoteService` - 业务逻辑服务\n- `WorkNoteFolderHandler` - 文件夹管理\n- `WorkNoteTaskRelationService` - 任务关联服务\n\n## 5. 业务逻辑\n\n### 5.1 权限控制\n- **私有笔记**：仅创建者可见\n- **团队笔记**：团队成员可见，权限继承项目设置\n- **公开笔记**：所有用户可见（只读）\n- **文件夹权限**：子文件夹继承父文件夹权限\n\n### 5.2 关联关系\n- **任务关联**：工作笔记可关联多个任务\n- **笔记关联**：笔记间可建立引用关系\n- **转换关系**：记录笔记到任务文档的转换历史\n- **版本关系**：保持文档版本间的关联\n\n### 5.3 生命周期管理\n- **草稿状态**：编辑中，仅创建者可见\n- **已发布**：正式内容，按权限可见\n- **已归档**：历史内容，只读状态\n- **模板状态**：可复用的模板内容\n\n## 6. 数据统计\n\n### 6.1 用户行为统计\n- **创建统计**：每日/周/月创建数量\n- **阅读统计**：浏览次数、停留时间\n- **编辑统计**：修改频率、编辑时长\n- **搜索统计**：搜索关键词、结果点击率\n\n### 6.2 内容统计\n- **类型分布**：各类型笔记数量占比\n- **优先级分布**：不同优先级内容分析\n- **标签统计**：热门标签、标签使用频率\n- **关联分析**：任务关联度、笔记引用网络\n\n## 7. 性能要求\n\n### 7.1 响应时间\n- **列表加载**：< 500ms\n- **内容渲染**：< 300ms\n- **搜索响应**：< 1s\n- **保存操作**：< 200ms\n\n### 7.2 并发处理\n- **同时在线用户**：支持100+并发\n- **编辑冲突**：乐观锁处理并发编辑\n- **数据同步**：实时同步编辑状态\n\n### 7.3 存储优化\n- **内容压缩**：大文本内容gzip压缩\n- **缓存策略**：热点内容Redis缓存\n- **数据库优化**：索引优化、分页查询\n\n## 8. 安全考虑\n\n### 8.1 数据安全\n- **输入验证**：XSS防护、SQL注入防护\n- **权限校验**：每个API调用都验证权限\n- **数据加密**：敏感数据加密存储\n- **审计日志**：记录关键操作日志\n\n### 8.2 业务安全\n- **版本控制**：防止恶意修改历史\n- **软删除**：重要数据软删除保护\n- **备份策略**：定期数据备份\n- **权限最小化**：用户仅获得必要权限\n\n## 9. 优化建议\n\n### 9.1 现有问题\n1. **编辑器功能**：当前编辑器功能相对简单，缺少高级功能\n2. **搜索能力**：全文搜索性能有待优化\n3. **协作功能**：缺少实时协作编辑能力\n4. **移动适配**：移动端体验需要进一步优化\n\n### 9.2 改进方向\n1. **富文本编辑**：升级为更强大的编辑器（如Block-based编辑器）\n2. **AI辅助**：集成AI功能辅助内容创作和组织\n3. **实时协作**：支持多人同时编辑一个文档\n4. **知识图谱**：构建知识点间的关联网络\n5. **智能推荐**：基于内容和行为的智能推荐系统\n\n### 9.3 技术债务\n1. **代码重构**：部分组件过于复杂，需要拆分\n2. **性能优化**：大列表虚拟化、懒加载优化\n3. **测试覆盖**：增加单元测试和集成测试\n4. **文档完善**：API文档和用户文档需要补充\n\n## 10. 发展规划\n\n### 10.1 短期目标（1-3个月）\n- 优化编辑器体验\n- 完善搜索功能\n- 增强权限管理\n- 移动端适配优化\n\n### 10.2 中期目标（3-6个月）\n- 实时协作功能\n- AI辅助创作\n- 知识图谱构建\n- 高级分析报表\n\n### 10.3 长期目标（6-12个月）\n- 企业级权限系统\n- 多租户支持\n- 开放API生态\n- 插件系统架构\n\n---\n\n## 附录\n\n### A. 技术栈清单\n- **前端**：React 18+, TypeScript, Ant Design 5.x, React Query\n- **后端**：Go 1.19+, Gin, GORM, PostgreSQL 13+\n- **工具**：Git, Docker, Redis, Nginx\n\n### B. 数据库Schema\n详细的数据库表结构请参考：\n- `work_notes` 表\n- `work_note_folders` 表  \n- `work_note_task_relations` 表\n- `documents` 表（基础表）\n\n### C. API文档\n完整的API文档请参考OpenAPI规范文件：`docs/api/openapi.yaml`	1	2025-09-23 05:13:18.340425	2025-09-23 05:13:18.340425	\N	1	markdown	draft	\N	\N	private	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N		1	\N	{}	f	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N
1209	1	任务文档	# 修复前后端数据模型不一致问题 - 开发方案\n\n## 问题分析\n\n当前前后端数据模型存在以下不一致问题：\n\n1. **工作笔记类型字段**：后端使用`work_note_type`，前端使用通用`type`字段\n2. **优先级字段**：后端有专门的`priority`字段，前端缺少对应定义\n3. **元数据字段**：后端的`metadata`字段包含工作笔记特有信息，前端访问不统一\n4. **类型枚举**：前端缺少工作笔记类型和优先级的枚举定义\n\n## 解决方案\n\n### 1. 前端类型定义统一\n\n#### 1.1 更新 workNotesService.ts 接口定义\n\n```typescript\n// 添加工作笔记专用枚举\nexport type WorkNoteType = 'general' | 'meeting' | 'idea' | 'log' | 'reference' | 'template';\nexport type WorkNotePriority = 'low' | 'medium' | 'high' | 'urgent';\n\n// 更新 WorkNote 接口\nexport interface WorkNote {\n  id: number;\n  project_id?: number;\n  folder_id?: number;\n  title: string;\n  content?: string;\n  \n  // 统一类型字段\n  type: 'markdown' | 'image' | 'pdf' | 'doc' | 'xlsx' | 'pptx' | 'txt' | 'html';\n  work_note_type: WorkNoteType;  // 新增工作笔记类型\n  priority: WorkNotePriority;    // 新增优先级字段\n  \n  status: 'draft' | 'published' | 'archived' | 'template';\n  file_url?: string;\n  file_size?: number;\n  mime_type?: string;\n  description?: string;\n  tags?: string[];\n  \n  // 工作笔记特有字段\n  is_pinned?: boolean;\n  is_bookmarked?: boolean;\n  view_count?: number;\n  word_count?: number;\n  read_time?: number;\n  last_read_at?: string;\n  \n  metadata?: any;\n  owner_id: number;\n  visibility: 'private' | 'team' | 'public';\n  version: number;\n  parent_document_id?: number;\n  is_template: boolean;\n  created_by: number;\n  created_at: string;\n  updated_at: string;\n  deleted_at?: string;\n  owner_name?: string;\n  folder_name?: string;\n  relations?: any[];\n  related_tasks?: number[];\n  related_notes?: number[];\n}\n\n// 更新创建请求接口\nexport interface CreateWorkNoteRequest {\n  folder_id?: number;\n  title: string;\n  content?: string;\n  type?: 'markdown' | 'image' | 'pdf' | 'doc' | 'xlsx' | 'pptx' | 'txt' | 'html';\n  work_note_type: WorkNoteType;  // 必填工作笔记类型\n  priority?: WorkNotePriority;   // 可选优先级\n  status?: 'draft' | 'published' | 'archived' | 'template';\n  description?: string;\n  tags?: string[];\n  visibility?: 'private' | 'team' | 'public';\n  is_template?: boolean;\n  is_pinned?: boolean;\n  is_bookmarked?: boolean;\n  related_tasks?: number[];\n  related_notes?: number[];\n}\n\n// 更新修改请求接口\nexport interface UpdateWorkNoteRequest {\n  folder_id?: number;\n  title?: string;\n  content?: string;\n  work_note_type?: WorkNoteType;\n  priority?: WorkNotePriority;\n  status?: 'draft' | 'published' | 'archived' | 'template';\n  description?: string;\n  tags?: string[];\n  visibility?: 'private' | 'team' | 'public';\n  is_pinned?: boolean;\n  is_bookmarked?: boolean;\n  related_tasks?: number[];\n  related_notes?: number[];\n}\n```\n\n#### 1.2 创建工作笔记常量文件\n\n创建 `frontend/src/constants/workNoteTypes.ts`：\n\n```typescript\nexport const WORK_NOTE_TYPES = {\n  general: { value: 'general', label: '通用笔记', icon: '📝', color: '#1890ff' },\n  meeting: { value: 'meeting', label: '会议笔记', icon: '🤝', color: '#52c41a' },\n  idea: { value: 'idea', label: '想法记录', icon: '💡', color: '#faad14' },\n  log: { value: 'log', label: '工作日志', icon: '📋', color: '#722ed1' },\n  reference: { value: 'reference', label: '参考资料', icon: '📚', color: '#13c2c2' },\n  template: { value: 'template', label: '笔记模板', icon: '📄', color: '#eb2f96' },\n} as const;\n\nexport const WORK_NOTE_PRIORITIES = {\n  low: { value: 'low', label: '低优先级', color: '#bfbfbf' },\n  medium: { value: 'medium', label: '中等优先级', color: '#1890ff' },\n  high: { value: 'high', label: '高优先级', color: '#faad14' },\n  urgent: { value: 'urgent', label: '紧急', color: '#ff4d4f' },\n} as const;\n\nexport const getWorkNoteTypeConfig = (type: string) => {\n  return WORK_NOTE_TYPES[type as keyof typeof WORK_NOTE_TYPES] || WORK_NOTE_TYPES.general;\n};\n\nexport const getWorkNotePriorityConfig = (priority: string) => {\n  return WORK_NOTE_PRIORITIES[priority as keyof typeof WORK_NOTE_PRIORITIES] || WORK_NOTE_PRIORITIES.medium;\n};\n```\n\n### 2. 后端API响应格式调整\n\n#### 2.1 修改 work_note_service.go\n\n确保API响应包含所有必要字段：\n\n```go\n// 在 GetWorkNote 等方法中确保返回完整的工作笔记信息\nfunc (s *WorkNoteService) buildWorkNoteFromDocument(doc models.Document) (*models.WorkNote, error) {\n    wn := &models.WorkNote{}\n    wn.FromDocument(doc)\n    \n    // 确保工作笔记特有字段都被正确设置\n    if wn.WorkNoteType == "" {\n        wn.WorkNoteType = models.WorkNoteTypeGeneral\n    }\n    if wn.Priority == "" {\n        wn.Priority = models.WorkNotePriorityMedium\n    }\n    \n    return wn, nil\n}\n```\n\n#### 2.2 更新数据转换逻辑\n\n在工作笔记服务中添加数据格式转换：\n\n```go\n// 确保API返回的JSON格式包含所有字段\nfunc (wn *WorkNote) MarshalJSON() ([]byte, error) {\n    type Alias WorkNote\n    return json.Marshal(&struct {\n        *Alias\n        WorkNoteType string `json:"work_note_type"`\n        Priority     string `json:"priority"`\n        IsPinned     bool   `json:"is_pinned"`\n        IsBookmarked bool   `json:"is_bookmarked"`\n        ViewCount    int    `json:"view_count"`\n        WordCount    *int   `json:"word_count,omitempty"`\n        ReadTime     *int   `json:"read_time,omitempty"`\n    }{\n        Alias:        (*Alias)(wn),\n        WorkNoteType: string(wn.WorkNoteType),\n        Priority:     string(wn.Priority),\n        IsPinned:     wn.IsPinned,\n        IsBookmarked: wn.IsBookmarked,\n        ViewCount:    wn.ViewCount,\n        WordCount:    wn.WordCount,\n        ReadTime:     wn.ReadTime,\n    })\n}\n```\n\n### 3. 前端服务层更新\n\n#### 3.1 更新 workNotesService.ts 方法\n\n```typescript\nclass WorkNotesService {\n  // 创建工作笔记时处理新字段\n  async createWorkNote(request: CreateWorkNoteRequest): Promise<WorkNote> {\n    const payload = {\n      ...request,\n      work_note_type: request.work_note_type || 'general',\n      priority: request.priority || 'medium',\n      type: request.type || 'markdown'\n    };\n    \n    // ... 现有逻辑\n  }\n\n  // 更新工作笔记时处理字段映射\n  async updateWorkNote(id: number, request: UpdateWorkNoteRequest): Promise<WorkNote> {\n    const payload = {\n      ...request\n    };\n    \n    // ... 现有逻辑\n  }\n\n  // 数据转换工具方法\n  private transformWorkNoteFromAPI(apiData: any): WorkNote {\n    return {\n      ...apiData,\n      work_note_type: apiData.work_note_type || 'general',\n      priority: apiData.priority || 'medium',\n      is_pinned: apiData.is_pinned || false,\n      is_bookmarked: apiData.is_bookmarked || false,\n      view_count: apiData.view_count || 0,\n    };\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 4. 测试验证\n\n#### 4.1 单元测试\n\n创建 `frontend/src/services/__tests__/workNoteTypes.test.ts`：\n\n```typescript\nimport { getWorkNoteTypeConfig, getWorkNotePriorityConfig } from '../constants/workNoteTypes';\n\ndescribe('Work Note Types', () => {\n  test('should return correct config for valid types', () => {\n    expect(getWorkNoteTypeConfig('meeting')).toEqual({\n      value: 'meeting',\n      label: '会议笔记',\n      icon: '🤝',\n      color: '#52c41a'\n    });\n  });\n\n  test('should return default config for invalid types', () => {\n    expect(getWorkNoteTypeConfig('invalid')).toEqual({\n      value: 'general',\n      label: '通用笔记',\n      icon: '📝',\n      color: '#1890ff'\n    });\n  });\n});\n```\n\n#### 4.2 集成测试\n\n创建API调用测试确保前后端数据格式一致。\n\n## 实施步骤\n\n### 第一阶段：类型定义和常量（1天）\n1. 更新 `workNotesService.ts` 接口定义\n2. 创建 `workNoteTypes.ts` 常量文件\n3. 添加类型定义的单元测试\n\n### 第二阶段：后端适配（1天）\n1. 更新后端JSON序列化逻辑\n2. 确保API响应包含所有必要字段\n3. 测试API响应格式\n\n### 第三阶段：前端服务层更新（1天）\n1. 更新前端服务方法\n2. 添加数据转换逻辑\n3. 更新相关组件的类型导入\n\n### 第四阶段：测试和验证（1天）\n1. 端到端测试\n2. API调用验证\n3. 数据格式一致性检查\n\n## 风险和注意事项\n\n1. **向后兼容性**：确保现有数据不受影响\n2. **数据迁移**：可能需要数据库数据格式迁移\n3. **缓存清理**：更新后需要清理前端缓存\n4. **API版本**：考虑是否需要API版本控制\n\n## 验收标准\n\n1. ✅ 前后端接口类型定义完全一致\n2. ✅ 所有工作笔记特有字段都有正确的类型定义\n3. ✅ API调用返回的数据格式符合前端期望\n4. ✅ 创建和更新操作正常工作\n5. ✅ 现有功能不受影响\n6. ✅ 单元测试和集成测试通过\n\n完成此任务后，前后端数据模型将完全统一，为后续UI功能开发奠定坚实基础。	1	2025-09-23 05:25:22.67672	2025-09-23 05:25:22.67672	\N	1	markdown	draft	\N	\N	private	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N		1	\N	{}	f	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N
1210	1	任务文档	# 完善工作笔记UI功能 - 类型、优先级、收藏置顶 - 开发方案\n\n## 功能需求分析\n\n基于检查报告，需要在现有UI基础上添加以下功能：\n\n1. **工作笔记类型选择器**：支持6种类型的可视化选择和显示\n2. **优先级视觉指示**：4级优先级的颜色标识和交互\n3. **收藏置顶功能**：收藏/取消收藏、置顶/取消置顶的按钮和状态显示\n4. **增强的过滤和排序**：基于类型、优先级、收藏状态的筛选\n\n## 设计方案\n\n### 1. 工作笔记类型选择器\n\n#### 1.1 类型选择器组件\n\n创建 `frontend/src/components/WorkNoteTypeSelector.tsx`：\n\n```tsx\nimport React from 'react';\nimport { Select, Tag, Space } from 'antd';\nimport { WORK_NOTE_TYPES, getWorkNoteTypeConfig } from '../constants/workNoteTypes';\nimport type { WorkNoteType } from '../services/workNotesService';\n\ninterface WorkNoteTypeSelectorProps {\n  value?: WorkNoteType;\n  onChange?: (value: WorkNoteType) => void;\n  size?: 'small' | 'middle' | 'large';\n  disabled?: boolean;\n  placeholder?: string;\n}\n\nconst WorkNoteTypeSelector: React.FC<WorkNoteTypeSelectorProps> = ({\n  value,\n  onChange,\n  size = 'middle',\n  disabled = false,\n  placeholder = '选择笔记类型'\n}) => {\n  return (\n    <Select\n      value={value}\n      onChange={onChange}\n      size={size}\n      disabled={disabled}\n      placeholder={placeholder}\n      style={{ minWidth: 120 }}\n      optionRender={(option) => {\n        const config = getWorkNoteTypeConfig(option.value as string);\n        return (\n          <Space>\n            <span style={{ fontSize: '16px' }}>{config.icon}</span>\n            <span>{config.label}</span>\n          </Space>\n        );\n      }}\n    >\n      {Object.entries(WORK_NOTE_TYPES).map(([key, config]) => (\n        <Select.Option key={key} value={key}>\n          <Space>\n            <span style={{ fontSize: '16px' }}>{config.icon}</span>\n            <span>{config.label}</span>\n          </Space>\n        </Select.Option>\n      ))}\n    </Select>\n  );\n};\n\nexport default WorkNoteTypeSelector;\n```\n\n#### 1.2 类型标签显示组件\n\n创建 `frontend/src/components/WorkNoteTypeTag.tsx`：\n\n```tsx\nimport React from 'react';\nimport { Tag } from 'antd';\nimport { getWorkNoteTypeConfig } from '../constants/workNoteTypes';\nimport type { WorkNoteType } from '../services/workNotesService';\n\ninterface WorkNoteTypeTagProps {\n  type: WorkNoteType;\n  size?: 'small' | 'default';\n  showIcon?: boolean;\n}\n\nconst WorkNoteTypeTag: React.FC<WorkNoteTypeTagProps> = ({\n  type,\n  size = 'default',\n  showIcon = true\n}) => {\n  const config = getWorkNoteTypeConfig(type);\n  \n  return (\n    <Tag \n      color={config.color}\n      style={{ \n        fontSize: size === 'small' ? '12px' : '14px',\n        marginRight: 4\n      }}\n    >\n      {showIcon && <span style={{ marginRight: 4 }}>{config.icon}</span>}\n      {config.label}\n    </Tag>\n  );\n};\n\nexport default WorkNoteTypeTag;\n```\n\n### 2. 优先级视觉指示\n\n#### 2.1 优先级选择器组件\n\n创建 `frontend/src/components/WorkNotePrioritySelector.tsx`：\n\n```tsx\nimport React from 'react';\nimport { Select, Space, Badge } from 'antd';\nimport { WORK_NOTE_PRIORITIES, getWorkNotePriorityConfig } from '../constants/workNoteTypes';\nimport type { WorkNotePriority } from '../services/workNotesService';\n\ninterface WorkNotePrioritySelectorProps {\n  value?: WorkNotePriority;\n  onChange?: (value: WorkNotePriority) => void;\n  size?: 'small' | 'middle' | 'large';\n  disabled?: boolean;\n}\n\nconst WorkNotePrioritySelector: React.FC<WorkNotePrioritySelectorProps> = ({\n  value,\n  onChange,\n  size = 'middle',\n  disabled = false\n}) => {\n  return (\n    <Select\n      value={value}\n      onChange={onChange}\n      size={size}\n      disabled={disabled}\n      placeholder="选择优先级"\n      style={{ minWidth: 100 }}\n    >\n      {Object.entries(WORK_NOTE_PRIORITIES).map(([key, config]) => (\n        <Select.Option key={key} value={key}>\n          <Space>\n            <Badge color={config.color} />\n            <span>{config.label}</span>\n          </Space>\n        </Select.Option>\n      ))}\n    </Select>\n  );\n};\n\nexport default WorkNotePrioritySelector;\n```\n\n#### 2.2 优先级标识组件\n\n创建 `frontend/src/components/WorkNotePriorityBadge.tsx`：\n\n```tsx\nimport React from 'react';\nimport { Badge, Tooltip } from 'antd';\nimport { \n  ExclamationCircleOutlined, \n  ArrowUpOutlined, \n  MinusOutlined, \n  ArrowDownOutlined \n} from '@ant-design/icons';\nimport { getWorkNotePriorityConfig } from '../constants/workNoteTypes';\nimport type { WorkNotePriority } from '../services/workNotesService';\n\ninterface WorkNotePriorityBadgeProps {\n  priority: WorkNotePriority;\n  showText?: boolean;\n  size?: 'small' | 'default';\n}\n\nconst WorkNotePriorityBadge: React.FC<WorkNotePriorityBadgeProps> = ({\n  priority,\n  showText = false,\n  size = 'default'\n}) => {\n  const config = getWorkNotePriorityConfig(priority);\n  \n  const getIcon = () => {\n    switch (priority) {\n      case 'urgent': return <ExclamationCircleOutlined />;\n      case 'high': return <ArrowUpOutlined />;\n      case 'medium': return <MinusOutlined />;\n      case 'low': return <ArrowDownOutlined />;\n      default: return <MinusOutlined />;\n    }\n  };\n\n  const content = (\n    <span style={{ \n      color: config.color,\n      fontSize: size === 'small' ? '12px' : '14px'\n    }}>\n      {getIcon()}\n      {showText && <span style={{ marginLeft: 4 }}>{config.label}</span>}\n    </span>\n  );\n\n  return (\n    <Tooltip title={config.label}>\n      {content}\n    </Tooltip>\n  );\n};\n\nexport default WorkNotePriorityBadge;\n```\n\n### 3. 收藏置顶功能\n\n#### 3.1 收藏置顶按钮组件\n\n创建 `frontend/src/components/WorkNoteActions.tsx`：\n\n```tsx\nimport React from 'react';\nimport { Button, Space, Tooltip, message } from 'antd';\nimport { \n  StarOutlined, \n  StarFilled, \n  PushpinOutlined, \n  PushpinFilled \n} from '@ant-design/icons';\nimport { workNotesService } from '../services/workNotesService';\nimport type { WorkNote } from '../services/workNotesService';\n\ninterface WorkNoteActionsProps {\n  note: WorkNote;\n  onUpdate?: (updatedNote: WorkNote) => void;\n  size?: 'small' | 'middle' | 'large';\n  compact?: boolean;\n}\n\nconst WorkNoteActions: React.FC<WorkNoteActionsProps> = ({\n  note,\n  onUpdate,\n  size = 'small',\n  compact = false\n}) => {\n  const [loading, setLoading] = React.useState<string | null>(null);\n\n  const handleBookmark = async () => {\n    setLoading('bookmark');\n    try {\n      const updatedNote = await workNotesService.updateWorkNote(note.id, {\n        is_bookmarked: !note.is_bookmarked\n      });\n      message.success(note.is_bookmarked ? '取消收藏成功' : '收藏成功');\n      onUpdate?.(updatedNote);\n    } catch (error) {\n      message.error('操作失败');\n    } finally {\n      setLoading(null);\n    }\n  };\n\n  const handlePin = async () => {\n    setLoading('pin');\n    try {\n      const updatedNote = await workNotesService.updateWorkNote(note.id, {\n        is_pinned: !note.is_pinned\n      });\n      message.success(note.is_pinned ? '取消置顶成功' : '置顶成功');\n      onUpdate?.(updatedNote);\n    } catch (error) {\n      message.error('操作失败');\n    } finally {\n      setLoading(null);\n    }\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <Space size={compact ? 4 : 8}>\n      <Tooltip title={note.is_bookmarked ? '取消收藏' : '收藏'}>\n        <Button\n          type="text"\n          size={size}\n          loading={loading === 'bookmark'}\n          icon={note.is_bookmarked ? <StarFilled style={{ color: '#fadb14' }} /> : <StarOutlined />}\n          onClick={handleBookmark}\n        />\n      </Tooltip>\n      <Tooltip title={note.is_pinned ? '取消置顶' : '置顶'}>\n        <Button\n          type="text"\n          size={size}\n          loading={loading === 'pin'}\n          icon={note.is_pinned ? <PushpinFilled style={{ color: '#1890ff' }} /> : <PushpinOutlined />}\n          onClick={handlePin}\n        />\n      </Tooltip>\n    </Space>\n  );\n};\n\nexport default WorkNoteActions;\n```\n\n### 4. 更新现有组件\n\n#### 4.1 更新 WorkNotesManager.tsx\n\n在现有的 `WorkNotesManager` 组件中集成新功能：\n\n```tsx\n// 导入新组件\nimport WorkNoteTypeSelector from './WorkNoteTypeSelector';\nimport WorkNotePrioritySelector from './WorkNotePrioritySelector';\nimport WorkNoteTypeTag from './WorkNoteTypeTag';\nimport WorkNotePriorityBadge from './WorkNotePriorityBadge';\nimport WorkNoteActions from './WorkNoteActions';\n\n// 添加新的过滤状态\nconst [typeFilter, setTypeFilter] = useState<WorkNoteType | 'all'>('all');\nconst [priorityFilter, setPriorityFilter] = useState<WorkNotePriority | 'all'>('all');\nconst [bookmarkFilter, setBookmarkFilter] = useState<'all' | 'bookmarked' | 'unbookmarked'>('all');\nconst [pinnedFilter, setPinnedFilter] = useState<'all' | 'pinned' | 'unpinned'>('all');\n\n// 更新过滤逻辑\nconst getFilteredAndSortedData = (notes: WorkNote[]): WorkNote[] => {\n  let filtered = [...notes];\n\n  // 类型过滤\n  if (typeFilter !== 'all') {\n    filtered = filtered.filter(note => note.work_note_type === typeFilter);\n  }\n\n  // 优先级过滤\n  if (priorityFilter !== 'all') {\n    filtered = filtered.filter(note => note.priority === priorityFilter);\n  }\n\n  // 收藏过滤\n  if (bookmarkFilter === 'bookmarked') {\n    filtered = filtered.filter(note => note.is_bookmarked);\n  } else if (bookmarkFilter === 'unbookmarked') {\n    filtered = filtered.filter(note => !note.is_bookmarked);\n  }\n\n  // 置顶过滤\n  if (pinnedFilter === 'pinned') {\n    filtered = filtered.filter(note => note.is_pinned);\n  } else if (pinnedFilter === 'unpinned') {\n    filtered = filtered.filter(note => !note.is_pinned);\n  }\n\n  // 置顶排序 - 置顶的总是在前面\n  filtered.sort((a, b) => {\n    if (a.is_pinned && !b.is_pinned) return -1;\n    if (!a.is_pinned && b.is_pinned) return 1;\n    return 0;\n  });\n\n  // 原有排序逻辑...\n  return filtered;\n};\n\n// 更新表格列定义\nconst columns: ColumnsType<WorkNote> = [\n  {\n    title: '标题',\n    dataIndex: 'title',\n    key: 'title',\n    render: (title: string, record: WorkNote) => (\n      <Space direction="vertical" size={4}>\n        <Space>\n          {record.is_pinned && <PushpinFilled style={{ color: '#1890ff' }} />}\n          <span style={{ \n            fontWeight: record.is_pinned ? 'bold' : 'normal',\n            cursor: 'pointer'\n          }} onClick={() => handleView(record)}>\n            {title}\n          </span>\n        </Space>\n        <Space size={4}>\n          <WorkNoteTypeTag type={record.work_note_type} size="small" />\n          <WorkNotePriorityBadge priority={record.priority} />\n        </Space>\n      </Space>\n    )\n  },\n  // ... 其他列\n  {\n    title: '操作',\n    key: 'action',\n    width: 200,\n    render: (_, record: WorkNote) => (\n      <Space>\n        <WorkNoteActions \n          note={record} \n          onUpdate={handleNoteUpdate}\n          compact\n        />\n        {/* 其他操作按钮 */}\n      </Space>\n    )\n  }\n];\n```\n\n#### 4.2 更新过滤器区域\n\n```tsx\nconst renderFilters = () => (\n  <Card size="small" style={{ marginBottom: 16 }}>\n    <Row gutter={16} align="middle">\n      <Col>\n        <Space>\n          <span>类型:</span>\n          <WorkNoteTypeSelector\n            value={typeFilter === 'all' ? undefined : typeFilter}\n            onChange={(value) => setTypeFilter(value || 'all')}\n            size="small"\n            placeholder="全部类型"\n          />\n        </Space>\n      </Col>\n      <Col>\n        <Space>\n          <span>优先级:</span>\n          <WorkNotePrioritySelector\n            value={priorityFilter === 'all' ? undefined : priorityFilter}\n            onChange={(value) => setPriorityFilter(value || 'all')}\n            size="small"\n          />\n        </Space>\n      </Col>\n      <Col>\n        <Space>\n          <span>状态:</span>\n          <Select\n            value={bookmarkFilter}\n            onChange={setBookmarkFilter}\n            size="small"\n            style={{ width: 100 }}\n          >\n            <Option value="all">全部</Option>\n            <Option value="bookmarked">已收藏</Option>\n            <Option value="unbookmarked">未收藏</Option>\n          </Select>\n        </Space>\n      </Col>\n    </Row>\n  </Card>\n);\n```\n\n#### 4.3 更新编辑器组件\n\n在 `ModernWorkNoteEditor.tsx` 中添加类型和优先级选择：\n\n```tsx\n// 在表单中添加新字段\n<Form.Item\n  label="笔记类型"\n  name="work_note_type"\n  rules={[{ required: true, message: '请选择笔记类型' }]}\n>\n  <WorkNoteTypeSelector />\n</Form.Item>\n\n<Form.Item\n  label="优先级"\n  name="priority"\n>\n  <WorkNotePrioritySelector />\n</Form.Item>\n\n<Form.Item name="is_pinned" valuePropName="checked">\n  <Checkbox>置顶显示</Checkbox>\n</Form.Item>\n\n<Form.Item name="is_bookmarked" valuePropName="checked">\n  <Checkbox>添加到收藏</Checkbox>\n</Form.Item>\n```\n\n## 实施步骤\n\n### 第一阶段：基础组件开发（2天）\n1. 创建工作笔记类型选择器和标签组件\n2. 创建优先级选择器和标识组件\n3. 创建收藏置顶操作组件\n4. 编写组件单元测试\n\n### 第二阶段：集成到现有界面（2天）\n1. 更新 WorkNotesManager 组件\n2. 更新编辑器组件\n3. 更新列表显示逻辑\n4. 添加过滤和排序功能\n\n### 第三阶段：样式和交互优化（1天）\n1. 优化视觉效果和响应式布局\n2. 添加动画和交互反馈\n3. 完善无障碍访问支持\n\n### 第四阶段：测试和修复（1天）\n1. 功能测试\n2. 用户体验测试\n3. 性能优化\n4. Bug修复\n\n## 设计规范\n\n### 颜色方案\n- 通用笔记: #1890ff (蓝色)\n- 会议笔记: #52c41a (绿色)\n- 想法记录: #faad14 (黄色)\n- 工作日志: #722ed1 (紫色)\n- 参考资料: #13c2c2 (青色)\n- 笔记模板: #eb2f96 (粉色)\n\n### 优先级颜色\n- 低优先级: #bfbfbf (灰色)\n- 中等优先级: #1890ff (蓝色)\n- 高优先级: #faad14 (橙色)\n- 紧急: #ff4d4f (红色)\n\n### 交互规范\n- 收藏状态: 金色星形图标\n- 置顶状态: 蓝色图钉图标\n- 悬停效果: 0.3s 过渡动画\n- 点击反馈: 按钮按下效果\n\n## 验收标准\n\n1. ✅ 工作笔记类型选择器正常工作，支持6种类型\n2. ✅ 优先级选择器和视觉指示正确显示\n3. ✅ 收藏和置顶功能完整，包括按钮、状态显示、排序\n4. ✅ 过滤功能支持多维度筛选\n5. ✅ 界面美观，符合设计规范\n6. ✅ 响应式设计适配不同屏幕尺寸\n7. ✅ 所有交互都有适当的反馈和错误处理\n8. ✅ 组件测试覆盖率达到80%以上\n\n完成此任务后，工作笔记模块的用户界面将支持完整的分类、优先级和收藏置顶功能，大大提升用户体验。	1	2025-09-23 05:26:34.316685	2025-09-23 05:26:34.316685	\N	1	markdown	draft	\N	\N	private	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N		1	\N	{}	f	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N
1211	1	任务文档	# 升级工作笔记编辑器为现代化编辑器 - 开发方案\n\n## 现状分析\n\n当前的 `ModernWorkNoteEditor` 组件使用基础的 Ant Design TextArea，功能相对简单：\n- 基础的文本编辑\n- 简单的预览模式切换\n- 自动保存功能\n- 字数统计\n\n相比PRD要求的现代化编辑器，缺少以下功能：\n- 富文本编辑能力\n- 高级Markdown支持\n- 实时预览\n- 工具栏快捷操作\n- 代码高亮\n- 表格编辑\n- 图片插入和管理\n- 协作功能基础\n\n## 设计目标\n\n### 核心功能\n1. **Markdown编辑器升级**：使用更强大的编辑器引擎\n2. **实时预览**：分屏实时预览，所见即所得\n3. **工具栏**：丰富的格式化工具\n4. **语法高亮**：代码块语法高亮\n5. **快捷键支持**：常用编辑快捷键\n6. **插件系统**：可扩展的插件架构\n\n### 用户体验\n1. **响应式设计**：适配不同屏幕尺寸\n2. **性能优化**：大文档编辑流畅\n3. **自动保存增强**：更智能的保存策略\n4. **无障碍支持**：键盘导航和屏幕阅读器支持\n\n## 技术选型\n\n### 编辑器引擎对比\n\n| 编辑器 | 优势 | 劣势 | 适用性 |\n|--------|------|------|--------|\n| @uiw/react-md-editor | 轻量、简单、React友好 | 功能相对基础 | ⭐⭐⭐⭐ |\n| react-markdown-editor-lite | 双栏预览、插件丰富 | 包体积较大 | ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ |\n| Monaco Editor | 功能强大、VS Code内核 | 包体积大、配置复杂 | ⭐⭐⭐ |\n| CodeMirror 6 | 高性能、可定制性强 | 学习成本高 | ⭐⭐⭐ |\n\n### 推荐方案：react-markdown-editor-lite\n\n**选择理由：**\n- 双栏实时预览\n- 丰富的插件生态\n- 良好的中文支持\n- 与Ant Design集成良好\n- 活跃的社区维护\n\n## 实施方案\n\n### 1. 依赖安装和配置\n\n```bash\nnpm install react-markdown-editor-lite markdown-it\nnpm install --save-dev @types/markdown-it\n```\n\n### 2. 核心编辑器组件\n\n创建 `frontend/src/components/AdvancedWorkNoteEditor.tsx`：\n\n```tsx\nimport React, { useState, useEffect, useRef, useCallback } from 'react';\nimport {\n  Drawer,\n  Button,\n  Input,\n  Select,\n  Form,\n  Space,\n  Divider,\n  Typography,\n  Tag,\n  Row,\n  Col,\n  Card,\n  message,\n  Tooltip,\n  Badge,\n  Switch,\n  Alert,\n  Affix\n} from 'antd';\nimport {\n  SaveOutlined,\n  EyeOutlined,\n  SendOutlined,\n  TagOutlined,\n  SettingOutlined,\n  FullscreenOutlined,\n  FullscreenExitOutlined,\n  FileMarkdownOutlined,\n  CloseOutlined,\n  BoldOutlined,\n  ItalicOutlined,\n  UnderlineOutlined,\n  CodeOutlined\n} from '@ant-design/icons';\nimport MdEditor from 'react-markdown-editor-lite';\nimport MarkdownIt from 'markdown-it';\nimport 'react-markdown-editor-lite/lib/index.css';\n\n// 导入自定义组件\nimport WorkNoteTypeSelector from './WorkNoteTypeSelector';\nimport WorkNotePrioritySelector from './WorkNotePrioritySelector';\nimport { workNotesService, WorkNote, CreateWorkNoteRequest, UpdateWorkNoteRequest } from '../services/workNotesService';\n\nconst { Title, Text } = Typography;\nconst { Option } = Select;\n\n// Markdown解析器配置\nconst mdParser = new MarkdownIt({\n  html: true,\n  linkify: true,\n  typographer: true,\n  breaks: true\n})\n  .use(require('markdown-it-footnote'))\n  .use(require('markdown-it-deflist'))\n  .use(require('markdown-it-abbr'))\n  .use(require('markdown-it-ins'))\n  .use(require('markdown-it-mark'))\n  .use(require('markdown-it-sub'))\n  .use(require('markdown-it-sup'));\n\ninterface AdvancedWorkNoteEditorProps {\n  visible: boolean;\n  note?: WorkNote | null;\n  onClose: () => void;\n  onSave: (noteData: any) => void;\n  initialFolderId?: number;\n}\n\nconst AdvancedWorkNoteEditor: React.FC<AdvancedWorkNoteEditorProps> = ({\n  visible,\n  note,\n  onClose,\n  onSave,\n  initialFolderId\n}) => {\n  const [form] = Form.useForm();\n  const [saving, setSaving] = useState(false);\n  const [autoSave, setAutoSave] = useState(true);\n  const [fullscreen, setFullscreen] = useState(false);\n  const [wordCount, setWordCount] = useState(0);\n  const [unsavedChanges, setUnsavedChanges] = useState(false);\n  const [editorHeight, setEditorHeight] = useState(500);\n  \n  const editorRef = useRef<MdEditor>(null);\n  const autoSaveRef = useRef<NodeJS.Timeout>();\n  const lastSavedContentRef = useRef<string>('');\n\n  // 编辑器配置\n  const editorConfig = {\n    view: {\n      menu: true,\n      md: true,\n      html: true,\n      fullScreen: false, // 使用自定义全屏\n      hideMenu: false\n    },\n    imageUrl: '',\n    imageAccept: '.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.gif,.bmp,.webp',\n    linkUrl: '',\n    table: {\n      maxRow: 5,\n      maxCol: 6\n    },\n    allowPasteImage: true,\n    syncScrollMode: ['leftFollowRight', 'rightFollowLeft']\n  };\n\n  // 自定义工具栏\n  const customToolbar = [\n    'header', 'font-bold', 'font-italic', 'font-underline', 'font-strikethrough',\n    'divider',\n    'list-unordered', 'list-ordered', 'block-quote', 'block-wrap', 'block-code-inline', 'block-code-block',\n    'divider',\n    'table', 'image', 'link',\n    'divider',\n    'clear', 'logger', 'info'\n  ];\n\n  // 表单数据状态\n  const [formData, setFormData] = useState({\n    title: '',\n    content: '',\n    description: '',\n    tags: [],\n    work_note_type: 'general' as const,\n    priority: 'medium' as const,\n    status: 'draft' as const,\n    visibility: 'team' as const,\n    is_pinned: false,\n    is_bookmarked: false,\n    folder_id: initialFolderId\n  });\n\n  // 初始化表单数据\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (note) {\n      const data = {\n        title: note.title || '',\n        content: note.content || '',\n        description: note.description || '',\n        tags: note.tags || [],\n        work_note_type: note.work_note_type || 'general',\n        priority: note.priority || 'medium',\n        status: note.status || 'draft',\n        visibility: note.visibility || 'team',\n        is_pinned: note.is_pinned || false,\n        is_bookmarked: note.is_bookmarked || false,\n        folder_id: note.folder_id || initialFolderId\n      };\n      setFormData(data);\n      lastSavedContentRef.current = data.content;\n      \n      if (visible) {\n        form.setFieldsValue({\n          ...data,\n          tags: data.tags.join(', ')\n        });\n      }\n    } else {\n      const data = {\n        title: '',\n        content: '',\n        description: '',\n        tags: [],\n        work_note_type: 'general' as const,\n        priority: 'medium' as const,\n        status: 'draft' as const,\n        visibility: 'team' as const,\n        is_pinned: false,\n        is_bookmarked: false,\n        folder_id: initialFolderId\n      };\n      setFormData(data);\n      lastSavedContentRef.current = '';\n      \n      if (visible) {\n        form.setFieldsValue({\n          ...data,\n          tags: ''\n        });\n      }\n    }\n    setUnsavedChanges(false);\n  }, [note, visible, form, initialFolderId]);\n\n  // 内容变化处理\n  const handleEditorChange = useCallback(({ text }: { text: string }) => {\n    setFormData(prev => ({ ...prev, content: text }));\n    setWordCount(text.length);\n    setUnsavedChanges(text !== lastSavedContentRef.current);\n\n    // 自动保存\n    if (autoSave && note?.id) {\n      if (autoSaveRef.current) {\n        clearTimeout(autoSaveRef.current);\n      }\n      autoSaveRef.current = setTimeout(() => {\n        handleAutoSave(text);\n      }, 2000);\n    }\n  }, [autoSave, note?.id]);\n\n  // 自动保存\n  const handleAutoSave = async (content: string) => {\n    if (!note?.id || content === lastSavedContentRef.current) return;\n\n    try {\n      await workNotesService.updateWorkNote(note.id, { content });\n      lastSavedContentRef.current = content;\n      setUnsavedChanges(false);\n      message.success('已自动保存', 1);\n    } catch (error) {\n      console.error('Auto save failed:', error);\n    }\n  };\n\n  // 手动保存\n  const handleSave = async () => {\n    try {\n      setSaving(true);\n      const values = await form.validateFields();\n      \n      const data = {\n        ...values,\n        content: formData.content,\n        tags: values.tags ? values.tags.split(',').map((tag: string) => tag.trim()).filter(Boolean) : []\n      };\n\n      if (note) {\n        const updatedNote = await workNotesService.updateWorkNote(note.id, data);\n        message.success('更新成功');\n        onSave(updatedNote);\n      } else {\n        const newNote = await workNotesService.createWorkNote(data);\n        message.success('创建成功');\n        onSave(newNote);\n      }\n      \n      lastSavedContentRef.current = formData.content;\n      setUnsavedChanges(false);\n    } catch (error: any) {\n      console.error('Save failed:', error);\n      message.error(error.message || '保存失败');\n    } finally {\n      setSaving(false);\n    }\n  };\n\n  // 发布\n  const handlePublish = async () => {\n    try {\n      setSaving(true);\n      await form.validateFields();\n      \n      const publishData = {\n        ...formData,\n        status: 'published' as const\n      };\n\n      if (note) {\n        const updatedNote = await workNotesService.updateWorkNote(note.id, publishData);\n        message.success('发布成功');\n        onSave(updatedNote);\n      } else {\n        const newNote = await workNotesService.createWorkNote(publishData);\n        message.success('发布成功');\n        onSave(newNote);\n      }\n      \n      setUnsavedChanges(false);\n    } catch (error: any) {\n      console.error('Publish failed:', error);\n      message.error(error.message || '发布失败');\n    } finally {\n      setSaving(false);\n    }\n  };\n\n  // 全屏切换\n  const toggleFullscreen = () => {\n    setFullscreen(!fullscreen);\n    setEditorHeight(fullscreen ? 500 : window.innerHeight - 200);\n  };\n\n  // 插入快捷内容\n  const insertQuickContent = (type: string) => {\n    const editor = editorRef.current;\n    if (!editor) return;\n\n    const templates = {\n      meeting: `## 会议记录\n\n**时间**: ${new Date().toLocaleString()}\n**参会人员**: \n**会议主题**: \n\n### 讨论要点\n- \n\n### 决议事项\n- \n\n### 后续行动\n- [ ] \n`,\n      idea: `## 💡 创意想法\n\n**时间**: ${new Date().toLocaleString()}\n**标签**: #想法\n\n### 核心思路\n\n\n### 可行性分析\n\n\n### 下一步计划\n- [ ] \n`,\n      log: `## 📋 工作日志\n\n**日期**: ${new Date().toLocaleDateString()}\n\n### 今日完成\n- \n\n### 遇到问题\n- \n\n### 明日计划\n- \n`\n    };\n\n    const template = templates[type as keyof typeof templates];\n    if (template) {\n      editor.insertText(template);\n    }\n  };\n\n  // 清理函数\n  useEffect(() => {\n    return () => {\n      if (autoSaveRef.current) {\n        clearTimeout(autoSaveRef.current);\n      }\n    };\n  }, []);\n\n  return (\n    <Drawer\n      title={\n        <Space>\n          <FileMarkdownOutlined />\n          <span>{note ? '编辑工作笔记' : '新建工作笔记'}</span>\n          {unsavedChanges && <Badge status="warning" text="未保存" />}\n        </Space>\n      }\n      placement="right"\n      size={fullscreen ? 'large' : 'default'}\n      width={fullscreen ? '100%' : '80%'}\n      visible={visible}\n      onClose={onClose}\n      closable={true}\n      maskClosable={false}\n      keyboard={false}\n      extra={\n        <Space>\n          <Switch\n            checked={autoSave}\n            onChange={setAutoSave}\n            size="small"\n          />\n          <Text type="secondary" style={{ fontSize: '12px' }}>自动保存</Text>\n          <Tooltip title={fullscreen ? '退出全屏' : '全屏编辑'}>\n            <Button\n              type="text"\n              icon={fullscreen ? <FullscreenExitOutlined /> : <FullscreenOutlined />}\n              onClick={toggleFullscreen}\n            />\n          </Tooltip>\n        </Space>\n      }\n      footer={\n        <Row justify="space-between" align="middle">\n          <Col>\n            <Space>\n              <Text type="secondary">字数: {wordCount}</Text>\n              {unsavedChanges && <Text type="warning">有未保存的更改</Text>}\n            </Space>\n          </Col>\n          <Col>\n            <Space>\n              <Button onClick={onClose}>\n                取消\n              </Button>\n              <Button\n                type="default"\n                icon={<SaveOutlined />}\n                loading={saving}\n                onClick={handleSave}\n              >\n                保存草稿\n              </Button>\n              <Button\n                type="primary"\n                icon={<SendOutlined />}\n                loading={saving}\n                onClick={handlePublish}\n              >\n                发布\n              </Button>\n            </Space>\n          </Col>\n        </Row>\n      }\n    >\n      <div style={{ height: '100%', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>\n        {/* 基础信息表单 */}\n        <Card size="small" style={{ marginBottom: 16 }}>\n          <Form\n            form={form}\n            layout="vertical"\n            initialValues={formData}\n          >\n            <Row gutter={16}>\n              <Col span={24}>\n                <Form.Item\n                  label="标题"\n                  name="title"\n                  rules={[{ required: true, message: '请输入标题' }]}\n                >\n                  <Input\n                    placeholder="请输入笔记标题"\n                    onChange={(e) => setFormData(prev => ({ ...prev, title: e.target.value }))}\n                  />\n                </Form.Item>\n              </Col>\n            </Row>\n            \n            <Row gutter={16}>\n              <Col span={8}>\n                <Form.Item\n                  label="笔记类型"\n                  name="work_note_type"\n                  rules={[{ required: true, message: '请选择笔记类型' }]}\n                >\n                  <WorkNoteTypeSelector\n                    onChange={(value) => setFormData(prev => ({ ...prev, work_note_type: value }))}\n                  />\n                </Form.Item>\n              </Col>\n              <Col span={8}>\n                <Form.Item label="优先级" name="priority">\n                  <WorkNotePrioritySelector\n                    onChange={(value) => setFormData(prev => ({ ...prev, priority: value }))}\n                  />\n                </Form.Item>\n              </Col>\n              <Col span={8}>\n                <Form.Item label="可见性" name="visibility">\n                  <Select onChange={(value) => setFormData(prev => ({ ...prev, visibility: value }))}>\n                    <Option value="private">私有</Option>\n                    <Option value="team">团队</Option>\n                    <Option value="public">公开</Option>\n                  </Select>\n                </Form.Item>\n              </Col>\n            </Row>\n\n            <Row gutter={16}>\n              <Col span={12}>\n                <Form.Item label="标签" name="tags">\n                  <Input placeholder="用逗号分隔多个标签" />\n                </Form.Item>\n              </Col>\n              <Col span={12}>\n                <Form.Item label="描述" name="description">\n                  <Input placeholder="简短描述（可选）" />\n                </Form.Item>\n              </Col>\n            </Row>\n          </Form>\n        </Card>\n\n        {/* 快捷模板 */}\n        <Card size="small" style={{ marginBottom: 16 }}>\n          <Space>\n            <Text strong>快捷模板:</Text>\n            <Button size="small" onClick={() => insertQuickContent('meeting')}>\n              会议记录\n            </Button>\n            <Button size="small" onClick={() => insertQuickContent('idea')}>\n              创意想法\n            </Button>\n            <Button size="small" onClick={() => insertQuickContent('log')}>\n              工作日志\n            </Button>\n          </Space>\n        </Card>\n\n        {/* Markdown编辑器 */}\n        <div style={{ flex: 1, minHeight: editorHeight }}>\n          <MdEditor\n            ref={editorRef}\n            value={formData.content}\n            style={{ height: editorHeight }}\n            renderHTML={(text) => mdParser.render(text)}\n            onChange={handleEditorChange}\n            config={editorConfig}\n            plugins={customToolbar}\n            placeholder="开始编写你的笔记..."\n          />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </Drawer>\n  );\n};\n\nexport default AdvancedWorkNoteEditor;\n```\n\n### 3. 编辑器插件扩展\n\n创建 `frontend/src/components/editor/CustomEditorPlugins.tsx`：\n\n```tsx\nimport React from 'react';\nimport { Button, Tooltip, Modal, Input, Form, Upload, message } from 'antd';\nimport { \n  PictureOutlined, \n  TableOutlined, \n  LinkOutlined,\n  CodeOutlined,\n  FileTextOutlined\n} from '@ant-design/icons';\n\n// 图片上传插件\nexport const ImageUploadPlugin = {\n  name: 'image-upload',\n  align: 'left',\n  render: (editor: any) => {\n    return (\n      <Tooltip title="插入图片">\n        <Button\n          size="small"\n          icon={<PictureOutlined />}\n          onClick={() => {\n            // 触发文件选择\n            const input = document.createElement('input');\n            input.type = 'file';\n            input.accept = 'image/*';\n            input.onchange = async (e) => {\n              const file = (e.target as HTMLInputElement).files?.[0];\n              if (file) {\n                // 这里可以集成图片上传服务\n                const imageUrl = await uploadImage(file);\n                editor.insertText(`![${file.name}](${imageUrl})`);\n              }\n            };\n            input.click();\n          }}\n        />\n      </Tooltip>\n    );\n  }\n};\n\n// 表格插入插件\nexport const TablePlugin = {\n  name: 'table-insert',\n  align: 'left',\n  render: (editor: any) => {\n    return (\n      <Tooltip title="插入表格">\n        <Button\n          size="small"\n          icon={<TableOutlined />}\n          onClick={() => {\n            const tableMarkdown = `\n| 列1 | 列2 | 列3 |\n|-----|-----|-----|\n| 数据1 | 数据2 | 数据3 |\n| 数据4 | 数据5 | 数据6 |\n`;\n            editor.insertText(tableMarkdown);\n          }}\n        />\n      </Tooltip>\n    );\n  }\n};\n\n// 代码块插件\nexport const CodeBlockPlugin = {\n  name: 'code-block',\n  align: 'left',\n  render: (editor: any) => {\n    return (\n      <Tooltip title="插入代码块">\n        <Button\n          size="small"\n          icon={<CodeOutlined />}\n          onClick={() => {\n            const codeBlock = `\\`\\`\\`javascript\n// 在这里编写代码\nconsole.log('Hello, World!');\n\\`\\`\\``;\n            editor.insertText(codeBlock);\n          }}\n        />\n      </Tooltip>\n    );\n  }\n};\n\n// 辅助函数\nasync function uploadImage(file: File): Promise<string> {\n  // 这里实现图片上传逻辑\n  // 可以上传到云存储或本地服务器\n  return new Promise((resolve) => {\n    const reader = new FileReader();\n    reader.onload = () => {\n      resolve(reader.result as string);\n    };\n    reader.readAsDataURL(file);\n  });\n}\n```\n\n### 4. 样式定制\n\n创建 `frontend/src/styles/advanced-editor.css`：\n\n```css\n/* 高级编辑器样式定制 */\n.advanced-work-note-editor {\n  .rc-md-editor {\n    border: 1px solid #d9d9d9;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n  }\n\n  .rc-md-editor.full {\n    border-radius: 0;\n  }\n\n  .editor-container {\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n\n  .custom-toolbar {\n    background: #fafafa;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #e8e8e8;\n    padding: 8px 12px;\n  }\n\n  .editor-content {\n    font-family: 'Monaco', 'Menlo', 'Ubuntu Mono', monospace;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n\n  .preview-content {\n    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    color: #24292e;\n  }\n\n  .preview-content h1,\n  .preview-content h2,\n  .preview-content h3 {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #eaecef;\n    padding-bottom: 8px;\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n  }\n\n  .preview-content code {\n    background: #f6f8fa;\n    border-radius: 3px;\n    padding: 2px 4px;\n    font-size: 85%;\n  }\n\n  .preview-content pre {\n    background: #f6f8fa;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    padding: 16px;\n    overflow: auto;\n  }\n\n  .preview-content blockquote {\n    border-left: 4px solid #dfe2e5;\n    padding: 0 16px;\n    color: #6a737d;\n  }\n\n  .preview-content table {\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    margin: 16px 0;\n    width: 100%;\n  }\n\n  .preview-content table th,\n  .preview-content table td {\n    border: 1px solid #dfe2e5;\n    padding: 8px 12px;\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n\n  .preview-content table th {\n    background: #f6f8fa;\n    font-weight: 600;\n  }\n}\n\n/* 全屏模式样式 */\n.editor-fullscreen {\n  .advanced-work-note-editor {\n    height: 100vh !important;\n  }\n\n  .rc-md-editor {\n    height: calc(100vh - 200px) !important;\n  }\n}\n\n/* 响应式设计 */\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  .advanced-work-note-editor {\n    .rc-md-editor {\n      height: 60vh;\n    }\n\n    .custom-toolbar {\n      padding: 4px 8px;\n    }\n\n    .custom-toolbar button {\n      margin: 2px;\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n/* 暗色主题支持 */\n@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n  .advanced-work-note-editor {\n    .rc-md-editor {\n      background: #1f1f1f;\n      border-color: #434343;\n    }\n\n    .editor-content {\n      background: #1e1e1e;\n      color: #d4d4d4;\n    }\n\n    .preview-content {\n      background: #1f1f1f;\n      color: #d4d4d4;\n    }\n\n    .custom-toolbar {\n      background: #2d2d30;\n      border-color: #434343;\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## 实施步骤\n\n### 第一阶段：基础编辑器集成（3天）\n1. 安装和配置 react-markdown-editor-lite\n2. 创建 AdvancedWorkNoteEditor 组件\n3. 集成基础的Markdown编辑和预览功能\n4. 添加自定义工具栏\n\n### 第二阶段：高级功能开发（3天）\n1. 实现自定义插件（图片上传、表格、代码块）\n2. 添加快捷模板功能\n3. 优化自动保存逻辑\n4. 添加全屏编辑模式\n\n### 第三阶段：样式和体验优化（2天）\n1. 自定义编辑器样式\n2. 响应式设计适配\n3. 暗色主题支持\n4. 性能优化\n\n### 第四阶段：集成和测试（2天）\n1. 替换现有编辑器组件\n2. 功能测试和用户体验测试\n3. 性能测试和优化\n4. 文档编写\n\n## 性能优化策略\n\n### 1. 懒加载\n```tsx\n// 懒加载编辑器组件\nconst AdvancedWorkNoteEditor = React.lazy(() => \n  import('./AdvancedWorkNoteEditor')\n);\n\n// 使用时包装在 Suspense 中\n<Suspense fallback={<Spin size="large" />}>\n  <AdvancedWorkNoteEditor {...props} />\n</Suspense>\n```\n\n### 2. 虚拟化大文档\n```tsx\n// 对于超大文档，使用分页或虚拟化\nconst useVirtualizedEditor = (content: string) => {\n  const [visibleContent, setVisibleContent] = useState('');\n  \n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (content.length > 50000) {\n      // 分块处理大文档\n      setVisibleContent(content.substring(0, 10000));\n    } else {\n      setVisibleContent(content);\n    }\n  }, [content]);\n  \n  return visibleContent;\n};\n```\n\n### 3. 防抖优化\n```tsx\nimport { useDebouncedCallback } from 'use-debounce';\n\nconst debouncedSave = useDebouncedCallback(\n  (content: string) => {\n    handleAutoSave(content);\n  },\n  2000\n);\n```\n\n## 测试策略\n\n### 1. 单元测试\n```tsx\n// AdvancedWorkNoteEditor.test.tsx\nimport { render, screen, fireEvent, waitFor } from '@testing-library/react';\nimport AdvancedWorkNoteEditor from './AdvancedWorkNoteEditor';\n\ndescribe('AdvancedWorkNoteEditor', () => {\n  test('should render editor with correct initial state', () => {\n    render(\n      <AdvancedWorkNoteEditor\n        visible={true}\n        onClose={jest.fn()}\n        onSave={jest.fn()}\n      />\n    );\n    \n    expect(screen.getByPlaceholderText('开始编写你的笔记...')).toBeInTheDocument();\n  });\n\n  test('should save content correctly', async () => {\n    const onSave = jest.fn();\n    render(\n      <AdvancedWorkNoteEditor\n        visible={true}\n        onClose={jest.fn()}\n        onSave={onSave}\n      />\n    );\n    \n    // 模拟编辑和保存\n    fireEvent.click(screen.getByText('保存草稿'));\n    await waitFor(() => {\n      expect(onSave).toHaveBeenCalled();\n    });\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### 2. 集成测试\n```tsx\n// 测试编辑器与后端API的集成\nimport { renderWithProviders } from '../test-utils';\n\ntest('should integrate with work notes service', async () => {\n  const mockService = {\n    createWorkNote: jest.fn().mockResolvedValue({ id: 1 }),\n    updateWorkNote: jest.fn().mockResolvedValue({ id: 1 })\n  };\n  \n  // 使用mock服务测试\n});\n```\n\n## 验收标准\n\n1. ✅ 编辑器支持完整的Markdown语法\n2. ✅ 实时预览功能正常工作\n3. ✅ 自动保存功能稳定可靠\n4. ✅ 工具栏功能完整且易用\n5. ✅ 支持图片插入和表格编辑\n6. ✅ 快捷模板功能正常\n7. ✅ 全屏编辑模式体验良好\n8. ✅ 响应式设计适配移动端\n9. ✅ 性能优化到位，大文档编辑流畅\n10. ✅ 与现有系统集成无缝\n11. ✅ 测试覆盖率达到85%以上\n\n完成此任务后，工作笔记模块将拥有功能强大、用户体验优秀的现代化编辑器，显著提升内容创作效率。	1	2025-09-23 05:28:31.363047	2025-09-23 05:28:31.363047	\N	1	markdown	draft	\N	\N	private	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N		1	\N	{}	f	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N
1208	1	工作笔记模块技术实现检查报告	# 工作笔记模块技术实现检查报告\n\n## 执行摘要\n\n基于PRD文档对工作笔记模块的技术实现进行了全面检查，发现该模块整体架构完整，核心功能基本实现，但存在一些与PRD要求不一致的地方和需要优化的问题。\n\n## 检查范围\n\n- **数据模型实现**：后端Go模型和前端TypeScript接口\n- **API接口实现**：REST API路由和服务层\n- **前端组件实现**：React组件和交互逻辑\n- **业务逻辑实现**：权限控制、数据处理、业务流程\n\n## 详细检查结果\n\n### 1. 数据模型实现情况 ✅ 95%完成度\n\n#### 1.1 后端数据模型 (models/work_note.go)\n\n**✅ 已实现功能：**\n- 完整的WorkNote数据结构\n- 6种笔记类型：general, meeting, idea, log, reference, template\n- 4级优先级：low, medium, high, urgent  \n- 完整的元数据结构(WorkNoteMetadata)\n- 转换功能相关结构(ConversionOptions, ConversionResult等)\n- 文件夹系统(WorkNoteFolder)\n- 完整的CRUD请求/响应结构\n\n**❌ 与PRD不符：**\n- 前端接口缺少`work_note_type`和`priority`字段的类型定义\n- 前端使用通用`type`字段而非专用的工作笔记类型\n\n#### 1.2 前端数据模型 (services/workNotesService.ts)\n\n**✅ 已实现功能：**\n- 基础WorkNote接口\n- CRUD请求接口\n- 转换功能接口\n- API响应结构\n\n**❌ 缺失功能：**\n- 缺少work_note_type枚举定义\n- 缺少priority枚举定义\n- 前端接口与后端模型不完全匹配\n\n### 2. API接口实现情况 ✅ 90%完成度\n\n#### 2.1 路由定义 (routes/work_notes_routes.go)\n\n**✅ 已实现的API：**\n```go\n// 基础CRUD\nGET    /work-notes              // 列表\nPOST   /work-notes              // 创建  \nGET    /work-notes/search       // 搜索\nGET    /work-notes/:id          // 详情\nPUT    /work-notes/:id          // 更新\nDELETE /work-notes/:id          // 删除\n\n// 统计和转换\nGET    /work-notes/stats                           // 统计\nPOST   /work-notes/:id/convert-preview             // 转换预览\nPOST   /work-notes/:id/convert-to-task-document    // 转换为任务文档\nPOST   /work-notes/batch-convert-to-task-documents // 批量转换\n\n// 文件夹管理\nGET    /work-note-folders       // 文件夹列表\nPOST   /work-note-folders       // 创建文件夹\nGET    /work-note-folders/tree  // 文件夹树\n// ... 完整的文件夹CRUD和管理操作\n```\n\n**✅ 符合PRD要求：**\n- 所有PRD中定义的API端点都已实现\n- 支持搜索、统计、转换等高级功能\n- 完整的文件夹管理API\n\n#### 2.2 前端服务层 (services/workNotesService.ts)\n\n**✅ 已实现功能：**\n- 完整的CRUD操作\n- 搜索功能\n- 统计功能  \n- 转换功能\n- 自动认证头处理\n\n**❌ 存在问题：**\n- 部分API调用可能与后端实际实现不匹配\n- 缺少错误处理的统一标准\n\n### 3. 前端组件实现情况 ✅ 85%完成度\n\n#### 3.1 核心组件\n\n**✅ 已实现组件：**\n1. `WorkNotesManager` - 主管理界面 ✅\n2. `ModernWorkNoteEditor` - 现代化编辑器 ✅\n3. `ModernWorkNoteViewer` - 内容查看器 ✅\n4. `WorkNoteConversionModal` - 转换功能弹窗 ✅\n5. `BatchWorkNoteConversionModal` - 批量转换 ✅\n6. `WorkNoteTaskSelectionModal` - 任务选择 ✅\n\n#### 3.2 界面功能对比\n\n**✅ 已实现功能：**\n- 列表和网格视图切换\n- 高级搜索和过滤\n- ID快速搜索(#ID格式)\n- 状态统计显示\n- 批量操作支持\n- 实时自动保存\n- 标签管理\n- 权限控制\n\n**❌ 与PRD不符：**\n- 缺少工作笔记类型的UI选择器\n- 缺少优先级的视觉指示\n- 编辑器功能相对基础，缺少高级功能\n- 缺少收藏/置顶的界面支持\n\n### 4. 业务逻辑实现情况 ✅ 80%完成度\n\n#### 4.1 权限控制\n\n**✅ 已实现：**\n- 三级权限：private/team/public\n- 基于用户ID的所有权验证\n- API级别的权限检查\n\n**❌ 缺失：**\n- 企业级权限集成尚未完全启用\n- 文件夹权限继承逻辑需要验证\n\n#### 4.2 数据处理\n\n**✅ 已实现：**\n- 基于Document模型的扩展设计\n- 元数据存储和解析\n- 软删除机制\n- 版本控制支持\n\n**✅ 转换功能：**\n- 工作笔记到任务文档转换\n- 批量转换支持\n- 转换预览功能\n- 关联关系保持\n\n#### 4.3 搜索和统计\n\n**✅ 已实现：**\n- 全文搜索\n- 多维度过滤\n- 状态统计\n- ID快速查找\n\n### 5. 主要差异分析\n\n#### 5.1 数据模型差异\n\n| PRD要求 | 实际实现 | 影响程度 |\n|---------|----------|----------|\n| work_note_type字段 | 使用通用type字段 | 中等 |\n| priority字段 | 存储在metadata中 | 中等 |\n| 前端类型定义 | 缺少枚举类型 | 低 |\n\n#### 5.2 功能实现差异\n\n| PRD要求 | 实际实现 | 状态 |\n|---------|----------|------|\n| 6种笔记类型 | 后端支持，前端未完全适配 | 部分实现 |\n| 4级优先级 | 后端支持，前端显示不足 | 部分实现 |\n| 收藏/置顶 | 后端支持，前端UI缺失 | 部分实现 |\n| 阅读统计 | 字段定义存在，逻辑未实现 | 未实现 |\n\n#### 5.3 用户体验差异\n\n| PRD要求 | 实际实现 | 评估 |\n|---------|----------|------|\n| 三栏布局 | 已实现 | ✅ 符合 |\n| 抽屉式编辑器 | 已实现 | ✅ 符合 |\n| 实时预览 | 基础实现 | ⚠️ 可优化 |\n| 响应式设计 | 基本支持 | ⚠️ 可优化 |\n\n## 技术债务和风险点\n\n### 1. 高优先级问题\n\n1. **数据模型不一致**\n   - 前后端接口定义不完全匹配\n   - 工作笔记特有字段在前端处理不足\n\n2. **功能完整性**\n   - 优先级和类型在UI层面支持不足\n   - 收藏置顶功能UI缺失\n\n### 2. 中等优先级问题\n\n1. **性能优化**\n   - 大列表渲染可优化\n   - 搜索响应时间可改进\n\n2. **用户体验**\n   - 编辑器功能相对基础\n   - 移动端适配有改进空间\n\n### 3. 低优先级问题\n\n1. **代码质量**\n   - 部分组件过于复杂\n   - 测试覆盖率不足\n\n## 改进建议\n\n### 1. 短期改进（1-2周）\n\n1. **统一数据模型**\n   ```typescript\n   // 前端补充缺失的类型定义\n   export type WorkNoteType = 'general' | 'meeting' | 'idea' | 'log' | 'reference' | 'template';\n   export type WorkNotePriority = 'low' | 'medium' | 'high' | 'urgent';\n   ```\n\n2. **完善UI组件**\n   - 添加工作笔记类型选择器\n   - 实现优先级视觉指示\n   - 添加收藏/置顶按钮\n\n3. **修复API对接**\n   - 确保前后端接口完全匹配\n   - 统一错误处理机制\n\n### 2. 中期改进（1-2个月）\n\n1. **增强编辑器功能**\n   - 升级Markdown编辑器\n   - 添加更多格式支持\n   - 改进预览功能\n\n2. **性能优化**\n   - 实现虚拟列表\n   - 优化搜索性能\n   - 添加缓存机制\n\n3. **统计和分析**\n   - 实现阅读统计逻辑\n   - 添加使用分析报表\n   - 改进搜索结果排序\n\n### 3. 长期改进（3-6个月）\n\n1. **高级功能**\n   - 实时协作编辑\n   - AI辅助创作\n   - 知识图谱构建\n\n2. **企业功能**\n   - 完善权限系统\n   - 多租户支持\n   - 审计日志\n\n## 总体评估\n\n### 完成度评分\n\n- **数据模型**: 95% ✅\n- **API接口**: 90% ✅  \n- **前端组件**: 85% ✅\n- **业务逻辑**: 80% ✅\n- **用户体验**: 75% ⚠️\n\n### 整体评价\n\n工作笔记模块整体实现质量较高，核心功能完整，架构设计合理。主要问题集中在前后端数据模型对接和部分UI功能的完整性上。建议优先解决数据模型不一致问题，然后逐步完善用户体验。\n\n该模块已具备生产使用的基础条件，通过短期改进可以达到PRD要求的标准。	1	2025-09-23 05:22:02.727348	2025-09-23 05:28:47.37789	\N	1	markdown	draft	\N	\N	private	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N		1	\N	{}	f	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N
1214	1	工作笔记UI功能完善实现文档	# 工作笔记UI功能完善实现文档\n\n## 任务概述\n\n完成了工作笔记模块的UI功能完善，实现了工作笔记类型、优先级、收藏和置顶等核心功能，大幅提升了用户体验和功能完整性。\n\n## 已实现功能\n\n### 1. 工作笔记类型系统 ✅\n\n**新增类型支持**:\n- 📝 **通用笔记** (general) - 蓝色主题\n- 🤝 **会议笔记** (meeting) - 绿色主题  \n- 💡 **想法记录** (idea) - 黄色主题\n- 📋 **工作日志** (log) - 紫色主题\n- 📚 **参考资料** (reference) - 青色主题\n- 📄 **笔记模板** (template) - 粉色主题\n\n**UI实现**:\n- 表格列显示类型标签（带图标和颜色）\n- 创建/编辑表单支持类型选择\n- 过滤器支持按类型筛选\n- 类型配置集中管理\n\n### 2. 优先级系统 ✅\n\n**优先级分级**:\n- 🔴 **紧急** (urgent) - 红色\n- 🟡 **高优先级** (high) - 橙色\n- 🔵 **中等优先级** (medium) - 蓝色  \n- ⚪ **低优先级** (low) - 灰色\n\n**UI实现**:\n- 表格列显示优先级标签\n- 创建/编辑表单支持优先级选择（必填）\n- 过滤器支持按优先级筛选\n- 颜色编码便于快速识别\n\n### 3. 收藏功能 ✅\n\n**功能特性**:\n- 📑 收藏/取消收藏切换\n- 标题行显示收藏图标指示器\n- 操作列快速收藏按钮\n- 表单支持设置收藏状态\n\n**UI体验**:\n- 橙色书签图标 (BookmarkFilled/BookmarkOutlined)\n- 按钮状态实时更新\n- 操作成功提示\n\n### 4. 置顶功能 ✅\n\n**功能特性**:\n- 📌 置顶/取消置顶切换\n- 标题行显示置顶图标指示器\n- 操作列快速置顶按钮\n- 表单支持设置置顶状态\n\n**UI体验**:\n- 红色图钉图标 (PushpinFilled/PushpinOutlined)\n- 按钮状态实时更新\n- 操作成功提示\n\n### 5. 表格功能增强 ✅\n\n**新增列**:\n- **笔记类型列**: 显示工作笔记类型（带图标和颜色）\n- **优先级列**: 显示优先级标签（带颜色编码）\n- **视觉指示器**: 标题列显示置顶、收藏、模板图标\n\n**操作增强**:\n- 新增收藏/取消收藏按钮\n- 新增置顶/取消置顶按钮\n- 保留原有模板、复制、删除等功能\n\n### 6. 过滤和搜索增强 ✅\n\n**新增过滤器**:\n- **笔记类型过滤**: 支持按6种笔记类型筛选\n- **优先级过滤**: 支持按4个优先级筛选\n- **重置功能**: 一键清空所有过滤条件\n\n**UI布局**:\n- 响应式布局，移动端友好\n- 过滤器状态实时反映\n- 结果统计显示\n\n### 7. 表单功能完善 ✅\n\n**创建表单**:\n- 笔记类型选择器（必填）\n- 优先级选择器（必填）\n- 置顶和收藏复选框\n- 表单验证和默认值\n\n**编辑表单**:\n- 所有字段支持编辑\n- 预填充现有值\n- 数据一致性保证\n\n## 技术实现\n\n### 1. 前端架构\n\n**组件结构**:\n```\nWorkNotesManager.tsx\n├── 类型和优先级常量导入\n├── 状态管理（新增过滤器状态）\n├── 数据转换和处理\n├── 表格列定义（新增类型和优先级列）\n├── 操作函数（收藏、置顶切换）\n└── 表单组件（创建/编辑）\n```\n\n**关键文件**:\n- `workNoteTypes.ts`: 类型和优先级常量定义\n- `workNotesService.ts`: API服务层数据转换\n- `WorkNotesManager.tsx`: 主要UI组件\n\n### 2. 数据流\n\n**前后端交互**:\n```\n前端表单 → 服务层转换 → 后端API → 数据库\n数据库 → 后端API → 服务层转换 → 前端展示\n```\n\n**字段映射**:\n- `work_note_type`: general|meeting|idea|log|reference|template\n- `priority`: low|medium|high|urgent  \n- `is_pinned`: boolean\n- `is_bookmarked`: boolean\n\n### 3. UI/UX设计\n\n**设计原则**:\n- 图标化：使用直观的emoji和图标\n- 色彩化：不同类型和优先级使用不同颜色\n- 一致性：与现有设计语言保持一致\n- 响应式：支持移动端和桌面端\n\n**交互体验**:\n- 即时反馈：操作后立即显示结果\n- 批量操作：支持多选和批量处理\n- 快速访问：关键操作按钮易于点击\n\n## 测试验证\n\n### API测试 ✅\n创建测试笔记验证所有新功能：\n```json\n{\n  "title": "高优先级会议笔记 - 工作笔记UI功能测试",\n  "work_note_type": "meeting",\n  "priority": "high", \n  "is_pinned": true,\n  "is_bookmarked": true,\n  "tags": ["测试", "UI功能", "会议"]\n}\n```\n\n**验证结果**: ✅ 所有字段正确保存和返回\n\n### 前端编译 ✅\n- TypeScript编译成功\n- 没有引入新的编译错误\n- 现有警告不影响新功能\n\n### 功能完整性 ✅\n- ✅ 创建笔记支持所有新字段\n- ✅ 编辑笔记支持所有新字段\n- ✅ 表格显示所有新字段\n- ✅ 过滤器支持新字段筛选\n- ✅ 操作按钮功能正常\n\n## 影响和价值\n\n### 用户体验提升\n- **功能完整性**: 从基础文档管理提升到专业笔记系统\n- **分类管理**: 6种笔记类型满足不同使用场景\n- **优先级管理**: 4级优先级支持任务管理\n- **快速操作**: 收藏和置顶便于重要内容管理\n\n### 系统功能增强\n- **数据结构**: 更丰富的元数据支持高级功能\n- **过滤搜索**: 多维度筛选提升查找效率\n- **视觉识别**: 颜色和图标编码提升可读性\n- **批量管理**: 支持批量操作提升工作效率\n\n### 代码质量\n- **模块化设计**: 常量配置集中管理\n- **类型安全**: TypeScript类型定义完善\n- **数据一致性**: 前后端字段映射统一\n- **可维护性**: 代码结构清晰，易于扩展\n\n## 后续建议\n\n### 优化方向\n1. **智能推荐**: 根据内容自动推荐笔记类型\n2. **批量编辑**: 支持批量修改类型和优先级\n3. **快捷键**: 添加键盘快捷键支持\n4. **模板系统**: 基于类型的模板预设\n\n### 性能优化\n1. **虚拟滚动**: 大量数据时的性能优化\n2. **缓存策略**: 常用筛选条件缓存\n3. **懒加载**: 图标和样式按需加载\n\n---\n\n**实现时间**: 2025-09-23  \n**实现状态**: ✅ 完成  \n**测试状态**: ✅ 通过  \n**部署状态**: ✅ 就绪	1	2025-09-23 06:07:18.511906	2025-09-23 06:07:18.511906	\N	1	markdown	draft	\N	\N	private	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N		1	\N	{}	f	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N
1216	40	任务文档	# 入库单条形码问题修复记录\n\n## 修复操作\n\n### 1. 问题确认\n- 入库单使用错误的API路径：`API_BASE_URL + /pbc/barcode`\n- 出库单使用正确的API路径：`baseURL + /v1/pbc/barcode`\n\n### 2. 修复操作\n**文件：** `diciai-admin/src/pages/warehouse/inbound/components/inbound-print.vue`\n\n**修改内容：**\n1. **第35-36行**：替换条形码URL生成逻辑\n   ```javascript\n   // 修改前\n   const url = API_BASE_URL + `/pbc/barcode?type=2&text=` + data.value.code;\n   \n   // 修改后\n   const baseURL = import.meta.env.VITE_APP_BASE_API_DEV ?? import.meta.env.VITE_APP_BASE_API;\n   const url = baseURL + `/v1/pbc/barcode?type=2&text=` + data.value.code;\n   ```\n\n2. **第17行**：移除不再需要的导入\n   ```javascript\n   // 删除\n   import { API_BASE_URL } from '@/config/default-setting.ts';\n   ```\n\n### 3. 验证结果\n- ✅ 构建测试通过：`yarn build:test` 成功完成\n- ✅ 代码语法正确：无编译错误\n- ✅ 与出库单逻辑保持一致\n\n### 4. 修复效果\n修复后，入库单的条形码生成将使用与出库单相同的逻辑：\n- 正确的环境变量：`VITE_APP_BASE_API_DEV ?? VITE_APP_BASE_API`\n- 正确的API路径：`/v1/pbc/barcode`\n- 确保条形码能够正常显示\n\n## 下一步\n建议测试入库单打印预览功能，确认条形码能够正常生成和显示。	110	2025-09-23 11:23:38.907484	2025-09-23 11:23:38.907484	\N	110	markdown	draft	\N	\N	private	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N		1	\N	{}	f	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N
1217	129	任务文档	# APP设备与本机IP连接配置指南\n\n## 环境信息概览\n\n### 本机网络配置\n- **主网卡IP**: `192.168.0.103/24` (Wi-Fi)\n- **虚拟机网络1**: `192.168.139.3/23` \n- **虚拟机网络2**: `172.31.0.0/16`\n- **默认网关**: `192.168.0.1`\n\n### 后端服务状态\n- **服务地址**: 本机所有网络接口\n- **端口**: `9099`\n- **API路径**: `/api/v1/`\n- **状态**: ✅ 正常运行 (已验证)\n\n### APP当前配置\n- **Debug模式**: `http://192.168.202.104:9099/api/v1/`\n- **Release模式**: `https://api.example.com/api/v1/`\n\n## 问题分析\n\n### 当前问题\nAPP配置的IP地址 `192.168.202.104` 与本机实际IP `192.168.0.103` 不匹配，导致无法连接。\n\n### 网络连接要求\n1. APP设备与本机必须在同一网络段\n2. 设备能够访问本机的9099端口\n3. 防火墙允许相关端口通信\n\n## 解决方案\n\n### 方案1：修改APP配置（推荐）\n\n**步骤1：修改build.gradle配置**\n```gradle\n// 文件: diciai-app/app/build.gradle\nbuildTypes {\n    debug {\n        buildConfigField "String", "API_BASE_URL", '"http://192.168.0.103:9099/api/v1/"'\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**步骤2：重新构建APP**\n```bash\ncd diciai-app\n./gradlew clean assembleDebug\n./gradlew installDebug\n```\n\n### 方案2：环境变量方式\n\n**构建时指定API地址：**\n```bash\nDICIAI_API_URL="http://192.168.0.103:9099/api/v1/" ./gradlew assembleDebug\n```\n\n### 方案3：动态IP获取\n\n**修改为获取本机局域网IP：**\n```bash\n# 获取本机局域网IP\nLOCAL_IP=$(ifconfig | grep -E "inet.*broadcast" | grep "192.168" | awk '{print $2}' | head -1)\nDICIAI_API_URL="http://${LOCAL_IP}:9099/api/v1/" ./gradlew assembleDebug\n```\n\n## 网络连接验证\n\n### 验证步骤\n\n**1. 确认后端服务运行**\n```bash\ncurl http://192.168.0.103:9099/api/v1/healthz\n```\n\n**2. 确认设备网络连通性**\n- 设备ping本机IP：`ping 192.168.0.103`\n- 设备访问API：`curl http://192.168.0.103:9099/api/v1/healthz`\n\n**3. 检查防火墙设置**\n```bash\n# macOS检查防火墙\nsudo pfctl -sr\n# 如需开放端口\nsudo pfctl -d  # 临时关闭防火墙测试\n```\n\n### 常见网络场景\n\n**场景1：Wi-Fi连接**\n- 本机和设备连接同一Wi-Fi\n- 使用Wi-Fi网段IP：`192.168.0.103`\n\n**场景2：有线网络**\n- 检查有线网卡IP地址\n- 相应修改APP配置\n\n**场景3：移动热点**\n- 本机开启热点，设备连接\n- 使用热点网段IP（通常 `192.168.x.1`）\n\n## 自动化配置脚本\n\n### 智能IP检测脚本\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n# 文件: setup-app-ip.sh\n\n# 获取主要网络接口IP\nMAIN_IP=$(route get default | grep interface | awk '{print $2}' | xargs ifconfig | grep -E "inet.*broadcast" | awk '{print $2}' | head -1)\n\nif [ -z "$MAIN_IP" ]; then\n    echo "无法获取网络IP，请手动配置"\n    exit 1\nfi\n\necho "检测到本机IP: $MAIN_IP"\necho "配置APP连接地址: http://$MAIN_IP:9099/api/v1/"\n\n# 修改build.gradle\nsed -i '' "s|http://.*:9099/api/v1/|http://$MAIN_IP:9099/api/v1/|g" diciai-app/app/build.gradle\n\necho "APP配置已更新，请重新构建APP"\n```\n\n### 快速部署命令\n```bash\n# 一键配置和构建\nchmod +x setup-app-ip.sh\n./setup-app-ip.sh\ncd diciai-app && ./gradlew clean assembleDebug installDebug\n```\n\n## 故障排除\n\n### 常见问题\n\n**1. 连接超时**\n- 检查IP地址是否正确\n- 确认设备网络连通性\n- 检查防火墙设置\n\n**2. 404错误**\n- 确认API路径正确：`/api/v1/`\n- 检查后端服务状态\n\n**3. 认证失败**\n- 确认JWT token正常\n- 检查登录接口：`/api/v1/pda-login`\n\n### 调试工具\n\n**网络调试：**\n```bash\n# 端口扫描\nnmap -p 9099 192.168.0.103\n\n# 网络连通性\ntelnet 192.168.0.103 9099\n\n# 抓包分析\ntcpdump -i any port 9099\n```\n\n**APP日志：**\n```bash\n# 查看APP网络请求日志\nadb logcat | grep -E "(HTTP|Network|ApiClient)"\n\n# 查看认证相关日志\nadb logcat | grep -E "(Auth|Login|Token)"\n```\n\n## 最佳实践\n\n### 开发环境建议\n1. **固定IP配置**：为开发机器配置静态IP\n2. **多环境支持**：使用环境变量区分不同网络\n3. **自动发现**：实现IP自动发现机制\n4. **网络监控**：添加网络状态检测\n\n### 部署清单\n- [ ] 确认本机IP地址\n- [ ] 修改APP配置文件\n- [ ] 重新构建APP\n- [ ] 验证网络连通性\n- [ ] 测试API接口调用\n- [ ] 确认设备可正常登录使用\n\n## 相关文件\n- **APP配置**: `diciai-app/app/build.gradle:27`\n- **网络客户端**: `diciai-app/app/src/main/java/com/diciai/app/network/ApiClient.kt`\n- **API配置**: `diciai-app/app/src/main/java/com/diciai/app/network/ApiConfig.kt`\n- **后端服务**: 监听所有接口端口9099	110	2025-09-23 12:04:37.803276	2025-09-23 12:04:37.803276	\N	110	markdown	draft	\N	\N	private	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N		1	\N	{}	f	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N
1218	129	任务文档	# DICIAI Android App USB自动配置解决方案\n\n## 问题描述\n\n每次Android设备通过USB连接开发机时，都需要手动修改`build.gradle`中的IP地址配置，然后重新编译安装APP，过程繁琐且容易出错。\n\n## 解决方案\n\n创建了自动化脚本 `auto-config-android.sh`，实现USB设备连接时的自动配置。\n\n### 核心功能\n\n1. **自动IP检测**: 自动获取开发机当前局域网IP地址\n2. **设备监控**: 监控USB设备连接状态\n3. **配置更新**: 自动更新`build.gradle`中的API地址\n4. **自动编译**: 自动编译并安装APK到设备\n5. **数据清理**: 清除应用缓存，确保配置生效\n\n### 脚本特性\n\n#### 使用模式\n- **一次性配置**: 连接设备后执行一次配置\n- **监控模式**: 持续监控设备连接，自动配置新设备\n\n#### 安全保障\n- 自动备份原始`build.gradle`文件\n- 后端连接测试，确保服务可用\n- 详细的日志输出和错误处理\n\n#### 智能检测\n- 自动检测本机IP地址变化\n- 验证ADB工具可用性\n- 检查设备连接状态\n\n### 使用方法\n\n```bash\n# 基础使用 - 一次性配置\n./auto-config-android.sh\n\n# 监控模式 - 持续监控设备连接\n./auto-config-android.sh --monitor\n\n# 查看帮助\n./auto-config-android.sh --help\n```\n\n### 工作流程\n\n1. **设备检测**: 等待USB设备连接\n2. **IP获取**: 获取开发机当前IP (如: 192.168.0.103)\n3. **后端验证**: 测试后端服务连接性\n4. **配置备份**: 备份当前build.gradle\n5. **配置更新**: 修改API_BASE_URL为当前IP\n6. **编译安装**: 执行`./gradlew clean assembleDebug`并安装\n7. **应用重置**: 清除应用数据缓存\n8. **启动应用**: 自动启动登录页面\n\n### 技术实现\n\n#### IP检测\n```bash\nifconfig | grep "inet " | grep -v "127.0.0.1" | head -1 | awk '{print $2}'\n```\n\n#### 配置更新\n```bash\nsed -i '' "s|buildConfigField \\"String\\", \\"API_BASE_URL\\", '\\"http://[^\\"]*\\"'|buildConfigField \\"String\\", \\"API_BASE_URL\\", '\\"$new_url\\"'|g" "$BUILD_GRADLE"\n```\n\n#### 设备管理\n```bash\nadb wait-for-device\nadb uninstall com.diciai.app\nadb install app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk\nadb shell pm clear com.diciai.app\n```\n\n### 文件位置\n\n- **脚本文件**: `/Users/johnqiu/coding/www/projects/new-diciai/auto-config-android.sh`\n- **目标配置**: `/Users/johnqiu/coding/www/projects/new-diciai/diciai-app/app/build.gradle`\n- **备份目录**: `/Users/johnqiu/coding/www/projects/new-diciai/diciai-app/backups/`\n\n### 解决的痛点\n\n1. ✅ **手动配置繁琐**: 自动检测和配置IP地址\n2. ✅ **编译安装重复**: 自动化编译安装流程\n3. ✅ **缓存清理**: 自动清除应用数据确保配置生效\n4. ✅ **错误处理**: 完善的错误检测和日志输出\n5. ✅ **开发效率**: 从手动5-10分钟缩短为自动30秒\n\n### 使用建议\n\n1. **监控模式**: 开发期间建议使用监控模式，一次启动，持续工作\n2. **后端先启动**: 确保后端服务已启动再连接设备\n3. **USB调试**: 确保Android设备已开启USB调试\n4. **网络稳定**: 确保开发机和设备在同一局域网\n\n### 示例输出\n\n```\n[INFO] DICIAI Android Auto-Configuration\n[INFO] Local IP: 192.168.0.103\n[INFO] App directory: /Users/johnqiu/coding/www/projects/new-diciai/diciai-app\n[INFO] Waiting for Android device connection...\n[SUCCESS] Device connected: LP60255L00628\n[INFO] Testing backend connection at http://192.168.0.103:9099/api/v1/health\n[SUCCESS] Backend is reachable at 192.168.0.103:9099\n[INFO] Updating build.gradle with IP: 192.168.0.103\n[SUCCESS] Updated API_BASE_URL to: http://192.168.0.103:9099/api/v1/\n[INFO] Building debug APK...\n[SUCCESS] Build completed successfully\n[INFO] Installing new APK...\n[SUCCESS] App installed successfully\n[INFO] Clearing app data...\n[INFO] Starting app...\n[SUCCESS] Auto-configuration completed!\n```\n\n## 结论\n\n该自动化解决方案彻底解决了手动配置的问题，提高了开发效率，减少了人为错误。开发者只需连接USB设备，脚本会自动完成所有配置工作。	110	2025-09-23 12:18:10.694748	2025-09-23 12:18:10.694748	\N	110	markdown	draft	\N	\N	private	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N		1	\N	{}	f	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N
1219	1	任务文档	# 散货出库扫码UI优化分析与建议\n\n## 当前问题分析\n\n### 现有设计的问题\n1. **反向选择checkbox设计突兀**\n   - 用户认知负担重，需要理解"选中=减法，未选中=加法"的逆向逻辑\n   - 与常规UI习惯相违背（通常checkbox选中表示正向操作）\n\n2. **红叉图标过于突兀**\n   - 视觉上过于强烈，给用户负面心理暗示\n   - 不符合现代扁平化设计趋势\n\n## UI/UX优化建议\n\n### 方案一：操作模式切换器\n**设计思路：** 使用toggle switch或segmented control明确表示当前操作模式\n\n```\n[+ 加货] [- 减货]  // segmented control\n```\n\n**优势：**\n- 直观明了，用户一眼就能看出当前模式\n- 符合用户心理模型\n- 操作反馈清晰\n\n### 方案二：动态按钮状态\n**设计思路：** 用不同颜色和文字的按钮表示当前状态\n\n```\n[正在添加货物 +]  // 绿色背景\n[正在减少货物 -]  // 橙色背景\n```\n\n### 方案三：图标+文字组合\n**设计思路：** 使用更友好的图标替代红叉\n\n```\n📦 入库模式    or    📤 出库模式\n⬆️ 增加数量    or    ⬇️ 减少数量\n```\n\n## 推荐方案\n\n### 建议采用方案一：操作模式切换器\n\n#### 具体设计细节：\n1. **位置：** 扫码输入框上方显著位置\n2. **样式：** 使用segmented control或toggle switch\n3. **状态标识：**\n   - 加货模式：绿色背景 + "+" 图标 + "增加"文字\n   - 减货模式：橙色背景 + "-" 图标 + "减少"文字\n4. **默认状态：** 加货模式（符合正常业务流程）\n\n#### 交互流程：\n1. 用户进入页面，默认为"增加"模式\n2. 需要减货时，点击切换到"减少"模式\n3. 模式状态在整个扫码过程中保持，直到用户主动切换\n4. 每次扫码后，根据当前模式执行相应操作\n\n#### 用户体验优势：\n- **直观性：** 当前操作模式一目了然\n- **一致性：** 符合用户对加/减操作的认知习惯\n- **效率性：** 减少用户思考成本，提高操作效率\n- **错误预防：** 降低误操作概率\n\n## 技术实现要点\n\n1. **状态管理：** 维护当前操作模式的全局状态\n2. **视觉反馈：** 确保模式切换有清晰的视觉变化\n3. **操作确认：** 考虑在减货操作时增加轻量级确认机制\n4. **记忆功能：** 可考虑记住用户最近使用的模式\n\n## 后续优化建议\n\n1. **A/B测试：** 可以考虑对不同用户群体测试不同方案\n2. **用户反馈：** 上线后收集实际使用反馈\n3. **数据分析：** 监控误操作率的变化	110	2025-09-23 16:50:59.277774	2025-09-23 16:50:59.277774	\N	110	markdown	draft	\N	\N	private	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N		1	\N	{}	f	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N
1220	1	任务文档	# 散货出库扫码UI优化 - 详细开发方案\n\n## 一、现有问题分析\n\n### 当前实现（BulkOutboundScanActivity.kt第133-145行）\n```xml\n<CheckBox\n    android:id="@+id/cb_reduce_mode"\n    android:layout_width="wrap_content"\n    android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n    android:layout_marginTop="8dp"\n    android:text="反向"\n    android:textSize="14sp"\n    android:textStyle="bold"\n    android:checked="false"\n    android:padding="8dp"\n    android:drawableStart="@android:drawable/ic_delete"\n    android:drawablePadding="8dp"\n    android:layout_gravity="center" />\n```\n\n### 逻辑问题（第352-354行）\n```kotlin\nprivate fun getCurrentOperationType(): Boolean {\n    return !binding.cbReduceMode.isChecked // true=增加, false=减少\n}\n```\n\n**问题总结：**\n1. 使用红叉图标(`ic_delete`)过于突兀\n2. 反向逻辑：未选中=增加，选中=减少，违反直觉\n3. "反向"文字表述模糊，用户理解困难\n\n## 二、优化方案：操作模式切换器\n\n### 设计原则\n- **直观性**：当前操作模式一目了然\n- **正向逻辑**：选中状态与操作含义一致\n- **视觉友好**：使用友好的图标和颜色\n\n### UI设计方案\n\n#### 方案A：双按钮切换器（推荐）\n```xml\n<LinearLayout\n    android:layout_width="wrap_content"\n    android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n    android:layout_marginTop="8dp"\n    android:layout_gravity="center"\n    android:orientation="horizontal"\n    android:background="@drawable/operation_mode_selector_bg"\n    android:padding="2dp">\n\n    <Button\n        android:id="@+id/btn_add_mode"\n        style="@style/OperationModeButton"\n        android:layout_width="100dp"\n        android:layout_height="40dp"\n        android:text="增加"\n        android:drawableStart="@drawable/ic_add_circle"\n        android:drawablePadding="4dp"\n        android:selected="true" />\n\n    <Button\n        android:id="@+id/btn_reduce_mode" \n        style="@style/OperationModeButton"\n        android:layout_width="100dp"\n        android:layout_height="40dp"\n        android:text="减少"\n        android:drawableStart="@drawable/ic_remove_circle"\n        android:drawablePadding="4dp"\n        android:selected="false" />\n\n</LinearLayout>\n```\n\n#### 方案B：Toggle Button（备选）\n```xml\n<ToggleButton\n    android:id="@+id/toggle_operation_mode"\n    android:layout_width="wrap_content"\n    android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n    android:layout_marginTop="8dp"\n    android:layout_gravity="center"\n    android:textOn="减少模式"\n    android:textOff="增加模式"\n    android:checked="false"\n    android:background="@drawable/toggle_operation_selector" />\n```\n\n## 三、具体实施计划\n\n### 3.1 创建新的样式资源\n\n#### 新建文件：`res/values/styles.xml`（如不存在）\n```xml\n<style name="OperationModeButton" parent="Widget.Material3.Button.OutlinedButton">\n    <item name="android:textSize">14sp</item>\n    <item name="android:textStyle">bold</item>\n    <item name="android:minHeight">40dp</item>\n</style>\n```\n\n#### 新建文件：`res/drawable/operation_mode_selector_bg.xml`\n```xml\n<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>\n<shape xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android">\n    <solid android:color="@color/operation_selector_bg" />\n    <corners android:radius="20dp" />\n    <stroke android:width="1dp" android:color="@color/operation_selector_border" />\n</shape>\n```\n\n#### 新建文件：`res/drawable/operation_mode_button_selector.xml`\n```xml\n<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>\n<selector xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android">\n    <item android:state_selected="true">\n        <shape>\n            <solid android:color="@color/operation_selected_bg" />\n            <corners android:radius="18dp" />\n        </shape>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n        <shape>\n            <solid android:color="@color/operation_unselected_bg" />\n            <corners android:radius="18dp" />\n        </shape>\n    </item>\n</selector>\n```\n\n### 3.2 创建图标资源\n\n#### 需要的矢量图标\n- `res/drawable/ic_add_circle.xml`：绿色加号圆圈\n- `res/drawable/ic_remove_circle.xml`：橙色减号圆圈\n\n```xml\n<!-- ic_add_circle.xml -->\n<vector xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"\n    android:width="24dp"\n    android:height="24dp"\n    android:viewportWidth="24"\n    android:viewportHeight="24">\n    <path\n        android:fillColor="#4CAF50"\n        android:pathData="M12,2C6.48,2 2,6.48 2,12s4.48,10 10,10 10,-4.48 10,-10S17.52,2 12,2zM17,13h-4v4h-2v-4H7v-2h4V7h2v4h4v2z"/>\n</vector>\n\n<!-- ic_remove_circle.xml -->\n<vector xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"\n    android:width="24dp"\n    android:height="24dp"\n    android:viewportWidth="24"\n    android:viewportHeight="24">\n    <path\n        android:fillColor="#FF9800"\n        android:pathData="M12,2C6.48,2 2,6.48 2,12s4.48,10 10,10 10,-4.48 10,-10S17.52,2 12,2zM17,13H7v-2h10v2z"/>\n</vector>\n```\n\n### 3.3 添加颜色资源\n\n#### 在`res/values/colors.xml`中添加：\n```xml\n<!-- 操作模式选择器颜色 -->\n<color name="operation_selector_bg">#F5F5F5</color>\n<color name="operation_selector_border">#E0E0E0</color>\n<color name="operation_selected_bg">#FFFFFF</color>\n<color name="operation_unselected_bg">#00FFFFFF</color>\n<color name="operation_add_color">#4CAF50</color>\n<color name="operation_reduce_color">#FF9800</color>\n```\n\n### 3.4 修改布局文件\n\n#### 替换`activity_bulk_outbound_scan.xml`第133-145行\n```xml\n<!-- 操作模式选择器 - 新设计 -->\n<LinearLayout\n    android:layout_width="wrap_content"\n    android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n    android:layout_marginTop="12dp"\n    android:layout_gravity="center_horizontal"\n    android:orientation="horizontal"\n    android:background="@drawable/operation_mode_selector_bg"\n    android:padding="3dp">\n\n    <Button\n        android:id="@+id/btn_add_mode"\n        style="@style/OperationModeButton"\n        android:layout_width="110dp"\n        android:layout_height="44dp"\n        android:text="+ 增加"\n        android:textColor="@color/operation_add_color"\n        android:background="@drawable/operation_mode_button_selector"\n        android:selected="true" />\n\n    <Button\n        android:id="@+id/btn_reduce_mode"\n        style="@style/OperationModeButton"\n        android:layout_width="110dp"\n        android:layout_height="44dp"\n        android:text="- 减少"\n        android:textColor="@color/operation_reduce_color"\n        android:background="@drawable/operation_mode_button_selector"\n        android:selected="false" />\n\n</LinearLayout>\n```\n\n### 3.5 修改Kotlin代码\n\n#### 修改`BulkOutboundScanActivity.kt`\n\n**1. 声明新的视图变量（在类顶部）：**\n```kotlin\nprivate var isAddMode: Boolean = true // 默认增加模式\n```\n\n**2. 替换`setupListeners()`方法中的checkbox监听器（第297-306行）：**\n```kotlin\n// 操作模式切换监听器\nbinding.btnAddMode.setOnClickListener {\n    switchToAddMode()\n}\n\nbinding.btnReduceMode.setOnClickListener {\n    switchToReduceMode()\n}\n```\n\n**3. 添加新的模式切换方法：**\n```kotlin\n/**\n * 切换到增加模式\n */\nprivate fun switchToAddMode() {\n    if (!isAddMode) {\n        isAddMode = true\n        updateModeButtons()\n        showMessage("已切换到：增加模式")\n        Log.d(TAG, "切换到增加模式")\n    }\n}\n\n/**\n * 切换到减少模式\n */\nprivate fun switchToReduceMode() {\n    if (isAddMode) {\n        isAddMode = false\n        updateModeButtons()\n        showMessage("已切换到：减少模式")\n        Log.d(TAG, "切换到减少模式")\n    }\n}\n\n/**\n * 更新模式按钮状态\n */\nprivate fun updateModeButtons() {\n    binding.btnAddMode.isSelected = isAddMode\n    binding.btnReduceMode.isSelected = !isAddMode\n}\n```\n\n**4. 修改`getCurrentOperationType()`方法（第352-354行）：**\n```kotlin\nprivate fun getCurrentOperationType(): Boolean {\n    return isAddMode // true=增加, false=减少\n}\n```\n\n**5. 在`onCreate()`中初始化按钮状态：**\n```kotlin\n// 在setupListeners()调用后添加\nupdateModeButtons()\n```\n\n### 3.6 删除旧代码\n\n#### 移除以下元素：\n1. 布局文件中的`cb_reduce_mode` CheckBox\n2. Kotlin代码中对`binding.cbReduceMode`的所有引用\n\n## 四、测试计划\n\n### 4.1 功能测试\n1. **模式切换测试**：验证增加/减少模式切换正常\n2. **视觉反馈测试**：验证按钮状态切换效果\n3. **扫码操作测试**：验证不同模式下扫码逻辑正确\n\n### 4.2 用户体验测试\n1. **直观性测试**：用户能否快速理解当前模式\n2. **操作效率测试**：模式切换是否方便快捷\n3. **错误预防测试**：是否减少了误操作\n\n## 五、技术细节\n\n### 5.1 兼容性考虑\n- 最低支持API 21\n- 使用Material Design 3组件\n- 考虑不同屏幕尺寸适配\n\n### 5.2 性能优化\n- 使用矢量图标减少APK大小\n- 状态切换使用轻量级动画\n- 避免频繁的布局重绘\n\n### 5.3 可扩展性\n- 预留接口支持未来添加更多操作模式\n- 样式资源化便于主题定制\n- 组件化设计便于复用\n\n## 六、验收标准\n\n### 功能验收\n- ✅ 移除红叉图标和"反向"CheckBox\n- ✅ 实现双按钮模式切换器\n- ✅ 增加/减少逻辑符合直觉\n- ✅ 视觉反馈清晰\n\n### 体验验收\n- ✅ 用户无需理解复杂逻辑\n- ✅ 当前模式一目了然\n- ✅ 操作流程更加流畅\n- ✅ 整体界面更加美观\n\n## 七、后续优化建议\n\n1. **添加切换动画**：提升视觉体验\n2. **记忆用户习惯**：保存常用模式\n3. **快捷键支持**：添加键盘快捷切换\n4. **统计分析**：收集模式使用数据	110	2025-09-23 16:54:56.564847	2025-09-23 16:54:56.564847	\N	110	markdown	draft	\N	\N	private	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N		1	\N	{}	f	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N
1221	129	App库存查询功能重构设计文档	# App库存查询功能重构设计方案\n\n## 项目背景\n\n基于当前DICIAI移动端库存查询功能分析，需要对现有功能进行重构，提供更加高效、用户友好的库存查询体验。\n\n## 现状分析\n\n### 后端API现状\n\n**现有库存查询API:**\n- **主要端点**: `GET /api/v1/wms/inventory` (diciai/internal/wms/router.go:82)\n- **API结构**: 完整的库存管理API，支持分页查询、多条件筛选\n- **查询参数**: \n  - `wh_id`: 仓库ID\n  - `name`: 货物名称\n  - `code`: 货物编码  \n  - `batch`: 批次\n  - `shipper_name`: 托运方\n  - `position_code`: 仓位编码\n  - `show_none`: 是否显示无库存数据\n  - 分页参数: `page`, `limit`, `sort`, `order`\n\n**响应数据结构** (diciai/pkg/api/wms/v1/wms_inventory.go:101-107):\n```go\ntype ListWmsInventoryResponse struct {\n    Count           int64               `json:"count"`\n    QtySum          float64             `json:"qty_sum"`           // 总库存计数\n    QtyLockedSum    float64             `json:"qty_locked_sum"`    // 总锁定库存计数\n    QtyAvailableSum float64             `json:"qty_available_sum"` // 总可用库存计数\n    Data            []*WmsInventoryList `json:"data"`\n}\n```\n\n**库存详细信息** (diciai/pkg/api/wms/v1/wms_inventory.go:44-83):\n- 包含完整的库存信息：ID、位置、货物信息、数量、价格、单位等\n- 支持包装单位转换显示\n- 包含仓库和仓位名称\n- 提供多种数量字段：总数量、锁定数量、可用数量、在途数量\n\n### 移动端现状\n\n**当前实现** (diciai-app/app/src/main/java/com/diciai/app/InventoryActivity.kt):\n- 基础UI框架存在，但功能未实现\n- 包含库存盘点和库存查询两个主要功能模块\n- UI设计良好，具备扫码输入和手动输入能力\n\n**API接口定义** (diciai-app/app/src/main/java/com/diciai/app/api/WmsApi.kt:58-66):\n```kotlin\n@GET("wms/inventory")\nsuspend fun getInventory(\n    @Query("sku") sku: String? = null,\n    @Query("warehouse_id") warehouseId: String? = null,\n    @Query("location_code") locationCode: String? = null,\n    @Query("page") page: Int = 1,\n    @Query("pageSize") pageSize: Int = 20\n): Response<ApiResponse<ListResponse<Inventory>>>\n```\n\n**数据模型** (diciai-app/app/src/main/java/com/diciai/app/model/WmsModels.kt:186-211):\n```kotlin\ndata class Inventory(\n    val id: String,\n    val goodsId: String,\n    val sku: String,\n    val name: String,\n    val availableQty: Int,\n    val totalQty: Int,\n    val locationCode: String? = null,\n    val warehouseId: String\n)\n```\n\n### 问题识别\n\n1. **API参数不匹配**: 移动端API参数与后端不完全匹配\n2. **数据模型简化**: 移动端数据模型缺少重要字段（批次、锁定库存、价格等）\n3. **功能未实现**: InventoryActivity只有UI框架，缺少实际查询逻辑\n4. **用户体验**: 缺少实时搜索、批量查询、历史记录等增强功能\n\n## 重构设计方案\n\n### 1. 后端API增强\n\n#### 1.1 新增PDA专用库存查询接口\n\n**建议新增端点**: `GET /api/v1/wms/inventory/pda-query`\n\n**设计理念**:\n- 专为移动端优化的轻量级接口\n- 支持条码扫描优先的查询模式\n- 返回移动端关注的核心字段\n- 支持快速响应和离线缓存\n\n**请求参数**:\n```go\ntype PDAInventoryQueryRequest struct {\n    // 主要查询条件（优先级递减）\n    Barcode      string `form:"barcode" json:"barcode"`           // 条码（扫码优先）\n    Code         string `form:"code" json:"code"`                 // SKU编码\n    Name         string `form:"name" json:"name"`                 // 货物名称（模糊搜索）\n    \n    // 筛选条件\n    WarehouseId  int64  `form:"warehouse_id" json:"warehouse_id"` // 仓库ID\n    LocationCode string `form:"location_code" json:"location_code"` // 仓位编码\n    Batch        string `form:"batch" json:"batch"`               // 批次\n    \n    // 查询选项\n    ShowZeroQty  bool   `form:"show_zero_qty" json:"show_zero_qty"` // 显示零库存\n    IncludeLocked bool  `form:"include_locked" json:"include_locked"` // 包含锁定库存信息\n    QuickMode    bool   `form:"quick_mode" json:"quick_mode"`     // 快速模式（仅返回基本信息）\n    \n    // 分页\n    Page         int    `form:"page,default=1" json:"page"`\n    Limit        int    `form:"limit,default=20" json:"limit"`\n}\n```\n\n**响应数据**:\n```go\ntype PDAInventoryQueryResponse struct {\n    Count     int64                    `json:"count"`\n    QueryTime int64                    `json:"query_time"`    // 查询时间戳\n    Summary   *PDAInventorySummary     `json:"summary"`       // 汇总信息\n    Items     []*PDAInventoryItem      `json:"items"`\n}\n\ntype PDAInventorySummary struct {\n    TotalQty      float64 `json:"total_qty"`      // 总库存数量\n    AvailableQty  float64 `json:"available_qty"`  // 可用库存数量\n    LockedQty     float64 `json:"locked_qty"`     // 锁定库存数量\n    LocationCount int     `json:"location_count"` // 涉及仓位数量\n}\n\ntype PDAInventoryItem struct {\n    Id               int64           `json:"id"`\n    GoodsId          int64           `json:"goods_id"`\n    Code             string          `json:"code"`             // SKU\n    Barcode          string          `json:"barcode"`          // 条码\n    Name             string          `json:"name"`             // 货物名称\n    FullName         string          `json:"full_name"`        // 完整名称\n    Specs            string          `json:"specs"`            // 规格\n    \n    // 库存数量信息\n    Qty              float64         `json:"qty"`              // 库存数量\n    QtyLocked        float64         `json:"qty_locked"`       // 锁定数量\n    QtyAvailable     float64         `json:"qty_available"`    // 可用数量\n    QtyIntransit     float64         `json:"qty_intransit"`    // 在途数量\n    \n    // 位置信息\n    WarehouseId      int64           `json:"warehouse_id"`\n    WarehouseName    string          `json:"warehouse_name"`\n    LocationsId      int64           `json:"locations_id"`\n    LocationsName    string          `json:"locations_name"`\n    PositionCode     string          `json:"position_code"`\n    \n    // 批次和定价\n    Batch            string          `json:"batch"`\n    Price            decimal.Decimal `json:"price"`            // 成本价\n    Amount           decimal.Decimal `json:"amount"`           // 库存金额\n    \n    // 单位信息\n    MinimalUnitId    int64           `json:"minimal_unit_id"`\n    MinimalUnitName  string          `json:"minimal_unit_name"`\n    PackUnits        []*WmsGoodsPackUnit `json:"pack_units"`   // 包装单位\n    \n    // PDA显示优化字段\n    DisplayQty       string          `json:"display_qty"`      // 格式化数量显示\n    DisplayLocation  string          `json:"display_location"` // 位置描述\n    UpdateTime       int64           `json:"update_time"`      // 最后更新时间\n}\n```\n\n#### 1.2 现有API增强\n\n**路由添加** (diciai/internal/wms/router.go):\n```go\n// 在wmsInventoryV1组中添加\nwmsInventoryV1.GET("pda-query", wmsInventoryC.PDAQuery)           // PDA库存查询\nwmsInventoryV1.GET("quick-search", wmsInventoryC.QuickSearch)     // 快速搜索\nwmsInventoryV1.GET("barcode/:code", wmsInventoryC.GetByBarcode)   // 条码查询\n```\n\n### 2. 移动端重构设计\n\n#### 2.1 架构模式\n\n采用**MVVM + Repository**模式：\n\n```\nInventoryQueryActivity (View)\n    ↓\nInventoryQueryViewModel (ViewModel)\n    ↓  \nInventoryRepository (Repository)\n    ↓\nWmsApi (Network Layer)\n```\n\n#### 2.2 核心组件设计\n\n**InventoryRepository.kt**:\n```kotlin\nclass InventoryRepository(private val wmsApi: WmsApi) {\n    // 主要查询方法\n    suspend fun queryInventory(request: InventoryQueryRequest): Result<InventoryQueryResponse>\n    \n    // 条码扫描查询\n    suspend fun queryByBarcode(barcode: String, warehouseId: String? = null): Result<List<InventoryItem>>\n    \n    // 快速搜索（自动完成）\n    suspend fun quickSearch(keyword: String, limit: Int = 10): Result<List<InventoryItem>>\n    \n    // 批量查询\n    suspend fun batchQuery(codes: List<String>): Result<List<InventoryItem>>\n    \n    // 获取仓库列表\n    suspend fun getWarehouses(): Result<List<Warehouse>>\n}\n```\n\n**InventoryQueryViewModel.kt**:\n```kotlin\nclass InventoryQueryViewModel(private val repository: InventoryRepository) : ViewModel() {\n    // UI状态\n    private val _uiState = MutableLiveData<InventoryQueryUiState>()\n    val uiState: LiveData<InventoryQueryUiState> = _uiState\n    \n    // 查询结果\n    private val _queryResults = MutableLiveData<List<InventoryItem>>()\n    val queryResults: LiveData<List<InventoryItem>> = _queryResults\n    \n    // 汇总信息\n    private val _summarResult = MutableLiveData<InventorySearchSummary>()\n    val summaryResult: LiveData<InventorySearchSummary> = _summaryResult\n    \n    // 搜索历史\n    private val _searchHistory = MutableLiveData<List<String>>()\n    val searchHistory: LiveData<List<String>> = _searchHistory\n    \n    // 主要操作方法\n    fun queryInventory(queryText: String, warehouseId: String? = null)\n    fun searchByBarcode(barcode: String)\n    fun clearResults()\n    fun saveSearchHistory(query: String)\n    fun applyFilters(filters: InventoryFilters)\n}\n```\n\n#### 2.3 UI/UX 增强设计\n\n**新增功能**:\n\n1. **智能搜索建议**\n   - 实时搜索建议（输入时）\n   - 历史搜索记录\n   - 热门商品快捷入口\n\n2. **高级筛选**\n   - 仓库选择器\n   - 库存状态筛选（有库存/无库存/锁定库存）\n   - 仓位区域筛选\n   - 批次筛选\n\n3. **结果展示优化**\n   - 列表/卡片视图切换\n   - 库存状态颜色编码\n   - 数量趋势图表\n   - 位置地图展示\n\n4. **操作便捷性**\n   - 扫码输入优化\n   - 语音搜索（可选）\n   - 一键导出功能\n   - 收藏常用商品\n\n#### 2.4 数据模型更新\n\n**新增/更新模型**:\n\n```kotlin\n// 库存查询请求\ndata class InventoryQueryRequest(\n    val barcode: String? = null,\n    val code: String? = null,\n    val name: String? = null,\n    val warehouseId: String? = null,\n    val locationCode: String? = null,\n    val batch: String? = null,\n    val showZeroQty: Boolean = false,\n    val includeLocked: Boolean = true,\n    val quickMode: Boolean = false,\n    val page: Int = 1,\n    val limit: Int = 20\n)\n\n// 增强的库存项\ndata class InventoryItem(\n    val id: String,\n    val goodsId: String,\n    val code: String,\n    val barcode: String? = null,\n    val name: String,\n    val fullName: String? = null,\n    val specs: String? = null,\n    \n    // 数量信息\n    val qty: Float,\n    val qtyLocked: Float,\n    val qtyAvailable: Float,\n    val qtyIntransit: Float = 0f,\n    \n    // 位置信息  \n    val warehouseId: String,\n    val warehouseName: String,\n    val locationsId: String? = null,\n    val locationsName: String? = null,\n    val positionCode: String? = null,\n    \n    // 其他信息\n    val batch: String? = null,\n    val price: Double? = null,\n    val amount: Double? = null,\n    val minimalUnitName: String? = null,\n    val displayQty: String? = null,\n    val displayLocation: String? = null,\n    val updateTime: Long? = null\n) {\n    // 计算属性\n    val stockStatus: StockStatus\n        get() = when {\n            qtyAvailable <= 0 -> StockStatus.OUT_OF_STOCK\n            qtyAvailable <= 10 -> StockStatus.LOW_STOCK  \n            qtyLocked > 0 -> StockStatus.PARTIALLY_LOCKED\n            else -> StockStatus.IN_STOCK\n        }\n        \n    val stockStatusColor: Int\n        get() = when (stockStatus) {\n            StockStatus.OUT_OF_STOCK -> Color.parseColor("#F44336")\n            StockStatus.LOW_STOCK -> Color.parseColor("#FF9800") \n            StockStatus.PARTIALLY_LOCKED -> Color.parseColor("#2196F3")\n            StockStatus.IN_STOCK -> Color.parseColor("#4CAF50")\n        }\n}\n\n// 库存状态枚举\nenum class StockStatus {\n    IN_STOCK,           // 有库存\n    LOW_STOCK,          // 库存不足 \n    OUT_OF_STOCK,       // 无库存\n    PARTIALLY_LOCKED    // 部分锁定\n}\n\n// 搜索汇总\ndata class InventorySearchSummary(\n    val totalQty: Float,\n    val availableQty: Float,\n    val lockedQty: Float,\n    val locationCount: Int,\n    val itemCount: Int\n)\n\n// UI状态\ndata class InventoryQueryUiState(\n    val isLoading: Boolean = false,\n    val isSearching: Boolean = false,\n    val error: String? = null,\n    val hasResults: Boolean = false,\n    val currentQuery: String = "",\n    val filters: InventoryFilters = InventoryFilters()\n)\n\n// 筛选条件\ndata class InventoryFilters(\n    val warehouseId: String? = null,\n    val stockStatus: StockStatus? = null,\n    val locationArea: String? = null,\n    val showZeroStock: Boolean = false,\n    val sortBy: SortBy = SortBy.UPDATE_TIME,\n    val sortOrder: SortOrder = SortOrder.DESC\n)\n\nenum class SortBy { NAME, QTY, UPDATE_TIME, LOCATION }\nenum class SortOrder { ASC, DESC }\n```\n\n### 3. 实现计划\n\n#### Phase 1: 后端API实现 (预计2-3天)\n1. 新增PDA库存查询接口\n2. 实现业务逻辑层\n3. 添加路由配置  \n4. API测试和文档\n\n#### Phase 2: 移动端基础功能 (预计3-4天)\n1. 重构InventoryActivity \n2. 实现Repository和ViewModel\n3. 基础查询功能实现\n4. 数据模型更新\n\n#### Phase 3: UI/UX增强 (预计2-3天)\n1. 高级筛选实现\n2. 搜索历史和建议\n3. 结果展示优化\n4. 扫码集成优化\n\n#### Phase 4: 测试和优化 (预计1-2天)\n1. 功能测试\n2. 性能优化\n3. 用户体验调优\n4. 文档完善\n\n### 4. 技术考虑\n\n#### 4.1 性能优化\n- **数据库索引优化**: 在code, barcode, name字段添加索引\n- **查询缓存**: 热门查询结果缓存30秒\n- **分页优化**: 移动端默认每页20条，支持无限滚动\n- **网络优化**: 支持请求去重和取消\n\n#### 4.2 用户体验\n- **离线支持**: 缓存最近查询结果\n- **响应速度**: 查询响应时间控制在500ms内\n- **操作反馈**: 加载状态、错误提示、成功反馈\n- **数据刷新**: 下拉刷新支持\n\n#### 4.3 错误处理\n- **网络错误**: 智能重试机制\n- **数据异常**: 降级显示方案\n- **权限控制**: 仓库级别访问控制\n- **日志记录**: 查询日志和错误追踪\n\n## 预期收益\n\n### 功能改进\n1. **查询效率提升**: 专用API响应速度提升60%\n2. **信息完整性**: 显示更全面的库存信息\n3. **操作便捷性**: 扫码优先的交互模式\n4. **数据准确性**: 实时库存状态展示\n\n### 用户体验提升\n1. **界面现代化**: Material Design 3规范\n2. **交互优化**: 减少操作步骤50%\n3. **视觉引导**: 库存状态色彩编码\n4. **个性化**: 搜索历史和偏好设置\n\n### 技术架构优势\n1. **可维护性**: MVVM模式清晰分层\n2. **可扩展性**: Repository模式便于功能扩展\n3. **稳定性**: 完善的错误处理机制\n4. **性能**: 分页加载和缓存优化\n\n## 总结\n\n本重构方案将现有的库存查询功能从基础UI框架升级为完整的、用户友好的查询系统。通过后端API优化和移动端架构重构，实现高效、准确、易用的库存查询体验，满足仓库作业人员的实际需求。\n\n整个重构预计需要8-12天完成，建议分阶段实施，确保每个阶段都有可交付的成果。	110	2025-09-23 17:25:55.122561	2025-09-23 17:25:55.122561	\N	110	markdown	draft	\N	\N	private	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N		1	\N	{}	f	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N
1222	129	后端PDA库存查询API详细开发方案	# 后端: 新增PDA库存查询API接口\n\n## 开发目标\n为移动端PDA应用新增专用的库存查询API接口，优化查询性能和响应格式，支持条码扫描优先的查询模式。\n\n## 技术方案\n\n### 1. API设计规范\n\n**端点**: `GET /api/v1/wms/inventory/pda-query`\n\n**请求参数**:\n```go\ntype PDAInventoryQueryRequest struct {\n    // 主要查询条件（优先级递减）\n    Barcode      string `form:"barcode" json:"barcode"`           // 条码（扫码优先）\n    Code         string `form:"code" json:"code"`                 // SKU编码\n    Name         string `form:"name" json:"name"`                 // 货物名称（模糊搜索）\n    \n    // 筛选条件\n    WarehouseId  int64  `form:"warehouse_id" json:"warehouse_id"` // 仓库ID\n    LocationCode string `form:"location_code" json:"location_code"` // 仓位编码\n    Batch        string `form:"batch" json:"batch"`               // 批次\n    \n    // 查询选项\n    ShowZeroQty  bool   `form:"show_zero_qty" json:"show_zero_qty"` // 显示零库存\n    IncludeLocked bool  `form:"include_locked" json:"include_locked"` // 包含锁定库存信息\n    QuickMode    bool   `form:"quick_mode" json:"quick_mode"`     // 快速模式（仅返回基本信息）\n    \n    // 分页\n    Page         int    `form:"page,default=1" json:"page"`\n    Limit        int    `form:"limit,default=20" json:"limit"`\n}\n```\n\n**响应数据**:\n```go\ntype PDAInventoryQueryResponse struct {\n    Count     int64                    `json:"count"`\n    QueryTime int64                    `json:"query_time"`    // 查询时间戳\n    Summary   *PDAInventorySummary     `json:"summary"`       // 汇总信息\n    Items     []*PDAInventoryItem      `json:"items"`\n}\n\ntype PDAInventorySummary struct {\n    TotalQty      float64 `json:"total_qty"`      // 总库存数量\n    AvailableQty  float64 `json:"available_qty"`  // 可用库存数量\n    LockedQty     float64 `json:"locked_qty"`     // 锁定库存数量\n    LocationCount int     `json:"location_count"` // 涉及仓位数量\n}\n\ntype PDAInventoryItem struct {\n    Id               int64           `json:"id"`\n    GoodsId          int64           `json:"goods_id"`\n    Code             string          `json:"code"`             // SKU\n    Barcode          string          `json:"barcode"`          // 条码\n    Name             string          `json:"name"`             // 货物名称\n    FullName         string          `json:"full_name"`        // 完整名称\n    Specs            string          `json:"specs"`            // 规格\n    \n    // 库存数量信息\n    Qty              float64         `json:"qty"`              // 库存数量\n    QtyLocked        float64         `json:"qty_locked"`       // 锁定数量\n    QtyAvailable     float64         `json:"qty_available"`    // 可用数量\n    QtyIntransit     float64         `json:"qty_intransit"`    // 在途数量\n    \n    // 位置信息\n    WarehouseId      int64           `json:"warehouse_id"`\n    WarehouseName    string          `json:"warehouse_name"`\n    LocationsId      int64           `json:"locations_id"`\n    LocationsName    string          `json:"locations_name"`\n    PositionCode     string          `json:"position_code"`\n    \n    // 批次和定价\n    Batch            string          `json:"batch"`\n    Price            decimal.Decimal `json:"price"`            // 成本价\n    Amount           decimal.Decimal `json:"amount"`           // 库存金额\n    \n    // 单位信息\n    MinimalUnitId    int64           `json:"minimal_unit_id"`\n    MinimalUnitName  string          `json:"minimal_unit_name"`\n    PackUnits        []*WmsGoodsPackUnit `json:"pack_units"`   // 包装单位\n    \n    // PDA显示优化字段\n    DisplayQty       string          `json:"display_qty"`      // 格式化数量显示\n    DisplayLocation  string          `json:"display_location"` // 位置描述\n    UpdateTime       int64           `json:"update_time"`      // 最后更新时间\n}\n```\n\n### 2. 实现步骤\n\n#### 2.1 文件结构\n```\ndiciai/pkg/api/wms/v1/wms_inventory_pda.go           # API模型定义\ndiciai/internal/wms/controller/wms_inventory/pda.go  # 控制器实现\ndiciai/internal/wms/biz/wms_inventory/pda_query.go   # 业务逻辑\ndiciai/internal/wms/store/wms_inventory_pda.go       # 数据访问层\n```\n\n#### 2.2 API模型定义 (wms_inventory_pda.go)\n```go\npackage v1\n\nimport "github.com/shopspring/decimal"\n\n// PDAInventoryQueryRequest PDA库存查询请求\ntype PDAInventoryQueryRequest struct {\n    Barcode      string `form:"barcode" json:"barcode"`\n    Code         string `form:"code" json:"code"`\n    Name         string `form:"name" json:"name"`\n    WarehouseId  int64  `form:"warehouse_id" json:"warehouse_id"`\n    LocationCode string `form:"location_code" json:"location_code"`\n    Batch        string `form:"batch" json:"batch"`\n    ShowZeroQty  bool   `form:"show_zero_qty" json:"show_zero_qty"`\n    IncludeLocked bool  `form:"include_locked,default=true" json:"include_locked"`\n    QuickMode    bool   `form:"quick_mode" json:"quick_mode"`\n    Page         int    `form:"page,default=1" json:"page"`\n    Limit        int    `form:"limit,default=20" json:"limit"`\n}\n\n// PDAInventoryQueryResponse PDA库存查询响应\ntype PDAInventoryQueryResponse struct {\n    Count     int64                    `json:"count"`\n    QueryTime int64                    `json:"query_time"`\n    Summary   *PDAInventorySummary     `json:"summary"`\n    Items     []*PDAInventoryItem      `json:"items"`\n}\n\n// 其他结构体定义...\n```\n\n#### 2.3 控制器实现 (pda.go)\n```go\npackage wms_inventory\n\nimport (\n    "diciai/internal/pkg/core"\n    "diciai/internal/pkg/errno"\n    "diciai/internal/pkg/log"\n    v1 "diciai/pkg/api/wms/v1"\n    "github.com/gin-gonic/gin"\n    "time"\n)\n\n// PDAQuery PDA库存查询\n//\n//  @Summary    PDA库存查询\n//  @Tags       库存-Inventory-PDA\n//  @Param      barcode         query   string  false   "条码"\n//  @Param      code            query   string  false   "SKU编码"\n//  @Param      name            query   string  false   "货物名称"\n//  @Param      warehouse_id    query   int64   false   "仓库ID"\n//  @Param      location_code   query   string  false   "仓位编码"\n//  @Param      batch           query   string  false   "批次"\n//  @Param      show_zero_qty   query   bool    false   "显示零库存"\n//  @Param      include_locked  query   bool    false   "包含锁定库存"\n//  @Param      quick_mode      query   bool    false   "快速模式"\n//  @Param      page            query   int     false   "页码"\n//  @Param      limit           query   int     false   "每页数量"\n//  @Success    200             {object} core.Response{data=v1.PDAInventoryQueryResponse}\n//  @Security   ApiKeyAuth\n//  @Router     /api/v1/wms/inventory/pda-query [get]\nfunc (ctrl *WmsInventoryController) PDAQuery(c *gin.Context) {\n    log.C(c).Infow("PDAQuery wms_inventory function called.")\n\n    var r v1.PDAInventoryQueryRequest\n    if err := c.ShouldBindQuery(&r); err != nil {\n        core.BadRequestResponse(c, errno.ErrBind)\n        return\n    }\n\n    // 记录查询开始时间\n    startTime := time.Now()\n\n    resp, err := ctrl.b.WmsInventory().PDAQuery(c, &r)\n    if err != nil {\n        core.BadRequestResponse(c, err)\n        return\n    }\n\n    // 设置查询时间\n    resp.QueryTime = time.Now().Unix()\n\n    core.WriteJSON(c, resp)\n}\n\n// QuickSearch 快速搜索（自动完成）\n//\n//  @Summary    快速搜索\n//  @Tags       库存-Inventory-PDA\n//  @Param      keyword         query   string  true    "搜索关键词"\n//  @Param      warehouse_id    query   int64   false   "仓库ID"\n//  @Param      limit           query   int     false   "返回数量限制"\n//  @Success    200             {object} core.Response{data=[]v1.PDAInventoryItem}\n//  @Security   ApiKeyAuth\n//  @Router     /api/v1/wms/inventory/quick-search [get]\nfunc (ctrl *WmsInventoryController) QuickSearch(c *gin.Context) {\n    log.C(c).Infow("QuickSearch wms_inventory function called.")\n\n    keyword := c.Query("keyword")\n    if keyword == "" {\n        core.BadRequestResponse(c, errno.NewInvalidParameter("keyword is required"))\n        return\n    }\n\n    warehouseId := c.Query("warehouse_id")\n    limit := c.DefaultQuery("limit", "10")\n\n    resp, err := ctrl.b.WmsInventory().QuickSearch(c, keyword, warehouseId, limit)\n    if err != nil {\n        core.BadRequestResponse(c, err)\n        return\n    }\n\n    core.WriteJSON(c, resp)\n}\n\n// GetByBarcode 条码查询\n//\n//  @Summary    条码查询\n//  @Tags       库存-Inventory-PDA\n//  @Param      code            path    string  true    "条码"\n//  @Param      warehouse_id    query   int64   false   "仓库ID"\n//  @Success    200             {object} core.Response{data=[]v1.PDAInventoryItem}\n//  @Security   ApiKeyAuth\n//  @Router     /api/v1/wms/inventory/barcode/{code} [get]\nfunc (ctrl *WmsInventoryController) GetByBarcode(c *gin.Context) {\n    log.C(c).Infow("GetByBarcode wms_inventory function called.")\n\n    barcode := c.Param("code")\n    if barcode == "" {\n        core.BadRequestResponse(c, errno.NewInvalidParameter("barcode is required"))\n        return\n    }\n\n    warehouseId := c.Query("warehouse_id")\n\n    resp, err := ctrl.b.WmsInventory().GetByBarcode(c, barcode, warehouseId)\n    if err != nil {\n        core.BadRequestResponse(c, err)\n        return\n    }\n\n    core.WriteJSON(c, resp)\n}\n```\n\n#### 2.4 业务逻辑实现 (pda_query.go)\n```go\npackage wms_inventory\n\nimport (\n    "context"\n    "diciai/internal/pkg/log"\n    v1 "diciai/pkg/api/wms/v1"\n    "fmt"\n    "strings"\n    "sync"\n)\n\n// PDAQuery PDA库存查询业务逻辑\nfunc (b *wmsInventoryBiz) PDAQuery(ctx context.Context, r *v1.PDAInventoryQueryRequest) (*v1.PDAInventoryQueryResponse, error) {\n    // 参数验证\n    if err := b.validatePDAQueryRequest(r); err != nil {\n        return nil, err\n    }\n\n    // 构建查询条件\n    queryConditions := b.buildPDAQueryConditions(r)\n\n    // 执行数据库查询\n    count, items, err := b.ds.WmsInventory().PDAQuery(ctx, queryConditions)\n    if err != nil {\n        log.C(ctx).Errorw("Failed to query inventory from storage", "err", err)\n        return nil, err\n    }\n\n    // 计算汇总信息\n    summary := b.calculateInventorySummary(items)\n\n    // 格式化返回数据\n    result := &v1.PDAInventoryQueryResponse{\n        Count:   count,\n        Summary: summary,\n        Items:   make([]*v1.PDAInventoryItem, 0, len(items)),\n    }\n\n    // 并发处理库存项数据增强\n    var mu sync.Mutex\n    var wg sync.WaitGroup\n\n    for _, item := range items {\n        wg.Add(1)\n        go func(inv *model.WmsInventoryM) {\n            defer wg.Done()\n            \n            pdaItem := b.convertToPDAInventoryItem(ctx, inv, r.QuickMode)\n            \n            mu.Lock()\n            result.Items = append(result.Items, pdaItem)\n            mu.Unlock()\n        }(item)\n    }\n\n    wg.Wait()\n\n    return result, nil\n}\n\n// validatePDAQueryRequest 验证PDA查询请求\nfunc (b *wmsInventoryBiz) validatePDAQueryRequest(r *v1.PDAInventoryQueryRequest) error {\n    // 至少提供一个查询条件\n    if r.Barcode == "" && r.Code == "" && r.Name == "" {\n        return errno.NewInvalidParameter("至少提供一个查询条件: barcode, code 或 name")\n    }\n\n    // 分页参数验证\n    if r.Page < 1 {\n        r.Page = 1\n    }\n    if r.Limit < 1 || r.Limit > 100 {\n        r.Limit = 20\n    }\n\n    return nil\n}\n\n// buildPDAQueryConditions 构建查询条件\nfunc (b *wmsInventoryBiz) buildPDAQueryConditions(r *v1.PDAInventoryQueryRequest) *store.PDAQueryConditions {\n    return &store.PDAQueryConditions{\n        Barcode:       strings.TrimSpace(r.Barcode),\n        Code:          strings.TrimSpace(r.Code),\n        Name:          strings.TrimSpace(r.Name),\n        WarehouseId:   r.WarehouseId,\n        LocationCode:  strings.TrimSpace(r.LocationCode),\n        Batch:         strings.TrimSpace(r.Batch),\n        ShowZeroQty:   r.ShowZeroQty,\n        IncludeLocked: r.IncludeLocked,\n        QuickMode:     r.QuickMode,\n        Page:          r.Page,\n        Limit:         r.Limit,\n    }\n}\n\n// calculateInventorySummary 计算库存汇总信息\nfunc (b *wmsInventoryBiz) calculateInventorySummary(items []*model.WmsInventoryM) *v1.PDAInventorySummary {\n    summary := &v1.PDAInventorySummary{}\n    locationSet := make(map[int64]bool)\n\n    for _, item := range items {\n        summary.TotalQty += item.Qty\n        summary.AvailableQty += item.QtyAvailable\n        summary.LockedQty += item.QtyLocked\n        locationSet[item.LocationsId] = true\n    }\n\n    summary.LocationCount = len(locationSet)\n    return summary\n}\n\n// convertToPDAInventoryItem 转换为PDA库存项\nfunc (b *wmsInventoryBiz) convertToPDAInventoryItem(ctx context.Context, inv *model.WmsInventoryM, quickMode bool) *v1.PDAInventoryItem {\n    item := &v1.PDAInventoryItem{\n        Id:               inv.Id,\n        GoodsId:          inv.GoodsId,\n        Code:             inv.Code,\n        Name:             inv.Name,\n        FullName:         inv.FullName,\n        Specs:            inv.Specs,\n        Qty:              inv.Qty,\n        QtyLocked:        inv.QtyLocked,\n        QtyAvailable:     inv.QtyAvailable,\n        QtyIntransit:     inv.QtyIntransit,\n        WarehouseId:      inv.WarehouseId,\n        LocationsId:      inv.LocationsId,\n        Batch:            inv.Batch,\n        Price:            inv.Price,\n        Amount:           inv.Amount,\n        MinimalUnitId:    inv.MinimalUnitId,\n        MinimalUnitName:  inv.MinimalUnitName,\n        UpdateTime:       inv.UpdateTime.Unix(),\n    }\n\n    // 快速模式跳过耗时的数据增强\n    if !quickMode {\n        // 获取条码信息\n        if goods, err := b.goodsBiz.Get(ctx, inv.GoodsId); err == nil {\n            item.Barcode = goods.Barcode\n        }\n\n        // 获取仓库名称\n        if warehouse, err := b.warehouseBiz.Get(ctx, inv.WarehouseId); err == nil {\n            item.WarehouseName = warehouse.Name\n        }\n\n        // 获取仓位名称\n        if inv.LocationsId > 0 {\n            if location, err := b.locationsBiz.Get(ctx, inv.LocationsId); err == nil {\n                item.LocationsName = location.Name\n                item.PositionCode = location.Code\n            }\n        }\n\n        // 获取包装单位\n        if packUnits, err := b.goodsBiz.FindPackUnits(ctx, inv.GoodsId, 0); err == nil {\n            item.PackUnits = packUnits\n        }\n\n        // 格式化显示字段\n        item.DisplayQty = b.formatDisplayQty(inv.Qty, inv.MinimalUnitName)\n        item.DisplayLocation = b.formatDisplayLocation(item.WarehouseName, item.LocationsName, item.PositionCode)\n    }\n\n    return item\n}\n\n// formatDisplayQty 格式化数量显示\nfunc (b *wmsInventoryBiz) formatDisplayQty(qty float64, unitName string) string {\n    if qty == float64(int64(qty)) {\n        return fmt.Sprintf("%.0f%s", qty, unitName)\n    }\n    return fmt.Sprintf("%.2f%s", qty, unitName)\n}\n\n// formatDisplayLocation 格式化位置显示\nfunc (b *wmsInventoryBiz) formatDisplayLocation(warehouseName, locationName, positionCode string) string {\n    parts := make([]string, 0, 3)\n    if warehouseName != "" {\n        parts = append(parts, warehouseName)\n    }\n    if locationName != "" {\n        parts = append(parts, locationName)\n    }\n    if positionCode != "" {\n        parts = append(parts, positionCode)\n    }\n    return strings.Join(parts, " > ")\n}\n\n// QuickSearch 快速搜索实现\nfunc (b *wmsInventoryBiz) QuickSearch(ctx context.Context, keyword, warehouseId, limitStr string) ([]*v1.PDAInventoryItem, error) {\n    // 实现快速搜索逻辑\n    // ...\n}\n\n// GetByBarcode 条码查询实现\nfunc (b *wmsInventoryBiz) GetByBarcode(ctx context.Context, barcode, warehouseId string) ([]*v1.PDAInventoryItem, error) {\n    // 实现条码查询逻辑\n    // ...\n}\n```\n\n#### 2.5 数据访问层实现 (wms_inventory_pda.go)\n```go\npackage store\n\nimport (\n    "context"\n    "diciai/internal/wms/model"\n    "fmt"\n    "gorm.io/gorm"\n    "strings"\n)\n\n// PDAQueryConditions PDA查询条件\ntype PDAQueryConditions struct {\n    Barcode       string\n    Code          string\n    Name          string\n    WarehouseId   int64\n    LocationCode  string\n    Batch         string\n    ShowZeroQty   bool\n    IncludeLocked bool\n    QuickMode     bool\n    Page          int\n    Limit         int\n}\n\n// PDAQuery PDA库存查询\nfunc (w *wmsInventoryStore) PDAQuery(ctx context.Context, conditions *PDAQueryConditions) (\n    count int64, \n    items []*model.WmsInventoryM, \n    err error,\n) {\n    // 构建基础查询\n    query := w.db.Model(&model.WmsInventoryM{}).\n        Select(`\n            inv.*,\n            wh.name as warehouse_name,\n            loc.name as locations_name,\n            loc.code as position_code,\n            goods.barcode\n        `).\n        Table("wms_inventory inv").\n        Joins("LEFT JOIN wms_warehouse wh ON inv.warehouse_id = wh.id").\n        Joins("LEFT JOIN wms_locations loc ON inv.locations_id = loc.id").\n        Joins("LEFT JOIN wms_goods goods ON inv.goods_id = goods.id")\n\n    // 应用查询条件\n    query = w.applyPDAQueryConditions(query, conditions)\n\n    // 获取总数\n    if err = query.Count(&count).Error; err != nil {\n        return 0, nil, err\n    }\n\n    // 分页查询\n    offset := (conditions.Page - 1) * conditions.Limit\n    query = query.Offset(offset).Limit(conditions.Limit)\n\n    // 排序：优先级 条码匹配 > SKU匹配 > 名称匹配 > 更新时间\n    orderBy := w.buildPDAOrderBy(conditions)\n    query = query.Order(orderBy)\n\n    // 执行查询\n    if err = query.Find(&items).Error; err != nil {\n        return 0, nil, err\n    }\n\n    return count, items, nil\n}\n\n// applyPDAQueryConditions 应用PDA查询条件\nfunc (w *wmsInventoryStore) applyPDAQueryConditions(query *gorm.DB, conditions *PDAQueryConditions) *gorm.DB {\n    // 条码查询（精确匹配）\n    if conditions.Barcode != "" {\n        query = query.Where("goods.barcode = ?", conditions.Barcode)\n    }\n\n    // SKU编码查询（精确匹配或模糊匹配）\n    if conditions.Code != "" {\n        query = query.Where("inv.code = ? OR inv.code LIKE ?", conditions.Code, "%"+conditions.Code+"%")\n    }\n\n    // 名称查询（模糊匹配）\n    if conditions.Name != "" {\n        query = query.Where("inv.name LIKE ? OR inv.full_name LIKE ?", \n            "%"+conditions.Name+"%", "%"+conditions.Name+"%")\n    }\n\n    // 仓库筛选\n    if conditions.WarehouseId > 0 {\n        query = query.Where("inv.warehouse_id = ?", conditions.WarehouseId)\n    }\n\n    // 仓位编码筛选\n    if conditions.LocationCode != "" {\n        query = query.Where("loc.code = ?", conditions.LocationCode)\n    }\n\n    // 批次筛选\n    if conditions.Batch != "" {\n        query = query.Where("inv.batch = ?", conditions.Batch)\n    }\n\n    // 零库存筛选\n    if !conditions.ShowZeroQty {\n        query = query.Where("inv.qty > 0")\n    }\n\n    // 租户隔离\n    query = query.Where("inv.tenant_id = ?", GetTenantId(ctx))\n\n    return query\n}\n\n// buildPDAOrderBy 构建PDA查询排序\nfunc (w *wmsInventoryStore) buildPDAOrderBy(conditions *PDAQueryConditions) string {\n    var orderParts []string\n\n    // 条码精确匹配优先\n    if conditions.Barcode != "" {\n        orderParts = append(orderParts, \n            fmt.Sprintf("CASE WHEN goods.barcode = '%s' THEN 1 ELSE 2 END", conditions.Barcode))\n    }\n\n    // SKU精确匹配优先\n    if conditions.Code != "" {\n        orderParts = append(orderParts, \n            fmt.Sprintf("CASE WHEN inv.code = '%s' THEN 1 ELSE 2 END", conditions.Code))\n    }\n\n    // 默认按更新时间倒序\n    orderParts = append(orderParts, "inv.update_time DESC")\n\n    return strings.Join(orderParts, ", ")\n}\n```\n\n#### 2.6 路由配置更新\n在 `diciai/internal/wms/router.go` 中添加新路由：\n\n```go\n// 在wmsInventoryV1组中添加（第98行后）\nwmsInventoryV1.GET("pda-query", wmsInventoryC.PDAQuery)           // PDA库存查询\nwmsInventoryV1.GET("quick-search", wmsInventoryC.QuickSearch)     // 快速搜索\nwmsInventoryV1.GET("barcode/:code", wmsInventoryC.GetByBarcode)   // 条码查询\n```\n\n### 3. 性能优化要点\n\n1. **数据库索引优化**\n   ```sql\n   -- 为PDA查询添加复合索引\n   CREATE INDEX idx_wms_inventory_pda_query ON wms_inventory (tenant_id, warehouse_id, code, qty);\n   CREATE INDEX idx_wms_goods_barcode ON wms_goods (barcode, tenant_id);\n   ```\n\n2. **查询缓存**\n   - 热门查询结果缓存30秒\n   - 使用Redis缓存商品基础信息\n\n3. **响应优化**\n   - QuickMode跳过耗时的数据增强\n   - 并发处理数据转换\n   - 分页限制最大100条\n\n### 4. 测试计划\n\n1. **单元测试**\n   - 查询条件构建测试\n   - 数据转换逻辑测试\n   - 边界条件测试\n\n2. **集成测试**  \n   - API接口功能测试\n   - 性能压力测试\n   - 错误处理测试\n\n3. **API文档**\n   - Swagger文档生成\n   - 接口示例和说明\n\n### 5. 预计工时\n- API设计和模型定义: 0.5天\n- 业务逻辑实现: 1天\n- 数据访问层实现: 1天\n- 路由配置和集成: 0.5天\n- 测试和优化: 1天\n\n**总计: 4天**	110	2025-09-23 17:29:13.33354	2025-09-23 17:29:13.33354	\N	110	markdown	draft	\N	\N	private	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N		1	\N	{}	f	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N
1223	129	Repository和ViewModel架构实现方案	# 移动端: 实现Repository和ViewModel架构\n\n## 开发目标\n为库存查询功能实现MVVM架构，创建Repository数据访问层和ViewModel业务逻辑层，确保代码架构清晰、可维护、可测试。\n\n## 架构设计\n\n### 整体架构图\n```\nInventoryQueryActivity (View Layer)\n        ↓ observes\nInventoryQueryViewModel (ViewModel Layer)  \n        ↓ calls\nInventoryRepository (Repository Layer)\n        ↓ calls  \nWmsApi (Network Layer)\n```\n\n## 实现方案\n\n### 1. Repository层实现\n\n#### 1.1 创建InventoryRepository.kt\n位置: `app/src/main/java/com/diciai/app/repository/InventoryRepository.kt`\n\n```kotlin\npackage com.diciai.app.repository\n\nimport com.diciai.app.api.WmsApi\nimport com.diciai.app.model.*\nimport com.diciai.app.network.ApiResponse\nimport com.diciai.app.network.ListResponse\nimport kotlinx.coroutines.Dispatchers\nimport kotlinx.coroutines.withContext\nimport retrofit2.Response\nimport javax.inject.Inject\nimport javax.inject.Singleton\n\n@Singleton\nclass InventoryRepository @Inject constructor(\n    private val wmsApi: WmsApi\n) {\n    \n    /**\n     * PDA库存查询 - 主要查询方法\n     * @param request 查询请求参数\n     * @return 查询结果\n     */\n    suspend fun queryInventory(request: InventoryQueryRequest): Result<InventoryQueryResponse> {\n        return withContext(Dispatchers.IO) {\n            try {\n                val response = wmsApi.pdaQueryInventory(\n                    barcode = request.barcode,\n                    code = request.code,\n                    name = request.name,\n                    warehouseId = request.warehouseId,\n                    locationCode = request.locationCode,\n                    batch = request.batch,\n                    showZeroQty = request.showZeroQty,\n                    includeLocked = request.includeLocked,\n                    quickMode = request.quickMode,\n                    page = request.page,\n                    limit = request.limit\n                )\n                \n                if (response.isSuccessful && response.body()?.success == true) {\n                    val data = response.body()?.data\n                    if (data != null) {\n                        Result.success(data)\n                    } else {\n                        Result.failure(Exception("数据为空"))\n                    }\n                } else {\n                    val errorMsg = response.body()?.message ?: "查询失败"\n                    Result.failure(Exception(errorMsg))\n                }\n            } catch (e: Exception) {\n                Result.failure(e)\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 条码扫描查询\n     * @param barcode 条码\n     * @param warehouseId 仓库ID（可选）\n     * @return 库存项列表\n     */\n    suspend fun queryByBarcode(\n        barcode: String, \n        warehouseId: String? = null\n    ): Result<List<InventoryItem>> {\n        return withContext(Dispatchers.IO) {\n            try {\n                val response = wmsApi.getInventoryByBarcode(barcode, warehouseId)\n                \n                if (response.isSuccessful && response.body()?.success == true) {\n                    val items = response.body()?.data ?: emptyList()\n                    Result.success(items)\n                } else {\n                    val errorMsg = response.body()?.message ?: "条码查询失败"\n                    Result.failure(Exception(errorMsg))\n                }\n            } catch (e: Exception) {\n                Result.failure(e)\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 快速搜索（自动完成）\n     * @param keyword 搜索关键词\n     * @param limit 返回数量限制\n     * @return 库存项列表\n     */\n    suspend fun quickSearch(\n        keyword: String, \n        limit: Int = 10\n    ): Result<List<InventoryItem>> {\n        return withContext(Dispatchers.IO) {\n            try {\n                val response = wmsApi.quickSearchInventory(keyword, limit)\n                \n                if (response.isSuccessful && response.body()?.success == true) {\n                    val items = response.body()?.data ?: emptyList()\n                    Result.success(items)\n                } else {\n                    val errorMsg = response.body()?.message ?: "搜索失败"\n                    Result.failure(Exception(errorMsg))\n                }\n            } catch (e: Exception) {\n                Result.failure(e)\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 批量查询\n     * @param codes SKU编码列表\n     * @return 库存项列表\n     */\n    suspend fun batchQuery(codes: List<String>): Result<List<InventoryItem>> {\n        return withContext(Dispatchers.IO) {\n            try {\n                val response = wmsApi.batchQueryInventory(codes)\n                \n                if (response.isSuccessful && response.body()?.success == true) {\n                    val items = response.body()?.data ?: emptyList()\n                    Result.success(items)\n                } else {\n                    val errorMsg = response.body()?.message ?: "批量查询失败"\n                    Result.failure(Exception(errorMsg))\n                }\n            } catch (e: Exception) {\n                Result.failure(e)\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 获取仓库列表\n     * @return 仓库列表\n     */\n    suspend fun getWarehouses(): Result<List<Warehouse>> {\n        return withContext(Dispatchers.IO) {\n            try {\n                val response = wmsApi.getWarehouses()\n                \n                if (response.isSuccessful && response.body()?.success == true) {\n                    val warehouses = response.body()?.data ?: emptyList()\n                    Result.success(warehouses)\n                } else {\n                    val errorMsg = response.body()?.message ?: "获取仓库列表失败"\n                    Result.failure(Exception(errorMsg))\n                }\n            } catch (e: Exception) {\n                Result.failure(e)\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 获取历史搜索记录\n     * @return 搜索历史列表\n     */\n    suspend fun getSearchHistory(): List<String> {\n        return withContext(Dispatchers.IO) {\n            // 这里可以从本地存储获取搜索历史\n            // 暂时返回空列表，后续可以集成SharedPreferences或Room数据库\n            emptyList()\n        }\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 保存搜索历史\n     * @param query 搜索关键词\n     */\n    suspend fun saveSearchHistory(query: String) {\n        withContext(Dispatchers.IO) {\n            // 这里可以保存到本地存储\n            // 暂时不实现，后续可以集成SharedPreferences或Room数据库\n        }\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 清除搜索历史\n     */\n    suspend fun clearSearchHistory() {\n        withContext(Dispatchers.IO) {\n            // 清除本地存储的搜索历史\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 2. ViewModel层实现\n\n#### 2.1 创建InventoryQueryViewModel.kt\n位置: `app/src/main/java/com/diciai/app/viewmodel/InventoryQueryViewModel.kt`\n\n```kotlin\npackage com.diciai.app.viewmodel\n\nimport androidx.lifecycle.LiveData\nimport androidx.lifecycle.MutableLiveData\nimport androidx.lifecycle.ViewModel\nimport androidx.lifecycle.viewModelScope\nimport com.diciai.app.model.*\nimport com.diciai.app.repository.InventoryRepository\nimport dagger.hilt.android.lifecycle.HiltViewModel\nimport kotlinx.coroutines.Job\nimport kotlinx.coroutines.delay\nimport kotlinx.coroutines.launch\nimport javax.inject.Inject\n\n@HiltViewModel\nclass InventoryQueryViewModel @Inject constructor(\n    private val repository: InventoryRepository\n) : ViewModel() {\n\n    // UI状态\n    private val _uiState = MutableLiveData<InventoryQueryUiState>()\n    val uiState: LiveData<InventoryQueryUiState> = _uiState\n\n    // 查询结果\n    private val _queryResults = MutableLiveData<List<InventoryItem>>()\n    val queryResults: LiveData<List<InventoryItem>> = _queryResults\n\n    // 汇总信息\n    private val _summaryResult = MutableLiveData<InventorySearchSummary>()\n    val summaryResult: LiveData<InventorySearchSummary> = _summaryResult\n\n    // 搜索历史\n    private val _searchHistory = MutableLiveData<List<String>>()\n    val searchHistory: LiveData<List<String>> = _searchHistory\n\n    // 仓库列表\n    private val _warehouses = MutableLiveData<List<Warehouse>>()\n    val warehouses: LiveData<List<Warehouse>> = _warehouses\n\n    // 快速搜索建议\n    private val _searchSuggestions = MutableLiveData<List<InventoryItem>>()\n    val searchSuggestions: LiveData<List<InventoryItem>> = _searchSuggestions\n\n    // 错误消息\n    private val _errorMessage = MutableLiveData<String?>()\n    val errorMessage: LiveData<String?> = _errorMessage\n\n    // 当前查询参数\n    private var currentQuery = ""\n    private var currentFilters = InventoryFilters()\n    \n    // 搜索防抖Job\n    private var searchJob: Job? = null\n\n    init {\n        // 初始化UI状态\n        _uiState.value = InventoryQueryUiState()\n        \n        // 加载仓库列表和搜索历史\n        loadInitialData()\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 主要库存查询方法\n     * @param queryText 查询文本\n     * @param filters 筛选条件\n     */\n    fun queryInventory(queryText: String, filters: InventoryFilters = currentFilters) {\n        if (queryText.isBlank()) {\n            updateUiState { it.copy(error = "请输入查询条件") }\n            return\n        }\n\n        currentQuery = queryText\n        currentFilters = filters\n\n        updateUiState { \n            it.copy(\n                isLoading = true, \n                error = null,\n                currentQuery = queryText,\n                filters = filters\n            )\n        }\n\n        viewModelScope.launch {\n            try {\n                val request = buildQueryRequest(queryText, filters)\n                val result = repository.queryInventory(request)\n                \n                result.fold(\n                    onSuccess = { response ->\n                        _queryResults.value = response.items\n                        _summaryResult.value = InventorySearchSummary(\n                            totalQty = response.summary?.totalQty ?: 0f,\n                            availableQty = response.summary?.availableQty ?: 0f,\n                            lockedQty = response.summary?.lockedQty ?: 0f,\n                            locationCount = response.summary?.locationCount ?: 0,\n                            itemCount = response.items.size\n                        )\n                        \n                        updateUiState { \n                            it.copy(\n                                isLoading = false,\n                                hasResults = response.items.isNotEmpty(),\n                                error = null\n                            )\n                        }\n                        \n                        // 保存搜索历史\n                        saveSearchHistory(queryText)\n                    },\n                    onFailure = { error ->\n                        updateUiState { \n                            it.copy(\n                                isLoading = false,\n                                error = error.message ?: "查询失败"\n                            )\n                        }\n                        _errorMessage.value = error.message\n                    }\n                )\n            } catch (e: Exception) {\n                updateUiState { \n                    it.copy(\n                        isLoading = false,\n                        error = e.message ?: "查询异常"\n                    )\n                }\n                _errorMessage.value = e.message\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 条码扫描查询\n     * @param barcode 条码\n     */\n    fun searchByBarcode(barcode: String) {\n        if (barcode.isBlank()) {\n            _errorMessage.value = "条码不能为空"\n            return\n        }\n\n        updateUiState { it.copy(isLoading = true, error = null) }\n\n        viewModelScope.launch {\n            val result = repository.queryByBarcode(barcode, currentFilters.warehouseId)\n            \n            result.fold(\n                onSuccess = { items ->\n                    _queryResults.value = items\n                    updateUiState { \n                        it.copy(\n                            isLoading = false,\n                            hasResults = items.isNotEmpty(),\n                            currentQuery = barcode\n                        )\n                    }\n                    \n                    // 计算汇总信息\n                    calculateSummary(items)\n                },\n                onFailure = { error ->\n                    updateUiState { \n                        it.copy(\n                            isLoading = false,\n                            error = error.message ?: "条码查询失败"\n                        )\n                    }\n                    _errorMessage.value = error.message\n                }\n            )\n        }\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 快速搜索（输入时实时搜索）\n     * @param keyword 搜索关键词\n     */\n    fun performQuickSearch(keyword: String) {\n        // 取消之前的搜索\n        searchJob?.cancel()\n        \n        if (keyword.length < 2) {\n            _searchSuggestions.value = emptyList()\n            return\n        }\n\n        // 防抖搜索\n        searchJob = viewModelScope.launch {\n            delay(300) // 防抖延迟\n            \n            val result = repository.quickSearch(keyword, 10)\n            result.fold(\n                onSuccess = { items ->\n                    _searchSuggestions.value = items\n                },\n                onFailure = { \n                    _searchSuggestions.value = emptyList()\n                }\n            )\n        }\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 应用筛选条件\n     * @param filters 新的筛选条件\n     */\n    fun applyFilters(filters: InventoryFilters) {\n        currentFilters = filters\n        \n        if (currentQuery.isNotBlank()) {\n            queryInventory(currentQuery, filters)\n        }\n        \n        updateUiState { it.copy(filters = filters) }\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 清除查询结果\n     */\n    fun clearResults() {\n        _queryResults.value = emptyList()\n        _summaryResult.value = null\n        _searchSuggestions.value = emptyList()\n        \n        updateUiState { \n            it.copy(\n                hasResults = false,\n                currentQuery = "",\n                error = null\n            )\n        }\n        \n        currentQuery = ""\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 清除错误消息\n     */\n    fun clearError() {\n        _errorMessage.value = null\n        updateUiState { it.copy(error = null) }\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 重新查询\n     */\n    fun retryQuery() {\n        if (currentQuery.isNotBlank()) {\n            queryInventory(currentQuery, currentFilters)\n        }\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 刷新数据\n     */\n    fun refreshData() {\n        loadWarehouses()\n        if (currentQuery.isNotBlank()) {\n            queryInventory(currentQuery, currentFilters)\n        }\n    }\n\n    // 私有方法\n\n    private fun loadInitialData() {\n        viewModelScope.launch {\n            loadWarehouses()\n            loadSearchHistory()\n        }\n    }\n\n    private suspend fun loadWarehouses() {\n        val result = repository.getWarehouses()\n        result.fold(\n            onSuccess = { warehouses ->\n                _warehouses.value = warehouses\n            },\n            onFailure = {\n                // 仓库列表加载失败不影响主要功能\n            }\n        )\n    }\n\n    private suspend fun loadSearchHistory() {\n        val history = repository.getSearchHistory()\n        _searchHistory.value = history\n    }\n\n    private suspend fun saveSearchHistory(query: String) {\n        repository.saveSearchHistory(query)\n        loadSearchHistory() // 重新加载历史记录\n    }\n\n    private fun buildQueryRequest(queryText: String, filters: InventoryFilters): InventoryQueryRequest {\n        return InventoryQueryRequest(\n            // 智能判断查询类型\n            barcode = if (queryText.matches(Regex("\\\\d+")) && queryText.length >= 8) queryText else null,\n            code = if (queryText.matches(Regex("[A-Za-z0-9-_]+")) && queryText.length <= 20) queryText else null,\n            name = if (!queryText.matches(Regex("\\\\d+"))) queryText else null,\n            warehouseId = filters.warehouseId,\n            locationCode = filters.locationArea,\n            showZeroQty = filters.showZeroStock,\n            includeLocked = true,\n            quickMode = false,\n            page = 1,\n            limit = 50\n        )\n    }\n\n    private fun calculateSummary(items: List<InventoryItem>) {\n        val summary = InventorySearchSummary(\n            totalQty = items.sumOf { it.qty.toDouble() }.toFloat(),\n            availableQty = items.sumOf { it.qtyAvailable.toDouble() }.toFloat(),\n            lockedQty = items.sumOf { it.qtyLocked.toDouble() }.toFloat(),\n            locationCount = items.map { it.locationsId }.distinct().size,\n            itemCount = items.size\n        )\n        _summaryResult.value = summary\n    }\n\n    private fun updateUiState(update: (InventoryQueryUiState) -> InventoryQueryUiState) {\n        _uiState.value = update(_uiState.value ?: InventoryQueryUiState())\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. 依赖注入配置\n\n#### 3.1 创建RepositoryModule.kt\n位置: `app/src/main/java/com/diciai/app/di/RepositoryModule.kt`\n\n```kotlin\npackage com.diciai.app.di\n\nimport com.diciai.app.api.WmsApi\nimport com.diciai.app.repository.InventoryRepository\nimport dagger.Module\nimport dagger.Provides\nimport dagger.hilt.InstallIn\nimport dagger.hilt.components.SingletonComponent\nimport javax.inject.Singleton\n\n@Module\n@InstallIn(SingletonComponent::class)\nobject RepositoryModule {\n\n    @Provides\n    @Singleton\n    fun provideInventoryRepository(wmsApi: WmsApi): InventoryRepository {\n        return InventoryRepository(wmsApi)\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 4. 数据模型更新\n\n#### 4.1 更新WmsModels.kt\n在现有的 `WmsModels.kt` 文件中添加新的数据模型：\n\n```kotlin\n// 库存查询请求\ndata class InventoryQueryRequest(\n    val barcode: String? = null,\n    val code: String? = null,\n    val name: String? = null,\n    val warehouseId: String? = null,\n    val locationCode: String? = null,\n    val batch: String? = null,\n    val showZeroQty: Boolean = false,\n    val includeLocked: Boolean = true,\n    val quickMode: Boolean = false,\n    val page: Int = 1,\n    val limit: Int = 20\n)\n\n// 库存查询响应\ndata class InventoryQueryResponse(\n    @SerializedName("count")\n    val count: Long,\n    @SerializedName("query_time") \n    val queryTime: Long,\n    @SerializedName("summary")\n    val summary: InventorySearchSummary?,\n    @SerializedName("items")\n    val items: List<InventoryItem>\n)\n\n// 搜索汇总\ndata class InventorySearchSummary(\n    val totalQty: Float,\n    val availableQty: Float,\n    val lockedQty: Float,\n    val locationCount: Int,\n    val itemCount: Int\n)\n\n// UI状态\ndata class InventoryQueryUiState(\n    val isLoading: Boolean = false,\n    val isSearching: Boolean = false,\n    val error: String? = null,\n    val hasResults: Boolean = false,\n    val currentQuery: String = "",\n    val filters: InventoryFilters = InventoryFilters()\n)\n\n// 筛选条件\ndata class InventoryFilters(\n    val warehouseId: String? = null,\n    val stockStatus: StockStatus? = null,\n    val locationArea: String? = null,\n    val showZeroStock: Boolean = false,\n    val sortBy: SortBy = SortBy.UPDATE_TIME,\n    val sortOrder: SortOrder = SortOrder.DESC\n)\n\n// 仓库信息\ndata class Warehouse(\n    @SerializedName("id")\n    val id: String,\n    @SerializedName("name")\n    val name: String,\n    @SerializedName("code")\n    val code: String,\n    @SerializedName("address")\n    val address: String? = null\n)\n\nenum class StockStatus {\n    IN_STOCK,           // 有库存\n    LOW_STOCK,          // 库存不足 \n    OUT_OF_STOCK,       // 无库存\n    PARTIALLY_LOCKED    // 部分锁定\n}\n\nenum class SortBy { NAME, QTY, UPDATE_TIME, LOCATION }\nenum class SortOrder { ASC, DESC }\n```\n\n### 5. 测试方案\n\n#### 5.1 Repository单元测试\n创建 `InventoryRepositoryTest.kt`:\n\n```kotlin\n@RunWith(MockitoJUnitRunner::class)\nclass InventoryRepositoryTest {\n\n    @Mock\n    private lateinit var wmsApi: WmsApi\n    \n    private lateinit var repository: InventoryRepository\n\n    @Before\n    fun setup() {\n        repository = InventoryRepository(wmsApi)\n    }\n\n    @Test\n    fun `queryInventory success should return result`() = runTest {\n        // 测试成功场景\n    }\n\n    @Test\n    fun `queryInventory failure should return error`() = runTest {\n        // 测试失败场景\n    }\n\n    @Test\n    fun `queryByBarcode should handle barcode query`() = runTest {\n        // 测试条码查询\n    }\n}\n```\n\n#### 5.2 ViewModel单元测试\n创建 `InventoryQueryViewModelTest.kt`:\n\n```kotlin\n@RunWith(MockitoJUnitRunner::class)\nclass InventoryQueryViewModelTest {\n\n    @Mock\n    private lateinit var repository: InventoryRepository\n    \n    private lateinit var viewModel: InventoryQueryViewModel\n\n    @Before\n    fun setup() {\n        viewModel = InventoryQueryViewModel(repository)\n    }\n\n    @Test\n    fun `queryInventory should update uiState and results`() = runTest {\n        // 测试查询逻辑\n    }\n\n    @Test\n    fun `searchByBarcode should handle barcode scanning`() = runTest {\n        // 测试条码扫描\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 6. 预计工时\n- Repository层实现: 1天\n- ViewModel层实现: 1天  \n- 依赖注入配置: 0.5天\n- 数据模型更新: 0.5天\n- 单元测试编写: 1天\n\n**总计: 4天**\n\n### 7. 注意事项\n\n1. **错误处理**: 完善的网络错误和业务错误处理\n2. **内存管理**: 及时清理LiveData和Job，避免内存泄漏\n3. **线程安全**: 确保Repository在IO线程执行，ViewModel在主线程更新UI\n4. **防抖优化**: 搜索输入防抖，避免频繁网络请求\n5. **状态管理**: 清晰的UI状态管理，便于UI层响应	110	2025-09-23 17:30:39.94151	2025-09-23 17:30:39.94151	\N	110	markdown	draft	\N	\N	private	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N		1	\N	{}	f	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N
