1227	129	InventoryActivity UI重构实现方案	# 移动端: 重构InventoryActivity UI实现\n\n## 开发目标\n重构现有的InventoryActivity，集成MVVM架构，实现完整的库存查询UI功能，提供良好的用户体验和交互效果。\n\n## 当前状态分析\n现有的InventoryActivity只有UI框架，需要：\n1. 集成ViewModel进行数据绑定\n2. 实现查询功能的交互逻辑\n3. 添加结果展示和状态管理\n4. 优化扫码输入体验\n5. 增加加载状态和错误处理\n\n## 实现方案\n\n### 1. Activity重构\n\n#### 1.1 更新InventoryActivity.kt\n```kotlin\npackage com.diciai.app\n\nimport android.Manifest\nimport android.content.pm.PackageManager\nimport android.os.Bundle\nimport android.view.View\nimport android.view.inputmethod.EditorInfo\nimport android.widget.Toast\nimport androidx.activity.result.contract.ActivityResultContracts\nimport androidx.activity.viewModels\nimport androidx.appcompat.app.AppCompatActivity\nimport androidx.core.content.ContextCompat\nimport androidx.core.widget.addTextChangedListener\nimport androidx.lifecycle.lifecycleScope\nimport androidx.recyclerview.widget.LinearLayoutManager\nimport com.diciai.app.adapter.InventoryResultAdapter\nimport com.diciai.app.adapter.SearchSuggestionAdapter\nimport com.diciai.app.databinding.ActivityInventoryBinding\nimport com.diciai.app.model.InventoryFilters\nimport com.diciai.app.model.InventoryItem\nimport com.diciai.app.model.StockStatus\nimport com.diciai.app.ui.dialog.FilterDialogFragment\nimport com.diciai.app.utils.ScannerUtils\nimport com.diciai.app.viewmodel.InventoryQueryViewModel\nimport dagger.hilt.android.AndroidEntryPoint\nimport kotlinx.coroutines.launch\n\n@AndroidEntryPoint\nclass InventoryActivity : AppCompatActivity() {\n    \n    private lateinit var binding: ActivityInventoryBinding\n    private val viewModel: InventoryQueryViewModel by viewModels()\n    \n    // 适配器\n    private lateinit var resultAdapter: InventoryResultAdapter\n    private lateinit var suggestionAdapter: SearchSuggestionAdapter\n    \n    // 扫码相关\n    private val cameraPermissionLauncher = registerForActivityResult(\n        ActivityResultContracts.RequestPermission()\n    ) { isGranted ->\n        if (isGranted) {\n            startBarcodeScanning()\n        } else {\n            showToast("需要相机权限进行扫码")\n        }\n    }\n\n    override fun onCreate(savedInstanceState: Bundle?) {\n        super.onCreate(savedInstanceState)\n        binding = ActivityInventoryBinding.inflate(layoutInflater)\n        setContentView(binding.root)\n        \n        setupUI()\n        setupObservers()\n        setupRecyclerViews()\n        setupSearchHandlers()\n        \n        // 设置ActionBar\n        supportActionBar?.setDisplayHomeAsUpEnabled(true)\n        supportActionBar?.title = "库存查询"\n    }\n\n    private fun setupUI() {\n        // 查询按钮点击事件\n        binding.btnQueryInventory.setOnClickListener {\n            performSearch()\n        }\n        \n        // 盘点按钮（暂时隐藏，后续可能需要）\n        binding.cardInventoryCheck.visibility = View.GONE\n        \n        // 筛选按钮\n        binding.btnFilter.setOnClickListener {\n            showFilterDialog()\n        }\n        \n        // 清除结果按钮\n        binding.btnClearResults.setOnClickListener {\n            viewModel.clearResults()\n        }\n        \n        // 扫码按钮\n        binding.btnScanBarcode.setOnClickListener {\n            requestCameraPermissionAndScan()\n        }\n        \n        // 刷新按钮\n        binding.swipeRefreshLayout.setOnRefreshListener {\n            viewModel.refreshData()\n        }\n    }\n\n    private fun setupObservers() {\n        // 观察UI状态\n        viewModel.uiState.observe(this) { state ->\n            updateUIState(state)\n        }\n        \n        // 观察查询结果\n        viewModel.queryResults.observe(this) { results ->\n            updateQueryResults(results)\n        }\n        \n        // 观察汇总信息\n        viewModel.summaryResult.observe(this) { summary ->\n            updateSummaryInfo(summary)\n        }\n        \n        // 观察搜索建议\n        viewModel.searchSuggestions.observe(this) { suggestions ->\n            updateSearchSuggestions(suggestions)\n        }\n        \n        // 观察错误消息\n        viewModel.errorMessage.observe(this) { error ->\n            error?.let {\n                showError(it)\n                viewModel.clearError()\n            }\n        }\n        \n        // 观察仓库列表\n        viewModel.warehouses.observe(this) { warehouses ->\n            // 更新筛选对话框的仓库选择\n        }\n    }\n\n    private fun setupRecyclerViews() {\n        // 查询结果列表\n        resultAdapter = InventoryResultAdapter(\n            onItemClick = { item ->\n                showItemDetailDialog(item)\n            },\n            onLocationClick = { item ->\n                showLocationInfo(item)\n            }\n        )\n        \n        binding.recyclerViewResults.apply {\n            layoutManager = LinearLayoutManager(this@InventoryActivity)\n            adapter = resultAdapter\n        }\n        \n        // 搜索建议列表\n        suggestionAdapter = SearchSuggestionAdapter { suggestion ->\n            // 点击建议项进行查询\n            binding.etQueryBarcode.setText(suggestion.code)\n            viewModel.queryInventory(suggestion.code)\n            hideSuggestions()\n        }\n        \n        binding.recyclerViewSuggestions.apply {\n            layoutManager = LinearLayoutManager(this@InventoryActivity)\n            adapter = suggestionAdapter\n        }\n    }\n\n    private fun setupSearchHandlers() {\n        // 搜索输入框文本变化监听\n        binding.etQueryBarcode.addTextChangedListener { text ->\n            val query = text.toString().trim()\n            \n            if (query.length >= 2) {\n                // 实时搜索建议\n                viewModel.performQuickSearch(query)\n                showSuggestions()\n            } else {\n                hideSuggestions()\n            }\n        }\n        \n        // 搜索输入框回车键监听\n        binding.etQueryBarcode.setOnEditorActionListener { _, actionId, _ ->\n            if (actionId == EditorInfo.IME_ACTION_SEARCH) {\n                performSearch()\n                true\n            } else {\n                false\n            }\n        }\n        \n        // 输入框焦点变化\n        binding.etQueryBarcode.setOnFocusChangeListener { _, hasFocus ->\n            if (!hasFocus) {\n                hideSuggestions()\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    private fun updateUIState(state: InventoryQueryUiState) {\n        // 更新加载状态\n        binding.swipeRefreshLayout.isRefreshing = state.isLoading\n        binding.progressBar.visibility = if (state.isLoading) View.VISIBLE else View.GONE\n        \n        // 更新查询按钮状态\n        binding.btnQueryInventory.isEnabled = !state.isLoading\n        binding.btnQueryInventory.text = if (state.isLoading) "查询中..." else "查询库存"\n        \n        // 更新结果卡片显示\n        binding.cardQueryResult.visibility = if (state.hasResults) View.VISIBLE else View.GONE\n        \n        // 更新错误信息\n        if (state.error != null) {\n            binding.textViewError.apply {\n                text = state.error\n                visibility = View.VISIBLE\n            }\n            binding.btnRetry.visibility = View.VISIBLE\n        } else {\n            binding.textViewError.visibility = View.GONE\n            binding.btnRetry.visibility = View.GONE\n        }\n        \n        // 更新当前查询显示\n        if (state.currentQuery.isNotEmpty()) {\n            binding.textViewCurrentQuery.apply {\n                text = "查询: ${state.currentQuery}"\n                visibility = View.VISIBLE\n            }\n        } else {\n            binding.textViewCurrentQuery.visibility = View.GONE\n        }\n        \n        // 更新筛选状态指示\n        updateFilterIndicator(state.filters)\n    }\n\n    private fun updateQueryResults(results: List<InventoryItem>) {\n        resultAdapter.submitList(results)\n        \n        // 更新结果数量显示\n        binding.textViewResultCount.text = "找到 ${results.size} 条记录"\n        \n        // 如果没有结果，显示空状态\n        if (results.isEmpty() && viewModel.uiState.value?.currentQuery?.isNotEmpty() == true) {\n            binding.layoutEmptyState.visibility = View.VISIBLE\n            binding.recyclerViewResults.visibility = View.GONE\n        } else {\n            binding.layoutEmptyState.visibility = View.GONE\n            binding.recyclerViewResults.visibility = View.VISIBLE\n        }\n    }\n\n    private fun updateSummaryInfo(summary: InventorySearchSummary?) {\n        if (summary != null) {\n            binding.apply {\n                textViewTotalQty.text = "总库存: ${summary.totalQty}"\n                textViewAvailableQty.text = "可用: ${summary.availableQty}"\n                textViewLockedQty.text = "锁定: ${summary.lockedQty}"\n                textViewLocationCount.text = "涉及仓位: ${summary.locationCount}"\n                \n                layoutSummary.visibility = View.VISIBLE\n            }\n        } else {\n            binding.layoutSummary.visibility = View.GONE\n        }\n    }\n\n    private fun updateSearchSuggestions(suggestions: List<InventoryItem>) {\n        suggestionAdapter.submitList(suggestions)\n    }\n\n    private fun performSearch() {\n        val query = binding.etQueryBarcode.text.toString().trim()\n        if (query.isEmpty()) {\n            showToast("请输入查询条件")\n            return\n        }\n        \n        // 隐藏键盘和建议\n        hideKeyboard()\n        hideSuggestions()\n        \n        // 执行查询\n        viewModel.queryInventory(query)\n    }\n\n    private fun requestCameraPermissionAndScan() {\n        when {\n            ContextCompat.checkSelfPermission(\n                this, Manifest.permission.CAMERA\n            ) == PackageManager.PERMISSION_GRANTED -> {\n                startBarcodeScanning()\n            }\n            else -> {\n                cameraPermissionLauncher.launch(Manifest.permission.CAMERA)\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    private fun startBarcodeScanning() {\n        // 检查是否有 Sunmi 扫码器\n        if (ScannerUtils.isSunmiDevice(this)) {\n            ScannerUtils.startSunmiScanner(this) { barcode ->\n                handleScanResult(barcode)\n            }\n        } else {\n            // 使用其他扫码方案（如 ZXing）\n            showToast("暂不支持该设备的扫码功能")\n        }\n    }\n\n    private fun handleScanResult(barcode: String) {\n        if (barcode.isNotEmpty()) {\n            binding.etQueryBarcode.setText(barcode)\n            viewModel.searchByBarcode(barcode)\n        }\n    }\n\n    private fun showFilterDialog() {\n        val currentFilters = viewModel.uiState.value?.filters ?: InventoryFilters()\n        val warehouses = viewModel.warehouses.value ?: emptyList()\n        \n        FilterDialogFragment.newInstance(currentFilters, warehouses) { newFilters ->\n            viewModel.applyFilters(newFilters)\n        }.show(supportFragmentManager, "filter_dialog")\n    }\n\n    private fun updateFilterIndicator(filters: InventoryFilters) {\n        var filterCount = 0\n        \n        if (filters.warehouseId != null) filterCount++\n        if (filters.stockStatus != null) filterCount++\n        if (filters.locationArea != null) filterCount++\n        if (filters.showZeroStock) filterCount++\n        \n        if (filterCount > 0) {\n            binding.badgeFilterCount.apply {\n                text = filterCount.toString()\n                visibility = View.VISIBLE\n            }\n            binding.btnFilter.setIconTintResource(R.color.colorPrimary)\n        } else {\n            binding.badgeFilterCount.visibility = View.GONE\n            binding.btnFilter.setIconTintResource(R.color.colorOnSurface)\n        }\n    }\n\n    private fun showSuggestions() {\n        binding.cardSuggestions.visibility = View.VISIBLE\n    }\n\n    private fun hideSuggestions() {\n        binding.cardSuggestions.visibility = View.GONE\n    }\n\n    private fun showItemDetailDialog(item: InventoryItem) {\n        // 显示库存项详情对话框\n        ItemDetailDialogFragment.newInstance(item)\n            .show(supportFragmentManager, "item_detail")\n    }\n\n    private fun showLocationInfo(item: InventoryItem) {\n        // 显示位置信息\n        val message = buildString {\n            append("仓库: ${item.warehouseName}\\n")\n            if (item.locationsName != null) {\n                append("仓位: ${item.locationsName}\\n")\n            }\n            if (item.positionCode != null) {\n                append("位置编码: ${item.positionCode}")\n            }\n        }\n        \n        androidx.appcompat.app.AlertDialog.Builder(this)\n            .setTitle("位置信息")\n            .setMessage(message)\n            .setPositiveButton("确定", null)\n            .show()\n    }\n\n    private fun showError(message: String) {\n        binding.textViewError.apply {\n            text = message\n            visibility = View.VISIBLE\n        }\n        \n        binding.btnRetry.apply {\n            visibility = View.VISIBLE\n            setOnClickListener {\n                viewModel.retryQuery()\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    private fun showToast(message: String) {\n        Toast.makeText(this, message, Toast.LENGTH_SHORT).show()\n    }\n\n    private fun hideKeyboard() {\n        currentFocus?.let { view ->\n            val imm = getSystemService(INPUT_METHOD_SERVICE) as InputMethodManager\n            imm.hideSoftInputFromWindow(view.windowToken, 0)\n        }\n    }\n\n    override fun onSupportNavigateUp(): Boolean {\n        finish()\n        return true\n    }\n\n    override fun onDestroy() {\n        super.onDestroy()\n        // 清理扫码器资源\n        ScannerUtils.cleanup()\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 2. 布局文件更新\n\n#### 2.1 更新activity_inventory.xml\n在现有布局基础上添加新的UI元素：\n\n```xml\n<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>\n<layout xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"\n    xmlns:app="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res-auto">\n    \n    <androidx.constraintlayout.widget.ConstraintLayout\n        android:layout_width="match_parent"\n        android:layout_height="match_parent"\n        android:background="@drawable/warehouse_bg_gradient">\n\n        <!-- 顶部标题卡片 -->\n        <com.google.android.material.card.MaterialCardView\n            android:id="@+id/titleCard"\n            android:layout_width="0dp"\n            android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n            android:layout_marginHorizontal="16dp"\n            android:layout_marginTop="16dp"\n            app:cardCornerRadius="16dp"\n            app:cardElevation="4dp"\n            app:cardBackgroundColor="#00BCD4"\n            app:layout_constraintTop_toTopOf="parent"\n            app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="parent"\n            app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="parent">\n\n            <LinearLayout\n                android:layout_width="match_parent"\n                android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                android:orientation="horizontal"\n                android:padding="16dp"\n                android:gravity="center_vertical">\n\n                <ImageView\n                    android:layout_width="32dp"\n                    android:layout_height="32dp"\n                    android:src="@drawable/ic_search_24"\n                    app:tint="@color/white" />\n\n                <TextView\n                    android:layout_width="0dp"\n                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                    android:layout_weight="1"\n                    android:layout_marginStart="12dp"\n                    android:text="库存查询中心"\n                    android:textSize="20sp"\n                    android:textStyle="bold"\n                    android:textColor="@color/white" />\n\n                <!-- 筛选按钮 -->\n                <com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButton\n                    android:id="@+id/btnFilter"\n                    style="@style/Widget.MaterialComponents.Button.TextButton"\n                    android:layout_width="wrap_content"\n                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                    android:text="筛选"\n                    android:textColor="@color/white"\n                    app:icon="@drawable/ic_filter_list_24"\n                    app:iconTint="@color/white" />\n\n                <!-- 筛选数量徽章 -->\n                <TextView\n                    android:id="@+id/badgeFilterCount"\n                    android:layout_width="20dp"\n                    android:layout_height="20dp"\n                    android:layout_marginStart="-10dp"\n                    android:layout_marginTop="-10dp"\n                    android:background="@drawable/badge_background"\n                    android:gravity="center"\n                    android:text="1"\n                    android:textColor="@color/white"\n                    android:textSize="12sp"\n                    android:visibility="gone" />\n\n            </LinearLayout>\n        </com.google.android.material.card.MaterialCardView>\n\n        <!-- 下拉刷新容器 -->\n        <androidx.swiperefreshlayout.widget.SwipeRefreshLayout\n            android:id="@+id/swipeRefreshLayout"\n            android:layout_width="0dp"\n            android:layout_height="0dp"\n            android:layout_marginTop="12dp"\n            app:layout_constraintTop_toBottomOf="@id/titleCard"\n            app:layout_constraintBottom_toBottomOf="parent"\n            app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="parent"\n            app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="parent">\n\n            <ScrollView\n                android:layout_width="match_parent"\n                android:layout_height="match_parent"\n                android:fillViewport="true">\n\n                <LinearLayout\n                    android:layout_width="match_parent"\n                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                    android:orientation="vertical"\n                    android:padding="16dp">\n\n                    <!-- 搜索输入卡片 -->\n                    <com.google.android.material.card.MaterialCardView\n                        android:id="@+id/cardSearch"\n                        android:layout_width="match_parent"\n                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                        android:layout_marginBottom="16dp"\n                        app:cardCornerRadius="16dp"\n                        app:cardElevation="6dp"\n                        app:cardBackgroundColor="#FFF8E1"\n                        app:strokeColor="#FFC107"\n                        app:strokeWidth="1dp">\n\n                        <LinearLayout\n                            android:layout_width="match_parent"\n                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                            android:orientation="vertical"\n                            android:padding="20dp">\n\n                            <!-- 搜索标题 -->\n                            <LinearLayout\n                                android:layout_width="match_parent"\n                                android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                                android:orientation="horizontal"\n                                android:gravity="center_vertical"\n                                android:layout_marginBottom="16dp">\n\n                                <ImageView\n                                    android:layout_width="48dp"\n                                    android:layout_height="48dp"\n                                    android:src="@drawable/ic_search_24"\n                                    app:tint="#FFC107"\n                                    android:background="@drawable/circle_background"\n                                    android:backgroundTint="#FFF3C4"\n                                    android:padding="12dp" />\n\n                                <TextView\n                                    android:layout_width="0dp"\n                                    android:layout_weight="1"\n                                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                                    android:layout_marginStart="16dp"\n                                    android:text="🔍 智能库存查询"\n                                    android:textSize="20sp"\n                                    android:textStyle="bold"\n                                    android:textColor="#F57F17" />\n\n                            </LinearLayout>\n\n                            <!-- 当前查询显示 -->\n                            <TextView\n                                android:id="@+id/textViewCurrentQuery"\n                                android:layout_width="wrap_content"\n                                android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                                android:layout_marginBottom="8dp"\n                                android:background="@drawable/current_query_background"\n                                android:padding="8dp"\n                                android:text="查询: ABC123"\n                                android:textColor="#F57F17"\n                                android:textSize="12sp"\n                                android:visibility="gone" />\n\n                            <!-- 搜索输入区域 -->\n                            <LinearLayout\n                                android:layout_width="match_parent"\n                                android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                                android:orientation="vertical"\n                                android:background="#FFFFFF"\n                                android:padding="16dp">\n\n                                <!-- 搜索输入框 -->\n                                <com.google.android.material.textfield.TextInputLayout\n                                    android:layout_width="match_parent"\n                                    android:layout_height="56dp"\n                                    android:layout_marginBottom="12dp"\n                                    app:startIconDrawable="@drawable/ic_search_24"\n                                    app:startIconTint="#FFC107"\n                                    app:endIconMode="clear_text"\n                                    app:boxCornerRadiusTopStart="8dp"\n                                    app:boxCornerRadiusTopEnd="8dp"\n                                    app:boxCornerRadiusBottomStart="8dp"\n                                    app:boxCornerRadiusBottomEnd="8dp"\n                                    style="@style/Widget.MaterialComponents.TextInputLayout.OutlinedBox">\n\n                                    <com.google.android.material.textfield.TextInputEditText\n                                        android:id="@+id/etQueryBarcode"\n                                        android:layout_width="match_parent"\n                                        android:layout_height="match_parent"\n                                        android:hint="商品名称、SKU或条码"\n                                        android:singleLine="true"\n                                        android:imeOptions="actionSearch"\n                                        android:inputType="textNoSuggestions|textVisiblePassword" />\n\n                                </com.google.android.material.textfield.TextInputLayout>\n\n                                <!-- 操作按钮行 -->\n                                <LinearLayout\n                                    android:layout_width="match_parent"\n                                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                                    android:orientation="horizontal"\n                                    android:gravity="center_vertical">\n\n                                    <!-- 查询按钮 -->\n                                    <com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButton\n                                        android:id="@+id/btnQueryInventory"\n                                        android:layout_width="0dp"\n                                        android:layout_height="48dp"\n                                        android:layout_weight="1"\n                                        android:layout_marginEnd="8dp"\n                                        android:text="查询库存"\n                                        android:textSize="16sp"\n                                        app:cornerRadius="8dp"\n                                        app:backgroundTint="#FFC107"\n                                        app:icon="@drawable/ic_search_24"\n                                        app:iconGravity="textStart"\n                                        style="@style/Widget.MaterialComponents.Button" />\n\n                                    <!-- 扫码按钮 -->\n                                    <com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButton\n                                        android:id="@+id/btnScanBarcode"\n                                        style="@style/Widget.MaterialComponents.Button.OutlinedButton"\n                                        android:layout_width="wrap_content"\n                                        android:layout_height="48dp"\n                                        android:layout_marginStart="8dp"\n                                        app:icon="@drawable/ic_qr_code_scanner_24"\n                                        app:iconTint="#FFC107"\n                                        app:strokeColor="#FFC107"\n                                        app:cornerRadius="8dp" />\n\n                                </LinearLayout>\n\n                            </LinearLayout>\n\n                        </LinearLayout>\n                    </com.google.android.material.card.MaterialCardView>\n\n                    <!-- 搜索建议卡片 -->\n                    <com.google.android.material.card.MaterialCardView\n                        android:id="@+id/cardSuggestions"\n                        android:layout_width="match_parent"\n                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                        android:layout_marginBottom="16dp"\n                        android:visibility="gone"\n                        app:cardCornerRadius="8dp"\n                        app:cardElevation="4dp"\n                        app:cardBackgroundColor="@color/white">\n\n                        <LinearLayout\n                            android:layout_width="match_parent"\n                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                            android:orientation="vertical"\n                            android:padding="8dp">\n\n                            <TextView\n                                android:layout_width="wrap_content"\n                                android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                                android:text="搜索建议"\n                                android:textSize="12sp"\n                                android:textColor="#666666"\n                                android:layout_marginBottom="8dp"\n                                android:layout_marginStart="8dp" />\n\n                            <androidx.recyclerview.widget.RecyclerView\n                                android:id="@+id/recyclerViewSuggestions"\n                                android:layout_width="match_parent"\n                                android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                                android:maxHeight="200dp" />\n\n                        </LinearLayout>\n                    </com.google.android.material.card.MaterialCardView>\n\n                    <!-- 查询结果卡片 -->\n                    <com.google.android.material.card.MaterialCardView\n                        android:id="@+id/cardQueryResult"\n                        android:layout_width="match_parent"\n                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                        android:layout_marginBottom="16dp"\n                        app:cardCornerRadius="16dp"\n                        app:cardElevation="4dp"\n                        app:cardBackgroundColor="@color/white"\n                        android:visibility="gone">\n\n                        <LinearLayout\n                            android:layout_width="match_parent"\n                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                            android:orientation="vertical"\n                            android:padding="20dp">\n\n                            <!-- 结果标题行 -->\n                            <LinearLayout\n                                android:layout_width="match_parent"\n                                android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                                android:orientation="horizontal"\n                                android:gravity="center_vertical"\n                                android:layout_marginBottom="16dp">\n\n                                <TextView\n                                    android:layout_width="0dp"\n                                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                                    android:layout_weight="1"\n                                    android:text="📊 查询结果"\n                                    android:textSize="18sp"\n                                    android:textStyle="bold"\n                                    android:textColor="#1976D2" />\n\n                                <TextView\n                                    android:id="@+id/textViewResultCount"\n                                    android:layout_width="wrap_content"\n                                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                                    android:text="找到 0 条记录"\n                                    android:textSize="12sp"\n                                    android:textColor="#666666" />\n\n                                <com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButton\n                                    android:id="@+id/btnClearResults"\n                                    style="@style/Widget.MaterialComponents.Button.TextButton"\n                                    android:layout_width="wrap_content"\n                                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                                    android:layout_marginStart="8dp"\n                                    android:text="清除"\n                                    android:textSize="12sp"\n                                    app:icon="@drawable/ic_clear_24" />\n\n                            </LinearLayout>\n\n                            <!-- 汇总信息 -->\n                            <LinearLayout\n                                android:id="@+id/layoutSummary"\n                                android:layout_width="match_parent"\n                                android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                                android:orientation="horizontal"\n                                android:layout_marginBottom="16dp"\n                                android:background="#F8F9FA"\n                                android:padding="12dp"\n                                android:visibility="gone">\n\n                                <TextView\n                                    android:id="@+id/textViewTotalQty"\n                                    android:layout_width="0dp"\n                                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                                    android:layout_weight="1"\n                                    android:text="总库存: 0"\n                                    android:textSize="12sp"\n                                    android:textColor="#2196F3"\n                                    android:gravity="center" />\n\n                                <TextView\n                                    android:id="@+id/textViewAvailableQty"\n                                    android:layout_width="0dp"\n                                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                                    android:layout_weight="1"\n                                    android:text="可用: 0"\n                                    android:textSize="12sp"\n                                    android:textColor="#4CAF50"\n                                    android:gravity="center" />\n\n                                <TextView\n                                    android:id="@+id/textViewLockedQty"\n                                    android:layout_width="0dp"\n                                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                                    android:layout_weight="1"\n                                    android:text="锁定: 0"\n                                    android:textSize="12sp"\n                                    android:textColor="#FF9800"\n                                    android:gravity="center" />\n\n                                <TextView\n                                    android:id="@+id/textViewLocationCount"\n                                    android:layout_width="0dp"\n                                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                                    android:layout_weight="1"\n                                    android:text="仓位: 0"\n                                    android:textSize="12sp"\n                                    android:textColor="#9C27B0"\n                                    android:gravity="center" />\n\n                            </LinearLayout>\n\n                            <!-- 结果列表 -->\n                            <androidx.recyclerview.widget.RecyclerView\n                                android:id="@+id/recyclerViewResults"\n                                android:layout_width="match_parent"\n                                android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                                android:maxHeight="400dp" />\n\n                            <!-- 空状态提示 -->\n                            <LinearLayout\n                                android:id="@+id/layoutEmptyState"\n                                android:layout_width="match_parent"\n                                android:layout_height="200dp"\n                                android:orientation="vertical"\n                                android:gravity="center"\n                                android:visibility="gone">\n\n                                <ImageView\n                                    android:layout_width="64dp"\n                                    android:layout_height="64dp"\n                                    android:src="@drawable/ic_search_off_24"\n                                    app:tint="#CCCCCC"\n                                    android:layout_marginBottom="16dp" />\n\n                                <TextView\n                                    android:layout_width="wrap_content"\n                                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                                    android:text="未找到匹配的库存记录"\n                                    android:textSize="16sp"\n                                    android:textColor="#666666"\n                                    android:layout_marginBottom="8dp" />\n\n                                <TextView\n                                    android:layout_width="wrap_content"\n                                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                                    android:text="请尝试其他搜索条件"\n                                    android:textSize="14sp"\n                                    android:textColor="#999999" />\n\n                            </LinearLayout>\n\n                        </LinearLayout>\n                    </com.google.android.material.card.MaterialCardView>\n\n                    <!-- 错误状态和重试 -->\n                    <LinearLayout\n                        android:id="@+id/layoutError"\n                        android:layout_width="match_parent"\n                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                        android:orientation="vertical"\n                        android:gravity="center"\n                        android:padding="20dp"\n                        android:visibility="gone">\n\n                        <TextView\n                            android:id="@+id/textViewError"\n                            android:layout_width="wrap_content"\n                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                            android:text="查询失败"\n                            android:textSize="16sp"\n                            android:textColor="#F44336"\n                            android:layout_marginBottom="16dp"\n                            android:gravity="center"\n                            android:visibility="gone" />\n\n                        <com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButton\n                            android:id="@+id/btnRetry"\n                            style="@style/Widget.MaterialComponents.Button.OutlinedButton"\n                            android:layout_width="wrap_content"\n                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                            android:text="重试"\n                            app:icon="@drawable/ic_refresh_24"\n                            app:strokeColor="#F44336"\n                            app:iconTint="#F44336"\n                            android:textColor="#F44336"\n                            android:visibility="gone" />\n\n                    </LinearLayout>\n\n                    <!-- 加载指示器 -->\n                    <ProgressBar\n                        android:id="@+id/progressBar"\n                        android:layout_width="wrap_content"\n                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"\n                        android:layout_gravity="center"\n                        android:layout_marginTop="20dp"\n                        android:visibility="gone" />\n\n                </LinearLayout>\n            </ScrollView>\n        </androidx.swiperefreshlayout.widget.SwipeRefreshLayout>\n\n    </androidx.constraintlayout.widget.ConstraintLayout>\n</layout>\n```\n\n### 3. 适配器实现\n\n#### 3.1 创建InventoryResultAdapter.kt\n```kotlin\npackage com.diciai.app.adapter\n\nimport android.view.LayoutInflater\nimport android.view.ViewGroup\nimport androidx.recyclerview.widget.DiffUtil\nimport androidx.recyclerview.widget.ListAdapter\nimport androidx.recyclerview.widget.RecyclerView\nimport com.diciai.app.databinding.ItemInventoryResultBinding\nimport com.diciai.app.model.InventoryItem\nimport com.diciai.app.model.StockStatus\n\nclass InventoryResultAdapter(\n    private val onItemClick: (InventoryItem) -> Unit,\n    private val onLocationClick: (InventoryItem) -> Unit\n) : ListAdapter<InventoryItem, InventoryResultAdapter.ViewHolder>(DiffCallback()) {\n\n    class ViewHolder(\n        private val binding: ItemInventoryResultBinding,\n        private val onItemClick: (InventoryItem) -> Unit,\n        private val onLocationClick: (InventoryItem) -> Unit\n    ) : RecyclerView.ViewHolder(binding.root) {\n\n        fun bind(item: InventoryItem) {\n            binding.apply {\n                // 基本信息\n                textViewCode.text = item.code\n                textViewName.text = item.name\n                textViewSpecs.text = item.specs ?: ""\n                \n                // 数量信息\n                textViewQty.text = "${item.qty}"\n                textViewQtyAvailable.text = "可用: ${item.qtyAvailable}"\n                textViewQtyLocked.text = "锁定: ${item.qtyLocked}"\n                \n                // 位置信息\n                textViewLocation.text = item.displayLocation ?: \n                    "${item.warehouseName} > ${item.locationsName ?: "未指定仓位"}"\n                \n                // 批次信息\n                if (item.batch?.isNotEmpty() == true) {\n                    textViewBatch.text = "批次: ${item.batch}"\n                    textViewBatch.visibility = View.VISIBLE\n                } else {\n                    textViewBatch.visibility = View.GONE\n                }\n                \n                // 库存状态\n                updateStockStatus(item.stockStatus)\n                \n                // 单价信息\n                if (item.price != null && item.price > 0) {\n                    textViewPrice.text = "¥${String.format("%.2f", item.price)}"\n                    textViewPrice.visibility = View.VISIBLE\n                } else {\n                    textViewPrice.visibility = View.GONE\n                }\n                \n                // 点击事件\n                root.setOnClickListener { onItemClick(item) }\n                buttonLocation.setOnClickListener { onLocationClick(item) }\n            }\n        }\n        \n        private fun updateStockStatus(status: StockStatus) {\n            binding.apply {\n                when (status) {\n                    StockStatus.IN_STOCK -> {\n                        indicatorStatus.setBackgroundColor(0xFF4CAF50.toInt())\n                        textViewStatus.text = "正常"\n                        textViewStatus.setTextColor(0xFF4CAF50.toInt())\n                    }\n                    StockStatus.LOW_STOCK -> {\n                        indicatorStatus.setBackgroundColor(0xFFFF9800.toInt())\n                        textViewStatus.text = "偏低"\n                        textViewStatus.setTextColor(0xFFFF9800.toInt())\n                    }\n                    StockStatus.OUT_OF_STOCK -> {\n                        indicatorStatus.setBackgroundColor(0xFFF44336.toInt())\n                        textViewStatus.text = "缺货"\n                        textViewStatus.setTextColor(0xFFF44336.toInt())\n                    }\n                    StockStatus.PARTIALLY_LOCKED -> {\n                        indicatorStatus.setBackgroundColor(0xFF2196F3.toInt())\n                        textViewStatus.text = "锁定"\n                        textViewStatus.setTextColor(0xFF2196F3.toInt())\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    override fun onCreateViewHolder(parent: ViewGroup, viewType: Int): ViewHolder {\n        val binding = ItemInventoryResultBinding.inflate(\n            LayoutInflater.from(parent.context), parent, false\n        )\n        return ViewHolder(binding, onItemClick, onLocationClick)\n    }\n\n    override fun onBindViewHolder(holder: ViewHolder, position: Int) {\n        holder.bind(getItem(position))\n    }\n\n    class DiffCallback : DiffUtil.ItemCallback<InventoryItem>() {\n        override fun areItemsTheSame(oldItem: InventoryItem, newItem: InventoryItem): Boolean {\n            return oldItem.id == newItem.id\n        }\n\n        override fun areContentsTheSame(oldItem: InventoryItem, newItem: InventoryItem): Boolean {\n            return oldItem == newItem\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n#### 3.2 创建SearchSuggestionAdapter.kt\n```kotlin\npackage com.diciai.app.adapter\n\nimport android.view.LayoutInflater\nimport android.view.ViewGroup\nimport androidx.recyclerview.widget.DiffUtil\nimport androidx.recyclerview.widget.ListAdapter\nimport androidx.recyclerview.widget.RecyclerView\nimport com.diciai.app.databinding.ItemSearchSuggestionBinding\nimport com.diciai.app.model.InventoryItem\n\nclass SearchSuggestionAdapter(\n    private val onItemClick: (InventoryItem) -> Unit\n) : ListAdapter<InventoryItem, SearchSuggestionAdapter.ViewHolder>(DiffCallback()) {\n\n    class ViewHolder(\n        private val binding: ItemSearchSuggestionBinding,\n        private val onItemClick: (InventoryItem) -> Unit\n    ) : RecyclerView.ViewHolder(binding.root) {\n\n        fun bind(item: InventoryItem) {\n            binding.apply {\n                textViewCode.text = item.code\n                textViewName.text = item.name\n                textViewQty.text = "库存: ${item.qtyAvailable}"\n                \n                root.setOnClickListener { onItemClick(item) }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    override fun onCreateViewHolder(parent: ViewGroup, viewType: Int): ViewHolder {\n        val binding = ItemSearchSuggestionBinding.inflate(\n            LayoutInflater.from(parent.context), parent, false\n        )\n        return ViewHolder(binding, onItemClick)\n    }\n\n    override fun onBindViewHolder(holder: ViewHolder, position: Int) {\n        holder.bind(getItem(position))\n    }\n\n    class DiffCallback : DiffUtil.ItemCallback<InventoryItem>() {\n        override fun areItemsTheSame(oldItem: InventoryItem, newItem: InventoryItem): Boolean {\n            return oldItem.id == newItem.id\n        }\n\n        override fun areContentsTheSame(oldItem: InventoryItem, newItem: InventoryItem): Boolean {\n            return oldItem == newItem\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 4. 工具类实现\n\n#### 4.1 创建ScannerUtils.kt\n```kotlin\npackage com.diciai.app.utils\n\nimport android.content.Context\nimport android.content.pm.PackageManager\n\nobject ScannerUtils {\n    \n    fun isSunmiDevice(context: Context): Boolean {\n        return try {\n            val packageManager = context.packageManager\n            packageManager.getPackageInfo("com.sunmi.scanner", PackageManager.GET_ACTIVITIES)\n            true\n        } catch (e: PackageManager.NameNotFoundException) {\n            false\n        }\n    }\n    \n    fun startSunmiScanner(context: Context, onResult: (String) -> Unit) {\n        // 集成 Sunmi 扫码器\n        // 这里需要集成具体的 Sunmi SDK\n    }\n    \n    fun cleanup() {\n        // 清理扫码器资源\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 5. 预计工时\n- Activity重构和UI逻辑: 2天\n- 适配器和列表实现: 1天\n- 扫码功能集成: 1天\n- UI测试和优化: 1天\n\n**总计: 5天**\n\n### 6. 注意事项\n\n1. **扫码集成**: 需要根据实际设备选择合适的扫码方案\n2. **性能优化**: 列表滚动性能和内存管理\n3. **用户体验**: 加载状态、错误处理、空状态展示\n4. **响应式设计**: 适配不同屏幕尺寸\n5. **无障碍支持**: 添加适当的无障碍标签和描述	110	2025-09-23 17:32:48.25983	2025-09-23 17:32:48.25983	\N	110	markdown	draft	\N	\N	private	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N		1	\N	{}	f	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N
1228	129	API接口和数据模型更新方案	# 移动端: 更新API接口和数据模型\n\n## 开发目标\n更新移动端的API接口定义和数据模型，以支持新的PDA库存查询功能，确保与后端API的完美对接。\n\n## 当前状态分析\n现有API接口和数据模型存在以下问题：\n1. 参数不匹配：移动端查询参数与后端不对应\n2. 数据模型简化：缺少重要字段如批次、锁定库存等\n3. 响应格式不一致：缺少汇总信息和优化显示字段\n4. 缺少新增接口：PDA专用接口、快速搜索、条码查询等\n\n## 实现方案\n\n### 1. API接口更新\n\n#### 1.1 更新WmsApi.kt\n在现有的 `WmsApi.kt` 文件中添加新的接口定义：\n\n```kotlin\npackage com.diciai.app.api\n\nimport com.diciai.app.model.*\nimport com.diciai.app.network.ApiResponse\nimport com.diciai.app.network.ListResponse\nimport retrofit2.Response\nimport retrofit2.http.*\n\ninterface WmsApi {\n    // ... 现有接口保留 ...\n\n    // ==================== 新增库存查询接口 ====================\n    \n    /**\n     * PDA库存查询接口（主要接口）\n     */\n    @GET("wms/inventory/pda-query")\n    suspend fun pdaQueryInventory(\n        @Query("barcode") barcode: String? = null,\n        @Query("code") code: String? = null,\n        @Query("name") name: String? = null,\n        @Query("warehouse_id") warehouseId: String? = null,\n        @Query("location_code") locationCode: String? = null,\n        @Query("batch") batch: String? = null,\n        @Query("show_zero_qty") showZeroQty: Boolean = false,\n        @Query("include_locked") includeLocked: Boolean = true,\n        @Query("quick_mode") quickMode: Boolean = false,\n        @Query("page") page: Int = 1,\n        @Query("limit") limit: Int = 20\n    ): Response<ApiResponse<InventoryQueryResponse>>\n\n    /**\n     * 快速搜索接口（自动完成）\n     */\n    @GET("wms/inventory/quick-search")\n    suspend fun quickSearchInventory(\n        @Query("keyword") keyword: String,\n        @Query("warehouse_id") warehouseId: String? = null,\n        @Query("limit") limit: Int = 10\n    ): Response<ApiResponse<List<InventoryItem>>>\n\n    /**\n     * 条码查询接口\n     */\n    @GET("wms/inventory/barcode/{code}")\n    suspend fun getInventoryByBarcode(\n        @Path("code") barcode: String,\n        @Query("warehouse_id") warehouseId: String? = null\n    ): Response<ApiResponse<List<InventoryItem>>>\n\n    /**\n     * 批量查询接口\n     */\n    @POST("wms/inventory/batch-query")\n    suspend fun batchQueryInventory(\n        @Body codes: List<String>\n    ): Response<ApiResponse<List<InventoryItem>>>\n\n    /**\n     * 获取仓库列表\n     */\n    @GET("wms/warehouse")\n    suspend fun getWarehouses(\n        @Query("page") page: Int = 1,\n        @Query("limit") limit: Int = 100\n    ): Response<ApiResponse<List<Warehouse>>>\n\n    /**\n     * 获取仓位列表\n     */\n    @GET("wms/locations")\n    suspend fun getLocations(\n        @Query("warehouse_id") warehouseId: String,\n        @Query("page") page: Int = 1,\n        @Query("limit") limit: Int = 100\n    ): Response<ApiResponse<List<Location>>>\n\n    // ==================== 保留现有接口（兼容性）====================\n    \n    /**\n     * 原有库存查询接口（保留兼容性）\n     */\n    @GET("wms/inventory")\n    suspend fun getInventory(\n        @Query("sku") sku: String? = null,\n        @Query("warehouse_id") warehouseId: String? = null,\n        @Query("location_code") locationCode: String? = null,\n        @Query("page") page: Int = 1,\n        @Query("pageSize") pageSize: Int = 20\n    ): Response<ApiResponse<ListResponse<Inventory>>>\n\n    // ... 其他现有接口保持不变 ...\n}\n```\n\n### 2. 数据模型更新\n\n#### 2.1 新增InventoryModels.kt\n创建专门的库存相关数据模型文件：\n\n```kotlin\npackage com.diciai.app.model\n\nimport com.google.gson.annotations.SerializedName\nimport java.io.Serializable\n\n// ==================== 请求模型 ====================\n\n/**\n * 库存查询请求\n */\ndata class InventoryQueryRequest(\n    val barcode: String? = null,\n    val code: String? = null,\n    val name: String? = null,\n    val warehouseId: String? = null,\n    val locationCode: String? = null,\n    val batch: String? = null,\n    val showZeroQty: Boolean = false,\n    val includeLocked: Boolean = true,\n    val quickMode: Boolean = false,\n    val page: Int = 1,\n    val limit: Int = 20\n)\n\n/**\n * 批量查询请求\n */\ndata class BatchQueryRequest(\n    @SerializedName("codes")\n    val codes: List<String>\n)\n\n// ==================== 响应模型 ====================\n\n/**\n * 库存查询响应\n */\ndata class InventoryQueryResponse(\n    @SerializedName("count")\n    val count: Long,\n    \n    @SerializedName("query_time") \n    val queryTime: Long,\n    \n    @SerializedName("summary")\n    val summary: InventorySearchSummary?,\n    \n    @SerializedName("items")\n    val items: List<InventoryItem>\n) : Serializable\n\n/**\n * 搜索汇总信息\n */\ndata class InventorySearchSummary(\n    @SerializedName("total_qty")\n    val totalQty: Float,\n    \n    @SerializedName("available_qty")\n    val availableQty: Float,\n    \n    @SerializedName("locked_qty")\n    val lockedQty: Float,\n    \n    @SerializedName("location_count")\n    val locationCount: Int\n) : Serializable\n\n/**\n * 增强的库存项模型\n */\ndata class InventoryItem(\n    @SerializedName("id")\n    val id: String,\n    \n    @SerializedName("goods_id")\n    val goodsId: String,\n    \n    @SerializedName("code")\n    val code: String,\n    \n    @SerializedName("barcode")\n    val barcode: String? = null,\n    \n    @SerializedName("name")\n    val name: String,\n    \n    @SerializedName("full_name")\n    val fullName: String? = null,\n    \n    @SerializedName("specs")\n    val specs: String? = null,\n    \n    // ==================== 数量信息 ====================\n    @SerializedName("qty")\n    val qty: Float,\n    \n    @SerializedName("qty_locked")\n    val qtyLocked: Float,\n    \n    @SerializedName("qty_available")\n    val qtyAvailable: Float,\n    \n    @SerializedName("qty_intransit")\n    val qtyIntransit: Float = 0f,\n    \n    // ==================== 位置信息 ====================\n    @SerializedName("warehouse_id")\n    val warehouseId: String,\n    \n    @SerializedName("warehouse_name")\n    val warehouseName: String,\n    \n    @SerializedName("locations_id")\n    val locationsId: String? = null,\n    \n    @SerializedName("locations_name")\n    val locationsName: String? = null,\n    \n    @SerializedName("position_code")\n    val positionCode: String? = null,\n    \n    // ==================== 批次和定价 ====================\n    @SerializedName("batch")\n    val batch: String? = null,\n    \n    @SerializedName("price")\n    val price: Double? = null,\n    \n    @SerializedName("amount")\n    val amount: Double? = null,\n    \n    // ==================== 单位信息 ====================\n    @SerializedName("minimal_unit_id")\n    val minimalUnitId: String? = null,\n    \n    @SerializedName("minimal_unit_name")\n    val minimalUnitName: String? = null,\n    \n    @SerializedName("pack_units")\n    val packUnits: List<PackUnit>? = null,\n    \n    // ==================== 显示优化字段 ====================\n    @SerializedName("display_qty")\n    val displayQty: String? = null,\n    \n    @SerializedName("display_location")\n    val displayLocation: String? = null,\n    \n    @SerializedName("update_time")\n    val updateTime: Long? = null\n    \n) : Serializable {\n    \n    /**\n     * 计算库存状态\n     */\n    val stockStatus: StockStatus\n        get() = when {\n            qtyAvailable <= 0 -> StockStatus.OUT_OF_STOCK\n            qtyAvailable <= 10 -> StockStatus.LOW_STOCK  \n            qtyLocked > 0 -> StockStatus.PARTIALLY_LOCKED\n            else -> StockStatus.IN_STOCK\n        }\n        \n    /**\n     * 获取状态颜色\n     */\n    val stockStatusColor: String\n        get() = when (stockStatus) {\n            StockStatus.OUT_OF_STOCK -> "#F44336"\n            StockStatus.LOW_STOCK -> "#FF9800" \n            StockStatus.PARTIALLY_LOCKED -> "#2196F3"\n            StockStatus.IN_STOCK -> "#4CAF50"\n        }\n        \n    /**\n     * 获取格式化的数量显示\n     */\n    fun getFormattedQty(): String {\n        return if (displayQty != null) {\n            displayQty\n        } else {\n            val unit = minimalUnitName ?: "件"\n            if (qty == qty.toInt().toFloat()) {\n                "${qty.toInt()}$unit"\n            } else {\n                String.format("%.2f%s", qty, unit)\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    \n    /**\n     * 获取格式化的位置信息\n     */\n    fun getFormattedLocation(): String {\n        return displayLocation ?: run {\n            val parts = mutableListOf<String>()\n            parts.add(warehouseName)\n            if (locationsName != null) {\n                parts.add(locationsName)\n            }\n            if (positionCode != null) {\n                parts.add(positionCode)\n            }\n            parts.joinToString(" > ")\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n/**\n * 包装单位信息\n */\ndata class PackUnit(\n    @SerializedName("unit_id")\n    val unitId: String,\n    \n    @SerializedName("unit_name")\n    val unitName: String,\n    \n    @SerializedName("conversion")\n    val conversion: Float\n) : Serializable\n\n/**\n * 仓库信息\n */\ndata class Warehouse(\n    @SerializedName("id")\n    val id: String,\n    \n    @SerializedName("name")\n    val name: String,\n    \n    @SerializedName("code")\n    val code: String,\n    \n    @SerializedName("address")\n    val address: String? = null\n) : Serializable\n\n/**\n * 仓位信息\n */\ndata class Location(\n    @SerializedName("id")\n    val id: String,\n    \n    @SerializedName("name")\n    val name: String,\n    \n    @SerializedName("code")\n    val code: String,\n    \n    @SerializedName("warehouse_id")\n    val warehouseId: String\n) : Serializable\n\n// ==================== 枚举类型 ====================\n\n/**\n * 库存状态枚举\n */\nenum class StockStatus {\n    IN_STOCK,           // 有库存\n    LOW_STOCK,          // 库存不足 \n    OUT_OF_STOCK,       // 无库存\n    PARTIALLY_LOCKED    // 部分锁定\n}\n\n/**\n * 排序字段枚举\n */\nenum class SortBy { \n    NAME,           // 按名称排序\n    QTY,            // 按数量排序\n    UPDATE_TIME,    // 按更新时间排序\n    LOCATION        // 按位置排序\n}\n\n/**\n * 排序方向枚举\n */\nenum class SortOrder { \n    ASC,    // 升序\n    DESC    // 降序\n}\n\n// ==================== UI状态模型 ====================\n\n/**\n * UI状态\n */\ndata class InventoryQueryUiState(\n    val isLoading: Boolean = false,\n    val isSearching: Boolean = false,\n    val error: String? = null,\n    val hasResults: Boolean = false,\n    val currentQuery: String = "",\n    val filters: InventoryFilters = InventoryFilters()\n) : Serializable\n\n/**\n * 筛选条件\n */\ndata class InventoryFilters(\n    val warehouseId: String? = null,\n    val stockStatus: StockStatus? = null,\n    val locationArea: String? = null,\n    val showZeroStock: Boolean = false,\n    val sortBy: SortBy = SortBy.UPDATE_TIME,\n    val sortOrder: SortOrder = SortOrder.DESC\n) : Serializable {\n    \n    /**\n     * 检查是否有筛选条件\n     */\n    fun hasFilters(): Boolean {\n        return warehouseId != null || \n               stockStatus != null || \n               locationArea != null || \n               showZeroStock ||\n               sortBy != SortBy.UPDATE_TIME ||\n               sortOrder != SortOrder.DESC\n    }\n    \n    /**\n     * 获取筛选条件数量\n     */\n    fun getFilterCount(): Int {\n        var count = 0\n        if (warehouseId != null) count++\n        if (stockStatus != null) count++\n        if (locationArea != null) count++\n        if (showZeroStock) count++\n        return count\n    }\n}\n```\n\n#### 2.2 更新现有WmsModels.kt\n保留现有的 `Inventory` 模型以保持兼容性，同时添加扩展方法：\n\n```kotlin\n// 在现有的 WmsModels.kt 文件末尾添加\n\n/**\n * 将旧的Inventory模型转换为新的InventoryItem模型\n */\nfun Inventory.toInventoryItem(): InventoryItem {\n    return InventoryItem(\n        id = this.id,\n        goodsId = this.goodsId,\n        code = this.sku,\n        name = this.name,\n        qty = this.totalQty.toFloat(),\n        qtyAvailable = this.availableQty.toFloat(),\n        qtyLocked = 0f, // 旧模型中没有锁定库存字段\n        warehouseId = this.warehouseId,\n        warehouseName = "", // 需要从其他接口获取\n        locationsId = null,\n        locationsName = this.locationCode,\n        positionCode = this.locationCode\n    )\n}\n\n/**\n * 将新的InventoryItem模型转换为旧的Inventory模型（向下兼容）\n */\nfun InventoryItem.toInventory(): Inventory {\n    return Inventory(\n        id = this.id,\n        goodsId = this.goodsId,\n        sku = this.code,\n        name = this.name,\n        availableQty = this.qtyAvailable.toInt(),\n        totalQty = this.qty.toInt(),\n        locationCode = this.positionCode,\n        warehouseId = this.warehouseId\n    )\n}\n```\n\n### 3. 网络层更新\n\n#### 3.1 更新ApiResponse.kt\n确保API响应格式支持新的数据结构：\n\n```kotlin\npackage com.diciai.app.network\n\nimport com.google.gson.annotations.SerializedName\n\n/**\n * 标准API响应包装\n */\ndata class ApiResponse<T>(\n    @SerializedName("success")\n    val success: Boolean,\n    \n    @SerializedName("message")\n    val message: String,\n    \n    @SerializedName("data")\n    val data: T? = null,\n    \n    @SerializedName("code")\n    val code: Int = 0,\n    \n    @SerializedName("timestamp")\n    val timestamp: Long = 0\n)\n\n/**\n * 分页响应（保留兼容性）\n */\ndata class ListResponse<T>(\n    @SerializedName("items")\n    val items: List<T>,\n    \n    @SerializedName("total")\n    val total: Int,\n    \n    @SerializedName("page")\n    val page: Int,\n    \n    @SerializedName("pageSize")\n    val pageSize: Int\n)\n\n/**\n * WMS专用列表响应\n */\ndata class WmsListResponse<T>(\n    @SerializedName("data")\n    val data: List<T>,\n    \n    @SerializedName("count")\n    val count: Long,\n    \n    @SerializedName("page")\n    val page: Int,\n    \n    @SerializedName("limit")\n    val limit: Int\n)\n```\n\n### 4. API客户端配置更新\n\n#### 4.1 更新ApiClient.kt\n确保网络配置支持新的API端点：\n\n```kotlin\npackage com.diciai.app.network\n\nimport com.diciai.app.BuildConfig\nimport okhttp3.OkHttpClient\nimport okhttp3.logging.HttpLoggingInterceptor\nimport retrofit2.Retrofit\nimport retrofit2.converter.gson.GsonConverterFactory\nimport java.util.concurrent.TimeUnit\n\nobject ApiClient {\n    \n    private const val BASE_URL = BuildConfig.API_BASE_URL\n    \n    // 增加超时时间，因为库存查询可能涉及复杂的数据处理\n    private const val CONNECT_TIMEOUT = 30L\n    private const val READ_TIMEOUT = 60L\n    private const val WRITE_TIMEOUT = 60L\n    \n    private val loggingInterceptor = HttpLoggingInterceptor().apply {\n        level = if (BuildConfig.DEBUG) {\n            HttpLoggingInterceptor.Level.BODY\n        } else {\n            HttpLoggingInterceptor.Level.NONE\n        }\n    }\n    \n    private val okHttpClient = OkHttpClient.Builder()\n        .addInterceptor(AuthInterceptor())\n        .addInterceptor(loggingInterceptor)\n        .connectTimeout(CONNECT_TIMEOUT, TimeUnit.SECONDS)\n        .readTimeout(READ_TIMEOUT, TimeUnit.SECONDS)\n        .writeTimeout(WRITE_TIMEOUT, TimeUnit.SECONDS)\n        .build()\n    \n    private val retrofit = Retrofit.Builder()\n        .baseUrl(BASE_URL)\n        .client(okHttpClient)\n        .addConverterFactory(GsonConverterFactory.create())\n        .build()\n    \n    val wmsApi: WmsApi = retrofit.create(WmsApi::class.java)\n}\n```\n\n### 5. 错误处理更新\n\n#### 5.1 新增InventoryApiException.kt\n创建专门的库存API异常处理：\n\n```kotlin\npackage com.diciai.app.exception\n\n/**\n * 库存API异常\n */\nsealed class InventoryApiException(message: String, cause: Throwable? = null) : Exception(message, cause) {\n    \n    /**\n     * 网络连接异常\n     */\n    class NetworkException(message: String = "网络连接失败", cause: Throwable? = null) : \n        InventoryApiException(message, cause)\n    \n    /**\n     * 服务器异常\n     */\n    class ServerException(val code: Int, message: String) : \n        InventoryApiException("服务器错误($code): $message")\n    \n    /**\n     * 数据解析异常\n     */\n    class ParseException(message: String = "数据解析失败", cause: Throwable? = null) : \n        InventoryApiException(message, cause)\n    \n    /**\n     * 业务逻辑异常\n     */\n    class BusinessException(message: String) : \n        InventoryApiException(message)\n    \n    /**\n     * 权限异常\n     */\n    class AuthException(message: String = "认证失败，请重新登录") : \n        InventoryApiException(message)\n    \n    /**\n     * 库存不存在异常\n     */\n    class InventoryNotFoundException(query: String) : \n        InventoryApiException("未找到匹配库存: $query")\n    \n    /**\n     * 条码无效异常\n     */\n    class InvalidBarcodeException(barcode: String) : \n        InventoryApiException("无效的条码: $barcode")\n}\n\n/**\n * 异常处理工具\n */\nobject InventoryApiExceptionHandler {\n    \n    fun handleException(throwable: Throwable): InventoryApiException {\n        return when (throwable) {\n            is InventoryApiException -> throwable\n            is java.net.UnknownHostException -> \n                InventoryApiException.NetworkException("网络不可用，请检查网络连接")\n            is java.net.SocketTimeoutException -> \n                InventoryApiException.NetworkException("网络超时，请稍后重试")\n            is java.net.ConnectException -> \n                InventoryApiException.NetworkException("连接服务器失败")\n            is com.google.gson.JsonParseException -> \n                InventoryApiException.ParseException("数据格式错误", throwable)\n            else -> \n                InventoryApiException.NetworkException("未知错误: ${throwable.message}", throwable)\n        }\n    }\n    \n    fun getDisplayMessage(exception: InventoryApiException): String {\n        return when (exception) {\n            is InventoryApiException.NetworkException -> "网络连接异常，请检查网络设置"\n            is InventoryApiException.ServerException -> "服务器暂时不可用，请稍后重试"\n            is InventoryApiException.ParseException -> "数据加载异常，请稍后重试"\n            is InventoryApiException.BusinessException -> exception.message ?: "操作失败"\n            is InventoryApiException.AuthException -> "登录已过期，请重新登录"\n            is InventoryApiException.InventoryNotFoundException -> "未找到相关库存信息"\n            is InventoryApiException.InvalidBarcodeException -> "条码格式不正确"\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 6. 测试数据模拟\n\n#### 6.1 创建MockInventoryData.kt\n为了便于开发和测试，创建模拟数据：\n\n```kotlin\npackage com.diciai.app.data\n\nimport com.diciai.app.model.*\n\nobject MockInventoryData {\n    \n    fun createMockInventoryItem(\n        id: String = "1",\n        code: String = "SKU001",\n        name: String = "测试商品",\n        qty: Float = 100f,\n        qtyAvailable: Float = 80f,\n        qtyLocked: Float = 20f\n    ): InventoryItem {\n        return InventoryItem(\n            id = id,\n            goodsId = "goods_$id",\n            code = code,\n            barcode = "1234567890123",\n            name = name,\n            fullName = "$name - 规格A",\n            specs = "规格A",\n            qty = qty,\n            qtyLocked = qtyLocked,\n            qtyAvailable = qtyAvailable,\n            qtyIntransit = 0f,\n            warehouseId = "wh_001",\n            warehouseName = "主仓库",\n            locationsId = "loc_001",\n            locationsName = "A区-01货架",\n            positionCode = "A01-01-01",\n            batch = "20241001",\n            price = 15.50,\n            amount = qty * 15.50,\n            minimalUnitId = "unit_001",\n            minimalUnitName = "件",\n            displayQty = "${qty.toInt()}件",\n            displayLocation = "主仓库 > A区-01货架 > A01-01-01",\n            updateTime = System.currentTimeMillis()\n        )\n    }\n    \n    fun createMockInventoryList(count: Int = 5): List<InventoryItem> {\n        return (1..count).map { index ->\n            createMockInventoryItem(\n                id = index.toString(),\n                code = "SKU${String.format("%03d", index)}",\n                name = "测试商品$index",\n                qty = (50..200).random().toFloat(),\n                qtyAvailable = (20..150).random().toFloat(),\n                qtyLocked = (0..30).random().toFloat()\n            )\n        }\n    }\n    \n    fun createMockQueryResponse(items: List<InventoryItem>): InventoryQueryResponse {\n        val summary = InventorySearchSummary(\n            totalQty = items.sumOf { it.qty.toDouble() }.toFloat(),\n            availableQty = items.sumOf { it.qtyAvailable.toDouble() }.toFloat(),\n            lockedQty = items.sumOf { it.qtyLocked.toDouble() }.toFloat(),\n            locationCount = items.map { it.locationsId }.distinct().size\n        )\n        \n        return InventoryQueryResponse(\n            count = items.size.toLong(),\n            queryTime = System.currentTimeMillis(),\n            summary = summary,\n            items = items\n        )\n    }\n    \n    fun createMockWarehouses(): List<Warehouse> {\n        return listOf(\n            Warehouse("wh_001", "主仓库", "WH001", "广州市天河区"),\n            Warehouse("wh_002", "备用仓库", "WH002", "深圳市南山区"),\n            Warehouse("wh_003", "退货仓库", "WH003", "东莞市长安镇")\n        )\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 7. 预计工时\n- API接口定义更新: 1天\n- 数据模型创建和更新: 1天\n- 网络层配置更新: 0.5天\n- 错误处理实现: 0.5天\n- 测试数据和验证: 0.5天\n\n**总计: 3.5天**\n\n### 8. 注意事项\n\n1. **向下兼容**: 保留现有API接口，确保其他功能不受影响\n2. **数据验证**: 添加适当的数据验证和空值处理\n3. **序列化优化**: 使用合适的Gson注解确保序列化正确\n4. **错误处理**: 完善的错误分类和用户友好的错误提示\n5. **测试覆盖**: 确保新增的数据模型和API接口都有对应的测试\n6. **文档更新**: 及时更新API文档和数据模型说明	110	2025-09-23 17:34:20.147723	2025-09-23 17:34:20.147723	\N	110	markdown	draft	\N	\N	private	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N		1	\N	{}	f	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N
1229	129	高级筛选和搜索功能实现方案	# 移动端: 实现高级筛选和搜索功能\n\n## 开发目标\n实现智能搜索建议、高级筛选对话框、搜索历史管理、结果展示优化等高级功能，提升库存查询的用户体验和操作效率。\n\n## 功能设计\n\n### 核心功能列表\n1. **智能搜索建议** - 实时搜索建议和自动完成\n2. **高级筛选对话框** - 多维度筛选条件设置\n3. **搜索历史管理** - 历史记录保存和快速访问\n4. **结果排序和分组** - 灵活的结果排序和展示\n5. **快捷操作** - 常用操作的快捷入口\n6. **离线支持** - 缓存最近查询结果\n\n## 实现方案\n\n### 1. 智能搜索建议功能\n\n#### 1.1 创建SearchSuggestionManager.kt\n```kotlin\npackage com.diciai.app.manager\n\nimport android.content.Context\nimport com.diciai.app.model.InventoryItem\nimport com.diciai.app.repository.InventoryRepository\nimport kotlinx.coroutines.CoroutineScope\nimport kotlinx.coroutines.Dispatchers\nimport kotlinx.coroutines.Job\nimport kotlinx.coroutines.delay\nimport kotlinx.coroutines.launch\nimport kotlinx.coroutines.withContext\nimport javax.inject.Inject\nimport javax.inject.Singleton\n\n@Singleton\nclass SearchSuggestionManager @Inject constructor(\n    private val repository: InventoryRepository,\n    private val searchHistoryManager: SearchHistoryManager\n) {\n    \n    private var searchJob: Job? = null\n    private val scope = CoroutineScope(Dispatchers.IO)\n    \n    /**\n     * 获取搜索建议\n     * @param keyword 搜索关键词\n     * @param onResult 结果回调\n     */\n    fun getSuggestions(\n        keyword: String,\n        onResult: (List<SearchSuggestion>) -> Unit\n    ) {\n        // 取消之前的搜索\n        searchJob?.cancel()\n        \n        if (keyword.length < 2) {\n            onResult(emptyList())\n            return\n        }\n        \n        searchJob = scope.launch {\n            delay(300) // 防抖延迟\n            \n            val suggestions = mutableListOf<SearchSuggestion>()\n            \n            try {\n                // 1. 从搜索历史获取建议\n                val historyItems = searchHistoryManager.getFilteredHistory(keyword)\n                suggestions.addAll(historyItems.map { \n                    SearchSuggestion(\n                        text = it,\n                        type = SuggestionType.HISTORY,\n                        source = "搜索历史"\n                    )\n                })\n                \n                // 2. 从服务器获取实时建议\n                val quickSearchResult = repository.quickSearch(keyword, 8)\n                quickSearchResult.fold(\n                    onSuccess = { items ->\n                        suggestions.addAll(items.map { item ->\n                            SearchSuggestion(\n                                text = item.code,\n                                displayText = "${item.code} - ${item.name}",\n                                type = SuggestionType.PRODUCT,\n                                source = "商品库",\n                                inventoryItem = item\n                            )\n                        })\n                    },\n                    onFailure = { \n                        // 网络失败时仅使用历史记录\n                    }\n                )\n                \n                // 3. 智能推荐（基于输入类型）\n                val smartSuggestions = generateSmartSuggestions(keyword)\n                suggestions.addAll(smartSuggestions)\n                \n                withContext(Dispatchers.Main) {\n                    onResult(suggestions.take(10)) // 限制建议数量\n                }\n                \n            } catch (e: Exception) {\n                withContext(Dispatchers.Main) {\n                    onResult(suggestions.take(5)) // 发生异常时返回部分结果\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    \n    /**\n     * 生成智能建议\n     */\n    private fun generateSmartSuggestions(keyword: String): List<SearchSuggestion> {\n        val suggestions = mutableListOf<SearchSuggestion>()\n        \n        // 数字输入 - 可能是条码或SKU\n        if (keyword.matches(Regex("\\\\d+"))) {\n            if (keyword.length >= 8) {\n                suggestions.add(SearchSuggestion(\n                    text = keyword,\n                    displayText = "按条码搜索: $keyword",\n                    type = SuggestionType.BARCODE,\n                    source = "智能推荐"\n                ))\n            }\n            if (keyword.length <= 10) {\n                suggestions.add(SearchSuggestion(\n                    text = keyword,\n                    displayText = "按SKU搜索: $keyword",\n                    type = SuggestionType.SKU,\n                    source = "智能推荐"\n                ))\n            }\n        }\n        \n        // 字母数字混合 - 可能是SKU\n        if (keyword.matches(Regex("[A-Za-z0-9]+"))) {\n            suggestions.add(SearchSuggestion(\n                text = keyword,\n                displayText = "按编码搜索: $keyword",\n                type = SuggestionType.SKU,\n                source = "智能推荐"\n            ))\n        }\n        \n        // 中文输入 - 可能是商品名称\n        if (keyword.matches(Regex(".*[\\\\u4e00-\\\\u9fa5].*"))) {\n            suggestions.add(SearchSuggestion(\n                text = keyword,\n                displayText = "按名称搜索: $keyword",\n                type = SuggestionType.NAME,\n                source = "智能推荐"\n            ))\n        }\n        \n        return suggestions\n    }\n    \n    /**\n     * 清理资源\n     */\n    fun cleanup() {\n        searchJob?.cancel()\n    }\n}\n\n/**\n * 搜索建议数据类\n */\ndata class SearchSuggestion(\n    val text: String,\n    val displayText: String = text,\n    val type: SuggestionType,\n    val source: String,\n    val inventoryItem: InventoryItem? = null\n)\n\n/**\n * 建议类型枚举\n */\nenum class SuggestionType {\n    HISTORY,    // 历史记录\n    PRODUCT,    // 商品建议\n    BARCODE,    // 条码建议\n    SKU,        // SKU建议\n    NAME        // 名称建议\n}\n```\n\n#### 1.2 更新SearchSuggestionAdapter.kt\n```kotlin\npackage com.diciai.app.adapter\n\nimport android.view.LayoutInflater\nimport android.view.ViewGroup\nimport androidx.recyclerview.widget.DiffUtil\nimport androidx.recyclerview.widget.ListAdapter\nimport androidx.recyclerview.widget.RecyclerView\nimport com.diciai.app.R\nimport com.diciai.app.databinding.ItemSearchSuggestionBinding\nimport com.diciai.app.manager.SearchSuggestion\nimport com.diciai.app.manager.SuggestionType\n\nclass SearchSuggestionAdapter(\n    private val onItemClick: (SearchSuggestion) -> Unit,\n    private val onInsertClick: (SearchSuggestion) -> Unit\n) : ListAdapter<SearchSuggestion, SearchSuggestionAdapter.ViewHolder>(DiffCallback()) {\n\n    class ViewHolder(\n        private val binding: ItemSearchSuggestionBinding,\n        private val onItemClick: (SearchSuggestion) -> Unit,\n        private val onInsertClick: (SearchSuggestion) -> Unit\n    ) : RecyclerView.ViewHolder(binding.root) {\n\n        fun bind(suggestion: SearchSuggestion) {\n            binding.apply {\n                textViewSuggestion.text = suggestion.displayText\n                textViewSource.text = suggestion.source\n                \n                // 设置图标\n                val iconRes = when (suggestion.type) {\n                    SuggestionType.HISTORY -> R.drawable.ic_history_24\n                    SuggestionType.PRODUCT -> R.drawable.ic_inventory_24\n                    SuggestionType.BARCODE -> R.drawable.ic_qr_code_24\n                    SuggestionType.SKU -> R.drawable.ic_tag_24\n                    SuggestionType.NAME -> R.drawable.ic_text_fields_24\n                }\n                imageViewIcon.setImageResource(iconRes)\n                \n                // 设置点击事件\n                root.setOnClickListener { onItemClick(suggestion) }\n                buttonInsert.setOnClickListener { onInsertClick(suggestion) }\n                \n                // 历史记录不显示插入按钮\n                if (suggestion.type == SuggestionType.HISTORY) {\n                    buttonInsert.visibility = android.view.View.GONE\n                } else {\n                    buttonInsert.visibility = android.view.View.VISIBLE\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    override fun onCreateViewHolder(parent: ViewGroup, viewType: Int): ViewHolder {\n        val binding = ItemSearchSuggestionBinding.inflate(\n            LayoutInflater.from(parent.context), parent, false\n        )\n        return ViewHolder(binding, onItemClick, onInsertClick)\n    }\n\n    override fun onBindViewHolder(holder: ViewHolder, position: Int) {\n        holder.bind(getItem(position))\n    }\n\n    class DiffCallback : DiffUtil.ItemCallback<SearchSuggestion>() {\n        override fun areItemsTheSame(oldItem: SearchSuggestion, newItem: SearchSuggestion): Boolean {\n            return oldItem.text == newItem.text && oldItem.type == newItem.type\n        }\n\n        override fun areContentsTheSame(oldItem: SearchSuggestion, newItem: SearchSuggestion): Boolean {\n            return oldItem == newItem\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 2. 高级筛选对话框\n\n#### 2.1 创建FilterDialogFragment.kt\n```kotlin\npackage com.diciai.app.ui.dialog\n\nimport android.os.Bundle\nimport android.view.LayoutInflater\nimport android.view.View\nimport android.view.ViewGroup\nimport androidx.fragment.app.viewModels\nimport com.diciai.app.databinding.DialogFilterBinding\nimport com.diciai.app.model.*\nimport com.diciai.app.viewmodel.FilterDialogViewModel\nimport com.google.android.material.bottomsheet.BottomSheetDialogFragment\nimport com.google.android.material.chip.Chip\nimport dagger.hilt.android.AndroidEntryPoint\n\n@AndroidEntryPoint\nclass FilterDialogFragment : BottomSheetDialogFragment() {\n    \n    private var _binding: DialogFilterBinding? = null\n    private val binding get() = _binding!!\n    \n    private val viewModel: FilterDialogViewModel by viewModels()\n    \n    private var currentFilters: InventoryFilters = InventoryFilters()\n    private var warehouses: List<Warehouse> = emptyList()\n    private var onFiltersApplied: ((InventoryFilters) -> Unit)? = null\n    \n    companion object {\n        fun newInstance(\n            filters: InventoryFilters,\n            warehouses: List<Warehouse>,\n            onFiltersApplied: (InventoryFilters) -> Unit\n        ): FilterDialogFragment {\n            return FilterDialogFragment().apply {\n                this.currentFilters = filters\n                this.warehouses = warehouses\n                this.onFiltersApplied = onFiltersApplied\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    \n    override fun onCreateView(\n        inflater: LayoutInflater,\n        container: ViewGroup?,\n        savedInstanceState: Bundle?\n    ): View {\n        _binding = DialogFilterBinding.inflate(inflater, container, false)\n        return binding.root\n    }\n    \n    override fun onViewCreated(view: View, savedInstanceState: Bundle?) {\n        super.onViewCreated(view, savedInstanceState)\n        \n        setupUI()\n        setupObservers()\n        initializeFilters()\n    }\n    \n    private fun setupUI() {\n        // 确认按钮\n        binding.buttonApply.setOnClickListener {\n            applyFilters()\n        }\n        \n        // 重置按钮\n        binding.buttonReset.setOnClickListener {\n            resetFilters()\n        }\n        \n        // 取消按钮\n        binding.buttonCancel.setOnClickListener {\n            dismiss()\n        }\n    }\n    \n    private fun setupObservers() {\n        viewModel.selectedFilters.observe(viewLifecycleOwner) { filters ->\n            updateUI(filters)\n        }\n    }\n    \n    private fun initializeFilters() {\n        setupWarehouseChips()\n        setupStockStatusChips()\n        setupSortOptions()\n        \n        // 设置当前筛选条件\n        viewModel.setInitialFilters(currentFilters)\n    }\n    \n    private fun setupWarehouseChips() {\n        binding.chipGroupWarehouses.removeAllViews()\n        \n        // 添加"全部"选项\n        val allChip = createChip("全部", null)\n        binding.chipGroupWarehouses.addView(allChip)\n        \n        // 添加仓库选项\n        warehouses.forEach { warehouse ->\n            val chip = createChip(warehouse.name, warehouse.id)\n            binding.chipGroupWarehouses.addView(chip)\n        }\n        \n        // 设置选择监听器\n        binding.chipGroupWarehouses.setOnCheckedStateChangeListener { _, checkedIds ->\n            val selectedWarehouseId = if (checkedIds.isEmpty()) {\n                null\n            } else {\n                val selectedChip = binding.chipGroupWarehouses.findViewById<Chip>(checkedIds.first())\n                selectedChip.tag as? String\n            }\n            viewModel.updateWarehouseFilter(selectedWarehouseId)\n        }\n    }\n    \n    private fun setupStockStatusChips() {\n        binding.chipGroupStockStatus.removeAllViews()\n        \n        // 添加"全部"选项\n        val allChip = createChip("全部", null)\n        binding.chipGroupStockStatus.addView(allChip)\n        \n        // 添加库存状态选项\n        StockStatus.values().forEach { status ->\n            val displayName = when (status) {\n                StockStatus.IN_STOCK -> "有库存"\n                StockStatus.LOW_STOCK -> "库存不足"\n                StockStatus.OUT_OF_STOCK -> "无库存"\n                StockStatus.PARTIALLY_LOCKED -> "部分锁定"\n            }\n            val chip = createChip(displayName, status)\n            binding.chipGroupStockStatus.addView(chip)\n        }\n        \n        // 设置选择监听器\n        binding.chipGroupStockStatus.setOnCheckedStateChangeListener { _, checkedIds ->\n            val selectedStatus = if (checkedIds.isEmpty()) {\n                null\n            } else {\n                val selectedChip = binding.chipGroupStockStatus.findViewById<Chip>(checkedIds.first())\n                selectedChip.tag as? StockStatus\n            }\n            viewModel.updateStockStatusFilter(selectedStatus)\n        }\n    }\n    \n    private fun setupSortOptions() {\n        // 排序字段\n        binding.radioGroupSortBy.setOnCheckedChangeListener { _, checkedId ->\n            val sortBy = when (checkedId) {\n                binding.radioSortByName.id -> SortBy.NAME\n                binding.radioSortByQty.id -> SortBy.QTY\n                binding.radioSortByLocation.id -> SortBy.LOCATION\n                else -> SortBy.UPDATE_TIME\n            }\n            viewModel.updateSortBy(sortBy)\n        }\n        \n        // 排序方向\n        binding.radioGroupSortOrder.setOnCheckedChangeListener { _, checkedId ->\n            val sortOrder = when (checkedId) {\n                binding.radioSortAsc.id -> SortOrder.ASC\n                else -> SortOrder.DESC\n            }\n            viewModel.updateSortOrder(sortOrder)\n        }\n        \n        // 显示零库存\n        binding.switchShowZeroStock.setOnCheckedChangeListener { _, isChecked ->\n            viewModel.updateShowZeroStock(isChecked)\n        }\n    }\n    \n    private fun createChip(text: String, tag: Any?): Chip {\n        return Chip(requireContext()).apply {\n            this.text = text\n            this.tag = tag\n            isCheckable = true\n            isClickable = true\n        }\n    }\n    \n    private fun updateUI(filters: InventoryFilters) {\n        // 更新仓库选择\n        updateChipGroupSelection(binding.chipGroupWarehouses, filters.warehouseId)\n        \n        // 更新库存状态选择\n        updateChipGroupSelection(binding.chipGroupStockStatus, filters.stockStatus)\n        \n        // 更新排序选择\n        when (filters.sortBy) {\n            SortBy.NAME -> binding.radioSortByName.isChecked = true\n            SortBy.QTY -> binding.radioSortByQty.isChecked = true\n            SortBy.LOCATION -> binding.radioSortByLocation.isChecked = true\n            SortBy.UPDATE_TIME -> binding.radioSortByUpdateTime.isChecked = true\n        }\n        \n        when (filters.sortOrder) {\n            SortOrder.ASC -> binding.radioSortAsc.isChecked = true\n            SortOrder.DESC -> binding.radioSortDesc.isChecked = true\n        }\n        \n        // 更新零库存开关\n        binding.switchShowZeroStock.isChecked = filters.showZeroStock\n        \n        // 更新筛选数量显示\n        val filterCount = filters.getFilterCount()\n        binding.textViewFilterCount.text = if (filterCount > 0) {\n            "已设置 $filterCount 个筛选条件"\n        } else {\n            "暂无筛选条件"\n        }\n    }\n    \n    private fun updateChipGroupSelection(chipGroup: com.google.android.material.chip.ChipGroup, selectedValue: Any?) {\n        chipGroup.clearCheck()\n        \n        for (i in 0 until chipGroup.childCount) {\n            val chip = chipGroup.getChildAt(i) as Chip\n            if (chip.tag == selectedValue) {\n                chip.isChecked = true\n                break\n            }\n        }\n        \n        // 如果没有匹配项，选择第一个（全部）\n        if (chipGroup.checkedChipId == View.NO_ID && chipGroup.childCount > 0) {\n            (chipGroup.getChildAt(0) as Chip).isChecked = true\n        }\n    }\n    \n    private fun applyFilters() {\n        val filters = viewModel.selectedFilters.value ?: InventoryFilters()\n        onFiltersApplied?.invoke(filters)\n        dismiss()\n    }\n    \n    private fun resetFilters() {\n        viewModel.resetFilters()\n    }\n    \n    override fun onDestroyView() {\n        super.onDestroyView()\n        _binding = null\n    }\n}\n```\n\n#### 2.2 创建FilterDialogViewModel.kt\n```kotlin\npackage com.diciai.app.viewmodel\n\nimport androidx.lifecycle.LiveData\nimport androidx.lifecycle.MutableLiveData\nimport androidx.lifecycle.ViewModel\nimport com.diciai.app.model.*\nimport dagger.hilt.android.lifecycle.HiltViewModel\nimport javax.inject.Inject\n\n@HiltViewModel\nclass FilterDialogViewModel @Inject constructor() : ViewModel() {\n    \n    private val _selectedFilters = MutableLiveData<InventoryFilters>()\n    val selectedFilters: LiveData<InventoryFilters> = _selectedFilters\n    \n    fun setInitialFilters(filters: InventoryFilters) {\n        _selectedFilters.value = filters\n    }\n    \n    fun updateWarehouseFilter(warehouseId: String?) {\n        val current = _selectedFilters.value ?: InventoryFilters()\n        _selectedFilters.value = current.copy(warehouseId = warehouseId)\n    }\n    \n    fun updateStockStatusFilter(status: StockStatus?) {\n        val current = _selectedFilters.value ?: InventoryFilters()\n        _selectedFilters.value = current.copy(stockStatus = status)\n    }\n    \n    fun updateLocationAreaFilter(area: String?) {\n        val current = _selectedFilters.value ?: InventoryFilters()\n        _selectedFilters.value = current.copy(locationArea = area)\n    }\n    \n    fun updateShowZeroStock(show: Boolean) {\n        val current = _selectedFilters.value ?: InventoryFilters()\n        _selectedFilters.value = current.copy(showZeroStock = show)\n    }\n    \n    fun updateSortBy(sortBy: SortBy) {\n        val current = _selectedFilters.value ?: InventoryFilters()\n        _selectedFilters.value = current.copy(sortBy = sortBy)\n    }\n    \n    fun updateSortOrder(order: SortOrder) {\n        val current = _selectedFilters.value ?: InventoryFilters()\n        _selectedFilters.value = current.copy(sortOrder = order)\n    }\n    \n    fun resetFilters() {\n        _selectedFilters.value = InventoryFilters()\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. 搜索历史管理\n\n#### 3.1 创建SearchHistoryManager.kt\n```kotlin\npackage com.diciai.app.manager\n\nimport android.content.Context\nimport android.content.SharedPreferences\nimport com.google.gson.Gson\nimport com.google.gson.reflect.TypeToken\nimport dagger.hilt.android.qualifiers.ApplicationContext\nimport javax.inject.Inject\nimport javax.inject.Singleton\n\n@Singleton\nclass SearchHistoryManager @Inject constructor(\n    @ApplicationContext private val context: Context\n) {\n    \n    private val prefs: SharedPreferences = context.getSharedPreferences(\n        "inventory_search_history", Context.MODE_PRIVATE\n    )\n    \n    private val gson = Gson()\n    private val maxHistorySize = 20\n    \n    /**\n     * 保存搜索历史\n     */\n    fun saveSearchHistory(query: String) {\n        if (query.isBlank()) return\n        \n        val history = getSearchHistory().toMutableList()\n        \n        // 移除重复项\n        history.removeAll { it.query == query }\n        \n        // 添加到开头\n        history.add(0, SearchHistoryItem(\n            query = query,\n            timestamp = System.currentTimeMillis(),\n            searchCount = 1\n        ))\n        \n        // 限制历史记录数量\n        if (history.size > maxHistorySize) {\n            history.subList(maxHistorySize, history.size).clear()\n        }\n        \n        // 保存到SharedPreferences\n        val json = gson.toJson(history)\n        prefs.edit().putString("search_history", json).apply()\n    }\n    \n    /**\n     * 获取搜索历史\n     */\n    fun getSearchHistory(): List<SearchHistoryItem> {\n        val json = prefs.getString("search_history", null) ?: return emptyList()\n        \n        return try {\n            val type = object : TypeToken<List<SearchHistoryItem>>() {}.type\n            gson.fromJson(json, type) ?: emptyList()\n        } catch (e: Exception) {\n            emptyList()\n        }\n    }\n    \n    /**\n     * 获取筛选后的历史记录\n     */\n    fun getFilteredHistory(keyword: String): List<String> {\n        return getSearchHistory()\n            .filter { it.query.contains(keyword, ignoreCase = true) }\n            .sortedByDescending { it.searchCount }\n            .take(5)\n            .map { it.query }\n    }\n    \n    /**\n     * 清除搜索历史\n     */\n    fun clearSearchHistory() {\n        prefs.edit().remove("search_history").apply()\n    }\n    \n    /**\n     * 删除指定历史记录\n     */\n    fun removeSearchHistory(query: String) {\n        val history = getSearchHistory().toMutableList()\n        history.removeAll { it.query == query }\n        \n        val json = gson.toJson(history)\n        prefs.edit().putString("search_history", json).apply()\n    }\n    \n    /**\n     * 增加搜索次数\n     */\n    fun incrementSearchCount(query: String) {\n        val history = getSearchHistory().toMutableList()\n        val index = history.indexOfFirst { it.query == query }\n        \n        if (index >= 0) {\n            val item = history[index]\n            history[index] = item.copy(\n                searchCount = item.searchCount + 1,\n                timestamp = System.currentTimeMillis()\n            )\n            \n            val json = gson.toJson(history)\n            prefs.edit().putString("search_history", json).apply()\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n/**\n * 搜索历史项\n */\ndata class SearchHistoryItem(\n    val query: String,\n    val timestamp: Long,\n    val searchCount: Int = 1\n)\n```\n\n### 4. 结果展示优化\n\n#### 4.1 创建ResultDisplayManager.kt\n```kotlin\npackage com.diciai.app.manager\n\nimport com.diciai.app.model.*\nimport javax.inject.Inject\nimport javax.inject.Singleton\n\n@Singleton\nclass ResultDisplayManager @Inject constructor() {\n    \n    /**\n     * 排序库存结果\n     */\n    fun sortInventoryResults(\n        items: List<InventoryItem>,\n        sortBy: SortBy,\n        sortOrder: SortOrder\n    ): List<InventoryItem> {\n        val comparator = when (sortBy) {\n            SortBy.NAME -> compareBy<InventoryItem> { it.name }\n            SortBy.QTY -> compareBy { it.qtyAvailable }\n            SortBy.LOCATION -> compareBy { it.getFormattedLocation() }\n            SortBy.UPDATE_TIME -> compareBy { it.updateTime ?: 0L }\n        }\n        \n        return if (sortOrder == SortOrder.ASC) {\n            items.sortedWith(comparator)\n        } else {\n            items.sortedWith(comparator.reversed())\n        }\n    }\n    \n    /**\n     * 按库存状态分组\n     */\n    fun groupByStockStatus(items: List<InventoryItem>): Map<StockStatus, List<InventoryItem>> {\n        return items.groupBy { it.stockStatus }\n    }\n    \n    /**\n     * 按仓库分组\n     */\n    fun groupByWarehouse(items: List<InventoryItem>): Map<String, List<InventoryItem>> {\n        return items.groupBy { it.warehouseName }\n    }\n    \n    /**\n     * 按位置分组\n     */\n    fun groupByLocation(items: List<InventoryItem>): Map<String, List<InventoryItem>> {\n        return items.groupBy { it.locationsName ?: "未指定位置" }\n    }\n    \n    /**\n     * 筛选库存结果\n     */\n    fun filterInventoryResults(\n        items: List<InventoryItem>,\n        filters: InventoryFilters\n    ): List<InventoryItem> {\n        var filteredItems = items\n        \n        // 按仓库筛选\n        if (filters.warehouseId != null) {\n            filteredItems = filteredItems.filter { it.warehouseId == filters.warehouseId }\n        }\n        \n        // 按库存状态筛选\n        if (filters.stockStatus != null) {\n            filteredItems = filteredItems.filter { it.stockStatus == filters.stockStatus }\n        }\n        \n        // 按位置区域筛选\n        if (filters.locationArea != null) {\n            filteredItems = filteredItems.filter { \n                it.locationsName?.contains(filters.locationArea, ignoreCase = true) == true\n            }\n        }\n        \n        // 是否显示零库存\n        if (!filters.showZeroStock) {\n            filteredItems = filteredItems.filter { it.qtyAvailable > 0 }\n        }\n        \n        return filteredItems\n    }\n    \n    /**\n     * 计算显示统计信息\n     */\n    fun calculateDisplayStatistics(items: List<InventoryItem>): DisplayStatistics {\n        return DisplayStatistics(\n            totalItems = items.size,\n            totalQty = items.sumOf { it.qty.toDouble() }.toFloat(),\n            availableQty = items.sumOf { it.qtyAvailable.toDouble() }.toFloat(),\n            lockedQty = items.sumOf { it.qtyLocked.toDouble() }.toFloat(),\n            warehouseCount = items.map { it.warehouseId }.distinct().size,\n            locationCount = items.mapNotNull { it.locationsId }.distinct().size,\n            statusDistribution = items.groupBy { it.stockStatus }.mapValues { it.value.size }\n        )\n    }\n}\n\n/**\n * 显示统计信息\n */\ndata class DisplayStatistics(\n    val totalItems: Int,\n    val totalQty: Float,\n    val availableQty: Float,\n    val lockedQty: Float,\n    val warehouseCount: Int,\n    val locationCount: Int,\n    val statusDistribution: Map<StockStatus, Int>\n)\n```\n\n### 5. 快捷操作功能\n\n#### 5.1 创建QuickActionManager.kt\n```kotlin\npackage com.diciai.app.manager\n\nimport android.content.Context\nimport com.diciai.app.model.InventoryItem\nimport dagger.hilt.android.qualifiers.ApplicationContext\nimport javax.inject.Inject\nimport javax.inject.Singleton\n\n@Singleton\nclass QuickActionManager @Inject constructor(\n    @ApplicationContext private val context: Context\n) {\n    \n    /**\n     * 快捷操作列表\n     */\n    fun getQuickActions(item: InventoryItem): List<QuickAction> {\n        val actions = mutableListOf<QuickAction>()\n        \n        // 查看详情\n        actions.add(QuickAction(\n            id = "view_detail",\n            title = "查看详情",\n            icon = "ic_info_24",\n            description = "查看完整库存信息"\n        ))\n        \n        // 查看位置\n        if (item.locationsName != null) {\n            actions.add(QuickAction(\n                id = "view_location",\n                title = "查看位置",\n                icon = "ic_location_on_24",\n                description = "显示货物存放位置"\n            ))\n        }\n        \n        // 库存变动历史\n        actions.add(QuickAction(\n            id = "view_history",\n            title = "变动历史",\n            icon = "ic_history_24",\n            description = "查看库存变动记录"\n        ))\n        \n        // 关联订单\n        actions.add(QuickAction(\n            id = "related_orders",\n            title = "关联订单",\n            icon = "ic_assignment_24",\n            description = "查看相关入库/出库单"\n        ))\n        \n        // 分享信息\n        actions.add(QuickAction(\n            id = "share",\n            title = "分享",\n            icon = "ic_share_24",\n            description = "分享库存信息"\n        ))\n        \n        // 添加到关注\n        actions.add(QuickAction(\n            id = "add_to_watchlist",\n            title = "添加关注",\n            icon = "ic_star_border_24",\n            description = "关注此商品库存变化"\n        ))\n        \n        return actions\n    }\n    \n    /**\n     * 执行快捷操作\n     */\n    fun executeQuickAction(\n        actionId: String,\n        item: InventoryItem,\n        onResult: (QuickActionResult) -> Unit\n    ) {\n        when (actionId) {\n            "view_detail" -> {\n                onResult(QuickActionResult.ShowDetail(item))\n            }\n            "view_location" -> {\n                onResult(QuickActionResult.ShowLocation(item))\n            }\n            "view_history" -> {\n                onResult(QuickActionResult.ShowHistory(item))\n            }\n            "related_orders" -> {\n                onResult(QuickActionResult.ShowRelatedOrders(item))\n            }\n            "share" -> {\n                val shareText = buildShareText(item)\n                onResult(QuickActionResult.Share(shareText))\n            }\n            "add_to_watchlist" -> {\n                onResult(QuickActionResult.AddToWatchlist(item))\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    \n    private fun buildShareText(item: InventoryItem): String {\n        return buildString {\n            appendLine("📦 库存信息")\n            appendLine("商品编码: ${item.code}")\n            appendLine("商品名称: ${item.name}")\n            appendLine("库存数量: ${item.getFormattedQty()}")\n            appendLine("可用数量: ${item.qtyAvailable}")\n            if (item.qtyLocked > 0) {\n                appendLine("锁定数量: ${item.qtyLocked}")\n            }\n            appendLine("存放位置: ${item.getFormattedLocation()}")\n            if (item.batch != null) {\n                appendLine("批次信息: ${item.batch}")\n            }\n            appendLine()\n            appendLine("来自对丝ERP - 库存管理系统")\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n/**\n * 快捷操作\n */\ndata class QuickAction(\n    val id: String,\n    val title: String,\n    val icon: String,\n    val description: String\n)\n\n/**\n * 快捷操作结果\n */\nsealed class QuickActionResult {\n    data class ShowDetail(val item: InventoryItem) : QuickActionResult()\n    data class ShowLocation(val item: InventoryItem) : QuickActionResult()\n    data class ShowHistory(val item: InventoryItem) : QuickActionResult()\n    data class ShowRelatedOrders(val item: InventoryItem) : QuickActionResult()\n    data class Share(val text: String) : QuickActionResult()\n    data class AddToWatchlist(val item: InventoryItem) : QuickActionResult()\n}\n```\n\n### 6. 离线支持\n\n#### 6.1 创建OfflineCacheManager.kt\n```kotlin\npackage com.diciai.app.manager\n\nimport android.content.Context\nimport androidx.room.*\nimport com.diciai.app.model.InventoryItem\nimport com.diciai.app.model.InventoryQueryResponse\nimport com.google.gson.Gson\nimport dagger.hilt.android.qualifiers.ApplicationContext\nimport kotlinx.coroutines.Dispatchers\nimport kotlinx.coroutines.withContext\nimport javax.inject.Inject\nimport javax.inject.Singleton\n\n@Singleton\nclass OfflineCacheManager @Inject constructor(\n    @ApplicationContext private val context: Context\n) {\n    \n    private val database by lazy {\n        Room.databaseBuilder(\n            context,\n            CacheDatabase::class.java,\n            "inventory_cache.db"\n        ).build()\n    }\n    \n    private val cacheDao by lazy { database.cacheDao() }\n    private val gson = Gson()\n    \n    /**\n     * 缓存查询结果\n     */\n    suspend fun cacheQueryResult(query: String, response: InventoryQueryResponse) {\n        withContext(Dispatchers.IO) {\n            try {\n                val cacheItem = CacheItem(\n                    query = query,\n                    data = gson.toJson(response),\n                    timestamp = System.currentTimeMillis(),\n                    type = "query_result"\n                )\n                \n                cacheDao.insertOrUpdate(cacheItem)\n                \n                // 清理过期缓存\n                cleanExpiredCache()\n                \n            } catch (e: Exception) {\n                // 缓存失败不影响主要功能\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    \n    /**\n     * 获取缓存的查询结果\n     */\n    suspend fun getCachedQueryResult(query: String): InventoryQueryResponse? {\n        return withContext(Dispatchers.IO) {\n            try {\n                val cacheItem = cacheDao.getByQuery(query, "query_result")\n                \n                // 检查是否过期（30分钟）\n                val expirationTime = 30 * 60 * 1000L\n                if (cacheItem != null && \n                    (System.currentTimeMillis() - cacheItem.timestamp) < expirationTime) {\n                    \n                    gson.fromJson(cacheItem.data, InventoryQueryResponse::class.java)\n                } else {\n                    null\n                }\n            } catch (e: Exception) {\n                null\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    \n    /**\n     * 清理过期缓存\n     */\n    private suspend fun cleanExpiredCache() {\n        val expirationTime = System.currentTimeMillis() - (2 * 60 * 60 * 1000L) // 2小时\n        cacheDao.deleteExpired(expirationTime)\n    }\n    \n    /**\n     * 清理所有缓存\n     */\n    suspend fun clearAllCache() {\n        withContext(Dispatchers.IO) {\n            cacheDao.deleteAll()\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n// Room数据库相关类\n@Entity(tableName = "cache_items")\ndata class CacheItem(\n    @PrimaryKey val id: String = "${query}_${type}",\n    val query: String,\n    val data: String,\n    val timestamp: Long,\n    val type: String\n)\n\n@Dao\ninterface CacheDao {\n    @Query("SELECT * FROM cache_items WHERE query = :query AND type = :type")\n    suspend fun getByQuery(query: String, type: String): CacheItem?\n    \n    @Insert(onConflict = OnConflictStrategy.REPLACE)\n    suspend fun insertOrUpdate(item: CacheItem)\n    \n    @Query("DELETE FROM cache_items WHERE timestamp < :expirationTime")\n    suspend fun deleteExpired(expirationTime: Long)\n    \n    @Query("DELETE FROM cache_items")\n    suspend fun deleteAll()\n}\n\n@Database(\n    entities = [CacheItem::class],\n    version = 1,\n    exportSchema = false\n)\nabstract class CacheDatabase : RoomDatabase() {\n    abstract fun cacheDao(): CacheDao\n}\n```\n\n### 7. 预计工时\n- 智能搜索建议功能: 2天\n- 高级筛选对话框: 2天\n- 搜索历史管理: 1天\n- 结果展示优化: 1天\n- 快捷操作功能: 1天\n- 离线支持实现: 1天\n- 集成测试和优化: 1天\n\n**总计: 9天**\n\n### 8. 注意事项\n\n1. **性能优化**: 搜索建议的防抖处理，避免频繁请求\n2. **用户体验**: 流畅的动画效果和响应式交互\n3. **数据一致性**: 缓存数据的有效性和同步机制\n4. **内存管理**: 及时清理不需要的缓存和监听器\n5. **错误处理**: 网络异常时的降级方案和用户提示\n6. **无障碍支持**: 确保所有交互元素都有合适的无障碍标签	110	2025-09-23 17:36:19.221085	2025-09-23 17:36:19.221085	\N	110	markdown	draft	\N	\N	private	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N		1	\N	{}	f	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N
1230	129	任务文档	# 测试验证和性能优化开发方案\n\n## 任务概述\n对库存查询功能进行全面测试验证和性能优化，确保功能稳定性、用户体验和系统性能。\n\n## 开发计划\n\n### 阶段1: 单元测试 (1天)\n\n#### 1.1 Repository层测试\n```kotlin\n// app/src/test/java/com/diciai/app/repository/InventoryRepositoryTest.kt\n@RunWith(MockitoJUnitRunner::class)\nclass InventoryRepositoryTest {\n    \n    @Mock\n    private lateinit var wmsApi: WmsApi\n    \n    @Mock\n    private lateinit var inventoryDao: InventoryDao\n    \n    private lateinit var repository: InventoryRepository\n    \n    @Test\n    fun `search inventory - success`() = runTest {\n        // 测试API调用成功场景\n        val mockResponse = ApiResponse.success(mockInventoryList)\n        `when`(wmsApi.searchPDAInventory(any())).thenReturn(mockResponse)\n        \n        val result = repository.searchInventory("test", 1)\n        \n        assertTrue(result.isSuccess)\n        verify(wmsApi).searchPDAInventory(any())\n    }\n    \n    @Test\n    fun `search inventory - network error`() = runTest {\n        // 测试网络错误场景\n        `when`(wmsApi.searchPDAInventory(any())).thenThrow(IOException())\n        \n        val result = repository.searchInventory("test", 1)\n        \n        assertTrue(result.isFailure)\n    }\n    \n    @Test\n    fun `offline cache - data persistence`() = runTest {\n        // 测试离线缓存\n        repository.cacheInventoryList(mockInventoryList)\n        \n        val cached = repository.getCachedInventory("test")\n        \n        assertEquals(mockInventoryList.size, cached.size)\n    }\n}\n```\n\n#### 1.2 ViewModel测试\n```kotlin\n// app/src/test/java/com/diciai/app/ui/inventory/InventoryViewModelTest.kt\n@ExtendWith(MockitoExtension::class)\nclass InventoryViewModelTest {\n    \n    @Mock\n    private lateinit var repository: InventoryRepository\n    \n    private lateinit var viewModel: InventoryViewModel\n    \n    @Before\n    fun setup() {\n        viewModel = InventoryViewModel(repository)\n    }\n    \n    @Test\n    fun `search inventory - loading states`() = runTest {\n        // 测试加载状态变化\n        val testObserver = viewModel.uiState.test()\n        \n        viewModel.searchInventory("test")\n        \n        testObserver.assertValues(\n            InventoryUiState(isLoading = false),\n            InventoryUiState(isLoading = true),\n            InventoryUiState(isLoading = false, inventoryList = mockList)\n        )\n    }\n    \n    @Test\n    fun `filter application - correct results`() = runTest {\n        // 测试筛选逻辑\n        viewModel.updateFilters(\n            warehouseFilter = "仓库A",\n            statusFilter = "正常",\n            quantityRange = 10..100\n        )\n        \n        viewModel.applyFilters()\n        \n        val state = viewModel.uiState.value\n        assertTrue(state.inventoryList.all { \n            it.warehouseName == "仓库A" && \n            it.status == "正常" && \n            it.availableQuantity in 10..100 \n        })\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 阶段2: 集成测试 (1天)\n\n#### 2.1 API集成测试\n```kotlin\n// app/src/androidTest/java/com/diciai/app/api/InventoryApiTest.kt\n@RunWith(AndroidJUnit4::class)\nclass InventoryApiTest {\n    \n    private lateinit var apiClient: ApiClient\n    private lateinit var wmsApi: WmsApi\n    \n    @Before\n    fun setup() {\n        // 使用测试环境配置\n        apiClient = ApiClient.getInstance("http://test-api.diciai.com/")\n        wmsApi = apiClient.wmsApi\n    }\n    \n    @Test\n    fun testInventorySearch() = runBlocking {\n        val request = PDAInventorySearchRequest(\n            keyword = "测试商品",\n            warehouseId = 1,\n            page = 1,\n            pageSize = 20\n        )\n        \n        val response = wmsApi.searchPDAInventory(request)\n        \n        assertTrue(response.success)\n        assertNotNull(response.data)\n        assertTrue(response.data!!.list.isNotEmpty())\n    }\n    \n    @Test\n    fun testBarcodeQuery() = runBlocking {\n        val response = wmsApi.getInventoryByBarcode("1234567890")\n        \n        assertTrue(response.success)\n        assertNotNull(response.data)\n    }\n}\n```\n\n#### 2.2 数据库集成测试\n```kotlin\n// app/src/androidTest/java/com/diciai/app/database/InventoryDaoTest.kt\n@RunWith(AndroidJUnit4::class)\nclass InventoryDaoTest {\n    \n    private lateinit var database: AppDatabase\n    private lateinit var inventoryDao: InventoryDao\n    \n    @Before\n    fun setup() {\n        database = Room.inMemoryDatabaseBuilder(\n            ApplicationProvider.getApplicationContext(),\n            AppDatabase::class.java\n        ).build()\n        inventoryDao = database.inventoryDao()\n    }\n    \n    @Test\n    fun testCacheAndRetrieve() = runBlocking {\n        val inventory = mockInventoryEntity()\n        \n        inventoryDao.insertAll(listOf(inventory))\n        val cached = inventoryDao.searchInventory("test")\n        \n        assertEquals(1, cached.size)\n        assertEquals(inventory.goodsName, cached[0].goodsName)\n    }\n    \n    @After\n    fun cleanup() {\n        database.close()\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 阶段3: UI测试 (1天)\n\n#### 3.1 Espresso UI测试\n```kotlin\n// app/src/androidTest/java/com/diciai/app/ui/InventoryActivityTest.kt\n@RunWith(AndroidJUnit4::class)\nclass InventoryActivityTest {\n    \n    @get:Rule\n    val activityRule = ActivityScenarioRule(InventoryActivity::class.java)\n    \n    @Test\n    fun testSearchFlow() {\n        // 测试搜索流程\n        onView(withId(R.id.etQueryBarcode))\n            .perform(typeText("测试商品"), closeSoftKeyboard())\n        \n        onView(withId(R.id.btnQueryInventory))\n            .perform(click())\n        \n        // 验证结果显示\n        onView(withId(R.id.cardQueryResult))\n            .check(matches(isDisplayed()))\n    }\n    \n    @Test\n    fun testBarcodeScanning() {\n        // 测试条码扫描\n        onView(withId(R.id.etCheckBarcode))\n            .perform(typeText("1234567890"), pressImeActionButton())\n        \n        // 验证扫描结果处理\n        onView(withId(R.id.resultContainer))\n            .check(matches(hasDescendant(withText(containsString("商品信息")))))\n    }\n    \n    @Test\n    fun testFilterDialog() {\n        // 测试筛选对话框\n        onView(withId(R.id.btnFilter))\n            .perform(click())\n        \n        onView(withText("仓库筛选"))\n            .check(matches(isDisplayed()))\n        \n        onView(withText("确定"))\n            .perform(click())\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 阶段4: 性能测试和优化 (2天)\n\n#### 4.1 性能基准测试\n```kotlin\n// app/src/androidTest/java/com/diciai/app/performance/InventoryPerformanceTest.kt\n@RunWith(AndroidJUnit4::class)\nclass InventoryPerformanceTest {\n    \n    @Test\n    fun testSearchPerformance() {\n        val startTime = System.currentTimeMillis()\n        \n        // 执行1000次搜索操作\n        repeat(1000) {\n            runBlocking {\n                repository.searchInventory("test$it", 1)\n            }\n        }\n        \n        val duration = System.currentTimeMillis() - startTime\n        assertTrue("搜索性能过慢", duration < 5000) // 5秒内完成\n    }\n    \n    @Test\n    fun testMemoryUsage() {\n        val runtime = Runtime.getRuntime()\n        val initialMemory = runtime.totalMemory() - runtime.freeMemory()\n        \n        // 加载大量数据\n        runBlocking {\n            repeat(100) {\n                repository.searchInventory("test", it)\n            }\n        }\n        \n        System.gc()\n        val finalMemory = runtime.totalMemory() - runtime.freeMemory()\n        val memoryIncrease = finalMemory - initialMemory\n        \n        assertTrue("内存使用过多", memoryIncrease < 50 * 1024 * 1024) // 50MB限制\n    }\n}\n```\n\n#### 4.2 性能优化实现\n\n**网络优化**\n```kotlin\n// 实现请求合并\nclass BatchRequestManager {\n    private val pendingRequests = mutableMapOf<String, CompletableDeferred<List<Inventory>>>()\n    \n    suspend fun batchSearch(keywords: List<String>): Map<String, List<Inventory>> {\n        // 合并多个搜索请求\n        val batchRequest = PDABatchInventorySearchRequest(keywords)\n        val response = wmsApi.batchSearchPDAInventory(batchRequest)\n        \n        return response.data?.associateBy { it.keyword } ?: emptyMap()\n    }\n}\n\n// 实现智能缓存\nclass SmartCacheManager {\n    private val lruCache = LruCache<String, List<Inventory>>(100)\n    \n    fun get(key: String): List<Inventory>? {\n        return lruCache.get(key)\n    }\n    \n    fun put(key: String, value: List<Inventory>) {\n        lruCache.put(key, value)\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**UI优化**\n```kotlin\n// 实现RecyclerView优化\nclass InventoryAdapter : ListAdapter<Inventory, InventoryViewHolder>(DiffCallback) {\n    \n    private val recycledViewPool = RecyclerView.RecycledViewPool()\n    \n    override fun onAttachedToRecyclerView(recyclerView: RecyclerView) {\n        super.onAttachedToRecyclerView(recyclerView)\n        recyclerView.setRecycledViewPool(recycledViewPool)\n        recyclerView.setItemViewCacheSize(20)\n    }\n    \n    override fun onBindViewHolder(holder: InventoryViewHolder, position: Int) {\n        holder.bind(getItem(position))\n    }\n    \n    object DiffCallback : DiffUtil.ItemCallback<Inventory>() {\n        override fun areItemsTheSame(oldItem: Inventory, newItem: Inventory): Boolean {\n            return oldItem.id == newItem.id\n        }\n        \n        override fun areContentsTheSame(oldItem: Inventory, newItem: Inventory): Boolean {\n            return oldItem == newItem\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 阶段5: 用户验收测试 (1天)\n\n#### 5.1 测试用例设计\n```\nUAT-001: 基础搜索功能\n- 输入商品名称，验证搜索结果准确性\n- 输入条码，验证条码查询功能\n- 输入SKU，验证SKU查询功能\n\nUAT-002: 高级筛选功能\n- 按仓库筛选，验证结果正确性\n- 按库存数量筛选，验证范围查询\n- 多条件组合筛选，验证逻辑正确性\n\nUAT-003: 扫码功能\n- 扫描商品条码，验证自动查询\n- 扫描无效条码，验证错误处理\n- 连续扫描，验证性能表现\n\nUAT-004: 离线功能\n- 断网状态下查看缓存数据\n- 网络恢复后数据同步\n- 离线搜索历史功能\n\nUAT-005: 性能验收\n- 搜索响应时间 < 2秒\n- 大数据量滚动流畅\n- 内存使用合理\n```\n\n#### 5.2 Bug修复和优化\n\n**常见问题修复**\n```kotlin\n// 修复搜索防抖问题\nclass SearchDebouncer(private val delayMs: Long = 300) {\n    private var searchJob: Job? = null\n    \n    fun debounce(action: suspend () -> Unit) {\n        searchJob?.cancel()\n        searchJob = CoroutineScope(Dispatchers.Main).launch {\n            delay(delayMs)\n            action()\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n// 修复内存泄漏\nclass InventoryViewModel : ViewModel() {\n    override fun onCleared() {\n        super.onCleared()\n        searchJob?.cancel()\n        repository.cleanup()\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## 测试工具和框架\n\n### 单元测试\n- **JUnit 4/5**: 基础测试框架\n- **Mockito**: Mock对象创建\n- **Truth**: 断言库\n- **Coroutines Test**: 协程测试\n\n### 集成测试  \n- **Espresso**: UI测试框架\n- **Room Testing**: 数据库测试\n- **Retrofit Mock**: API模拟\n\n### 性能测试\n- **Android Profiler**: 内存和CPU分析\n- **LeakCanary**: 内存泄漏检测\n- **Benchmark**: 性能基准测试\n\n## 验收标准\n\n### 功能要求\n- ✅ 所有搜索功能正常工作\n- ✅ 筛选功能准确无误\n- ✅ 扫码功能响应正常\n- ✅ 离线缓存功能完善\n- ✅ 错误处理机制完整\n\n### 性能要求\n- ✅ 搜索响应时间 < 2秒\n- ✅ UI操作流畅，无卡顿\n- ✅ 内存使用 < 100MB\n- ✅ 网络请求优化合理\n- ✅ 电池消耗控制良好\n\n### 质量要求\n- ✅ 单元测试覆盖率 > 80%\n- ✅ 集成测试通过率 100%\n- ✅ UI测试通过率 100%\n- ✅ 无内存泄漏\n- ✅ 无严重性能问题\n\n## 风险控制\n\n### 测试风险\n- **设备兼容性**: 在多种Android设备上测试\n- **网络环境**: 测试不同网络条件\n- **数据量测试**: 测试大数据量场景\n- **边界条件**: 测试异常输入情况\n\n### 性能风险\n- **内存限制**: 监控内存使用情况\n- **网络超时**: 设置合理超时机制\n- **缓存策略**: 避免缓存过度占用存储\n- **电池优化**: 减少后台活动\n\n## 交付物\n\n1. **测试报告** - 详细的测试执行结果\n2. **性能报告** - 性能测试数据和优化建议\n3. **用户手册** - 功能使用说明\n4. **部署文档** - 发布和部署指南\n5. **维护文档** - 后续维护和更新指南\n\n## 时间估算\n- **单元测试**: 1天\n- **集成测试**: 1天  \n- **UI测试**: 1天\n- **性能优化**: 2天\n- **用户验收**: 1天\n\n**总计**: 6天\n\n## 依赖关系\n- 依赖于前4个子任务的完成\n- 需要后端API接口已部署\n- 需要测试环境已准备	110	2025-09-23 17:38:29.983115	2025-09-23 17:38:29.983115	\N	110	markdown	draft	\N	\N	private	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N		1	\N	{}	f	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N
