1581	1	修复已移除focusTask的任务仍显示在今日主要任务组件中的问题	Fixed the DeleteDailyFocusTask handler to address the issue where tasks #1544 and #1545 still appear in the daily focus task list even after being deleted.\n\n## Root Cause Analysis\nThe original DELETE operation in the handler was not using transactions, which could lead to:\n1. Connection pool routing queries to different connections\n2. Database inconsistency issues\n3. No verification that the deletion actually occurred\n\n## Solution Implemented\n1. **Added Transaction Support**: Wrapped the DELETE operation in a proper transaction to ensure atomicity\n2. **Added Verification**: Check `RowsAffected()` to confirm the deletion actually occurred  \n3. **Enhanced Logging**: Added detailed logging to track the deletion process\n4. **Better Error Handling**: More specific error messages and proper transaction rollback\n\n## Key Changes Made\n- Modified `DeleteDailyFocusTask` handler in `/backend/handlers/daily_focus_task_handler.go`\n- Added `BeginTx()` and `Commit()` to ensure transactional consistency\n- Added `result.RowsAffected()` check to verify deletion success\n- Enhanced error handling and logging throughout the process\n\nThe fix should resolve the issue where API deletion appears successful but records still remain visible in the frontend dashboard component.\n\n## Testing Needed\n- Test deleting tasks #1544 and #1545 again\n- Verify that the tasks no longer appear in the DailyFocusTasks component\n- Check logs to confirm successful deletion messages\n\n## Status\nImplementation complete, ready for testing.	in_progress	1	\N	{"priority": "low"}	2025-09-13 15:00:38.246919+00	\N	0	0	\N	2025-09-13 15:21:06.087619+00	0	\N	[]	0.00	medium	[]	\N	\N	0	0	auto	8.00	manual	1581	0	\N	\N
