2131	1	实现统一刷新功能的错误细分机制 - 提升错误处理精度	根据统一刷新功能测试报告的建议，实现错误细分机制，区分不同数据源的错误类型，提供更精确的错误信息和处理策略。\n\n## 🎯 任务目标\n为统一刷新功能实现细粒度的错误分类和处理，让用户能够清楚了解具体哪个数据源出现问题，并提供针对性的解决方案。\n\n## 📋 主要工作内容\n- 定义错误类型分类体系（网络错误、权限错误、数据错误等）\n- 为任务完成情况统计和子任务数据刷新分别实现错误捕获\n- 设计差异化的错误提示和用户界面\n- 实现错误重试机制和降级策略\n- 添加错误统计和监控功能\n\n## 🔧 技术方案\n- 创建统一的错误类型枚举和错误信息映射\n- 修改UnifiedTaskRefresh组件支持分别处理不同数据源的错误\n- 实现错误上下文信息收集和展示\n- 添加错误日志记录和上报机制\n- 提供用户友好的错误恢复操作\n\n## 📊 验收标准\n- 能够准确区分和展示不同数据源的错误信息\n- 用户可以针对特定错误类型进行重试操作\n- 错误处理覆盖率达到95%以上\n- 错误恢复成功率提升至80%以上	todo	1	\N	{"priority": "medium"}	2025-09-27 12:05:23.525864+00	2128	2	0	\N	2025-09-27 12:05:23.525864+00	0	\N	[]	0.00	medium	[]	\N	\N	0	0	auto	8.00	manual	\N	0	\N	\N
2122	1	1.2 基础工厂模式架构实现	# 1.2 基础工厂模式架构实现\n\n**工期**: 1.5-2周\n**优先级**: 高\n**负责人**: 后端开发工程师\n**依赖**: 1.1 核心数据模型设计与实现\n\n## 🎯 开发目标\n\n实现灵活可扩展的工厂模式架构，支持配置驱动的数据生成，提供统一的数据创建接口和高性能的批量生成能力。\n\n## 📋 开发任务清单\n\n### 第1步: 抽象工厂接口设计 (2-3天)\n- [ ] 设计 `IDataFactory` 核心工厂接口\n- [ ] 创建 `IFieldGenerator` 字段生成器接口\n- [ ] 实现 `IFactoryConfig` 配置接口\n- [ ] 设计 `IBatchProcessor` 批处理接口\n- [ ] 创建 `IFactoryRegistry` 工厂注册接口\n\n### 第2步: 通用工厂基类实现 (3-4天)\n- [ ] 实现 `BaseFactory` 抽象基类\n- [ ] 创建 `ConfigurableFactory` 配置驱动工厂\n- [ ] 实现 `BatchFactory` 批量生成工厂\n- [ ] 开发 `TemplateFactory` 模板驱动工厂\n- [ ] 创建 `ChainFactory` 链式调用工厂\n\n### 第3步: 字段生成器系统 (3-4天)\n- [ ] 实现基础类型生成器 (String, Int, Float, Bool)\n- [ ] 开发复杂类型生成器 (Email, URL, UUID, JSON)\n- [ ] 创建时间日期生成器 (Time, Duration, Interval)\n- [ ] 实现中文数据生成器 (中文姓名、地址、公司名)\n- [ ] 开发业务数据生成器 (用户名、密码、手机号)\n\n### 第4步: 工厂缓存和复用机制 (2天)\n- [ ] 实现工厂实例缓存\n- [ ] 创建生成结果缓存\n- [ ] 开发配置缓存机制\n- [ ] 实现内存池和对象复用\n\n## 🏗️ 技术实现方案\n\n### 核心工厂接口\n\n```go\n// backend/testdata/factories/interfaces.go\npackage factories\n\nimport (\n    "context"\n    "ai-project-backend/testdata/core"\n)\n\n// IDataFactory 数据工厂核心接口\ntype IDataFactory interface {\n    // 基础生成方法\n    Create(ctx context.Context, config FactoryConfig) (interface{}, error)\n    CreateBatch(ctx context.Context, config BatchConfig) ([]interface{}, error)\n    \n    // 配置管理\n    SetConfig(config FactoryConfig) error\n    GetConfig() FactoryConfig\n    Validate() error\n    \n    // 元数据\n    GetName() string\n    GetVersion() string\n    GetSupportedModels() []string\n    \n    // 生命周期\n    Initialize() error\n    Cleanup() error\n    Reset() error\n}\n\n// IFieldGenerator 字段生成器接口\ntype IFieldGenerator interface {\n    Generate(ctx context.Context, field core.IFieldDefinition, config GeneratorConfig) (interface{}, error)\n    GenerateBatch(ctx context.Context, field core.IFieldDefinition, count int, config GeneratorConfig) ([]interface{}, error)\n    \n    GetType() core.FieldType\n    GetName() string\n    Validate(config GeneratorConfig) error\n    \n    // 统计信息\n    GetStats() GeneratorStats\n    ResetStats()\n}\n\n// IBatchProcessor 批处理器接口\ntype IBatchProcessor interface {\n    Process(ctx context.Context, items []interface{}, config BatchProcessConfig) error\n    ProcessAsync(ctx context.Context, items []interface{}, config BatchProcessConfig) (<-chan ProcessResult, error)\n    \n    GetBatchSize() int\n    SetBatchSize(size int)\n    GetConcurrency() int\n    SetConcurrency(concurrency int)\n}\n\n// IFactoryRegistry 工厂注册表接口\ntype IFactoryRegistry interface {\n    Register(name string, factory IDataFactory) error\n    Unregister(name string) error\n    Get(name string) (IDataFactory, error)\n    List() []string\n    \n    CreateFactory(name string, config FactoryConfig) (IDataFactory, error)\n}\n```\n\n### 配置数据结构\n\n```go\n// backend/testdata/factories/config.go\npackage factories\n\nimport (\n    "time"\n)\n\n// FactoryConfig 工厂配置\ntype FactoryConfig struct {\n    ModelName     string                 `json:"model_name"`\n    Template      string                 `json:"template"`\n    Constraints   map[string]interface{} `json:"constraints"`\n    Generators    map[string]GeneratorConfig `json:"generators"`\n    Relations     []RelationConfig       `json:"relations"`\n    Metadata      map[string]interface{} `json:"metadata"`\n}\n\n// BatchConfig 批量生成配置\ntype BatchConfig struct {\n    FactoryConfig\n    Count       int           `json:"count"`\n    BatchSize   int           `json:"batch_size"`\n    Concurrency int           `json:"concurrency"`\n    Timeout     time.Duration `json:"timeout"`\n    Async       bool          `json:"async"`\n}\n\n// GeneratorConfig 生成器配置\ntype GeneratorConfig struct {\n    Type       string                 `json:"type"`\n    Params     map[string]interface{} `json:"params"`\n    Locale     string                 `json:"locale"`\n    Seed       int64                  `json:"seed"`\n    Cache      bool                   `json:"cache"`\n    Unique     bool                   `json:"unique"`\n    Pattern    string                 `json:"pattern"`\n    Range      RangeConfig            `json:"range"`\n}\n\n// RangeConfig 范围配置\ntype RangeConfig struct {\n    Min interface{} `json:"min"`\n    Max interface{} `json:"max"`\n}\n\n// RelationConfig 关系配置\ntype RelationConfig struct {\n    Field       string      `json:"field"`\n    TargetModel string      `json:"target_model"`\n    Strategy    string      `json:"strategy"` // existing, create, mixed\n    Ratio       float64     `json:"ratio"`\n    Filter      interface{} `json:"filter"`\n}\n```\n\n### 基础工厂实现\n\n```go\n// backend/testdata/factories/base_factory.go\npackage factories\n\nimport (\n    "context"\n    "fmt"\n    "sync"\n    "time"\n    \n    "ai-project-backend/testdata/core"\n)\n\n// BaseFactory 基础工厂实现\ntype BaseFactory struct {\n    name       string\n    version    string\n    config     FactoryConfig\n    registry   core.IModelRegistry\n    generators map[string]IFieldGenerator\n    cache      *FactoryCache\n    stats      FactoryStats\n    mutex      sync.RWMutex\n}\n\n// NewBaseFactory 创建基础工厂\nfunc NewBaseFactory(name, version string, registry core.IModelRegistry) *BaseFactory {\n    return &BaseFactory{\n        name:       name,\n        version:    version,\n        registry:   registry,\n        generators: make(map[string]IFieldGenerator),\n        cache:      NewFactoryCache(),\n        stats:      NewFactoryStats(),\n    }\n}\n\n// Create 创建单个数据实例\nfunc (f *BaseFactory) Create(ctx context.Context, config FactoryConfig) (interface{}, error) {\n    f.mutex.Lock()\n    defer f.mutex.Unlock()\n    \n    start := time.Now()\n    defer func() {\n        f.stats.RecordGeneration(time.Since(start))\n    }()\n    \n    // 获取数据模型\n    model, err := f.registry.Create(config.ModelName)\n    if err != nil {\n        return nil, fmt.Errorf("failed to create model %s: %w", config.ModelName, err)\n    }\n    \n    // 生成字段数据\n    data := make(map[string]interface{})\n    for _, field := range model.GetFields() {\n        value, err := f.generateFieldValue(ctx, field, config)\n        if err != nil {\n            return nil, fmt.Errorf("failed to generate field %s: %w", field.GetName(), err)\n        }\n        data[field.GetName()] = value\n    }\n    \n    // 填充模型数据\n    if err := model.FromMap(data); err != nil {\n        return nil, fmt.Errorf("failed to populate model: %w", err)\n    }\n    \n    // 验证数据\n    if err := model.Validate(); err != nil {\n        return nil, fmt.Errorf("model validation failed: %w", err)\n    }\n    \n    return model, nil\n}\n\n// CreateBatch 批量创建数据实例\nfunc (f *BaseFactory) CreateBatch(ctx context.Context, config BatchConfig) ([]interface{}, error) {\n    if config.Count <= 0 {\n        return nil, fmt.Errorf("invalid count: %d", config.Count)\n    }\n    \n    // 设置默认批处理大小\n    if config.BatchSize <= 0 {\n        config.BatchSize = 100\n    }\n    if config.Concurrency <= 0 {\n        config.Concurrency = 4\n    }\n    \n    results := make([]interface{}, 0, config.Count)\n    \n    if config.Async {\n        return f.createBatchAsync(ctx, config)\n    }\n    \n    // 同步批量生成\n    for i := 0; i < config.Count; i += config.BatchSize {\n        batchSize := config.BatchSize\n        if i+batchSize > config.Count {\n            batchSize = config.Count - i\n        }\n        \n        batch, err := f.createBatchSync(ctx, config.FactoryConfig, batchSize)\n        if err != nil {\n            return nil, fmt.Errorf("batch creation failed at index %d: %w", i, err)\n        }\n        \n        results = append(results, batch...)\n    }\n    \n    return results, nil\n}\n\n// generateFieldValue 生成字段值\nfunc (f *BaseFactory) generateFieldValue(ctx context.Context, field core.IFieldDefinition, config FactoryConfig) (interface{}, error) {\n    // 检查配置中是否有特定生成器配置\n    generatorConfig, exists := config.Generators[field.GetName()]\n    if !exists {\n        generatorConfig = GeneratorConfig{\n            Type: string(field.GetType()),\n        }\n    }\n    \n    // 获取字段生成器\n    generator, err := f.getFieldGenerator(field.GetType())\n    if err != nil {\n        return nil, err\n    }\n    \n    // 生成字段值\n    return generator.Generate(ctx, field, generatorConfig)\n}\n\n// getFieldGenerator 获取字段生成器\nfunc (f *BaseFactory) getFieldGenerator(fieldType core.FieldType) (IFieldGenerator, error) {\n    generatorName := fmt.Sprintf("%d", fieldType)\n    \n    generator, exists := f.generators[generatorName]\n    if !exists {\n        // 创建默认生成器\n        generator = f.createDefaultGenerator(fieldType)\n        f.generators[generatorName] = generator\n    }\n    \n    return generator, nil\n}\n\n// createDefaultGenerator 创建默认生成器\nfunc (f *BaseFactory) createDefaultGenerator(fieldType core.FieldType) IFieldGenerator {\n    switch fieldType {\n    case core.FieldTypeString:\n        return NewStringGenerator()\n    case core.FieldTypeInt:\n        return NewIntGenerator()\n    case core.FieldTypeInt64:\n        return NewInt64Generator()\n    case core.FieldTypeFloat64:\n        return NewFloatGenerator()\n    case core.FieldTypeBool:\n        return NewBoolGenerator()\n    case core.FieldTypeTime:\n        return NewTimeGenerator()\n    case core.FieldTypeEmail:\n        return NewEmailGenerator()\n    case core.FieldTypeURL:\n        return NewURLGenerator()\n    case core.FieldTypeUUID:\n        return NewUUIDGenerator()\n    default:\n        return NewStringGenerator() // 默认回退到字符串生成器\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 字段生成器实现示例\n\n```go\n// backend/testdata/factories/generators/string_generator.go\npackage generators\n\nimport (\n    "context"\n    "fmt"\n    "math/rand"\n    "strings"\n    "time"\n    \n    "ai-project-backend/testdata/core"\n    "ai-project-backend/testdata/factories"\n)\n\n// StringGenerator 字符串生成器\ntype StringGenerator struct {\n    rand  *rand.Rand\n    stats GeneratorStats\n}\n\n// NewStringGenerator 创建字符串生成器\nfunc NewStringGenerator() *StringGenerator {\n    return &StringGenerator{\n        rand:  rand.New(rand.NewSource(time.Now().UnixNano())),\n        stats: NewGeneratorStats(),\n    }\n}\n\n// Generate 生成字符串值\nfunc (g *StringGenerator) Generate(ctx context.Context, field core.IFieldDefinition, config factories.GeneratorConfig) (interface{}, error) {\n    start := time.Now()\n    defer func() {\n        g.stats.RecordGeneration(time.Since(start))\n    }()\n    \n    // 检查是否有自定义模式\n    if config.Pattern != "" {\n        return g.generateByPattern(config.Pattern)\n    }\n    \n    // 获取长度范围\n    minLen, maxLen := g.getLengthRange(field, config)\n    \n    // 生成随机长度\n    length := minLen\n    if maxLen > minLen {\n        length = minLen + g.rand.Intn(maxLen-minLen+1)\n    }\n    \n    // 根据字段名称生成相应类型的字符串\n    fieldName := strings.ToLower(field.GetName())\n    switch {\n    case strings.Contains(fieldName, "name"):\n        return g.generateName(config.Locale)\n    case strings.Contains(fieldName, "title"):\n        return g.generateTitle(length)\n    case strings.Contains(fieldName, "description"):\n        return g.generateDescription(length)\n    case strings.Contains(fieldName, "username"):\n        return g.generateUsername(length)\n    case strings.Contains(fieldName, "password"):\n        return g.generatePassword(length)\n    default:\n        return g.generateRandomString(length), nil\n    }\n}\n\n// generateName 生成姓名\nfunc (g *StringGenerator) generateName(locale string) (string, error) {\n    if locale == "zh_CN" {\n        surnames := []string{"李", "王", "张", "刘", "陈", "杨", "黄", "赵", "周", "吴"}\n        givenNames := []string{"伟", "芳", "娜", "敏", "静", "丽", "强", "磊", "军", "洋"}\n        \n        surname := surnames[g.rand.Intn(len(surnames))]\n        givenName := givenNames[g.rand.Intn(len(givenNames))]\n        return surname + givenName, nil\n    }\n    \n    // 英文名称\n    firstNames := []string{"John", "Jane", "Mike", "Sarah", "David", "Lisa", "Tom", "Amy", "Bob", "Emma"}\n    lastNames := []string{"Smith", "Johnson", "Williams", "Brown", "Jones", "Garcia", "Miller", "Davis", "Rodriguez", "Martinez"}\n    \n    firstName := firstNames[g.rand.Intn(len(firstNames))]\n    lastName := lastNames[g.rand.Intn(len(lastNames))]\n    return fmt.Sprintf("%s %s", firstName, lastName), nil\n}\n\n// generateTitle 生成标题\nfunc (g *StringGenerator) generateTitle(maxLen int) (string, error) {\n    titles := []string{\n        "项目管理系统优化",\n        "用户界面重构",\n        "数据库性能调优",\n        "API接口开发",\n        "前端组件库升级",\n        "系统安全加固",\n        "移动端适配",\n        "测试用例编写",\n        "文档更新维护",\n        "代码审查和重构",\n    }\n    \n    title := titles[g.rand.Intn(len(titles))]\n    if len(title) > maxLen && maxLen > 0 {\n        title = title[:maxLen-3] + "..."\n    }\n    \n    return title, nil\n}\n\n// generateDescription 生成描述\nfunc (g *StringGenerator) generateDescription(maxLen int) (string, error) {\n    templates := []string{\n        "完成{task}的开发工作，包括需求分析、设计实现和测试验证。",\n        "对{component}进行优化改进，提升系统性能和用户体验。",\n        "实现{feature}功能模块，满足业务需求并确保代码质量。",\n        "修复{bug}相关问题，分析根本原因并提供解决方案。",\n        "编写{document}技术文档，确保内容准确完整。",\n    }\n    \n    template := templates[g.rand.Intn(len(templates))]\n    \n    // 替换占位符\n    placeholders := map[string][]string{\n        "{task}": {"登录模块", "支付功能", "搜索引擎", "报表系统", "消息通知"},\n        "{component}": {"数据库查询", "缓存机制", "用户界面", "后台服务", "第三方集成"},\n        "{feature}": {"多语言支持", "权限管理", "文件上传", "数据导出", "实时同步"},\n        "{bug}": {"内存泄漏", "并发冲突", "数据不一致", "接口超时", "页面卡顿"},\n        "{document}": {"API接口", "部署指南", "用户手册", "开发规范", "架构设计"},\n    }\n    \n    for placeholder, options := range placeholders {\n        if strings.Contains(template, placeholder) {\n            replacement := options[g.rand.Intn(len(options))]\n            template = strings.Replace(template, placeholder, replacement, -1)\n        }\n    }\n    \n    if len(template) > maxLen && maxLen > 0 {\n        template = template[:maxLen-3] + "..."\n    }\n    \n    return template, nil\n}\n\n// generateUsername 生成用户名\nfunc (g *StringGenerator) generateUsername(length int) (string, error) {\n    prefixes := []string{"user", "admin", "test", "demo", "guest"}\n    prefix := prefixes[g.rand.Intn(len(prefixes))]\n    \n    // 添加数字后缀\n    suffix := fmt.Sprintf("%d", g.rand.Intn(9999)+1)\n    username := prefix + suffix\n    \n    if len(username) > length && length > 0 {\n        username = username[:length]\n    }\n    \n    return username, nil\n}\n\n// getLengthRange 获取长度范围\nfunc (g *StringGenerator) getLengthRange(field core.IFieldDefinition, config factories.GeneratorConfig) (int, int) {\n    minLen, maxLen := 1, 50 // 默认范围\n    \n    // 从字段约束中获取长度限制\n    for _, constraint := range field.GetConstraints() {\n        switch constraint.GetType() {\n        case core.ConstraintMinLength:\n            if min, ok := constraint.GetParams()["min"].(int); ok {\n                minLen = min\n            }\n        case core.ConstraintMaxLength:\n            if max, ok := constraint.GetParams()["max"].(int); ok {\n                maxLen = max\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    \n    // 从配置中获取范围\n    if config.Range.Min != nil {\n        if min, ok := config.Range.Min.(int); ok {\n            minLen = min\n        }\n    }\n    if config.Range.Max != nil {\n        if max, ok := config.Range.Max.(int); ok {\n            maxLen = max\n        }\n    }\n    \n    return minLen, maxLen\n}\n```\n\n## 📁 文件结构\n\n```\nbackend/testdata/factories/\n├── interfaces.go           # 工厂接口定义\n├── config.go              # 配置数据结构\n├── base_factory.go        # 基础工厂实现\n├── configurable_factory.go # 配置驱动工厂\n├── batch_factory.go       # 批量生成工厂\n├── template_factory.go    # 模板驱动工厂\n├── chain_factory.go       # 链式调用工厂\n├── cache.go               # 缓存机制\n├── stats.go               # 统计信息\n├── registry.go            # 工厂注册表\n├── generators/\n│   ├── base_generator.go   # 生成器基类\n│   ├── string_generator.go # 字符串生成器\n│   ├── number_generator.go # 数字生成器\n│   ├── time_generator.go   # 时间生成器\n│   ├── email_generator.go  # 邮箱生成器\n│   ├── chinese_generator.go # 中文生成器\n│   └── business_generator.go # 业务生成器\n└── tests/\n    ├── factory_test.go     # 工厂测试\n    ├── generator_test.go   # 生成器测试\n    └── benchmark_test.go   # 性能测试\n```\n\n## 🧪 测试方案\n\n### 单元测试\n\n```go\n// backend/testdata/factories/tests/factory_test.go\nfunc TestBaseFactory_Create(t *testing.T) {\n    registry := core.GetRegistry()\n    factory := NewBaseFactory("test", "1.0.0", registry)\n    \n    config := FactoryConfig{\n        ModelName: "User",\n        Generators: map[string]GeneratorConfig{\n            "username": {\n                Type: "string",\n                Params: map[string]interface{}{\n                    "pattern": "user_{random}",\n                },\n            },\n        },\n    }\n    \n    result, err := factory.Create(context.Background(), config)\n    assert.NoError(t, err)\n    assert.NotNil(t, result)\n    \n    user, ok := result.(*models.UserModel)\n    assert.True(t, ok)\n    assert.NotEmpty(t, user.Username)\n}\n\nfunc BenchmarkFactory_CreateBatch(b *testing.B) {\n    registry := core.GetRegistry()\n    factory := NewBaseFactory("bench", "1.0.0", registry)\n    \n    config := BatchConfig{\n        FactoryConfig: FactoryConfig{\n            ModelName: "User",\n        },\n        Count:       1000,\n        BatchSize:   100,\n        Concurrency: 4,\n    }\n    \n    b.ResetTimer()\n    for i := 0; i < b.N; i++ {\n        _, err := factory.CreateBatch(context.Background(), config)\n        assert.NoError(b, err)\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## 📊 验收标准\n\n### 功能验收\n- [ ] 工厂接口设计完整\n- [ ] 基础工厂实现正确\n- [ ] 字段生成器功能完备\n- [ ] 批量处理性能良好\n- [ ] 缓存机制有效\n- [ ] 单元测试覆盖率 > 90%\n\n### 性能验收\n- [ ] 单个对象生成时间 < 10ms\n- [ ] 批量生成1000个对象 < 1s\n- [ ] 内存使用 < 100MB (生成10k对象)\n- [ ] 缓存命中率 > 80%\n\n## 🚨 风险与注意事项\n\n### 性能风险\n1. **生成器性能瓶颈**\n   - 缓解：实现对象池和结果缓存\n2. **内存占用过高**\n   - 缓解：分批处理和及时回收\n\n### 扩展性风险\n1. **生成器扩展困难**\n   - 缓解：设计良好的插件机制\n2. **配置复杂度过高**\n   - 缓解：提供默认配置和模板\n\n## 📝 开发清单\n\n- [ ] 实现核心工厂接口\n- [ ] 开发基础工厂