2179	1	基础设施：配置Nginx支持SSE	## 任务目标\n配置Nginx反向代理支持Server-Sent Events，确保SSE连接稳定可靠，防止缓冲和连接问题。\n\n## 技术要求\n- 禁用SSE路径的缓冲机制\n- 配置正确的HTTP协议版本\n- 设置适当的超时参数\n- 防止代理端对SSE流的干扰\n- 支持跨域访问\n\n## 实施步骤\n\n### 1. 修改前端 Nginx 配置\n文件位置：`frontend/nginx.conf`\n\n```nginx\nserver {\n    listen 80;\n    server_name localhost;\n    \n    # 常规静态文件配置\n    location / {\n        root /usr/share/nginx/html;\n        index index.html index.htm;\n        try_files $uri $uri/ /index.html;\n    }\n    \n    # SSE专用配置\n    location /api/v1/timer/sse {\n        proxy_pass http://backend:8080;\n        \n        # SSE关键配置\n        proxy_buffering off;\n        proxy_cache off;\n        proxy_set_header Connection '';\n        proxy_http_version 1.1;\n        chunked_transfer_encoding off;\n        \n        # 超时配置\n        proxy_connect_timeout 60s;\n        proxy_send_timeout 300s;\n        proxy_read_timeout 300s;\n        \n        # 头部配置\n        proxy_set_header Host $host;\n        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme;\n        \n        # CORS支持\n        add_header Access-Control-Allow-Origin *;\n        add_header Access-Control-Allow-Methods "GET, OPTIONS";\n        add_header Access-Control-Allow-Headers "Authorization, Content-Type";\n    }\n    \n    # 其他API路径的正常代理\n    location /api/ {\n        proxy_pass http://backend:8080;\n        \n        proxy_set_header Host $host;\n        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme;\n        \n        # 正常API超时配置\n        proxy_connect_timeout 30s;\n        proxy_send_timeout 30s;\n        proxy_read_timeout 30s;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Docker Compose 配置验证\n确保在 `docker-compose.dev.yml` 中：\n- 前端服务正确连接到后端\n- 网络配置支持长连接\n- 端口映射正确\n\n### 3. 测试配置\n创建测试脚本验证SSE配置：\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n# test_sse_config.sh\n\necho "测试SSE连接..."\ncurl -N -H "Accept: text/event-stream" \\\n     -H "Authorization: Bearer $ACCESS_TOKEN" \\\n     "http://localhost:3000/api/v1/timer/sse" &\n\nSSE_PID=$!\nsleep 5\nkill $SSE_PID\n\necho "测试完成"\n```\n\n### 4. 日志配置\n添加SSE相关的日志记录：\n```nginx\n# 在server块中添加\nerror_log /var/log/nginx/sse_error.log;\naccess_log /var/log/nginx/sse_access.log combined;\n\n# 只记录SSE相关访问\nlocation /api/v1/timer/sse {\n    # ... SSE配置 ...\n    access_log /var/log/nginx/sse_specific.log combined;\n}\n```\n\n## 性能优化\n- 设置适当的worker_connections\n- 优化keepalive_timeout\n- 配置适当的client_max_body_size\n\n## 文件修改\n- `frontend/nginx.conf` - 主要配置文件\n- `docker-compose.dev.yml` - 验证Docker配置\n- `scripts/test_sse_config.sh` - 新建测试脚本\n\n## 注意事项\n- 确保 `proxy_buffering off` 是关键配置\n- `chunked_transfer_encoding off` 防止分块传输问题\n- 超时参数需要较长以支持长连接\n- CORS配置支持跨域访问\n\n## 验收标准\n- [ ] SSE连接能够正常建立\n- [ ] 数据流不被缓冲或截断\n- [ ] 长时间连接不会超时\n- [ ] CORS支持正常\n- [ ] 日志记录正确\n- [ ] 性能测试通过\n\n## 预计工时\n2-3小时	completed	1	\N	{"priority": "low"}	2025-09-28 01:02:44.874062+00	2176	2	0	\N	2025-09-28 02:49:50.694426+00	0	\N	[]	0.00	medium	[]	\N	\N	0	0	auto	8.00	manual	2176.2179	1	\N	\N
